window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1801,"title":"Chapter 1801: Rest for the Hard Worker 10","paragraphs":["As the sun is setting, we return to the cottage from the jetty. Since we had already eaten an early dinner earlier, all we had to do was relax in the cottage, but we decided to prepare the bathroom first.","Well, though I say prepare, we're actually just activating the magic tools that have been installed with a touch After a while, the bath is ready.","[Now then, it's still a little early, but let's go ahead and take a bath.]","[I suppose so. In that case, let's get ready to go. Does Master have any towels?]","[Yeah, I got them in my magic box.]","[I see, I also have clothes and other stuff in my magic box, so there seems to be no problem.]","In response to my words, Anima got up from the sofa she was sitting on Arehh? Something feels out of place. \"Let's get ready to go?\" Arehh? Doesn't it seem like the conversation is naturally leading to us getting into the bath together?","From her demeanor and the way she's preparing, it seems like Anima is fully determined to head to the bathroom with me. She also didn't seem embarrassed at all, and was instead brimming with motivation.","When I had gone fishing with her before and stayed outside overnight, she seemed quite shy and nervous, and she even fainted while we were bathing.","Ahh, I see, this is \"that\", isn't it Due to a strong determination \"not to repeat the same mistake as before\", she's brimming with an overwhelming sense of motivation, putting aside embarrassment and the like out of her mind.","As if to affirm such thoughts of mine, Anima looks at me with eyes full of vigor and declares.","[Mater! I made a big blunder before, but I will not make the same mistake this time! As your servant, as your lover, I will complete my role of washing Master's back!]","[I- I see Unnn.]","Seeing Anima's blazing determination, I realized a significant mistake. This is because during our mixed bath before, Anima had been misled by Alice with the lie \"Couples are supposed to share a mixed bath and engage in a naked relationship with each other\", and she completely believed this.","And at that time, I had sworn to myself that I would clarify her misunderstanding but due to the commotion caused by Anima faining shortly afterward, I completely forgot to clear up that misunderstanding.","And now, Anima is filled with determination that this time, she will perform the mixed bathing well as my lover and I feel that this would be difficult to refuse. I mean, if I told her that we should go in separately this time, she'd probably get depressed, thinking \"This is because of my previous blunder\".","H- Hmmm. But unlike the last time, since I knew what was going on ahead of time, I may have mental leeway, and the reason why Anima fainted was because of that tail incident, and without that, there shouldn't be any problem.","[I'll confirm this just in case, but aren't you feeling embarrassed, Anima? You don't have to force yourself, okay? I didn't get to say this last time, but Alice was just fooling around, and there's actually no rule in the other world that lovers must bathe together.]","[I'm glad Master is concerned about me However, please don't worry about me! I will never repeat the same blunder twice!]","[Ahh, unnn. I see T- Then, shall we go together?]","[Hah!]","This is no good, her determination switch had been completely flipped. She's in her servant mode Hmmm. Well, I don't want to dampen her motivation either, and if Anima herself is fine with it, it's not that I don't want to do it either.","I promised Anima that we would be doing things that would be typical of lovers, and mixed bathing is definitely something lovers do. I'll just make sure to be careful here so that no incidents occur, just like what had happened before I hope we can finish this mixed bathing in a way that satisfies Anima.","For the time being, given what has happened so far, there's a possibility of some sort of accident happening in the bathroom, so let's be extra cautious about my surroundings.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Ohh, Kaito-san isn't being optimistic, so it seems like things are gonna be okay.]","Serious-senpai : [I don't really like mixed bathing events anyhow, Kaito seemed to have gotten used to mixed bathing he's gotten calmer about it.]","? ? ? : [Well, there are lots of things that occur over there, but with the other party being Anima, I guess things would do well?]"]},{"number":1802,"title":"Chapter 1802: Rest for the Hard Worker 11","paragraphs":["Because of a strange flow of some kind, as if pushed by the motivated Anima, we both went into the bathroom together.","Fortunately, we were able to slide a simple partition into the changing room, so changing was no problem. When we finished changing, Anima had a towel wrapped around her body, and even though I knew she looked quite sexy because of her good proportions, I still felt a bit nervous.","On the other hand, Anima's overflowing motivation seemed to outweigh her embarrassment, as she didn't seem to mind it that much, having prepared various things, including a sponge-like item in a mesh basket that appeared to be for bath use.","[Anima, are you alright? Aren't you feeling embarrassed?]","[Hah! I'm completely fine! This time, so as not to make the same blunder as before, I have also prepared a large towel and made use of State Preservation Magic to fixate it in place.]","[I- I see, I guess we can be relieved right?]","The previous blunder she was talking about is probably that incident with trying to show the base of the tail, but that doesn't seem to have much to do with fixating the towel in place Well, I guess it's to avoid incidents like the towel coming off while washing my back?","Shiro-san's blessing may have its precautionary effect, but it's confirmed that the dispelling effect of Shiro-san's blessing doesn't apply to State Preservation Magic, so I think we should be fine in that regard. However, since Anima said \"made use\" just now, there's a possibility that it may be affected, so let's be careful not to touch her towel.","[Arehh? Come to think of it, are those hairpins new?]","[Ah, yes. I bought it for bathing, thinking we would do this again. I can't let the hairpin Master gave me get wet, but there's also the possibility that my bangs might get in the way while I was washing your back, so I'm ensuring everything is in perfect order.]","Anima currently uses orange hair pins to hold her hair in place. She normally wears a hairpin made from Magnawell-san's processed scales that I gave her, and the current one she's wearing seems to be a substitute for that.","[I see, hairpins of that color also look cute on you.]","[Yesh T- Thank you very much.]","When I honestly expressed my feelings, Anima's body twitched, and blushing a bit, she thanked me. Thereupon, after her gaze shifted around nervously for a moment, taking a deep breath, her expression returned to a determined one.","[Well then, Master, I'll now start washing your back. Please come this way.]","[Unnn. Thanks.]","This is probably that, isn't it? It's not that she doesn't feel embarrassed, it's just that she's suppressing it by overriding it with her strong will not to repeat the same blunder, so it seems she does feel some embarrassment about us bathing together like this.","And so, when she's caught off-guard like just now, her suppressed embarrassment leaks out and she feels restless.","It would probably be better to just let Anima take the lead and not say anything until she finished washing my back. After all the effort she's put in, it would be a shame if things go awry","As I had such a thought in mind, Anima urged me to enter the bathroom.. and I found it to be a very tropical bath.","There's a large circular bathtub in the center, and the interior of the bathroom has a fairly bright design with white as the base color. There are also what seem to be ornamental plants.","When I was preparing the bath, I just activated the magic tools installed in the changing room, so I didn't look inside, but this was amazing.","[Well, this is quite the beautiful bath.]","[Indeed. I suppose it's to be expected for a cottage aimed at the wealthy. Ahh, Master, they have flowers here.]","[Flowers? Ahh, could these be the ones that were made to float in the bathtub?]","[That seems to be the case. There are several kinds and a brief description of their fragrance.]","Near the wall, there's a basket covered with a lid, and inside it, there are pastel-colored flowers reminiscent of those seen in movies, making me think of them being scattered on the bathtub.","After lightly scattering the flowers in the bathtub, I sat on a chair to have Anima wash my back.","[Well then, I'll start washing your back.]","[Unnn. I'm in your care.]","Anima's touch as she begins to wash my back is truly exquisite, providing a sensation of indescribable comfort","[Master, how's the strength of my scrubbing? Is this okay?]","[It's alright. I mean, I feel it's quite exquisite.]","[Actually, I've been practicing so that I'll be ready when the opportunity arises, so my scrubbing strength should be perfect.]","[You were practicing?]","[Yes. I've had Cara accompany me There are three times when I kinda pushed on Cara's back too much and things got bloody, but I got it perfectly now!]","[I- I- I- I see.]","E- Eeehhhh!? Pushed on Caraway's back too much and things got bloody, does that mean she applied too much for and ended up scraping off her skin? Hyiiihhh, just imagining that is terrifying.","No, Anima could actually do that much with her power b- but for the time being, let's give Caraway a word of thanks for her efforts when we get back.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I mean, all his lovers could at least scrub off a person's back if they wanted to.]","Makina : [Chocolate would be great.]","Serious-senpai : [Huh? What are you suddenly saying now?]","Makina : [Considering the numbering of the chapters, the bath scene should be finished in the next chapter, and the subtitle will change and they will flirt with each other, right? Perhaps, as they were flirting with each other, things could lead to that, don't you think?]","Serious-senpai : [Yeah, that's a future I don't really like, but it's very likely to happen So?]","Makina : [I want to eat chocolate fondue, so I'm hoping you'd turn into chocolate.]","Serious-senpai : [Did you lose your human heart somewhere]"]},{"number":1803,"title":"Chapter 1803: Rest for the Hard Worker 12","paragraphs":["While Anima washes my back, I pondered a bit. In this situation, what is the right thing to do after she finishes washing my back? Or rather, to what extent were things within Anima's expectations?","In the natural course of events, considering that Anima washed my back now, it would be logical for me to reciprocate later, but based on her earlier statement, Anima seems to have fixated her own towel with State Preservation Magic. In other words, I feel like she hadn't considered at all having her own back being washed by me.","What is important here though isn't what is generally the case, but what Anima thinks about it Since I have learned from our previous exchange that Anima has suppressed her embarrassment and her guard may collapse if I were to abruptly poke this matter, I want to avoid deviating from Anima's expectations as much as possible.","[Well then, I'll be rinsing your body.]","[Unnn. Thanks.]","While Anima rinses my body using the shower magic tool, washing away the foam and such from my body, I wash my front myself. That ends the process of washing my back but now, what would she do next?","My Sympathy Magic is convenient in situations like this, but just taking that into consideration on its own is meaningless. I have to read Anima's intentions thoroughly, including her facial facial expressions and eye movements.","[W- Well then, I'm also going to wash myself.]","Even though she said she was going to wash herself, from the momentary glance she made towards me and the subtle expectation I could feel through my Sympathy Magic, and considering the strange knowledge Alice taught her","[Anima, I'll wash your back in return.]","[Eh? Ah, but having Master do such a thing is]","[I want to do it not as your master, but as your lover.]","[Ahh Yes! Well then, umm, I'm in your care.]","As I had expected, just as she had explicitly mentioned being open to naked socializing before, it seemed like she had anticipated us washing each other's backs.","Although she was feeling reserved, she understood my intention not as a master to his servant, but as her lover, and with a somewhat happy expression on her face, she sat down on a chair in front of me, unfastened the towel that was wrapped around her and held it to cover her front.","Anima's white, beautiful back and the tail on her butt were exposed before my eyes. My heart skipped a beat at her beauty, but if I got flustered or felt nervous here, what I felt would spread toward Anima.","Fortunately or not, I have a lot of experience in mixed bathing, so if I firmly held my emotions in place, I wouldn't be no, I would be a little shaken, but I was able to calm myself down.","[Well then, I'll start washing your back.]","Saying this, I put some body soap on a sponge and gently scrubbed her back, just like Anima had done earlier. Well, even if I were to rub vigorously on her back, I probably wouldn't cause her any harm, so compared to Anima, there's no difficulty in adjusting my scrubbing strength.","[Is the scrubbing strength alright?]","[Yes, it's comfortable Ahh, no, I originally should be feeling apologetic as a servant, but as Master's lover I feel so happy that I hope you'll forgive me if my face slackens.]","[Ahaha, I'm rather glad you're feeling happy. In fact, when Anima was washing my back earlier, it felt like you were being considerate of various things on my end, and that kinda made me happy.]","[I'm glad if that's the case.]","Anima likely has various concerns, whether it's as a servant or as my lover, but those concerns don't seem to be a negative one. Despite the uncertainties, she seems to be finding a balance within herself, enjoying the present and coming to terms with it in her own way.","As I was thinking about this while I was washing Anima's back, I suddenly heard Anima speak in a soft voice.","[Master, umm, I would like you to listen to me while we're like this.]","[Unnn?]","[Errr, if I were to face you directly, I might get nervous and not express myself well, but I don't want to postpone it either, so with all due respect, while I'm immersed in the happiness of having my back washed by Master, I'd like to express my feelings.]","After saying these words as a preface, Anima was silent for a few moments and then, as if putting her thoughts into them, she slowly spun her words.","[I dearly love you. No, I suppose this is too formal. Rather, to put it more simply ummm I love the always kind Master.]","[Anima Thanks. I too love the earnest and cute Anima.]","[I'm glad. It's a bit embarrassing, but more than that, I feel incredibly]","Her straightforward expression of affection is both ticklish and pleasantly soothing creating an atmosphere of happiness that seems to flow between the two of us.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Guohhh, n- not yet]","Makina : [..]","Serious-senpai : [Oi, stop all that! What's with those skewers and fruits Can you not give me that expectant look!?]"]},{"number":1804,"title":"Chapter 1804: Sea Bathing with Anima 1","paragraphs":["Entering her assigned bedroom, Anima takes out her pajamas from her magic box. Previously, she used to sleep without wearing anything, but after being persuaded by Kaito having received pajamas as a gift, she now wears them normally and sleeps.","(Today was really a wonderful day. I was with Master all the time, we talked a lot, took a bath together unintentionally slackened my cheeks No, this was all because of my lack of physical condition management, so that is something I should be reflecting on but Uuuu, it's no good. All of such thoughts are overridden by the feeling of happiness of being with Master.)","She found herself asking herself the same question several times, but the feeling of happiness ultimately outweighed how she felt apologetic and although that's something she also feels guilty about, she found it difficult to amend.","Even as she prepared to change and go to bed right now, what inevitably came to her mind wasn't self-reflection, but rather the feeling of happiness being with Kaito.","(I can spend tomorrow with Master again. The last time we went swimming, I was but a newcomer among his lovers, and I was in the company of great people such as Shallow Vernal-sama, Alice-dono and Kuromueina-sama, so I couldn't help but feel reserved. Although I was told to put aside our status, I still couldn't help feeling conscious of it.)","Anima has a strong sense of reverence towards Alice, who is her target in various fields, Kuromueina, who is her actual teacher, and Shallow Vernal, who reincarnated her. Her faith towards Shallow Vernal is especially deep, so its impossible for her not to be conscious of them at moments like the beach swimming before where all the lovers were gathered.","But tomorrow, she will be bathing with Kaito at a private beach, and since it will be just the two of them, she will be able to enjoy herself in a more relaxed way than last time.","(The fact that I'm alone with Master is a blessing in disguise, but when I see him caring for me in so many ways as he did today, even though I really feel apologetic the strong feeling of being valued and cherished really just brings me joy. Rather, because we were together until just now, I now feel slightly lonely Hm!? This won't do! For me to think of troubling Master any more than this, what am I doing!!!? I think I'd better get a good night's sleep and be ready for tomorrow For that reason, let's go to sleep early.)","Shaking off the slight feeling of loneliness in her heart, Anima changes into her pajamas, gets into her futon, and turns off the illumination magic tool in her room. Looking forward to swimming in the sea tomorrow with Kaito, she quietly fell asleep.","While feeling the sensation of her consciousness surfacing from a comfortable slumber, Anima's eyes remain closed as she thinks in a daze.","(Ahh, it's morning I guess fatigue really has accumulated in my body huh? Sleeping feels so comfortable that it feels a bit like a chore to open my eyes. The warmth enveloping me also feels comfortable, and dozing off while basking in the scent of my beloved Master, what happiness this happiness arehh? Master's scent?)","As her consciousness gradually awakens, Anima immediately notices something out of place. As a Beastman Demon, she has a very good nose, and even though she wasn't quite awake yet, there's no way she could mistake the scent of her beloved being, Kaito, for anything else.","However, that in itself is strange. She should have slept in a separate bedroom from Kaito, and there was no way she could have smelled Kaito's scent. Not only that, this warmth she felt underneath the futon felt like warmth akin to human touch, so bewildered, Anima opened her eyes but seeing Kaito's sleeping face in front of her, Anima's mind went blank.","[","! ? ! ? ! ? ]","It was a shock that almost made her jump up to the ceiling, but at the last moment, the thought of \"not wanting to wake the sleeping Kaito\" kicked in, so Anima swallowed the shriek that was about to leak out of her mouth.","However, even though she had suppressed such a feeling, she still couldn't understand the situation.","(M- M- M- M- Master!? W- W- W- Why is he in my futon!? Did he get the wrong bedroom No, that's impossible. Even though I was asleep, how is it possible that I would sleep through anyone much less Master himself entering my room without me noticing?)","Her confused mind frantically thought. Anima is one of the high-ranking powerhouses in the world, with a power comparable to that of a Count, and no matter how tired she is and how soundly she sleeps, it's impossible for her not to notice someone coming into her room.","Furthermore, she can say with certainty that it would be impossible for her not to notice the presence of her beloved Kaito approaching but with such impossibility having occurred before her eyes, her mind couldn't catch up at all.","Even though confused, still trying not to wake up Kaito, Anima carefully moved her gaze and noticed something.","(Arehh? That window is in a different position? The window should be over there from my bed Arehh? Then, this isn't my room, but Master's room which means, I'm the one who snuck into Master's room and got under his futon Eeehhhh!?)","Despite realizing the shocking truth, the reason she refrained from screaming was solely due to how earnest her feelings for Kaito were. Well, it goes without saying that Anima's mind went blank once again.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Phew.]","Makina : [Arehh? Where have you been?]","? ? ? : [Yes, I just finished some work as the Cupid of Love So, what are you doing?]","Makina : [Ahh, I'm just making my preparations just in case someone turns into solid chocolate. Like, I brought in tools to break and melt chocolate.]","? ? ? : [Ahh That so Hmm???]"]},{"number":1805,"title":"Chapter 1805: Sea Bathing with Anima 2","paragraphs":["Confused by this unknown situation of being in Kaito's room when she woke up in the morning, Anima's thoughts were completely scattered, but she desperately tried to regain her composure scattered, but she desperately tried to regain her composure and bring her thoughts back on track.","(The sun isn't shining through the window. I can't check the time immediately, but it seems to be before dawn. Although this is just from how I feel, I have definitely slept for several hours, so it should be early morning. And judging from the room's interior, this is definitely Master's room I- It's difficult to think about, but based on the information currently available, I can't help but conclude that I came to Master's room and ended up sharing the same futon. W- What disrespect This is disrespect that goes beyond the boundaries of a servant F- For the time being, it was fortunate that I had developed the habit of wearing pajamas before going to sleep but in any case, I must get out of the futon now so as not to wake the sleeping Master, slowly)","In view of her current situation and other factors, Anima could only assume that she had slipped underneath the sleeping Kaito's futon, and even though Anima is filled with the overwhelming desire to clutch her head and scream \"Why!?\" with all her might, what's even more urgent than that was her need to escape from her current situation.","She does feel tempted by the warmth of the futon shared with Kaito, but thinking that the current situation was too disrespectful to Kaito, Anima quietly attempts to slip out of the futon but","[Hnnn]","[ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ! ? ! ? ? ! ? ! ? ]","The sleeping Kaito shifted his sleeping position, reaching out his hand and embracing Anima from behind, wrapping his arms around her. It was an action carried out in an unconscious state, much like hugging a body pillow while in deep sleep, but it was an action with a devastating impact more than enough to elicit a silent scream from Anima.","(Abababa, M- M- M- Master is holding me tightly Hawawa Master's scent, his warmth What happiness Wait, snap out of it! W- What a blunder. I've been completely careless. F- For things to have turned out like this b- but if it's like this, escaping is)","While Kaito clung tightly to Anima with all his strength, given Anima's abilities, she could certainly be able to easily break free.","She could easily break free but breaking free carries the high risk of waking Kaito. She had already been disrespectful enough for slipping into his futon, so Anima couldn't afford to commit such rudeness More than anything, if Kaito were to wake up in the current situation, Anima wouldn't know how to explain why they're currently like this, nor could she think of any excuses.","(Uuuu, t- this won't do. This is too much stimulation It's so overwhelmingly comfortable that my thoughts won't stay calm at all!? W- Well, I could certainly just continue being embraced by Master like this I can't afford to wake Master, so this is kinda inevitable N- No, stop right there, Anima, calm yourself down! If Master wakes up while we're in this state, how exactly am I going to explain myself!!!?)","With a pointless display of skill, Anima's face contorted into a myriad of expressions without making a single sound She's the type of person who can handle embarrassment to a certain extent if she's prepared beforehand.","Being both Kaito's lover and servant, she firmly held the awareness of her own position, allowing her to handle anticipated situations calmly and engage in lover-like skinship without getting flustered.","However, this is only limited to situations she can anticipate, making her vulnerable to unexpected surprises, as was the case with the bathroom incident. And the current situation is indeed one such unexpected surprise, making it impossible for her to regain her composure.","In fact, despite usually maintaining discipline, Anima's affection for Kaito is incredibly strong. If anything, when alone with him, she even wishes to act more spoiled around him.","No matter what her head may think though, her body is being honest with her emotions, as Anima's hand unconsciously crept to the back of the sleeping Kaito, and before she knew it, she was hugging him back.","(WHAT THE HECK AM I DOIIIIIIING!? B- Before I knew it, I'm now hugging Master W- What foolishness have I but well uuu this warmth is irresistible Auu It's like my head is melting Ahh The sleeping Master is cool too, being hugged makes me glad, and being wrapped in Master's scent is happiness Fuaaahhh I love you.)","As the overwhelmingly blissful situation melts her rationality, Anima hugs Kaito, rubbing the tip of her nose against his neck. Kaito's unconsciously endearing action brought about such sweet happiness that Anima's expression remained relaxed.","However, it was only natural that Kaito wouldn't remain asleep while Anima indulged in such actions.","[Hmm? Unn? .Huh? Eh? A- Anima!?]","[Ahh T- This isUmm]","As Kaito woke up and clearly looked shocked, Anima's face, which had been completely melted with bliss just a moment ago, paled in an instant.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Aaahhh, kuh. H- However, if I get done in here, it will be just as that crazy god wants. I- I must at least prevent just that]","Makina : [Serious-senpai. I also want to eat some white chocolate, so can you, like, turn half regular chocolate, while the other half's white chocolate?]","Serious-senpai : [What the heck do you think I am!?]","Makina : [An interesting creature?]"]},{"number":1806,"title":"Chapter 1806: Sea Bathing with Anima 3","paragraphs":["When I woke up, I found Anima in the futon, who was supposed to be sleeping in another room, and we were hugging each other. Even though I myself don't know what I'm saying here, that really is the case.","How should I say this As tempting as it might be to continue embracing the soft, warm and comfortable body of Anima, and enjoy the bliss of a second round of sleep in the lingering drowsiness, I must prioritize confirming the situation over such indulgence.","Looking at Anima, who had clearly turned pale","[Errr, Anima Good morning. Umm, this situation]","[T- That's not it! This certainly is Master's room, and it may seem from the situation that I slipped into Master's futon, but I have no recollection of doing that whatsoever! Before I knew it, I found myself like this! N- No, even if Master says I unconsciously moved to Master's room and slipped into the futon, it would certainly be difficult for me to deny given the situation, as I certainly did feel a bit lonely last night, so I do have a motive to do such a thing but]","While trying desperately to explain, her voice had gotten a little smaller, as if she herself was unsure about the part where she might have unconsciously slipped into my room while half asleep.","No, but even if she was sleepwalking, the probability of her moving from her room to mine and crawling under my covers seems low, doesn't it? Looking at Anima, she doesn't even seem like she had woken up in the middle of the night.","While I was thinking like this, some sort of glowing letter suddenly appeared in the air in front of me. I think I had seen that somewhere. Oh, it was that magical letter just like that one Kuro had left in my room when I had just come to this world back then.","\"I've made the arrangements for you, so please make out to your heart's content as lovers.","-Transcendental Beauty Cupid\"","It was that idiot huh. Well, indeed, managing to move Anima, who had the strength on the level of a Count-rank, to a different room without her noticing might be a task only people on Alice's level can do.","Even so, even though she was incredibly shy and would likely run away if something like this happened to her, when it comes to my other lovers, she tends to be meddlesome and do various things like this.","[Anima, calm down, I know who the culprit is.]","[Eh? T- The culprit Ahh, this is]","[Unnn. It seems that Alice brought you here while you're sleeping.]","[S- So that's how it is. I see, if it's Alice-dono, it's understandable why I wasn't able to notice her. Perhaps Alice-dono noticed that I was feeling an inexplicable loneliness from sleeping in a separate room from Master last night, she was being considerate of me.]","[I- I guess so.]","My guess is perhaps, this is mostly for a prank but Anima's opinion of Alice is extremely high, so it seems like she naturally interprets what she did in a positive way.","Rather, just as she mentioned before, it feels like Anima herself had been wanting to sleep together with me somewhere deep in her heart. Well, with how earnest Anima is, she probably suppressed that thought","[By the way, Anima, it's still dark outside, right?]","[Ah, that's right. I can't check the clock at the moment, but I guess it's around 4 or 5 o clock.]","[I see]","[U- Umm, by the way, how long are we going to stay like this]","The sun hasn't risen yet, and I'm still feeling a bit drowsy. It might be a good idea to just take a nap like this.","[Hmm~~ Since we're at it, let's just get a second sleep? Of course, if Anima doesn't mind, that is]","[Ahh, umm Like this, all close to Master?]","[Unnn. Do you not like it?]","[No, umm, I'm rather happy It's just doing this as your servant is]","[Then, until we wake up, you as a servant are resting, and regardless of whether we're servant and master, we'd be sleeping as lovers You okay with that?]","With those words, I embraced Anima's body closer, and I could feel my drowsiness gradually lulling me to sleep. I heard that the warmth of human touch reassures a person, and it indeed feels very pleasant and comfortable.","Being under the same futon, the slightly elevated temperature adds to the overall comfort, making it even more pleasant.","[Yes.]","It seems that Anima accepted my suggestion, as after giving me a bashful smile, she hugged me tightly, affectionately rubbing her face against my neck.","She would usually be reserved, trying to act as my servant, but I guess she also wants to be pampered like this. As I gently caressed the head of the adorable Anima, I sank into a comfortable slumber.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Unnn, unnn. It's nice to be so lovey-dovey Even so, hmmm. She really did turn into a solid one huh.]","? ? ? : [As Makina had said, half of her body really is made of white chocolate Seriously, what kind of being are you, Serious-senpai]"]},{"number":1807,"title":"Chapter 1807: Sea Bathing with Anima 4","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I don't have time, so today's chapter is short.","After having a second sleep with Anima, we had breakfast and rested a little before heading out to the beach as planned. That said, the private beach was really just a stone's throw away from the cottage, so we each changed into our swimsuits in our rooms before heading for the beach.","Since it was abruptly decided that we were going to the beach, both the swimsuits Anima and I were wearing were the same as what we had when we went swimming at the beach.","[Thank you for waiting.]","[I told you the same thing when we went swimming at the beach last time, but just like before, you look cute in your swimsuit.]","[Thank you. Even though this is the second time, perhaps because I'm still not used to it, I'm very happy to hear it.]","Anima's swimsuit was the same as her previous one, a brown and white striped top with a hot pants-like swimsuit on the bottom.","Her swimsuit is made in a way that it has a hole for her tail to come out, but looking at it again like this, Anima in her swimsuit looks quite attractive.","She has an outstanding style to begin with, with her large breasts and well-proportioned limbs, and perhaps because she usually wears long-sleeved, long-pants, military-style outfit, her femininity seems to stand out when she's dressed in a way that exposes her skin.","[Let's go then It sure is nice being able to walk mostly empty-handed at a time like this.]","[You're right. There's also our magic box, but to begin with, since the cottage is nearby, it's very convenient that we can easily go back to get what we need when we actually need it.]","[There seems to be some play equipment for use at the beach provided but for now, all we need is a parasol and a sheet, and we can come back for the rest when we need them.]","[Yes! Or perhaps, it might be nice to prepare something easy to eat for lunch and enjoy it by the seaside.]","[Ahh, that's a good idea.]","While chatting happily like this, we were heading for the private beach, but suddenly coming up with an idea, I stopped.","Seeing my sudden stop, Anima tilted her head curiously and called out..","[Master? Is something the matter?]","[Ahh, no, since we're at it, even though it wasn't that far of a distance, how about holding hands on the way?]","[Ah Yes!]","Anima and I are lovers that had gone on several dates like that fishing trip we had before, but I don't think we've held hands that much.","We had decided we were going to do a lot of lover-like things this time, so I suggested holding hands while we were at it. Thereupon, she brightened up to a smile and she clasped my held-out hand.","Since Anima usually wears gloves, it feels a little refreshing holding her bare hands like this. Of course, we're holding hands like lovers would.","[This, umm feels a bit embarrassing, but how should I say this being like this makes me feel like I'm closer to Master and it kinda makes me happy.]","With each of Anima's adorable reactions and smiles, I kinda feel like I could see a puppy wagging its tail behind her, and as I felt rather pleasant, we headed towards the sea together.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Alright, first, we divide her into two]","? ? ? : [This guy she bisected her without hesitation]","Makina : [It's alright, she's gonna resurrect anyway, so let's do it.]","? ? ? : [I mean, looking at her cross-section, she's completely chocolate so it's not just her outer layers that are chocolate huh I wonder if the sweetness changes depending on the sugar content of the story?]"]},{"number":1808,"title":"Chapter 1808: Sea Bathing with Anima 5","paragraphs":["Upon arriving at the beach, we immediately pulled out our leisure sheets and set up our parasols. As to be expected from a private resort aimed at the wealthy, the beach was just as beautiful as the beach we went to before.","[Well, playing at the beach doesn't just mean swimming with gusto, relaxing by the sea is also attractive, isn't it?]","[You're right. Hydra Kingdom has a warm climate, and the weather is very nice today, so the sun is very pleasant.]","[Are you alright with the heat, Anima?]","[I don't particularly mind it I can regulate it with magic, and if anything, I actually dislike the cold more. How about you, Master?]","It seems that Anima isn't fond of the cold rather than the heat. I don't know if Black Bears hibernate or not, but Anima always wears long sleeves, long pants, gloves and a fur mantle, so her attire generally seems warm and cozy all the time.","[Since I arrived in this world, thanks to Shiro-san's blessing, the temperature doesn't affect me nearly as much as the others, but if I had to pick, I guess I don't like the heat that much? You see, I could cope with the cold to some extent by putting on thicker clothes, but there's a limit to how much you can be lightly dressed when it's hot.]","[I see. I heard that there was no magic in the world Master lived, so it must be difficult to regulate one's bodily temperature.]","[Well, there was aircon a machine that adjusts the temperature inside the room, so things are fine indoors, but that certainly is the case when we had to go outside but well, even in this world, there aren't that many people who can use magic that regulates their body temperature all the time while they're on a trip outside?]","[T- That certainly is the case. I'm kinda starting to misunderstand with how everyone around us can naturally do it but now that Master mentioned it, there are people who can't even use magic, so not everyone can take these measures.]","[Yeah, I get what you feel. Being surrounded by so many great people makes me feel like my criteria are higher.]","In my case, I think that's especially true for my sense of money I'm aware that my sense of money is getting skewed with all the rich people around me, so I really have to be careful In that sense, friends like Kaori-san are truly valuable. Talking with her makes me realize how my perception of things has unknowingly shifted.","[However, since we're here, let's have a little fun at the beach first.]","[Yes.]","[We can simply go swimming, but is there anything you want to do, Anima?]","[T- That's a difficult question.]","[Ahh, I guess that's because you haven't been to the ocean much?]","The last time Anima has been to the beach was when we went swimming at the beach before. And during that time, Anima primarily helped Alice prepare for the barbecue, and it didn't seem like she had played in the sea that much.","It seems like she did join the others and played with them a bit, and maybe the beach volleyball afterward (?), but if that's the case, there's a possibility that Anima simply isn't familiar with playing at the beach.","No, well, it's not like I'm that knowledgeable about it either I guess I could only think of beach volleyball and watermelon splitting. As for things like snorkeling and the like, a layman like me wouldn't know about them, so doing that feels like it would be difficult even with the equipment provided.","[Ahh, no, that's, of course, part of it but more than that, errr, I'm just so happy to be with Master right now that I can't think of anything else right away.]","[Fufu, I see In that case, how about accompanying me for the time being? If you think of anything we could do along the way, let me know.]","[Yes! I'll accompany you!]","While enjoying the company of the adorable Anima, for the time being, it was decided I would be leading her while we headed to the sea. Although we're just going to soak in the water, swim a bit, and have a casual chat with Anima, it's still plenty enjoyable.","[Ah, come to think of it, I think I got a rubber boat in my magic box.]","[Is that right? As expected of Master, you're very well prepared.]","[No, I received various things from Kuro after that beach outing we had before. I believe they're products from Kuro's trading company.]","[Kuromueina-dono really does make a lot of things.]","Kuro brought things like banana boats during our previous beach outing, and I assume she had likely had those created with her knowledge about the other world. Given her personality, if she sees potential in selling such products, she might sell them through her trading companies.","In fact, since Laguna-san sought to promote private beaches and that beach we went swimming to before, it seems that sea leisure is relatively common in this world, so there likely is demand for products catering to such activities.","[It's too late to say this, but it seems like playing at the beach seemed to be pretty major in this world as well.]","[There are several species living by the sea, such as the Mermaids, so their presence may have a connection to it. If something had a certain amount of history to it, amusements related to it would naturally exist as well.]","[I see Well, for the time being, let's go for a rubber boat ride.]","Considering that activities for aquatic species like Mermaids may have influenced sea leisure, there might be games and activities not just by the seaside but also underwater. With these thoughts in mind, I bring out a rubber boat from my magic box.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Haahhh T- That was dangerous. Maybe I should get a little break I have to recover my stamina at this time]","Makina : [Does your chocolatization have a connection with your stamina? Unnn delish!]","Serious-senpai : [How am I supposed to react to a dangerous guy who talks to me very casually while fondue-ing marshmallows with what's likely melted chocolate I was transformed into]"]},{"number":1809,"title":"Chapter 1809: Sea Bathing with Anima 6","paragraphs":["Even though I said we're riding a boat, it's not a banana boat like that one I rode with Kuro and Sieg-san. It's a normal rubber boat one that's made for leisure and has a cute appearance.","It's quite a large size, spacious enough that I can lie down comfortably. What's great about the magic box is that I can store items like this inflated and play with them immediately when taken out. Well, as long as there's enough space available in the magic box, that is. Not like that matters, as my magic box is about the size of a large island, so there's plenty of room. In fact, it could easily fit even a house I won't put a house inside since taking it out is troublesome, but well, I do have that house that I used for when I went fishing and camping with Anima, so saying that a house fits inside is no exaggeration","[I'm thinking of relaxing on this, but I think it would be better if we tie it with a rope somewhere so that it doesn't drift away.]","[In that case, please leave it to me!]","It's a fairly large boat, so I'd like to try lying down on it, but there's a risk of being carried away by the waves. No, well, even if we drifted away, I can always use my Teleportation Magic Tool to come back, so that really isn't a problem, but it would be better to just avoid trouble if we could.","As I was trying to find a cord to tie with, Anima asked me to leave it to her. I had no reason to refuse, so I left it to her. Thereupon, she turned her hand to the seashore and brought forth a magic circle.","Immediately after, something like a translucent stake emerges from Anima's hand, piercing into the sandy beach, and then a similarly translucent chain extends towards the rubber boat, connecting the stake and the rubber boat After that, the stake and the chain both disappeared from sight as if nothing had happened.","[Errr, what was that just now?]","[It's a magic that limits the target's range of actions. As long as the effect lasts, the rubber boat will not be able to move away from the beach for more than a certain distance.]","[I see, that's a great magic.]","[Ahh, no, it's just like the preemptive magic for learning Barrier Magic For people with a certain level of magic power, that's something that can be easily nullified. The duration certainly is relatively long, lasting around a day, but with its significantly high magic power consumption, it's not particularly useful. It's only convenient in times when it can be used.]","If you think of it as being able to hold onto objects within a specific range for a day, it seems quite useful but considering that a Count-rank like Anima finds this magic's magic power consumption as significantly high, it's likely a magic with rather poor magic power efficiency.","I was a bit concerned if Anima was pushing herself too hard, but it seems there's no issue at all. Well, thinking about it again, even Teleportation Magic, which is considered to have the highest magic power consumption among all magic, can be used quite freely by those on the level of Count-ranks, so it's probably just described as \"relatively high\" in consumption when compared to other magic.",".Well, I'll probably run out of magic power if I were the one using it though! Must be nice, having lots of magic power","[Well, with this, we'd be able to enjoy it without worries. Thanks, Anima.]","[I'm glad I could be of service to you, Master!]","[Let's get on it then.]","[Hah. I'll hold it down for Master, so please go in first.]","[Well then, if you'll excuse me Ohh, it's shaking a bit but it's pretty stable.]","[It's splendidly made after all. Well then, I'll be getting on too]","The largish boat feels quite stable, and in terms of size, even with Anima with me, there's plenty of space. It might feel a bit cramped when the two of us lie supine, but if we face each other, it should be fine.","[Anima, how far can we go with this magic?]","[The range is quite long, so it should be able to go far enough. In fact, the main focus is the center point of the magic Being the caster of this magic, I could tell where the stake is located, so even if we go too far offshore, we won't get lost.]","[I see, that's a relief.]","[Well, if it's a distance reachable by this boat, I can see it well enough with my eyes, so there isn't any problem but]","Well, for the time being, I guess that means I don't have to worry about getting lost at sea with Anima here. Besides, if it really comes down to it, I can just use my Teleportation Magic Tool, and there's also that thing in my magic box that thing in my magic box","[Master?]","[Come to think of it, I haven't used that state-of-the-art magic ship I got as memorabilia for the Six Kings Festival]","[A- Ahh, you really had that thing! Kuromueina's memorabilia However, isn't it too huge for the two of us to use?]","[You're right If we're gonna use it, it would be for something like a boat party Well, let's just enjoy ourselves on this leisure boat then.]","[Yes!]","Coming here in the sea, I remembered about a boat in my magic box that was given to me but never used. And just as Anima said, it's huge. It's a size reminiscent of a luxury cruise ship, so I don't feel like it's something you'd use for sea leisure. Unless we're going on an actual sea voyage or something similar, I don't think it would be used.","Hmmm. However, not using it at all seems a bit wasteful, so let's think about how we can make effective use of it another time.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That did exist]","Makina : [Senpai, Senpai, I want you to turn into those pop pop candies next time. I'll break it into pieces and eat it with chocolate.]","Serious-senpai : [You want me to turn into a candy that contains CO2 gas!? That's something made with special facilities, not something that can be made normally No, in the first place, like hell I can turn into something if I just aim for it!!!]","Makina : [Don't worry. I'm sure you'll be able to become a pop pop candy. \"I made such a future definite\" after all!]","Serious-senpai : [Oi, almighty god Don't go at it in a roundabout way, just directly create the finished product and go eat that]","Makina : [This is this, and that is that What I want to eat is you, Serious-senpai.]","Serious-senpai : [You're not saying that in a sexual way, but in a literal way, right Rather, declaring to break a person into pieces and eat them right in front of the said person, is this guy seriously out of her mind Yep, she really is out of her mind huh]"]},{"number":1810,"title":"Chapter 1810: Sea Bathing with Anima 7","paragraphs":["We headed out to sea on a large rubber boat. The boat is equipped with oars, so there's no need to worry about moving around. Incidentally, I entrusted the oars to Anima this time without any pretense.","I have been on a boat with Olivia-san before, so I do have experience in rowing a boat, but I don't know if I can row a boat in the same way in the wavy sea. Moreover, there's a fundamental difference in strength between me and Anima.","[Anima, I'm sorry for entrusting the oars to you.]","[No, I'm rather glad that Master is relying on me! Besides, this level of work is not at all burdensome, so there's no problem.]","From Anima's perspective, it seemed like she was moving the oars lightly, and the resistance from the waves didn't seem to affect her at all. Rather, it seems like Anima is happy about the fact that I entrusted the oars to her, as she has a cheerful smile on her lips.","However, facing Anima directly like this, it feels a bit awkward trying to find where to look. Being faced with Anima in her swimsuit right in front of me, it's hard to avoid my gaze turning towards strange places.","Anima's swimsuit, with its design resembling hot pants, might have been a good choice after all.","[We're already pretty far out to sea. Hmmm, the breeze feels good.]","[The weather is certainly nice and the sunlight isn't too strong, making it a pleasant climate. By the way, Master, where shall we move to?]","[Ahh, you can stop when we get out to the sea to some extent. I mean, the original purpose of the trip was to relax on the boat, swaying in the waves.]","[I see Well then, I'll stop in this area.]","If we consider only our original purpose, there wasn't really a need to go out to sea, but I suppose it adds to the overall atmosphere. No, even so, the wind feels refreshing, and the sea surface seems to sparkle beautifully. The water's transparency is quite something, and I can even occasionally see fish swimming.","How should I say this This place really feels like a nice tropical resort.","[Since we have a largish boat, why don't we lay out on it?]","[Certainly, with a boat this size, you might be able to lay down. Well then, please leave controlling the boat to me, and Master could take it easy]","[No, when I said \"we\", I mean the two of us lying down together.]","[I- I see, that may indeed be a more natural course of action T- That said, this boat is a little cramped for the two of us to lie down together, so I have a feeling that we'd be glued to each other Ahh, no, it's a little late for that now since we were much closer in the morning huh.]","[That is, well, true.]","Even though I say it's largish, it's not the size of a lifeboat or anything like that. It's about the size of a two-seater, and in terms of width, it's slightly narrower than a regular bed, so if the two of us lie down side by side, it seems like we'd be snugly close to each other.","[Of course, I won't force you or anything like that.]","[No, I hadn't anticipated that, so I do feel a bit embarrassed, but I would say Master's suggestion makes me happy, as just imagining that scene in my mind right now makes me feel blessed]","[Shall we lie down together then?]","[Yes.]","This is just my hunch, but after that incident in the morning or perhaps, since yesterday's bath, Anima seems to have opened up, her thoughts changing to some extent.","I can feel that she isn't being reserved as my servant, but trying to communicate her desires and emotions honestly to a certain extent as my lover.","Even now, even though she's feeling embarrassed, she's honestly expressing her desire to lie down with me, which makes things very easy for me as well.","Anyhow, with Anima's agreement, we lay down on the boat together. Also, while I may seem at ease in front of Anima, I'm actually quite nervous too.","[I- I wonder why? The distance between us should be further than when we were sleeping together in the morning, but perhaps because we are both wearing swimsuits, I feel strangely nervous.]","[Ahaha, that's true I'm also feeling quite nervous.]","[Master is also feeling nervous?]","[Unnn. I'm trying to stay calm in front of Anima, but you're just so beautiful and charming, so in a situation like this, where we are looking at each other up close, my heart would obviously be beating really fast.]","[Ahh I- I see.]","Upon hearing my sincere words, Anima's eyes widened in surprise, before she shyly blushed, but I could see a hint of joy in her smile.","[I'm glad Master feels that way Although I'm feeling embarrassed errr, how about we get closer?]","[I suppose so. Maybe that would balance things out better]","[W- Well then, if you'll excuse me.]","With determination in mind, Anima assertively approached me after obtaining my approval, gently snuggling up to me. As our bodies touched in a way that felt completely different from when we were embracing on the bed, I couldn't help blushing, but as if it was arranged beforehand, we instinctively gently embraced each other.","No words were exchanged between us, but it felt both ticklish and blissful, and the sensation of our slightly damp skin touching each other felt strangely pleasant. Feeling the boat slightly bobbing in the waves, enveloped in a peaceful silence we enjoyed a moment of bliss for a while.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Hmm~~ Pop pop candies and chocolates really are a perfect match!]","? ? ? : [I have a question. After Makina finished eating, well, all of her, where does Serious-senpai come back from?]","Makina : [Doesn't she just spawn from over there?]","? ? ? : [Hearing you say that makes me just wanna go \"I see, understandable\", but I kinda don't really like that explanation. I mean, seriously, what the heck is she]"]},{"number":1811,"title":"Chapter 1811: Sea Bathing with Anima 8","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I got home late due to overtime, so today's chapter is a bit short.","After lying on the boat and flirting with Anima, we spent some time swimming in the sea and playing with a ball.","When we were tired after playing to some extent, we decided to have lunch, so we wiped off the water on our body with a towel and moved to our leisure sheet on the beach.","[I had a good time playing, and I'm also feeling hungry, but since it will take time if we cook now, let's just take some food out of our magic box.]","[Understood. I'll have our drinks prepared.]","[Thanks, I'm counting on you.]","My magic box contains various types of food, but considering we're going to eat on the sandy beach, ease of consumption is also important.","And so, I'm going to prepare easy-to-eat items, mainly the instant food I received from Kuro. Anima also brought out an easy-to-drink bottled tea Unnn?","[Anima, where did you get that tea?]","[Ahh, when I went back to the room earlier to prepare, Alice-dono gave me these, saying \"These are good for when you're drinking at the beach. Please ask Kaito-san about how to drink from it.\"]","[I see. Well, this certainly is suitable for drinking at the beach]","It wouldn't be surprising if Alice knew about bottled tea, and since she knows it, she would probably know how to make it as well. And so, without thinking too deeply about it, I decided to teach Anima how to open it and drink it along with her.","And then, after eating lunch, the two of us took a break while relaxing and gazing at the sea.","[Come to think of it, what are you going to do with that ship we were talking about earlier, that one Kuromueina-sama gave Master?]","[Hmmm. It's just too big, isn't it? I don't think it's suitable for a small group of people. I think the most effective way to use it is for when we're going to have a party on a ship.]","[I think Master hosting a party would be a good idea. Using expressing gratitude for the usual everyday things as an excuse, if Master would make good use of the ship you received, Kuromueina-sama would probably also be pleased. Master could also temporarily hire personnel to operate the ship.]","[Fumu, indeed]","Hearing Anima's suggestion, what she said certainly sounded like a good idea. While I have been invited to various events, I haven't had much opportunity to host my own event, that housewarming party being the only one I could remember. That's also, well, feels somewhat like a celebration for the completion of the house","[Since I'm going to use the ship Kuro gave me, I'd like to think about it in earnest If you don't mind, I would appreciate it if you could also give various opinions, Anima.]","[Please leave it to me! Shall I think about it under the assumption that we would be holding it right away?]","[Ahh, it would also be a good conversation topic. Let's think about it then]","Although it hasn't yet been decided that a party will definitely be held on the ship, it's quite fun to talk about it under the assumption that it will be held.","Just like that, I continued having a lively conversation with Anima about various things like where to hold it and the permissions we'd need.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Ahh, Serious-senpai! It gets tiring just eating fondue, so I also made solid chocolates. Ones that contain pop pop candies! Have some too, Serious-senpai~~]","Serious-senpai : [How the heck am I supposed to treat this? Cannibalism? Autosarcophagy?]","Makina : [Isn't it like how people nibble on their fingernails?]","Serious-senpai : [Stop with the metaphors that make me lose appetite! Ahh, this is delicious. I mean, the texture of the chocolate is incredibly smooth, and it feels like something made by someone with a lot of skill.]","Makina : [Fufun I am Almighty after all!]","Serious-senpai : [Annoying smug face]"]},{"number":1812,"title":"Chapter 1812: Sea Bathing with Anima 9","paragraphs":["While Anima and I were thinking about how to utilize the magic ship that Kuro gave me, we came up with quite a few different ideas for planning a ship party. I mean, it's strange how we initially just think under the assumption of \"what if we were setting up a party?\", but as we started talking about various things, it's quite curious how I started getting motivated to actually set up that party.","[If Master is going to host a party, it might be a good idea to make use of your identity as someone from another world and make things like cuisine unique to the other world.]","[I see However, there isn't that big of a difference in food culture between Trinia and Earth. Ahh, but when one asks if Japanese food is unique, it certainly is unique but I doubt that it would suit a ship party.]","Since the cuisine in this world is mostly Western-style, Japanese cuisine might be considered unique. Putting aside whether Japanese cuisine is suitable for a ship party, having such cuisine may certainly give the guests a sense of novelty.","It certainly might be a good idea to collaborate with someone like Kaori-san and serve dishes focused on other world cuisine.","[The ship that I received from Kuro had quite the size, and I feel like there shouldn't be any issues even if we invite most of the people I know.]","[Indeed. Will the main attendees be the people who came to Master's birthday party before? Well, with Shallow Vernal-sama present, it's undoubtedly going to be an extraordinary event]","[That is, well, true but such a party does sound a lot of fun. If we're going to hold a party like that, I'll definitely be asking Anima for help with various things, so I'll be counting on you at that time.]","[Hah! Please leave it to me!!!]","If we're going to have a party on the ship, it seems like I'd be relying on Anima for various things. Well, there's also Ein-san and Zwei-san, who appeared seemingly out of nowhere during the previous housewarming party, acting as if they were part of the hosting team and actively participated in the preparations","[Wouldn't Ein-san or Zwei-san join in the preparations just like they did in the previous housewarming party?]","[That certainly seems possible. It might be a good idea to send them invitations in advance and discuss having them attend only as guests. Also, you might also want to give a heads up to Kuromueina-dono]","[Ahh, yeah, the only one who could probably control those two would be Kuro If we're going to do it, let's ask her to keep them in check.]","Since I'm going to be hosting my own party, I'd like to handle the preparations with my family. Well, not in the sense of blood relatives like mom or dad, but I mean those related to my household. As for who will be part of the preparation group for the ship party, I guess it would be Anima, Caraway, Eta, Theta and Nebula?","Illness-san does oversee the household affairs for me, so she's technically part of my family, but considering she's also a maid at Lilia-san's mansion, I'm in a slight dilemma about this.","[Hmmm. Thinking about it again though, I feel like I know a lot more people now than I did back when I had my housewarming party.]","[I suppose so. Not only that, there are also worldly changes, such as Isis-dono's side almost completely functioning as their own camp and the increased visits of the High-ranking Gods to the Human Realm compared to before.]","Thinking back to the people I met since the housewarming party, there were the Six Kings' Executives, some of the High-ranking Gods, new members of Isis-san's camp, past Hero Actors like Kaori-san, and people I've met through various events With a considerable increase in acquaintances, inviting all of them would make the event quite large in scale.","No, even if I do invite all of them, would their schedule be convenient at that time? Well, I can take various measures such as reminding them that they don't have to attend if they have plans on that day","[Hmmm, I'm kinda feeling pretty motivated to have that party now.]","[Fufu, I see. Discussing and planning various aspects in something does make one eager to execute their plan. If Master is alright with it, shall we proceed and involve Cara and the others in earnestly planning this event?]","[That certainly sounds like a good idea. We might end up facing various difficulties, and if it seems like hosting a ship party would be difficult, there's always the option not to proceed with it Let's talk to everyone about this next time.]","A ship party on a luxurious ship huh Although I'm on the planning side, I'm looking forward to it. I mean, even though I've been welcomed to various events, I haven't been on the hosting side much, so being able to entertain and express gratitude to those who have taken care of me would be quite nice Rather, that's something that makes me very eager.","It seems like Anima is also in favor, so let's give this some thought a bit more seriously","<Afterword>","Makina : [I think the direction for the next arc has been decided. Ah, do you want some coffee, Serious-senpai?]","Serious-senpai : [A bitter one, please.]","Makina : [Yes. Here you go.]","Serious-senpai : [Thanks Unn? What's that round chocolate?]","Makina : [This, you see, it's a thin chocolate coating wrapped around cream that goes well with coffee. By putting it in the coffee like this, the chocolate coating gradually melts and the taste changes! Isn't it nice? Want one of these in your coffee too, Serious-senpai?]","Serious-senpai : [Make it not sweet.]","Makina : [Yes, yes There, I altered the filling and almost eliminated the sweetness. You can only taste the richness and creaminess of the chocolate!]","Serious-senpai : [Hmm Not too shabby. Well then, it would be great if things keep going like this towards the next arc]","Makina : [Wouldn't there be one or a few chapters more that had lovey-dovey stuff in them?]","Serious-senpai : [Ugheehh]","? ? ? : [No, haven't you gotten too close to each other!?]"]},{"number":1813,"title":"Chapter 1813: Sea Bathing with Anima 10","paragraphs":["After taking a break to discuss various things about the ship party, we had some more fun in the sea before returning to our cottage. After showering and rinsing off the seawater, we gathered in the living room of the cottage in casual clothing.","[We played quite a bit, so I'm feeling rather fatigued. It feels like sleeping now would be nice.]","[That might be so, but it might be a little late for a nap.]","Just as Anima said, it's about 3:00 in the afternoon, and I think it's a little late to take a nap now. Moreover, since we intend to return home at night, I'm thinking of talking with Laguna-san for a bit before heading back, so I'd like to depart around evening. In that case, I guess we'd be leaving a few more hours?","[Is there anything Anima wants to do?]","[Let's see. I don't have anything specific in mind, but I'd like to umm, relax with Master.]","[I see, relaxing would certainly be nice. The purpose of the trip was originally to thank you, so that would be just right.]","Well, we played quite a bit in the sea, so rather than being able to rest, we'd become somewhat tired from playing.. but still, at least for me, Anima doesn't seem to be tired at all. Well, I guess that's just due to the difference in basic stamina between us.","Putting that aside, Anima said she wanted to relax, but I'm somewhat concerned with that slight pause just now.","[Anima, you kinda seemed like you were hesitating to speak just now]","[Uuuu, ah, no, that is p- please wait a moment. I understand what Master is trying to say, so please wait a moment and allow my emotions to calm down.]","Hmmm. From the way she acts, it feels like she probably wants to do something lover-like. At first, she was being reserved and didn't say anything, but when I pointed this out to her, she must have sensed that I wanted her to tell me what she wanted without hesitation if possible.","And although this is just my guess, I have a feeling that Anima is trying to be somewhat honest with her feelings during this overnight stay, so I guess she's prepared to tell me what she wants.","As I wait while thinking this, Anima takes a few deep breaths, and after looking at me with a calm expression on her face, she speaks.","[Master, would you allow me to give you a lap pillow?]","[Errr, you mean you don't want to sleep on my lap like yesterday, but the other way around?]","[Yes. It may sound strange to say that I want to repay you for yesterday, but umm, I also really want to do something for Master Would that be alright?]","[I have no problem with that at all. That's something I'm happy to do for you but I feel like I might fall asleep if I lay on your lap right now.]","[That isn't a problem. I'll wake you up in a little while In fact, I would be happy if you could rest comfortably for a while.]","That's certainly just like Anima, asking such a cute and heartwarming request.","[Well then, while we're at it, I'll be having that lap pillow.]","[Yes!]","Responding to Anima, who smiled happily upon hearing my answer, with a smile, I laid down on her lap. At this moment, unlike her usual military-style outfit, Anima is dressed in a more casual outfit. Perhaps due to the use of lighter fabric for her trousers, I can feel the softness of her thighs, making it quite comfortable.","When I lay down, Anima looked genuinely delighted with a happy smile on her face, looking like a puppy with some phantom tail wagging behind her.","[How is it, Master? Does it feel comfortable?]","[Unnn. I mean, rather than just comfortable, I feel like I'm going to fall asleep soon.]","[Thank goodness. Please, feel free to rest without any worries. I'll wake Master up when the time is right]","[Thanks. I'll take your word for it then.]","I was tired from playing at the beach, and combined with the comfortable and relaxing situation, I soon began to feel sleepy. Following Anima's suggestion, I closed my eyes, and at that moment, Anima gently placed a hand over my eyes as if to cover them.","[Master, thank you for everything you did for me this time. I really should be reflecting on not taking better care of my physical health, but at the same time, I can't help but feel happy that Master cares for me like this. I hope I can return even a little bit of my feelings for Master Good night, Master. I dearly love you.]","After I heard her gentle voice, I felt a soft touch on my lips. Anima's kiss, filled with her heartfelt love for me, was incredibly comforting and made me truly happy.","It's just, being like this also makes me feel embarrassed to open my eyes now, so I guess Anima covered my eyes because she's also feeling embarrassed. And so, not answering her, savoring the feeling of happiness, I slowly drifted into sleep.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Oya, Serious-senpai is eating chocolate again. Rather, what's with the kotatsu?]","Makina : [I've already had my fill of chocolate, so I thought I'd just leave things here until next time, and I kinda put out the kotatsu on a whim. Kotatsu is great, you know~~ Ahh, we've also got mandarins, want some?]","? ? ? : [I'll have some then.]","Makina : [I want to eat too, so peel one for me.]","? ? ? : [Yeah, peeling them does feel troublesome. Well, as a reward for preparing the kotatsu and mandarins, I guess I'll indulge that level of selfishness]","Makina : [Ahh, can you, like, take off the white piths?]","? ? ? : [You're starting to give quite detailed requests huh. There you go, all peeled.]","Makina : [Ahhn.]","? ? ? : [..]","Makina : [Ahhhhhhhhhhhn.]","? ? ? : [Good grief.]","Makina : [Unnn. Delish!]"]},{"number":1814,"title":"Chapter 1814: The Hero and The Set-Meal Restaurant 1","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I don't have time today, so today's chapter is short.","During the overnight stay at a cottage with Anima, we suddenly talked about the idea of making good use of the magic ship I received from Kuro and hosting a ship party organized by me. I'm quite enthusiastic about it myself, so I'm moving forward with the plan.","I was going to visit Kaori-san to discuss with her about the menu, but before that, I thought of something and contacted a certain someone. To meet that person, I went to the Demon Realm towards Kuro's castle.","[Hello, Kaito-san. How can I be of help today?]","[Actually, I'm here to suggest, or rather, to invite Neun-san]","Yes, the person I had business with was Neun-san. No, even though I said business, it's not like I came for a specific reason, as it's more like I came here to suggest something I've been thinking about for a while.","[Errr, won't you come with me to the Friendship City for a bit?]","[U- Umm Did I do something to offend Kaito-san?]","[A- Ahh, no, that's not it Sorry. I got the order of explanation wrong.]","For Neun-san, Friendship City is the last place in the world she'd want to visit, so just hearing my words earlier, the despair in her voice seemed as if the world had come to an end.","No, of course, I don't intend to bully Neun-san either, and in fact, I think this wouldn't be something bad for her but I really made a mistake with the order of my explanation.","[Errr, actually, there's an otherworlder like us a previous Hero Actor who is now living in Friendship City and has opened her restaurant there, but did you know about this?]","[No, I haven't heard any information coming from Friendship City Even so, I see, an immigrant huh. While hearing that is quite delightful, it would also be difficult for me to visit her casually. By the way, what kind of restaurant does she have there?]","[Errr, it's a set-menu restaurant that mainly serves Japanese food]","[ ! ? ]","The expression on Neun-san's face, which looked really uneager with coming to Friendship City up to this point, clearly changed after hearing my words.","Neun-san is quite particular about Japanese cuisine, so she would probably have a strong interest in a set-meal restaurant owned by an otherworlder.","[And so, I saved her storefront in my Teleportation Magic Tool, so we could head there even almost without seeing Friendship City How about it?]","[Uuu, I- I'm honestly interested Japanese cuisine, set-meal I wanna eat.]","It seems that Neun-san is also on board with coming to visit Kaori-san. However, since we're coming to have a meal, Neun-san's true identity would definitely be exposed, so let's make sure we're clear on that.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A stomachache flag comes for Kaori]"]},{"number":1815,"title":"Chapter 1815: The Hero and the Set-Meal Restaurant 2","paragraphs":["Bringing Neun-san to Kaori-san's place has been something I've been considering for a while, but the bottleneck here is Neun-san's identity as the First Hero.","Kaori-san lives in Friendship City, a place that literally has a statue of her, so there's a possibility that Neun-san would be recognized if someone saw her face.","That said, if I were to convey this to Kaori-san first This is a rather delicate issue though, making doing that quite challenging.","[Kaori-san is an ordinary person, so even though Neun-san said you're not that good at Recognition Inhibition Magic, it would probably work against her.]","[I suppose so. I also have those magic tools that can change hairstyle and hair color, so if we're there only for a short while, she probably wouldn't realize my identity.]","[Yes, and so, in that state please visit and actually see Kaori-san. I think Kaori-san is someone trustworthy, but I don't know what kind of impression Neun-san will have of her, so I'll leave that up to you to decide.]","[I understand.]","Therefore, what I thought is to have her meet Kaori-san once, taking precautions like Recognition Inhibition Magic and such. I've also mentioned to Kaori-san that I'll be bringing someone from another world, so I asked her to let us into the restaurant during her pre-opening hours.","And so, if Neun-san thinks that Kaori-san is a trustworthy person and that it's okay for her to reveal her identity, she can convey that herself, but otherwise, she can continue using Recognition Inhibition Magic.","[Well, I'm not that adamant about hiding my true identity, so even if Kaito-san had told her, there would have been no problem, but since you had thoughtfully considered this, I'll gratefully accept this.]","[Yes. Well then, in that case let's go.]","Even if I were to convey Neun-san's true identity to Kaori-san, considering that the information about First Hero still existing was revealed during the Hydra Kingdom's Founding Festival, if rumors start spreading and it seems like it could cause a sirt, Alice or someone among her group might move to control the information.","Well, it would be best if Neun-san herself made her own judgment. If she does reveal her true identity, Kaori-san might be surprised, and for that, I'm truly apologetic but circumstances related to the First Hero are too delicate of a subject to discuss without permission, so I hope she'll forgive me for this.","With this in mind, I teleported to Kaori-san's restaurant, where I had made an appointment in advance using the Teleportation Magic Tool.","When I entered the restaurant, probably because I had told her about our visit beforehand, Kaori-san greeted us with a smile.","[Welcome, Kaito-kun! You're the human-turned-Demon he mentioned to me before, Neun-san, right? Nice to meet you, I'm Mizuhara Kaori.]","[Nice to meet you, I'm delighted to meet someone from the same homeworld. My name used to be Kujou Hikari when I was Japanese, but I now go by the name Neun. I look forward to getting to know you better]","[The same goes for me Eh?]","[Neun-san!?]","And so, when Neun-san's meeting with Kaori-san finally occurred, surprisingly, she immediately dispelled the helmet of her armor and greeted Kaori-san with her true, undisguised face. She even went on to reveal that she was Kujou Hikari","When Kaori-san was stunned and I was astonished, Neun-san turned to me and lightly smiled.","[Sorry, I kinda brought all your concerns to naught. However, if she's someone Kaito-san thinks as trustworthy, I would like to treat her with the same amount of trust, so I decided to inform upfront without all the conjectures.]","[Ah, so that's how it is No, if Neun-san's alright with it, I have no problem with it.]","[Huehhh.]","[K- Kaori-san!? Are you alright!?]","I was happy to feel the deep trust from Neun-san, but muttering something, as if she was a doll that had her strings snapped, Kaori-san slumped to the floor.","[I'm not alright This is that, isn't it? In other words, this is all about that, right?]","[Yes, umm, I'm sorry for surprising you.]","[No, unn. I could understand your side Given the flow of the conversation just now, and considering I'm not an idiot, I understand that conveying something like this wasn't something that you could do so easily. As expected, I can't blame Kaito-kun for this I can't blame you for this but GEEEEEEEZ! CAN YOU, LIKE, HOLD YOURSELF BACK!!!? HOW MANY BIG NAMES DO YOU THINK HAVE COME TO MY RESTAURANT IN THE PAST FEW MONTHS!? CAN YOU, LIKE, SPACE IT OUT A BIT MORE LIKE, GIVE ME SOME TIME TO REST OR SOMETHING, YOU KNOW!!!? EVEN THOUGH MY HEAD CAN UNDERSTAND THE SITUATION HERE, YOU DO UNDERSTAND IT WON'T MAKE MY STOMACHACHE GO AWAY, RIGHT!!!?]","Seemingly understanding that the situation was unavoidable, but still wanted to complain bitterly, Kaori-san's half-crying scream echoed through the store.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, the circumstances around Neun, or rather, the First Hero are complicated, so she understands that Kaito can't talk about it as he pleases. She understands that, but that doesn't mean her stomachache will go away]","? ? ? : [Neun-san herself isn't particularly adamant about hiding it, and even if her identity were to be revealed, she's now under Kuro-san's patronage, and I'll also take measures to handle it, so it shouldn't become a serious issue but knowing the impact her presence has on society, surpassing even the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods, she does understand Kaito-san's concerns. Well, as a result though, it seems Kaori-san received a body blow, straight to her stomach]"]},{"number":1816,"title":"Chapter 1816: The Hero and the Set-Meal Restaurant 3","paragraphs":["Since Neun-san readily told her that she was the First Hero, Kaori-san seemed to have received quite the damage. However, Kaori-san is someone who switches her thoughts fairly quickly, and after a little while, she seems to have recovered and approached Neun-san.","[Errr, Neun-san I swear to keep Neun-san's true identity a secret! It may not seem like it, but I can keep my mouth shut!]","[Fufu, no need to feel that pressured. The fact that Kujou Hikari still lives has already become widely known, especially back in Hydra Kingdom's Founding Festival The fact that Kujou Hikari is in this world is something you can casually mention without any issues. Even if it were accidentally revealed, nominally speaking, I don't belong to any camp in reality though, one could say I'm considered as Kuromu-sama's subordinate Any amount of misdirection and adaptability works. In fact, I go around quite freely without worrying about my identity too much.]","Come to think of it, when it comes to Kuro's camp, they're more like a family rather than the King and her subordinates, so Neun-san isn't exactly Kuro's subordinate.","Kuro had simply taken in Neun-san, who doesn't have any family, and treated her like family. Despite the actual situation, given the unique circumstances of the Underworld King camp, she can't really give any explanation","Now that I think about it though, she does casually participate in events like the Sacred Tree Festival, the White God Festival, and Founding Festivals, so I don't think there are almost no restrictions on her actions. As for Friendship City, she just doesn't visit this place because she doesn't want to","[Neun-san, Kaori-san, chatting is nice and all, but since we're here]","[Ahh, you're right! Neun-san, Kaito-san, please take a seat at the counter.]","Upon hearing my words, Kaori-san brightly smiled, guided me and Neun-san to our seats and handed us the menu. And then, as Neun-san browsed through the menu, her eyes sparkled, and her expression changed to one of keen interest.","[This is wonderful. Everything on the menu looks delicious. While it's tempting to order some of these unfamiliar set meals, I'll go for the classic and order the grilled salmon set meal please.]","[Then, I'll have the same thing.]","[Yeeeees. Two grilled salmon set-meals, please wait a moment~~]","After receiving our order, Kaori-san began skillfully cooking the dishes, while-san nodded in admiration as she looked around the restaurant.","[The interior of the restaurant is very relaxing. I can feel the attention to detail here and there.]","[Ah, you get it!? That's right. I'm quite particular about the interior design.]","The interior of Kaori-san's restaurant, Suiren, is a typical Japanese restaurant, and it has an atmosphere that is quite rare in this world. Having a purely Japanese style for an interior is one thing, but the menu and other items also seem to have been carefully crafted.","In fact, it seemed to be just as Neun-san had said, and Kaori-san seemed happy to be praised.","After a while, our grilled salmon set meals were served, and with a \"Thank you for the food\", Neun-san started eating with beautiful movements but she stopped eating immediately, seemingly deeply moved. This might just be my imagination, but there even seemed like a hint of tears in her eyes.","[This is it. This is what I wanted to eat.]","[You looked quite moved there. However, doesn't Kuro's place usually serve a lot of Japanese food?]","[Yes, that's right. That's certainly the case but No, I'm aware that this is an extravagant problem, but it's just not the same.]","From the fact that Kuro is apparently accustomed to using chopsticks and how their \"breakfast is mostly Japanese cuisine\", I can tell that Japanese cuisine is often served at Kuro's residence. According to what Acht and the others say, that's apparently something Neun-san strongly wished for.","Hearing my words, Neun-san looked awkward, averted her eyes, and started muttering something.","[No, the Japanese cuisine served at Kuromu-sama's residence is truly wonderful. Ein-sama is the one preparing them, so each dish is truly a taste that can be described as supreme but umm each dish is so refined that I feel like I'm eating in a ryotei or a luxury ryokan No, of course, they're undoubtedly delicious, but it's just, there's this homeliness to it saying it's not perfect might sound rude, but I've been craving this kind of simple deliciousness.]","[Ahh, indeed, if it's Ein-san, she would undoubtedly create dishes at the pinnacle of refinement, as she's someone who absolutely doesn't compromise.]","[Yes. That's why, these dishes that capture the atmosphere of Japanese home-cooked meals are so moving that it seems to stir up old memories. There's this warmth from having someone else prepare it for you, as opposed to when I make them myself It truly gives a wonderful feeling.]","[A- Ahaha, hearing you say all that makes me happy. I started this restaurant for the same reason, wanting people from our homeworld to remember the taste of home.]","Although it' doesnt have a perfect 100% taste, Kaori-san's cooking, with its homely warmth, seemed to touch Neun-san's heart, and as she continued to eat her set meal, seemingly finding the dish delicious, Kaori-san also looked somewhat happy.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It seemed like she's gonna become a regular.]","? ? ? : [Well, the location would become the biggest barrier for Neun-san though.]"]},{"number":1817,"title":"Chapter 1817: The Hero and the Set-Meal Restaurant 4","paragraphs":["After finishing the set meal with a hearty appetite, Neun-san smiled calmly as she sipped the hot hojicha tea that Kaori-san served after the meal.","[The food was wonderful. This is a good restaurant. I would have loved to come back here again, but the location is a problem.]","[I'm glad you liked it. As for the place Ahh, things would turn into a commotion if people here in Friendship City discovered Neun-san, right? Ahh, in that case, if you naturally let me know when you're coming beforehand, you can come even during the times when the store isn't open. That way, you won't have to meet the other customers]","[I'm grateful for your concern, but I would just be troubling you]","It seems that Neun-san likes Kaori-san's cooking and wants to come again, but the location still seems to be a hurdle for her.","Neun-san seems to struggle with Recognition Inhibition Magic, and even disguising her appearance has its limitations.","(Ahh, come to think of it, I forgot about this.)","Unn? Shiro-san? What's the matter, all of a sudden?","(Regarding the Recognition Inhibition Magic Tool that Kaito-san asked for earlier, we still haven't had that orthodox onsen trip we promised, but since we stayed at the onsen ryokan during the previous Founding Festival, I can go ahead and hand them over now \"Are you fine with just two\"?)","That's an unexpectedly timely help. Considerately proposing suggestions that take into account my wishes and concern for Neun-san, I truly feel Shiro-san's emotional growth, and most of all, being cared for in such a way makes me happy.","Thank you very much. If it's alright with Shiro-san, I would very much like to have two of them.","(I understand. Well then, here you go.]","As I heard those words, something that seemed to be a glasses case appeared in each of my hands. As soon as I touched them, the instructions on how to use the contents also poured into my mind.","[Umm, Neun-san. If you'd like, please take this.]","[These are oya? Glasses?]","[Yes, it's something I received from Shiro-san. When you put it on, not only does it automatically clad you with Recognition Inhibition Magic, it's one that is much more powerful than normally casted ones. Wearing those glasses, it seems that even Peerage holders won't perceive Neun-san unless they're already acquainted with you while you were wearing them.]","[It's unnerving how you just casually said you received something from the God of Creation-sama Let's pretend I didn't hear anything. Yep, I haven't heard a thing. Too busy cleaning up to pay attention]","The glasses that Shiro-san gave me have a power that is close to that of an Authority. in other words, it has power that is higher than magic, and by simply wearing these glasses, one is constantly enveloped in Recognition Inhibition Magic. As a result, they would be perceived as just an ordinary person by everyone else.","However, it seems to be flexible, as it excludes individuals with whom the wearer has already interacted with while wearing the glasses. This means there's no need to worry about acquaintances not recognizing the wearer. It seems that these functions were originally prepared with the expectation that I would use them, so they were created in consideration of that.","However, by putting the glasses into the glasses case and solemnly thinking about it, one can switch the target of Recognition Inhibition to \"Everyone\", \"Excluding Acquaintances\", and \"Excluding Family and Close Friends\", which is quite the flexible function I mean, this is quite a high-performance article.","[T- That's a very wonderful item, but I can't possibly accept such a thing]","[Ahh, no, I have one for me too. I mean, it was originally created because I asked her for one, and it seems like Shiro-san was being considerate and prepared another one for me. With the fact that they were handed over now, they're prepared with the assumption that I will give it to you, so please feel free to accept it without hesitation.]","[Thank you very much, Kaito-san, Shallow Vernal-sama. I will take good care of it.]","It seemed like it was truly an item that would make things easier for Neun-san, so even though she was feeling a bit apologetic, the joy it brought her seemed to be even more significant. In fact, Neun-san must have faced many challenging situations due to her struggles with Recognition Inhibition Magic, and if this alleviates those inconveniences, that would be great.","This is all thanks to Shiro-san's consideration. Shiro-san, thank you very much! Let's thank her again with something other than that trip.","[Eh? Wha, an earthquake!? Arehh? It doesn't feel that way outside the window though It's only in my restaurant that's shaking!? Eh? But the condiments on the shelves aren't shaking at all, so what's going on!? Also, is this just my imagination? Am I actually hearing some \"Doyaaaaa\" sound!? I don't remember earthquakes sounding like this!]","Ahh~~ Unnn. I'm really grateful to Shiro-san but I'd like you to stop with the doyaquake Even Kaori-san looked quite confused here","<Afterword>","Shallow Vernal Used Doyaquake!","The sound of smugness shakes the earth!","Kaori is confused!","Kaito used Farsight! He looks far into the distance!","Neun Acquired Super Recognition Inhibition Glasses!"]},{"number":1818,"title":"Chapter 1818: The Hero and the Set-Meal Restaurant 5","paragraphs":["It seems that it was only inside the restaurant that was shaken by the doyaquake, and there was no sign of a commotion outside. Moreover, the inside of the restaurant was also completely normal, with no abnormalities happening in the dishes or the condiments.","Maybe the shaking we were just feeling was some kind of illusion Well, since Shiro-san can do anything she wants to, it wouldn't be surprising if some mysterious power was at work","[At any rate, to get my mind back on track, I actually have another purpose for bringing Neun-san along this time.]","[Fumu, you mean?]","[Well, Neun-san is familiar with Japanese ingredients to be more specific, the Japanese ingredients that were present in this world, so I thought she might be able to help Kaori-san You know, Kaori-san did mention how there are some ingredients that you haven't found yet]","[Ahh, unnn. Knowing where certain ingredients are would certainly be helpful]","Bringing Neun-san to Kaori-san's restaurant this time wasn't only to let Neun-san enjoy Japanese cuisine, but also to provide a hint for Kaori-san's ingredient search is what I was thinking.","Neun-san is quite particular about Japanese cuisine, and based on her diary about her past travels, it seems she was searching for various Japanese ingredients, so it wouldn't be surprising if she knew about ingredients that neither I nor Kaori-san are aware of.","[I see, I certainly have confidence in my knowledge in that area. I think I know quite a bit about the Japanese ingredients that exist here in Trinia.]","[Incidentally, Kaori-san has yuzu and sudachi, so Neun-san would also benefit-]","[What!? Really!!!?]","[-Eh? Ah, yes. I heard she received them from Eden-san.]","The fact that she clearly looked astonished at my words probably means that there really is no yuzu or sudachi in this world huh","[By your reaction, does that mean there really is no yuzu or sudachi in this world, Neun-san?]","[Ye, as far as I know, there are no yuzu or sudachi in this world. There are some things that are close to that, so I have been using those as alternatives For example, when I want to use yuzu, I make use of this fruit, which is relatively close to it.]","While answering Kaori-san's question, Neun-san took out a fruit from her magic box that seemed to be about the size of a melon.","[That thing has quite the size.]","[That's right. However, its taste and aroma are the closest to yuzu Well, there are some subtle differences though.]","[In other words, it's yuzu-ish fruit It has a slightly different aroma.]","Taking a sniff of the fruit Neun-san brought out along with Kaori-san, it certainly did have a scent that's kinda reminiscent of yuzu. However, it has this subtle difference from yuzu one might not notice without being told.","[Kaori-san, could you please give me some yuzu and sudachi? If I could acquire them, I think Raz-sama could grow them Of course, I will pay you for it.]","[Ahh, there's no need for the money. There are plenty of them, and each plant bears 5 fruits each day In exchange though, can I ask if there's a way to obtain matsutake mushrooms? I heard a bit from Kuromueina-sama that they do exist but]","In exchange for handing over yuzu and sudachi, what Kaori-san asked was about matsutake mushrooms. Matsutake huh, that would be nice Come to think of it, didn't Lanza-san mention how they have matsutake mushrooms?","Camellia-san said she's always willing to make an arrangement, but I haven't had any actual negotiations with her yet.","[To be honest, it's pretty hard to get them.]","[Ahh, I guess it really would be hard to get them without the connections?]","[Yes, while it has a different name here, there are trees called Needle Trees that are like the Red Pines in our world. They grow in the frontier regions of the Demon Realm However, the Spirits that govern that land significantly limit the harvest, so only a few make it to the market each year.]","It didn't seem that way when I talked to Camellia-san, but is it really that rare?","[I also heard from Kuro that it's hard to get them without the connections, but isn't that to preserve their market value?]","[No, it's not like that. Many of the Spirits are apparently indifferent to money. Just like Lillywood-sama, they have a mindset that as long as they have enough money for their needs, that's enough. Consequently, they only release the minimum amount to meet their needs in the market.]","[I see, we'd need to negotiate with them to obtain those huh.]","[That would indeed be the best approach, but obtaining matsutake mushrooms is challenging without strong connections. The forest where Needle Trees grow is protected by the Spirits of the Spear-branched Tree, so one must obtain permission from these Spirits The Spirits of the Spear-branched Tree are closed-off and not very inclined to interact with the outside though, making it challenging to establish connections with them Ahh~~ But I do recall hearing about the Spirit who became their new leader about a hundred years ago apparently aims to reach the top and is inclined to interact with the outside world.]","As I thought, or rather, just as Kuro had told me, Neun-san doesn't have much interest in matsutake mushrooms, and was explaining about them in a casual manner.]","[I see Then, I guess it would be best to ask for Kaito-kun on this one then.]","[Even Kaito-san would find it challenging without a clear pathway to connect with her though]","[Ahh, no I'm already acquainted with that leader you mentioned.]","[]","Upon hearing my words, Neun-san looked as if she was a cat that was suddenly cast out into space.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Arehh? Don't Spirits basically become stronger over the years?]","? ? ? : [No, it's just that their growth is extremely slow, but they can grow with training. Also, when it comes to growth over time, the point at which growth reaches its peak depends on talent, so Lanza-san is blessed with talent enough to surpass their previous leader.]"]},{"number":1819,"title":"Chapter 1819: The Hero and the Set-Meal Restaurant 6","paragraphs":["As the topic of matsutake mushrooms came up, the conversation inevitably shifted to Japanese ingredients. Or rather, it took the form of me and Kaori-san asking Neun-san various questions.","[Heehhh So eels do exist here huh. I don't think I've seen them]","[Eels are actually specialties of Archlesia Empire, not the Hydra Kingdom, so even though you may have some difficulty finding them, you can generally find eel kabayaki and other eel dishes at stalls. It's just, they were rather minor so they can be somewhat rare.]","At Kaori-san's question filled with curiosity, Neun-san responded with a wry smile. In this world, I suppose eels might be considered some kind of B-class gourmet or something. In the first place, rice consumption is minor in this world, so eel kabayaki, which goes perfectly with white rice, isn't that popular.","However, although it's a minor food, it seems that there are some restaurants that cater them, so I would definitely like to try them myself.","After talking like this for a while, Neun-san suddenly seemed to have remembered something.","[Ahh, come to think of it This may seem like advertising, but would you be interested in this, Kaori-san?]","[That is soy sauce and miso Ahh, you also have tofu.]","[Yes. They're products that are handled in the store I oversee]","[Eh? Neun-san, you have your own store?]","The three items that Neun-san took out of the magic box and laid out were soy sauce, miso and tofu, all of which were properly packaged and looked, just as Neun-san said, like marketed products.","However, I had never heard that Neun-san had her own store. I did hear how she was supplying kanji calligraphy works to one of Kuro's stores but","[Yes, actually, the sales of the calligraphy works I started selling after getting advice from Kaito-san were quite good, so Kuromu-sama suggested that I could try supervising various Japanese products in a dedicated store, and she provided a store for me. I think she was being considerate of me though, knowing that I usually worry about my lack of income from work.]","[I see However, indeed, when it comes to handling Japanese items if it's supervised by the fussy Neun-san, the quality of the goods seems like they'd be quite high.]","As expected of Kuro, I guess. She just readily handed a store to Neun-san. That said, it certainly is difficult for Neun-san, with her position, to work with other trading companies, and I think it's good she took that into consideration.","And so, Neun-san is now promoting the products she deals there to Kaori-san, who deals in Japanese set meals","[Yes, I may have been a layman, but I have been improving my soy sauce and miso for nearly 1000 years, so I have confidence in their taste. As for the tofu, with the help of Ein-sama, I'm confident they have improved more than the other two. This is a sample, so if it's alright, would you like to taste it?]","[Then, since you're offering Ahh, they're amazing! These are really tasty! They're all much better quality than what I have here in my restaurant. I would really like to stock up on these.]","[By all means, we're also in the midst of expanding our business connections as well I usually leave business connection development to others since I can't really appear much in public, so I will arrange for someone to come here later, and you can discuss with them the price and other matters at that time.]","[Yes! We're in your care!]","It seems that Kaori-san also liked the items made by Neun-san, as their discussion about purchasing proceeded in a very realistic manner. Well, it seems they eventually decided that detailed discussions were scheduled for later with someone on Neun-san's side handling it in her stead, but at that moment, something occurred to me, so I decided to inquire about it.","[Speaking of which, Kaori-san's restaurant handles tofu too, right? Doesn't that mean you also source them from somewhere?]","[No. I couldn't find any trading companies that make and sell tofu, so I learned how to make them from Shige-san and produced them myself. However, since they're something created by a layman, their texture and taste are lacking I've been wanting good tofu, so I'm really happy about this discussion!]","Just from the fact that Neun-san previously asked me about how to make tofu, it's clear that tofu wasn't in circulation in this world before. Now, it seems that Neun-san is selling them in her store, so there's a possibility that they'd be circulated in the future","I hadn't paid much attention to the tofu in the miso soup at Kaori-san's restaurant, so bringing up the topic made me wonder where she was getting her tofu from, but it seems that she was making them herself.","However, it seems that Kaori-san really only made tofu for her restaurant, so combined with the fact that her restaurant is located in Friendship City, a place Neun-san intentionally avoids, it's not surprising that Neun-san didn't know about the existence of tofu in this world until she met me.","Even so, gathering with people from the same homeworld and having various conversations like this which leads to new discoveries is quite fun. While it's likely that Neun-san's expertise in Japanese ingredients surpasses ours, given that she has lived in this world for over 1000 years, we still had a very lively conversation.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [In a sense, it's ironic how tofu exists only in Friendship City, which is outside of Neun's information-gathering area Shigenobu seemed like he'd only make enough for his family if she had asked Alice, wouldn't Neun find out how? No, but Kuro did say how it was difficult to make contact with her in the first place back when Kaito wasn't in Trinia Either way is difficult for Neun to get info on tofu huh]"]},{"number":1820,"title":"Chapter 1820: The Hero and the Set-Meal Restaurant 7","paragraphs":["After talking about Japanese ingredients, the topic of conversation eventually led to Japan-related stuff. Neun-san is kind and easy to talk to, and moreover, since they're from the same homeworld, Kaori-san seemed to be enjoying the conversation.","[Come to think of it, one of the World King's Executives, the Seven Princesses, is the Cherry Blossom Princess, right? That means there are cherry blossoms here too, right?]","[Yes, Blossom-san is the Spirit of the Cherry Blossom Tree. Lillywood-sama heard about cherry blossoms from me and became interested in them, so she created new cherry blossom trees, which grow mainly in the Central Great Forest that Lillywood-sama governs.]","[Speaking of Blossom-san, she sure is fond of Japanese culture, isn't she?]","[She certainly is.]","From the somewhat subtle expression Neun-san has on her face at my words, it seems she also knows about Blossom-san's slightly deviated knowledge of Japan.","Arehh? But then, if Neun-san and Blossom-san are acquainted with each other It shouldn't be surprising for Neun-san to teach her the correct knowledge. I mean, from Blossom-san's perspective, Neun-san should be someone familiar with otherworld culture, so it wouldn't be strange for her to actively interact with Neun-san.","[What kind of person is Blossom-sama?]","[She's an honest and straightforward good person. Yes, there's no doubt about that However, umm, she can be a bit persistent with her own assumptions One she believes something is the truth, she tends to become very forward and may not listen to others and somehow, she firmly believes that I'm \"an otherworld enthusiast kindred just like her\".]","[Eh? Is that so?]","[Yes, in fact, Blossom-san is younger than me, so she doesn't know me from when I was still Human. Perhaps that's why, even when I mentioned being a former otherworlder, she just perceived it as \"my setting\" Heck, she even responded with \"What a coincidence! I'm a Samurai too!\" once.]","Yeah, I can somewhat picture that scene in my mind. That's right, Blossom-san is undeniably a good person with an honest and straightforward personality, but once she's convinced something is so, she can be a bit too single-minded.","I mean, she still thinks I'm a \"Samurai Master\", and since my attempts to correct her won't reach her at all, Neun-san was probably pushed away by the same feeling.","[Well, in the first place, there's not really a precedent for someone like me who has transformed their body from a Human's to a Demon's or rather, from one species to another, so I can understand why she's got such a mindset.]","[Come to think of it, it may have skipped my mind from the shock of hearing you're the First Hero, but Neun-san did mention how you were reincarnated as a Demon I guess that must be something quite difficult?]","[Although it's an advanced technique, changing one's appearance and other characteristics isn't that difficult. However, transforming into a Demon while maintaining my human qualities like in my case, keeping my appearance exactly the same and only changing my body structure, is quite challenging. Since a being's magic power's wavelength varies depending on the species, it seems that without precise adjustments down to the smallest details, some abnormalities can occur during the transformation process. It's at a level where achieving it is possible only for those with deep magical knowledge and extremely precise magic power manipulation ability, much like Kuromu-sama.]","It seems that changing a person's race really is quite challenging. When she did talk about this to Lilia-san and the others, they were also quite surprised, and I can now understand why. However, from the way Neun-san was speaking, it seems that if one isn't fixated on a specific appearance or characteristic, doing that is quite possible.","However, that would mean there's a possibility you'd end up looking like a monster, making people uncomfortable to do it","[It's especially more challenging when one attempts to do it by oneself. Altering one's own body runs the risk of failure with even the slightest error in the procedure or a slight misalignment in magic power manipulation Let's see. For example, if someone has Kaito-san's Sympathy Magic, which allows for \"extremely precise understanding of magic power\", combined with an \"enormous amount of magic power\", and Duchess Lilia's \"exceptional talent\", it might be possible for one to reincarnate into the desired species.]","[Speaking of which, there's the child named Eul Eulpecula in Isis-san's place, and she's trying to remake her own body I guess it must be risky huh?]","[Hmmm It depends on the extent of the transformation. If it's just altering the physical form, it might not be too difficult but well, if Isis-sama did give her her approval, then there shouldn't be any issues. Isis-sama is one of the foremost experts in magic power manipulation in the world, and with her profound knowledge, she, just like Kuromu-sama, could likely change the species of others. If it seems risky, she would undoubtedly intervene and advise against it.]","[I see, I'm glad to hear that.]","I've heard that Eul is studying hard with the goal of having the same form as me or Isis-san, so hearing Neun-san's story made me a bit uneasy, but indeed, with Isis-san overseeing her, she should be alright.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Come to think of it, Eulpecula is trying to remake her body, isn't she?]","? ? ? : [It seems like Eul is aiming to incorporate the strong points of Humans and Demons into her new body, striving to become a Demon with the growth potential of Humans. It seems she personally wants to inherit traits from both Kaito-san and Isis-san. As expected, achieving that would be quite challenging, and even if she has considerable talent nearing Lilia-san's level, she'd be struggling, so she will probably have to take a few more years to achieve it.]","Serious-senpai : [Looking at it the other way though, that means she'd be successful in a few years huh]"]},{"number":1821,"title":"Chapter 1821: The Hero and the Set-Meal Restaurant 8","paragraphs":["After chatting with Neun-san and Kaori-san for a while, I remembered the other reason for coming here and decided to talk to Kaori-san about it.","[Come to think of it, Kaori-san, I actually have something I'd like to consult with you I'm actually thinking about inviting acquaintances and planning to do something like a party, and I'm planning to have Japanese cuisine those that are considered as \"otherworld cuisine\" served as the main focus at that time However, it's only natural, but among my acquaintances, there are few people skilled in cooking and knowledge about Japanese cuisine, so I would really like to consult with you about this]","[Ahh~~ I see, rice-based dishes certainly are relatively uncommon in this world, and many people may not be familiar with them. However, if Kaito-kun is going to host a party, serving that kind of cuisine would be good.]","In fact, there are those I know such as Alice that fit that criteria, but when one speaks of otherworld cuisine, the one that comes to mind is Kaori-san.","Kaori-san runs a set-meal restaurant, so she has a wide repertoire, and she seems to have a good grasp of Japanese cuisine that suits the tastes of people in this world, so she's quite reliable.","In addition, Neun-san, who is familiar with Japanese ingredients, is also here, so this would be a good time to ask for advice. Well, the problem is that we haven't yet decided who to invite to the party, so this is more of a consultation on what kind of food people would like rather than a menu decision.","[In short, we are going to have some kind of home party, so you want my advice on what to serve huh Unnn. In that case, do you want me to help you?]","[Eh? I'd appreciate that, but is that alright?]","[Of course, you can always rely on Big Sis. And so, how many people are there going to be? About 20?]","To my surprise, Kaori-san is going to cooperate with me on the food-related aspects of the party. In this case, cooperation seems like it wouldn't only involve advice on menu creation, but also assistance in cooking and other aspects of the party.","I do feel apologetic, but Kaori-san seems quite enthusiastic, almost like she's the opportunity to act like my Senpai. How should I say this She looks kinda charming.","What she's doing makes me think of her as a Senpai rather than a Big Sis but I think it'd be boorish to point that out.","[In that case, since you're saying that, please allow me to accept your kind words. Since you have your own restaurant, please don't overexert yourself. I haven't thought about the exact number of people, but I'm guessing it will be around 100?]","[It's more than I expected. Come to think of it, Kaito-kun does have a lot of acquaintances. W- Well, umm, with that number, it should be alright.]","[Kaori-san, I don't think you should promise without thought]","Considering the size of the magic ship Kuro gave me, I think I can invite more people but since I'm limiting the party to acquaintances only this time, I think the number of attendees should be around that.","If it was only my acquaintances, I think it would be even less than 100, but considering that Ryze-san and Chris-san would be bringing some guards, thinking that the numbers would be around 100 should be alright.","[It's alright. Even though it may not seem like it, I'm quite skilled at cooking, and besides, once in a while, I want to show Kaito-kun a Senpai-like side of me and regain my dignity as the older one.]","[No, that's not it We're talking about a party hosted by Kaito-san here, okay? That would definitely be a gathering of the top figures from various fields]","[Eh? N- No, no, Kaito-kun certainly does have an impressive circle of friends, and while they're usually a bit overwhelming for me, such top figures are busy with their own responsibilities, so having all of those busy people attend might not be feasible]","[On Kaito-san's birthday, all the Six Kings, the Supreme Gods, God of Creation-sama herself, and the Three Rulers came, you know?]","[Ah Can we, like, forget what I said just now b- but if I tell him that, my dignity as the Senpai will]","While I was lost in thought, Neun-san and Kaori-san were whispering something to each other. I couldn't catch the content of their conversation, but I couldn't help but notice that Kaori-san's expression was very grim.","[At any rate, I'm in your care, Kaori-san! Having your help is very reassuring Let's talk about this in more detail later.]","[Unnn You can count on me]","The expression on Kaori-san's face, who for some reason, looked at me as if she had given up on everything, left quite an impression in my mind.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, she's the type to make promises without thought and blunder]"]},{"number":1822,"title":"Chapter 1822: The Hero and the Set-Meal Restaurant 9","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I'm busy with tax returns and didn't have time, so today's chapter is a bit short.","Just as Kaori-san agreed to cooperate with me with an indescribable expression on her face How should I say this as if she had done something she can't take back anymore, a hummingbird suddenly comes towards Kaori-san.","[Arehh? Kaori-san, you bought a hummingbird magic tool?]","[Fufu, ehehe It was only a few days ago, but I finally bought one! Thanks to Kaito-kun introducing Akane-san and Raz-sama, the expenses I use on supplies have decreased, and the improvement of quality resulted in increased sales, which gives me more allowance in budget! Since I'm gaining more acquaintances outside of Friendship City, I took the plunge and bought one because it's convenient to have it. Let's register each other later!]","As expected of Kaori-san's quick change of pace, unlike the strange expression she had on her face earlier, she told me with a smile that conveyed her excitement.","It's charming seeing her acting like she was showing off her newly bought smartphone, and although this may be impolite, despite being older, she's brimming more of cuteness rather than the maturity of an adult.","[Hmmm. Kaito-kun, Olivia-sama wants to express her greetings but is that alright?]","[Ahh, Olivia-san wants to come huh. How did she know I was here Ahh, I suppose she could tell while I'm here in Friendship City? Yes, if Kaori-san is alright with it, there's no problem.]","For a moment, I wondered how she knew I was at Kaori-san's restaurant, but I remembered that while Olivia-san is within Friendship City, she has a power comparable to the Supreme Gods with a vast range of abilities.","That especially goes when it comes to matters concerning Friendship City, as she is apparently able to do anything to some extent, so it must be easy for her to tell who is coming to Friendship City.","And because of Olivia-san's personality, I could understand why she would want to come and say hello if I were here, so I told Kaori-san it was fine as long as she, the owner of the restaurant, was okay with it.","[Olivia-sama huh It's been a while since we've met.]","[Are you acquainted with her?]","[Yes, we met face to face when Shallow Vernal-sama first created Olivia-sama, but we haven't met since then Olivia-sama, you see she basically never leaves Friendship City.]","[Ahh, I see. With a situation like that, you'd certainly never meet.]","Olivia-san, who basically never goes out of Friendship City, and Neun-san, who basically never approaches Friendship City There certainly isn't any factor where they'd meet at all.","However, as Olivia-san holds the position of safeguarding and preserving the original text of the Friendship Treaty, which can be said to be the achievement of the First Hero, Neun-san, I feel like she would also see Neun-san as a rather significant figure.","It will be interesting to see how the meeting between the two will turn out.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Can I tell you my personal prediction?]","? ? ? : [The floor is yours.]","Serious-senpai : [Olivia probably has no interest in Neun at all I mean, that hummingbird she sent to Kaori only said she wanted to say his greetings to Kaito, with no mention of Neun at all.]"]},{"number":1823,"title":"Chapter 1823: The Hero and the Set-Meal Restaurant 10","paragraphs":["Soon after, Olivia-san arrived, and inside Kaori-san's restaurant was a strange combination of Olivia-san, the Founder of the Friendship City, Neun-san, the First Hero, and otherworlders me and Kaori-san.","I was curious about the relationship between Neun-san and Olivia-san, and like me, Kaori-san was also curious, alternately looking at Olivia-san and Neun-san.","[It's been a while, Olivia-sama.]","[Kujou Hika Excuse me, it was Neun now, right? It's been a thousand years, hasn't it. Long time no see.]","They first greeted each other briefly. The two of them haven't met in a thousand years because Neun-san doesn't stop by the Friendship City and doesn't participate in the Festival of Heroes, so they'd probably have a lot of things they'd like to talk about.","Especially since Olivia-san is the head of the city that honors the First Hero, so she'd probably have lots of thoughts","[Well then, if you'll excuse me Mizuhara Kaori, my apologies for coming before your opening today. And once again, Miyama Kaito-sama, it's a pleasure to see you like this again. I apologize for being somewhat late in coming to greet you.]","[Eh? Ah, no, hello, Olivia-san.]","is what I was thinking, but after giving her a brief nod, she immediately dropped the subject and came over to us!? To say even a few words to Kaori-san, I suppose it's to be expected of the earnest Olivia-san.","[Seeing you safe and sound today makes me very happy. When Miyama Kaito-sama visits us, I feel as if the air in our Friendship City becomes a little brighter.]","[I- I think that's an exaggeration]","[No, that isn't the case at all Ahh, come to think of it, I have heard that the tea brand Miyama Kaito-sama has launched is doing very well. I'm very happy to hear that. Indeed, being a person of Miyama Kaito-sama's caliber, you can achieve significant results in any field they enter.]","Olivia-san's shining eyes were full of respect as she spoke, and I felt that her expression was richer than before.","She seems to be visiting Kaori-san's restaurant often and getting along well with her, and that combined with the fact that she seems to be getting more human, she seems to be changing for the better.","However, I can sense slight nervousness from her. When Olivia-san is nervous, she tends to praise me more than usual, so there might be some underlying reason for this.","[That's completely different from the time and passion she showed for us. Rather, the reason why she purposely said her greetings to Kaito-kun last was because she was going to talk with him the longest huh I guess that's just the usual Olivia-sama.]","[I'm rather surprised. I thought she was a taciturn person who hardly spoke, but she's more talkative than I imagined.]","[No, when it comes to people other than Kaito-kun, she's exactly as Neun-san imagined, calm and composed, expressing herself in a matter-of-fact way. It's only when it comes to Kaito-kun that she seems like a different person, with more vivid expressions and emotions.]","[I see.]","[However, she seems to be a little more nervous than usual today. Is it because she's meeting up with Kaito-kun here?]","Kaori-san seems to know quite a bit about Olivia-san, possibly because Olivia is a regular customer at her restaurant, and it seems that just like me, Kaori-san sensed Olivia-san's restaurant.","[She's nervous? She seemed pretty casual and lively with the way she speaks though]","[Hmmm, but she seemed to speak more than usual, like she's being conscious of something Ahh I see now]","[Did you realize something?]","[I certainly did, but the circumstances about that are complicated, so I'll close my mouth here Sorry.]","It seems that Kaori-san had an idea why Olivia-san was like this, but she doesn't intend to speak, leaving the details unclear.","Although I'm wondering about this answer myself, I decided to just ask Olivia-san in front of me.","[Olivia-san, if there's anything troubling you, please feel free to let me know. I might not be able to be of much help, but I'm always here to help]","[Thank you very much. Miyama-sama's kindness shines brilliantly like sunlight cutting through overcast skies. I do indeed hold the desire to touch such a compassionate light, and the gentle Miyama Kaito-sama will definitely receive me with warmth but please accept my apologies. This isn't exactly a problem, as it's more of a matter of consciousness, so I'd appreciate it if you'd be understanding for now. Once I've firmly gathered my resolve and assumptions, I will let you know.]","[Ah, yes. I understand.]","While still showering me with her usual exaggerated praises, Olivia-san mentioned that she can't talk about what's troubling her at the moment, but will do so later. It doesn't seem too serious though, as Kaori-san, who seemed to know the circumstances, is just smiling kindly, so it would probably be alright I do feel curious, but I'll refrain from delving any further.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh, her date plans for Kaito haven't been finalized, so she can't ask him out on a date at the moment, but I guess she was feeling nervous thinking about the time when she does ask him out huh]"]},{"number":1824,"title":"Chapter 1824: God and Koppepan","paragraphs":["Before I knew it, I found myself in a place that seemed to be a school rooftop, with its striking wire mesh and concrete. For the time being, let's organize the situation I went to Kaori-san's restaurant with Neun-san, and Olivia-san joined in later. After that, we chatted about the aforementioned party and other things.","Without any particular issues, our chat time ended, and we dispersed. After returning home, I spent the day as usual and went to sleep or so I thought, but I'm now in this situation.","Unnn. At this point, I can already tell who caused this situation. And as if to affirm my conjecture, a cheerful voice resounded.","[Well~~ school rooftops really are brimming with youth!]","[I suppose so. Well, the high school I went to didn't allow access to the rooftop though]","[Ahh~~ that's certainly how it commonly is. In fiction works, school rooftops are often depicted, but in reality, many rooftops aren't accessible due to safety considerations.]","[Right Ah, for the time being, hello, Makina-san. Is this, like, inside a dream?]","[Hello, my beloved child. I see you look exceptionally cute today again! Unnn! As usual, this is inside my child's dream~~ I made it so we're on the rooftop today!]","With her single mechanical wing and rainbow-colored eyes, suddenly appearing before my eyes was Makina-san, the main body of Eden-san. She often interferes with my dreams like this.","I tend to forget my memories during these encounters when I wake up, so when I encounter dreams like this I would often just think \"Ah, I see.\". That especially goes when I remember Mana-san, who I've realized by recollecting my time here, was actually Makina-san.","While pondering about these things, Makina-san, with a bright smile on her lips, offered me what seemed to be a carton of milk and packaged koppepan.","[For today's snack, we have coffee milk and koppepan! Don't they feel student-like? As for this koppepan, it has strawberry jam and margarine as filling. I think this combination is the most delicious.]","[Indeed, that combination is undeniably good.]","[Unn, unnn! Of course, other fruit-cream combinations are tasty too, but I still think strawberry jam and margarine are the best. They just won't work with French bread. It's because it's koppepan that these two's flavors are enhanced!]","Despite being an omniscient and omnipotent god, Makina-san really feels like a commoner, making her surprisingly amicable. When she's in her Eden-san form, I could feel how crazy she is more, but while she's in Makina-san's state, how should I say this This might be disrespectful to a god, but she feels so klutzy that she has this friendly atmosphere around her.","Well, she actually still has her crazy moments at times like this though","For the time being, I sat on the edge of the rooftop and enjoyed the koppepan and coffee milk that Makina-san gave me. It's been a while since I had koppepan, but as Makina-san said, its simple taste is an exquisite delight.","[Speaking of bread, you know about melonpan?]","[Yes, I do.]","[About that, people have this perception that the upper cookie dough should be crispy, but I like the kind where the upper part feels moist although saying it's mushy might not be the best description, but I really like that type of melonpan.]","[Ahh~~ I get what you mean. It may stick to the back of your teeth, but that moist feeling has a unique deliciousness that the crispy ones don't have.]","[Right! That's exactly it! As expected of my beloved child, you really do get me!]","When Eden-san is present, our conversations are often calm. Since Eden-san comes around about 5 times a week, we have many opportunities to talk, but generally speaking, aside from occasional outbursts, Eden-san listens calmly to what I have to say.","On the other hand, when she's in her Makina-san form, she tends to bring up various topics. Perhaps because Makina-san herself has a cheerful personality, talking like this is quite enjoyable.","No, of course, there's always the caveat of \"assuming she doesn't go out of control\", but at least I feel like my discomfort with her, which I had before, has somewhat diminished.","[I like that one bread too. You know, the rollpan with raisins inside and brushed with margarine.]","[Ahh~~ yeah, those are great. They taste even better when heated up, but there's always the risk of the margarine oozing out when you bite into it.]","[I know what you mean. It gets sticky on your hands.]","[Exactly! Moreover, it's not like the margarine would be properly applied to every section of the bread, so it would sometimes ooze out and sometimes not, which makes it tricky. But well, eating it like that is still delicious, so I end up heating them anyway Speaking of raisin filling, there's also mushipan]","Watching Makina-san, whose expressions change frequently but always with a bright smile on her lips, I couldn't help but smile too.","Just like that, we spent some time chatting happily about bread for a while, enjoying an indescribably peaceful moment with Makina-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Arehh? His evaluation of Makina-san surprisingly isn't bad He did say that \"assuming she doesn't go out of control\" part, but I still feel like they've gotten pretty close to each other.]","<Translator's Notes>","Koppepan","a soft, oblong-shaped white bread, Japan's take on bread rolls or hot dog buns. Name is based on the word \"coup\", meaning cut + pan, which means bread. Melonpan","Not made with melons, but resembles one. They're traditionally not melon flavored, but manufacturers have added melon flavoring to melonpan recently. Rollpan Mushipan","Steamed cake"]},{"number":1825,"title":"Chapter 1825: Memories on a Luxury Cruise Ship","paragraphs":["After eating koppepan with Makina-san in my dream, we had our usual chat, and the topic of conversation went to the ship party I was planning.","There was no problem for Makina-san to know about the ship party. I mean, it was natural for her to know about it with her omniscience.","[A ship party huh~~ How nostalgic.]","[Have you been to a ship party before, Makina-san?]","[Unnn. I attended one that's being held on a luxury cruise ship. Well~~ It was really great and left a deep impression on me]","[Makina-san?]","I think this would probably be a story from before she became a God, but Makina-san seemed to have memories related to a ship party, as she had a nostalgic expression on her face. However, just as she was talking about it, halfway through, her expression turned into anger.","It's not as if she was angry with me, instead seemingly angry because she remembered something that happened at the ship party she attended.","[My beloved child, listen closely, okay? As your mother, I advise you, even with close friends, it's not good to trust them too much! There are bad people out there who lie without hesitation!!!]","[H- Huhh Is that so?]","[That's right!!! She took advantage of the fact that it was my first time at a casino, telling me lies like \"It's bad manners to bet more than one chip at a time in roulette\" and \"In poker, it's an unspoken agreement to bet the lowest chip first, and those who don't do it should be ashamed\", all with a face that seemed to say she's doing it out of kindness!!!]","[I- I see?]","[I did think it was strange, you know? I should have had a complete victory with my omniscience, yet why was I losing by such a large margin Just when I was wondering if I was just that much of an amateur and had been gambling unskillfully Gununu.]","Yeah~~ That's definitely Alice. I've heard that Makina-san and Alice are best friends, and they probably rode on a luxury cruise ship together before Makina-san became a God.","So, did they have a match of some sort at that time? And Alice, who thought she would be at a disadvantage in an upfront contest against omniscient Makina-san, told lies to Makina-san, and as the novice Makina-san trusted her best friend, Alice won","[T- That's how should I say this unfair, isn't it?]","[That's right! That was just mean!!! After she did all that, she came and talked about a punishment game as if it's her natural right!? At that time, I thought I had just normally lost, but then, after I realized later that I had been deceived]","[That's probably.. No, that's definitely Alice, isn't it? Well, it does seem like something Alice would do, but did you complain later when you realized it?]","[Yeah I did tell her. I angrily said \"How dare you deceive me like that\" but I was told \"I just said that because I wanted to have an even match with my beloved best friend Makina, seeking for a handicap against your omniscience, but it seems I went a little overboard with the handicap, I'm sorry\" Well, my omniscience is also unfair, and it's my fault for not suggesting for me to not use my omniscience right from the start We're best friends after all, I understand why she'd want us to be even Ehehe.]","[.]","No, aren't you being too easy!? It seems like she was completely cajoled, being all happy from being called \"beloved best friend\".","This is probably not the only time this happened Makina-san seems quite soft on Alice, and I have a feeling that she was deceptively coaxed into various other things as well.","Seeing Makina-san, who just a moment ago was angry, now happily talking about Alice and their journey, I couldn't help feeling a sense of warmth. Even though I usually recognize her as being the most dangerous among my acquaintances, how should I say this Being like this makes her look charming, considerably changing my impression of her.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, because she doesn't use her omniscience when it comes to Alice and trusts her as her best friend, she usually believes what she says, and even if she finds out what Alice does later, she's so lenient with Alice that she ends up getting deceived]"]},{"number":1826,"title":"Chapter 1826: In Some Way, She’s Just Like Always","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","Syosetu was under maintenance yesterday, so I wasn't able to post an update yesterday. Therefore, in order to match the amount of text in the two-day update, \"we have increased the amount of Makina's lines in the story\".","Incidentally, I have to admit that I was a bit nervous when I started talking about the ship party with Makina-san. I was afraid that she might say something like \"I'll help you\", but fortunately, she moved on to talk about her memories together with Alice, which was a relief","[Ahh, that's right! My beloved child, I will also help you with the party!]","[..]","Ahh~~ I see so the party persuasion starts here huh Now then, how should I respond here? Even if I say I plan to prepare this with just family this time, she might retort with \"I'm your mother, so I'm family\", and if I give her a weird excuse, that might trigger her rampage switch, which will be very troublesome.","She tends to interpret most of my persuasions very positively, which often results in increased affection and favorability towards me, causing her to go on a rampage I feel like I'm playing a game in which I'm desperately searching for a way to avoid getting cornered.","[Errr, I appreciate the sentiment, but you see, when I wake up, I forget what happens here]","[Fufu, you don't need to worry about that. I was going to reveal this later but I've actually adjusted my contract with Shallow Vernal! Now that my Makina body can also be brought into that world, my beloved child won't have to forget about what happens here. Aren't you glad? You're glad, aren't you? That's right, being able to remember about Mother is nice, isn't it? Well~~ Seeing you being this happy makes me feel a bit embarrassed.]","That's strange, even though I haven't responded a single word yet I would like you to refrain from incorporating imaginary Kaito reactions into our conversation while the person himself is present.","No, her imaginations aside, I was thinking of declining with the excuse of not being able to inherit memories from this dream, but it seemed like that issue was somehow being resolved already.","Come to think of it, the whole point of making me forget my memories in the first place was so that Shiro-san wouldn't notice, and if she already talked with Shiro-san about that, then there should be no need to adjust my memories at that point.","[Is that as Mana-san, who had come to visit several times before?]","[Ah, no. That terminal kinda possesses abilities close to my main body Well, you know, since that terminal's power is too significant and could potentially impact the world if not properly prepared, I can't operate it frequently. So, basically, I intend to continue to act as I always have. Still, I can sometimes come to meet you in this form too!]","[I- I see]","In contrast to the happy smile Makina has on her face, my smile is slightly forced. After all, I lost the card that would allow me to reject her peacefully, so now I'm wondering how I could avoid Makina-san's help","[I'm very happy that Makina-san feels that way, but I was thinking that this time, if possible, I'd like to have the party with just me and the people who live in my home as the hosting side]","[Huh!? I- I see, you're completely right!!!]","Deciding not to complicate things further, I opted to speak to Makina-san directly and straightforwardly. Thereupon, Makina-san looked momentarily dazed, but then she suddenly looked as if she thought of something.","[I see, my beloved child wants to show Mother that you have grown up and that you can do things on your own! Ahh, how thoughtless of me I was just about to help impulsively, but it's not a mother's role to do just about everything for her child. Sometimes, it's also important to watch as your child grows up Ahh, but this is indeed a terribly vexing problem. There are too many advantages to both helping and not helping. The advantage of helping is that I can engage in a joint task filled with love with my beloved child. My beloved child would be very happy to be with Mother for a long time, and in a situation where Mother offers her help, my beloved child, who is usually shy and restrained, would be able to fully depend on his mother. And such a thing would be an act Mother shall wholeheartedly receive Such would be great. Really great. This option, if I were to describe it, is the lovey-dovey affectionate route. I would love to decide on this route right away, but the other option is just as appealing. Children tend to exert themself because they want to show their parents how they have grown up. That's why my beloved child doesn't want everything to be done by me, his mother, and instead has the desire to do things with his own strength and show the results to me, his beloved mother. If that's the case, accepting those feelings is an incredibly important role for a mother. I won't be able to see my beloved child who has grown a bit taller in an attempt to become more adult-like unless I go through this route! This kind of innocence tends to fade with familiarity, and a slightly more mature beloved child, standing proudly for his mother, would surely be incredibly adorable. And I, gently stroking my beloved child's head, would be praising his efforts and satisfying his need for recognition. This is truly the compassionate love of a mother! Thinking about it again, this route is also Uwaahhh!? W- What should I do!? Both such moments of my beloved child are supreme! There's no way I can compare which is better between two supreme scenarios! They're both so overwhelmingly wonderful!!! But ahhh, as a mother, I have to make a decision between the two Hahh!? N- No, wait, calm down, Makina! You are overlooking something very important. That is, yes! The feelings of my beloved child!!! If I think about this from the perspective of my beloved child, I will see things differently. If I take the former route, my beloved child will receive Mother's overflowing love and be pampered to the fullest. My beloved child is still at the age where he wants to be pampered, and even if he's usually shy, he naturally has the desire to jump into Mother's chest and entrust his body and soul to me! In that case, this route can also be seen as a path where my beloved child can express the feelings he usually keeps hidden inside. On the contrary, in the other route, my beloved child can gain great recognition by showing his mother how much he has grown. My beloved child is a boy, and even though he's young now, I'm sure he wants to grow up to be a wonderful man who can stand next to me, his beloved mother. Of course, my beloved child is already supreme at this moment, but from his perspective, he may still want to feel his growth. He probably wants to feel that he's getting closer to his mother, who may feel like a distant figure to him right now. No, of course, my beloved child is already by my side, so close that I can hold him in my arms even if I don't reach out, both physically and emotionally, but it's sometimes hard to see that from his perspective. If that's the case, then this route fulfills my beloved child's need for recognition, while boosting his self-esteem, and also helps him reaffirm his presence by Mother's side No, one can realize the strength of his love for Mother not only as a child, but as a man. In other words, this is a route where he can strongly recognize me as a member of the opposite gender, right!? T- This is also quite enchanting My love is infinite, so I can give my beloved child whatever he desires, and I'm sure my beloved child would also want to really feel what he achieved with his own hands Hmmmmm. In that case, the former would involve a significant contribution from me, while the latter involves my beloved child earning it with his own efforts. Thinking along those lines, perhaps the latter option, where my beloved child earns it himself, would be preferable but the former route is also hard to throw away. The problem is that my beloved child is just too cute, making it challenging to choose because he's always supreme no matter what I choose. Alright, let's think this over a little more carefully. In the first place, should I focus solely on how this relates to my beloved child and his Mother that I am, or should I consider other factors as well? Of course, the most important factor here is my beloved child. It's not wrong to think about my beloved child's charms, but I believe it's important to consider not only the merits but also the demerits. No, of course, there are no drawbacks to interacting with my beloved child, and in fact, one could argue that any drawbacks would simply transform into merits, so there's no issue at all For the time being, in the former case, depending on how much I help, the concern might be that there will be more situations where I will be involved with those talking lump of flesh. I believe I should be fine with Anima, who is my beloved child's lover living in his home, and should be able to treat her kindly, but can I really manage without showing any aversion towards the others? No, of course, I intend to do my best, but there's always the possibility of unexpected situations or making a blunder. With that in mind, there's also a chance that I might cause inconvenience to my beloved child, which could clearly be considered a demerit. Whatever happens to the lumps of flesh unrelated to my beloved child doesn't matter to me, but even if they're merely talking lumps of flesh, my beloved child will be sad if they're a friend of his, so as a mother, I want to be as tolerant as possible. Recently, I've come to recognize my beloved child's lovers as practically like my daughters-in-law, so I think I've become able to treat them kindly, but Alice still tells me I should be a little softer with them, so I wonder if that could be a cause for concern? In the latter case, I would basically just wait and be welcomed by my beloved child, which gives it an advantage for not having the aforementioned demerit. It's just, in the latter case, there's the demerit of not being involved in the preparations at all, so I won't be able to see my beloved child working hard up close. The words \"be welcomed by my beloved child\" may sound as sweet as honey from heaven, but I'm the type of person who wants to pamper my beloved child a lot, I mean, I'm the affectionate type, so I would rather be the one welcoming than the one being welcomed Ahh, but love isn't just about one-sidedly giving it to another, right? Mutual giving is important, so considering that my beloved child would also want to reciprocate love towards me, I suppose I should just respect such an opportunity, right? In that case, would going for the latter route really be the correct one here? No, not yet! It's too early to draw a conclusion based on merits and demerits alone. I also have to take lickability into consideration here! In terms of lickability points, I think the former route is higher. As expected, being able to be with my beloved child from the preparatory stages and thoroughly enjoying his cuteness already gives it pretty high points. With my abilities, I can easily assist in preparations while etching my beloved child's gallant figure into my soul, making it the best environment to be able to continuously gaze upon my beloved child. Oops, of course, I don't mean to get too hands-on with everything. The protagonist here is my beloved child, and Mother should be devoted to supporting him. Of course, if my beloved child wishes, I will support him from these preparations to his personal life at any time. In fact, not just for this matter, but for anything, if he just lets me know, I'll support him as much as I can and make sure he feels plenty of maternal affection! Fortunately, I've been able to interact with my beloved child in my true form, so it's not an exaggeration to say that the distance between my beloved child and me has become even closer than before. While assisting my beloved child with the preparations, I'll be firmly engraving his gallant figure, and during breaks after the preparations, I'll embrace my beloved child and praise him for a job well done. In that case, my beloved child would also let himself be pampered by Mother, and the two of us who love each other can spend intense and meaningful time together! Of course, since I can manipulate the time around us, being able to be pampered by Mother without worrying about the time is a huge merit for my beloved child, and for me, being able to adore my beloved child to my heart's content makes it the best time imaginable. When I think about it, the former route really is great When I compare this to my lovey-dovey moments with my beloved child, this route would undoubtedly be overwhelming! But of course, that doesn't mean the latter route is lacking in lickability]","[.]","I think Makina-san is a normal, nice person at heart. Whenever I see her as Eden-san, I always have the image of her rampaging in my mind, but in reality, she does make efforts to restrain herself, and her affection towards me is undoubtedly genuine.","Having more opportunities to meet her like this in my dreams, I have gotten to know how she got the preference of a commoner, how she is kinda klutzy, and has a charming side to her but Unnn. I guess my final conclusion definitely is that \"she really is a dangerous person\"","As I watch Makina-san, repeatedly talking to herself endlessly, after a while, Makina-san clenches her fist and strikes her own face with it.","The impact blew away all the scenery behind Makina-san, and as the space behind her cracked open, I felt like I saw the outer space for a moment.","[T- That was dangerous My love for my beloved child was sparked again and I almost went out of control. I'm glad I managed to hold myself back just in time]","[.]","No, I don't really think you managed to do that I'm really curious about what made her decide that she should hold her ground, but I feel like that would be kinda terrifying, so I don't want to ask.","How should I say this I guess it's appropriate to say that Makina-san really is just being the same as always","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Of all the freaking things, why did you increase that!? I mean, even though she had gone to great lengths to increase his favorability to her, I guess it really is just like Makina-san to end up being given the conclusion of \"she really is a dangerous person\".]"]},{"number":1827,"title":"Chapter 1827: The Truth About the Lost Child 1","paragraphs":["As Makina-san said in my dream, this time, I remembered the exchange I had with Makina-san in my dreams even after waking up.","Well, persuading Makina-san had been really difficult, so I'm kinda feeling more like I would rather forget all that No, it's not that Makina-san herself doesn't listen. If it's my words, she usually listens, but this time, maybe because she was overly excited, every word I said seemed to inflate her imagination hundreds of times, and she would endlessly talk within her madness, then punch herself and calm down for a while, only to repeat this cycle.","Well, even though her contemplation progressed at a pace like that of a tortoise, Makina-san eventually agreed not to intervene this time.","While recalling the struggles I had in that dream, I shifted my attention to the guests relaxing in the room.","[Tre-san, what are you reading?]","[Unn? Oh, this is a catalog for new magic tools. Not from our company though, but from another trading company. It's interesting how each company has its own unique features in their catalogs.]","Tre-san lounges on a sofa, casually flipping through a catalog. This time though, she had normally come over along with Cent-san and Cien-san.","Cent-san and Cien-san seem to be enjoying the tea and snacks provided while sitting on the sofa opposite Tre-san.","[Are you planning to buy something?]","[I'm actually thinking of buying the Detection Magic Tool that this trading company is releasing next month. It's quite high-performance, as it can function normally even in places with dense magic power where previous Detection Magic Tools couldn't detect properly. Plus, if I carry the magic tool attached to it, it could also serve as a measure against me getting lost.]","[Ahh, I see, that sounds like a good idea.]","Indeed, if Tre-san becomes easier to detect, it would reduce the burden on Cent-san and Cien-san, which should make the two happy but Arehh? Why do the two of them have a doubtful look on their faces?","[Esteemed Sister Tre, let's stop this. It's just gonna be a waste of money.]","[She's right. Even if you have money to spare, let's avoid wasting it, especially since that tool's going to malfunction again at a crucial moment.]","[N- No, but you see, it might work out this time]","Arehh? That's strange? Despite always struggling with Tre-san getting lost, Cent-san and Cien-san seem to be trying to stop her with a somewhat pitying expression on their faces instead.","Confused by the situation, I tilted my head, and noticing my reaction, Cien-san explained with a wry smile.","[Ahh, Kaito-san didn't know about this, right? Actually, this isn't the first time Esteemed Sister Tre is considering buying a Detection Magic Tool. It's not like Esteemed Sister Tre is intentionally getting lost, so she does feel sorry for inconveniencing us.]","[She's just overly positive. Once she strays away from us, she would just say \"We'll probably meet again soon\" and start doing whatever she likes, so measures are taken to prevent her from getting lost. This isn't the first time we bought a Detection Magic Tool.]","Following Cent-san's lead, Cien-san also explains with a wry smile. Apparently, this isn't the first time Tre-san has taken measures to prevent getting lost","[Fufufu, actually, I already have almost all types of existing Detection Magic Tools!]","[And so, judging from your reactions earlier Does that mean all of those didn't work?]","[Yes. Somehow, no matter how high-performance those magic tools were, they never seemed to work properly when Esteemed Sister Tre got lost. Those magic tools would either malfunction or stop working altogether.]","[It's not just limited to Detection Magic Tool. We once purchased Communication Magic Tools for us to contact each other in case Esteemed Sister Tre got lost, but those magic tools would also stop responding when she actually got lost. And strangely enough, after finding Esteemed Sister Tre, they would start working perfectly again, and there were no malfunctions when examined.]","[That's quite mysterious.]","It's truly mysterious, not only does Tre-san not get detected by Detection Magic Tools when she gets lost, all the precautionary magic tools they prepared also seem to malfunction. Seriously, is she cursed or something?","[It has to be that, right? How about I just wear a collar and you two hold the leash?]","[Please stop with that! Are you planning to socially kill both me and Cien Besides, even if we do that, I have a feeling the leash would just snap when it's most crucial.]","[It's not like Esteemed Sister Tre gets lost every time we go somewhere, and it's not feasible for us to have you leashed all the time either.]","[Hmmm. Things really aren't working out huh~~]","As Cent-san and Cien-san said, it seems Tre-san herself has been trying various things to prevent herself from getting lost. Well, since Tre-san is a monster of positivity, if things don't work out, she'd probably just go \"Oh well\" and shrug it off but","[It would already be great if we could find her quickly, but it always takes a long time to search for Esteemed Sister Tre.]","[That's also rather strange. Both Cent and I have the power to search through every spot in a small town within a second, yet we still can't find her every time]","[Hnn~~ But Kuromu-sama always finds me quickly though?]","[Is that so?]","That's a piece of new information, but it seems Kuro always finds Tre-san easily. When I inquired further, Cent-san and Cien-san nodded in agreement.","[Just as Esteemed Sister Tre said, Kuromu-sama always easily finds her with her Detection Magic, so when we can't find Esteemed Sister Tre, we eventually rely on Kuromu-sama.]","[Is it because of the difference in our skills compared to Kuromu-sama's? However, Detection Magic shouldn't be affected by such a skill difference]","[Ahh, come to think of it, Kaito can also find me quickly!]","[Now that you mentioned it, that's true. It might just be a coincidence since the number of instances was still low, but considering how long it takes me and Cien each time, just like the times in the White God Festival, you do find her incredibly quickly.]","Fumu Unnn? Arehh? Kuro can find her easily, and I can find her easily too. However, even people who were as skilled as Cent-san and Cien-san, who are at a level of Count-ranks, have trouble finding her.","Something's off It's as if Tre-san's tendency to get lost is somehow related to Shiro-san's power, and Kuro, who can neutralize that, and I, who have Shiro-san's Blessing, was unaffected by it and can easily find her No, as expected, that's probably not it There shouldn't be any reason for Shiro-san to reach her hands towards Tre-san","(Ah.)","Wait, what's with that reaction of yours!?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected, she really is the culprit for most things.]"]},{"number":1828,"title":"Chapter 1828: The Truth About the Lost Child 2","paragraphs":["When Tre-san was talking with Fors-san before, she jokingly said that she was lost because she was cursed by the world or something like that, but I never thought that really turned out to be true.","It seems that Shiro-san clearly has some idea why, but is Shiro-san the cause of this?","(If you ask for the cause, I certainly am the cause of it. It's a story from quite a long time ago, but when I first created this world, I experimented with various things. Kuro described me back then as one indifferent to the world, just a mere observer. While it's true that nothing had particularly moved my emotions, it might be more accurate to say that I was observing the results after making various adjustments, rather than me just watching the world passively. Well, part of the reason was that I was advised by Earth God to try various things)","Come to think of it, wasn't Trinia only made up of the God Realm and the Demon Realm at first? From the way Shiro-san spoke, am I correct in recognizing that she had made a lot of adjustments to the creatures in the Demon Realm?","(Yes. In the first place, the reason why the Demon Realm is more diverse than the other realms is that I have attempted various things in the past. Basically, I was trying to make this world's own creatures by making various adjustments based on the humans I saw in the world created by Earth God.)","Ahh, because humans were basically your reference point, that's why there are many humanoids among the Demons as well huh It's quite interesting to hear such stories from the creator of the world. So, does that mean Tre-san was also born while you were doing those experiments?","(Yes. Excluding Kuro and Alice, the Six Kings and Ein are also beings that I modified in the beginning. At that time, I still didn't know how I should adjust them, so in some cases, they ended up becoming so powerful that they had a great impact on the world, so after that, I held back a bit more and the adjustments I made made them specialized in various fields.)","Speaking of which, since it was mentioned before that Isis-san was created by Shiro-san using the soul of the Great Evil God of Despair, it's natural that she would be someone that Shiro-san had modified huh I understand now why the Six Kings and Ein-san have outstanding power compared to the other Demons.","As for Tre-san, she must be one of the people who have been modified afterwards.","(Yes. Or rather, it's not all of them, but the current Six Kings Executives Those who are called Duke-ranks and Peak Count-ranks, quite a few of them are ones I have experimented with.)","Eh? Are there that many?","(No, there actually used to be a lot more but Alice erased about 80% of them, so the number was greatly reduced. Well, by then, my interests had moved on to other things, so I didn't really care what she did)","Ahh, I heard that during the great purge of the Demon Realm by Alice, those who were judged to be evil among the powerful Demons were uprooted and disposed of, and it seems like among them were many beings that Shiro-san had modified.","(Returning the topic to this Tre in front of Kaito-san, she was modified as, if I were to describe it, an unbound free being. She has been given the ability, which is almost like an authority, to naturally step aside factors that would hinder her movements. I was wondering if perhaps, that's why)","I see, so that's how it is For example, if Tre-san is going around with Cent-san and Cien-san and she gets interested in something and tries to go there, the obstacles hindering her movements will naturally be brushed aside, regardless of Tre-san's intentions Cent-san and Cien-san wouldn't notice Tre-san's movements, and even with Detection Magic or similar methods, they wouldn't be able to detect Tre-san if she's acting with a certain purpose, due to the broad definition of \"factors that could potentially hinder her movements\".","Combining Tre-san's carefree personality with her tendency to simply start doing what she likes after straying off, once she gets lost, it's quite challenging to find her again. This means that at least until Tre-san completes her objective, she becomes impossible to track.","(What I had originally intended to create was a creature with free-spirited actions, but it seems she had inadvertently acquired the secondary characteristic of being prone to wandering and getting lost.)","And Shiro-san being the person she is, as she had said earlier, her interests had shifted to other things while Alice conducted that great purge, so she hadn't particularly observed Tre-san's life later, so I guess she just remembered it after I thought of it.","Even so, I see, things do make sense if Shiro-san's power had an influence in this. At this rate, it's even possible that Shiro-san had done something for Fors-san to have that severe lack of sense of direction","(No, I didn't do anything, nor do I know what's with her.)","Fors-san was unrelated to Shiro-san and really was just directionally challenged!?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Come to think of it, many of the Six Kings Executives are unique beings, so it makes sense that Shiro had modified them in various ways.]","? ? ? : [Not all of them though. There are also unique beings like Ozma-san and Camellia-san who were apparently naturally occurring anomalies untouched by Shallow Vernal-sama's influence. Looking at it the other way though, it means that in the Demon Realm back then, the upper limit of abilities that one could naturally reach was around the level of those two. It illustrates just how exceptional the power of the Six Kings is.]","Serious-senpai : [In that case, is it correct to say that the only time Shiro had a hand on the Human Realm was when she created it?]","? ? ? : [There's no mistaking that. Around the time of the creation of the Human Realm About 19000 years ago, Shallow Vernal-sama's interest had completely shifted to Kaito-san, so from that point on, she didn't make any modifications.]","Serious-senpai : [I see What about Lilia though?]","? ? ? : [Nah, that one's just a bug in this world.]"]},{"number":1829,"title":"Chapter 1829: The Truth About the Lost Child 3","paragraphs":["Well then, I know that Shiro-san is the cause of this, but I don't really know what I should do with that information. For the time being, I explained the situation to Tre-san and the others, but they were understandably astounded.","[Errr, in other words, the reason I get lost so often is the influence of a power given to me by Shallow Vernal-sama. Unnn, I see I can't complain about it then.]","Yes, the other party is the creator of the world, so even if the circumstances had changed, she isn't the kind of person Tre-san can complain about. Moreover, the ability itself is rather powerful, comparable to the authority of Gods, so depending on how it is used, it can be extremely powerful.","And so Tre-san and the others had very complicated expressions on their faces, but soon after, the room lit up and Shiro-san appeared.","[Excuse my intrusion.]","[ [ [ ! ? ! ? ] ] ]","While astonished by Shiro-san's appearance, Tre-san, Cento-san and Cien-san immediately got off the couch and dropped to their knees on the floor, assuming a praying posture.","[Shiro-san, what's with the sudden visit?]","[Yes, since we were on the topic, if she's feeling troubled about it, I'm thinking of giving her an item that would help you out a bit Perhaps, if she wears an accessory which blocks the effect of the power that makes your movements unobstructed, she shouldn't have to worry about getting lost.]","[Ahh~~ I see, that's good! That's what she said, Tre-san? Errr, Tre-san?]","It seems that Shiro-san is being considerate, as she offered to give Tre-san an item that would make it so that she wouldn't have to worry about getting lost, which should solve the problem, but Tre-san and the others remained in that prayer posture, not moving an inch.","When I tilted my head in wonder, Tre-san silently beckoned me close, so I approached her","[ Kaito, are you an idiot, or are you acting like an idiot!? Like hell can we talk, we haven't received permission from Shallow Vernal-sama to speak! Kaito may be special, but people normally can't raise their gaze or speak in front of Shallow Vernal-sama without permission!]","[A- Ahh, I see]","She skillfully conveyed her message by shouting angrily in a whisper, which made me understand what was going on. Come to think of it, I remember that when I accompanied Lilia-san to talk with Chronois-san before, Chronois-san, who did not know that Shiro-san had given her blessing to me, was really angry when I called out to Shiro-san.","[Shiro-san, may I ask permission for Tre-san and the others to speak?]","[Yes, well then I will allow the three of you to speak freely at this time and place today until I leave. You may also raise your face.]","[ [ [ Hah! ] ] ]","When Mr. White gave her permission, the three of them nervously raised their gazes. Shiro-san is at the top of the world, so I guess this kind of reaction is normal. Some like Lilia-san have occasional opportunities to meet Shiro-san, and as she was given approval by Shiro-san, she can speak relatively freely, but Shiro-san is basically someone for whom even a single utterance requires permission.","As I was thinking this, Shiro-san lightly waved her hand and two bracelets appeared.","[Regarding the person in question Tre, there may be situations where you can effectively utilize that ability, so I will refrain from sealing it. Instead, I will give these to the two of you. If you were to wear this bracelet, you won't lose sight from Tre's ability, and even if she does get lost, you'll be able to pinpoint her location using Detection Magic or with other means.]","[Our heartfelt gratitude to Sharrowvanal-sama's compassion]","[We respectfully accept it.]","As the bracelets automatically floated in front of Cent-san and Cien-san, the two of them politely received them with their heads bowed deeply, and Tre-san deeply bowed as well.","[Well, then, I've done what I came here to do, so I'm leaving.]","[Shiro-san, thank you.]","It's really heartwarming to see this kind of thoughtfulness from Shiro-san, making me feel Shiro-san's growth and kindness.","After smiling lightly at me when I thanked her, Shiro-san disappeared, and a little while after she was gone, Tre-san and the others let out a sigh.","[I- I was so nervous As expected, the cold sweat won't stop. You really are quite the outrageous one, Kaito.]","[I- I have never seen Shallow Vernal-sama's countenance that close before.]","[Just like Esteemed Sister Tre, I'm dripping with cold sweat Receiving such a valuable item, albeit humbling, is truly an honor.]","I hadn't paid much attention since I often meet Shiro-san, but it seems that the very situation of seeing Shiro-san up close is unimaginable. Even Tre-san herself looked mentally exhausted, so it must have been a truly intense experience.","I wish I could have informed them in advance but Shiro-san came here abruptly Notifying them beforehand is impossible in that situation, so I hope they'll let me off of this.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It's a forgettable setting, and with Kaito not hearing about this from the others, he wouldn't know about it but the magic power Shallow Vernal wielded is on a different level from the others, so the setting is that she exerts this heavy, oppressive pressure around her]"]},{"number":1830,"title":"Chapter 1830: The Truth About the Lost Child 4","paragraphs":["Thanks to Shiro-san's consideration, Cent-san and Cien-san now have items that can compensate for Tre-san's ability. This would theoretically prevent the two of them from losing sight of Tre-san.","In the first place, if what Tre-san was just a simple ability, Cent-san and Cien-san could have powered through searching for her, so there shouldn't be any problem unless it's something related to a power on the level of authority given by Shiro-san but there's no way to know without trying.","[So, if Tre-san gets lost, Cent-san and Cien-san will be able to quickly search for her?]","[Yes, I'm sure there's no mistaking that since Shallow Vernal-sama had given it to us, but I'm not completely sure how it's like without trying it out.]","[Just as Cent-san said, I'd also like to try it once Esteemed Sister Tre, would you mind getting lost for a moment?]","[As expected of my little sisters, you two just demand the most outrageous things.]","I don't think there's any problem with it since that's something created by Shiro-san, but still, I guess it's natural for a person to want to actually try it out.","And so, in order to test it out, she asked Tre-san to get lost Of course, Cien-san said that in a tone that clearly sounded like a joke, and Tre-san herself just chuckled with amusement. Then, after a moment of thought, she spoke.","[Hmmm. In essence, even if I'm not actually lost, it would just be fine if Cent and Cien could track me using Detection Magic, right? Then, I'll go out around the city with Kaito, and after Cent and Cien wait here for about 15 minutes, you can come after me with Detection Magic.]","[Ahh, I see, that would certainly work as an experiment to see if Tre-san can be located with Detection Magic.]","[ [ .. ] ]","Tre-san's suggestion seemed like a good idea to me, and I thought it would also be fun for the four of us to meet up and hang out in the city, but for some reason, Cent-san and Cien-san had this indescribably complicated expression on their faces.","What's going on? It's as if they were hesitating about something, looking uncomfortable like that","[Ahh, no need to worry. I already know about this beforehand, so I won't be jamming it.]","[Ah, yes.]","[Thank you for your concern.]","As I tilted my head in confusion, Alice showed herself, uttered a few words to Cent-san and Cien-san, and then disappeared again. Seeing the evident relief on their faces in response to her words, I can somewhat guess the situation.","I remember receiving a message from Alice when I first met the two of them in the Demon Realm, saying that Cent-san and Cien-san wanted to greet me properly at a later date. This is just a guess, but Cent-san and Cien-san probably tried to find me with Detection Magic, and Alice blocked what they were doing.","It didn't seem like they were tense or feeling afraid of Alice, and from her remark just now, it felt more like they just reacted impulsively at that moment. And so, since Alice knew in advance that the two of them would use Detection Magic, she probably showed herself to tell them that there was no problem with using it.","[Did something happen between the two of you and Shalltear-sama?]","[Ahh, no, we just used Detection Magic when we tried to locate Kaito-san and Sieglinde-san before but Phantasmal King-sama, who had been guarding Kaito-san, forcibly neutralized it.]","[I heard that Phantasmal King-sama wasn't particularly finding fault with us, but was instead simply reacting reflexively but still, that made me keenly feel the immense gap in power between us Looking back, what happened back then makes me feel a bit tense.]","Wryly smiling at Cent-san and Cien-san's explanation, Tre-san and I nodded in understanding. For the time being, it seemed that there was no issue regarding this matter, so Tre-san and I decided to go around the city together.","[Alright! Kaito, it's a date!!! Let's decide on our blazing hot 15-minute adventure!]","[I'm not deciding anything, and besides, I think there's not really much time]","[That's strange, I should have accumulated enough favorability by now~~]","[Maybe things would have been different if you stopped being unclear whether what you're saying is for real or just a joke.]","[No way, is my love not being transmitted Feelings sure are difficult.]","[Even if you say that with a cheerful look on your face]","Tre-san, who was speaking half-jokingly, seemed to be having fun, and while there was still a part of me unsure how serious she was, it didn't change the fact that talking with Tre-san was enjoyable.","While this outing would also serve as an experiment, I'm also looking forward to going out around the city with Tre-san and the others.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It's really reassuring that Tre doesn't seem to be leaning towards a sweet mood at the moment.]","? ? ? : [No, wouldn't someone of her type become extra sweet when they get all affectionate?]","Serious-senpai : [Stop with the disturbing things.]"]},{"number":1831,"title":"Chapter 1831: The Truth About the Lost Child 5","paragraphs":["Tre-san and I left the house and headed out into the city. However, since Cent-san and Cien-san will join us 15 minutes later, we won't go too far.","[For the time being, should we go somewhere nearby? Tre-san, any places you'd like to visit?]","[I feel like eating something sweet. Maybe some ice cream~~]","[Hmmm. This area has many high-end shops, so if we walk a bit and reach the main street, we might find a shop serving some]","[Alright, let's head out towards there~~]","Heading towards the main street would be perfect since it's suitable for hanging out after meeting up with Cent-san and Cien-san. When Tre-san mentioned something, I think she's referring to those that can be enjoyed while walking like crepes or ice cream, but if we don't find any, we can always go to a caf.","As expected, having lived in Symphonia Kingdom's Royal Capital for quite some time myself, I already know quite a few shops on the main street, so I think I can guide them.","[Speaking of which, wasn't it here in the Royal Capital where Kaito had your first date with Kuromu-sama?]","[Yes, you remember it well huh.]","[Kuromu-sama seemed so happy talking about it after all~~]","[Ahaha, I see I mean, in the first place, I hadn't gone anywhere outside Symphonia Kingdom's Royal Capital at that time yet. It was still early days since I came to this world]","Thinking back upon Tre-san mentioning my date with Kuromu-sama, how should I say this I'm feeling somewhat nostalgic. Back then, I think we also wandered around, passing through an area lined with many street stalls, starting from the main street","[You just came to a completely unknown world after all. That must have been tough However, finding everything around you to be new must have been exciting too!]","[That's certainly true. Especially since there was no magic in the world I came from, I was overwhelmed with this world's magical culture.]","[I did hear something about that, but I can't really imagine a culture without magic. Also, remember that What's it called again? VR? Those mechanical products I saw in those were amazing. It made me realize how different worlds have different cultures.]","[That was a bit unique, but indeed, there are also many things in this world that are unusual to the people from our world. I can't really say which one's more convenient over the other but]","Magic tools and magic are incredibly convenient, often surpassing the performance of mechanical items. However, just as Alice mentioned before, it's not about one being superior to the other; both magic and technology have aspects they excel in.","For example, there are no computers or smartphones in this world, and magic tools usually have one function per item, and those few with multiple functions are expensive.","It's interesting to think about differences like this.","[Heehhh~~ That sounds interesting. Hey, hey, since we've got some time while walking, tell me about your previous world, Kaito.]","[Sure. Where should I start]","Casually strolling down the street, Tre-san and I engage in lighthearted conversation. Tre-san is a good listener and reacts enthusiastically to each of my stories, making the conversation enjoyable.","As we continued our conversation and moved along, nearing the main street after passing through the upscale shopping area, Cent-san and Cien-san appeared.","[Oh, Cent and Cien. You managed to meet up with us.]","[Yes, we were able to locate Tre-san quite easily. With this, we can feel reassured in the future.]","[Where are you two heading, Esteemed Sister Tre, Kaito-san?]","[We were planning to go to the main street to get something sweet. If there's an ice cream or crepe stand, we'll eat there; otherwise, we'll probably go to a caf]","Thanks to the accessory that Shiro-san provided, it seems they were able to locate Tre-san successfully this time, and with Cent-san and Cien-san joining, we're now a group of four.","[Come to think of it, Cien, weren't you not very fond of sweets?]","[No, it's just that I'm not a big fan of whipped cream. As long as it's not overly sweet, I'm fine with it.]","[I see. What about you, Cent?]","[Ahh I'm actually quite fond of sweets.]","We continued our lively conversation as we moved along. While chatting with just Tre-san was enjoyable, being lively with all four of us like this adds to the fun.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I'll allow okazu crepes. I won't allow regular ones.]","(T/N: Okazu crepes, unlike the traditional sweet crepes filled with fruits and whipped cream, are savory and filled with various ingredients such as meat, often seasoned with savory sauces, vegetables, mayo and other such toppings.)","? ? ? : [Is it because they're sweet? Personally though, I find some crepes such as tuna-mayo crepe as just heresy. Well, they're still delicious though. It's just, as expected, sweet crepes are great.]"]},{"number":1832,"title":"Chapter 1832: Creating a Guest List","paragraphs":["It was decided that I would be the one to create the guest invitation list for the ship party. Kaori-san would assist with the party dishes, Illness-san and the others responsible for cooking would decide on the menu, while Anima and Caraway would handle the procurement of ingredients.","Considering the need for guards and assistants for high-profile individuals like Ryze-san and Chris-san, as well as the possibility of guests bringing a few companions, the number of guests feels like it would be considerable.","Although the magic ship Kuro gifted to me as memorabilia was really luxurious, with its size comparable to that of a grand cruise ship, I couldn't help but think that it might be better to hire chefs to prepare food for such a large number of people but Illness-san assured me that it wouldn't be a problem.","While I felt that if it was Illness-san, she could certainly handle it, I made sure to tell her that she shouldn't push herself too hard and that if necessary, we could hire people through Anima.","[Well, if you're shorthanded, I'll do something about it, so don't worry. It's probably better for Kaito-san and the others to handle this though, so I won't intervene unless there's a problem.]","[That's incredibly reassuring Ahh, Alice. Since you're here, could you give me some advice? How many companions do you think we should allow for the invited guests?]","[Why not have each person declare their desired number of companions? Write that in the invitations and ask them to inform you how many companions they'll bring.]","[I see, that certainly makes sense There's no way all the Gods would show up, right?]","[Couldn't you just make it clear to Shallow Vernal-sama beforehand? That only those you directly invited should come Kaito-san is already acquainted with the Supreme Gods, and since you're also getting acquainted with more High-ranking Gods, there shouldn't be any issues in terms of numbers.]","While consulting with Alice, I continued to write down the invited guests on a paper. It was important not to miss anyone, so I double-checked but since Alice had prepared a chair and sat next to me before I knew it, it seemed she intended to stay with me until I finished making the list, so there shouldn't be a problem.","[As I make this list, I can't help noticing it seems longer than it was for the housewarming party]","[Well, you've become acquainted with all the Six Kings' Executives after all. I mean, frankly speaking, you don't need to invite those perverts at my place since they're basically just going to be nuisances]","[Even if you say that, I can't just exclude them. No, well, it would be bad if their identities were exposed and there are some crazy ones among them, so please tell them that they don't necessarily have to attend Well, the other Executives would probably be busy too, so all of them might not come.]","[No, all of them are going to end up coming, okay? Even if they say they're busy, adjusting schedules for someone with the power of a Peak Count-rank is quite manageable. If there's about a month between the invitation's arrival and the event, they wouldn't have any problem.]","I was thinking there were many influential people among those invited, so I thought it would be difficult for everyone to attend but Alice estimated that everyone would attend without any problems. In that case, everyone would probably actually come","Alice is truly dependable, but I shouldn't rely on her too much If I rely on her too much here, it would deviate from my intention of me and the people living with me making our own efforts as the host wait, she may always disappear from my sight, but acting as my guard, she always stays by my side and is practically living here too, right? No, well, even if that's the case, if I rely too much on Alice, I might end up thinking I should just leave everything to her, so I should be careful not to let that happen.","[Unn? What's the matter, Kaito-san? You look a bit off]","[Ahh, no, I was just thinking Alice is practically part of the family.]","[Fuahh!? U- U- U- Umm, K- Kaito-san!? W- What are you suddenly N- No, essentially in the future t- that might be the case, b- but as expected, it's too early for that]","[]","Oops, I clearly ended up saying that in the wrong way. Alice, who is weak to this kind of topic, blushed and seemed visibly flustered but if I try to clarify her misunderstanding now, wouldn't she feel even more understanding? No, but leaving her having that misunderstanding is also Hmmm.","[Sorry. I didn't phrase that properly. What I meant this time wasn't that, but more like, I was thinking since you're practically living in my house too, you're practically family.]","[Ehh? A- Ahh, so that's how it is! T- That scared me]","[Well, if you're talking about the future as Alice said, even if you did misunderstand that just now, you aren't exactly mistaken about it.]","[Why do you have to make me embarrassed after calming me down!?]","Seeing Alice blush and shout again, I couldn't help but feel amused as I refocused on creating the guest list.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [On the contrary, I think those invited would find it more challenging to find a reason not to attend the party organized by Kaito, where the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods are confirmed to attend Some might end up having stomachaches again.]","? ? ? : [For the time being, it seems Kaori-san is likely to have a serious stomachache.]"]},{"number":1833,"title":"Chapter 1833: Golden Encounter 1","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I got home late today, so today's chapter is short.","The preparation for the ship party seems to be proceeding steadily, so there's no need to rush. I've also completed the guest list, but it seems like drawing up the invitations will have to be done a little later, so there's still plenty of room for additions.","For the time being, there's no point in getting too worked up, so I decided to take a stroll through the city for a change of pace. However, as I reached the main street, I spotted someone that caught my attention.","It was a woman with beautiful golden hair, but her bangs were long, covering her eyes and even reaching near her nose. She wore brown leather pants, a white shirt, and a brown jacket, which seemed like a modest combination but strangely enough, there was this sense of elegance in the quality of her clothes. How should I say this The aura around her feels like she's a noble lady \"trying to disguise herself as a commoner\".","However, what caught my attention wasn't just that. The woman was standing with what seemed like a note in her hand, and from her demeanor, she seemed to be lost.","Just to be sure, I tried using Sympathy Magic, and indeed, I could sense troubled emotions from her. Since she had caught my attention, with my personality, I couldn't just ignore her, so I approached and called out to her.","[Excuse me for suddenly calling out to you. This is just my impression, but are you lost? If so, I think I can be of some help]","[ ! ? ]","When I called out to her, the woman turned around, looking surprised. Since her eyes were hidden, I couldn't clearly see her expression, but her movements and the visible parts of her face conveyed her surprise.","I guess it's certainly natural for someone to be startled if a stranger suddenly approaches. In fact, there's even a possibility that she'd see me as some sort of pick-up artist.","If the woman in front of me were indeed a noble lady who's walking around in the streets incognito, it wouldn't be strange for her to be cautious of me.","As I had such a thought in mind, the woman hesitated for a moment before timidly speaking up.","[Yes. I'm embarrassed to admit it, but I don't have much experience going around this street, and I'm looking for a shop but do you know where this shop is?]","[Let me take a look for a bit Hmmm]","Seemingly judging I wasn't a suspicious person for the time being, the woman asked for directions, so I looked at the note she was holding.","It had the name of the street and a simple hand-drawn map written on it but","[Errr It's hard to say this, but this this isn't the street you were aiming for. This should be in the Western District.]","[Eh? I- Is that so?]","[Yes. The three streets that can be accessed from the plaza in front of the Royal Castle in Symphonia Kingdom's Royal Capital all have resembling names, and this one is the name of the streets that extend towards the Western District.]","[I see My ignorance of this matter is rather embarrassing. Errr Then, is it quite a distance from here?]","[It's not that far, but since you'll have to pass through the plaza in front of the Royal Castle, it'll be a bit of a detour.]","[I- I see]","It seems like this woman isn't very familiar with the Royal Capital. When she heard that it would be a detour, she clearly looked uneasy She might be a noble from another region or even from another country.","[If you'd like, shall I guide you until you're near that area?]","[W- Would that be alright? You must have your own plans, and I wouldn't want to burden you]","[It's alright. I'm just out for a stroll with no particular plans in mind anyway]","[I see Well then, though I'm feeling embarrassed to ask this of you, would it be acceptable for me to rely on your words?]","[Yes, of course. Ahh, we haven't introduced ourselves yet, right? I'm Miyama Kaito.]","[I'm Ale- Ahh, no, please call me Aria.]","(T/N:","= \"Are\". Her actual name could either be starting with \"Are\" or \"Ale\".)","It felt like she hastily corrected herself just now. Yeah, she really does feel like a noble traveling incognito. Perhaps she gave me a pseudonym instead of her real name?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Kaito going out alone, evidently raising a new character flag.]"]},{"number":1834,"title":"Chapter 1834: Golden Encounter 2","paragraphs":["Together with Aria-san, whom I happened to meet in the city and ended up guiding, we aimed towards the street in the Western District by heading towards the plaza in front of the Royal Castle first.","However, I wonder why? Regarding Aria-san I feel like I've met her somewhere before.. It's just, I can immediately recall where I met her, so I guess even if I did encounter her, it was only just a brief exchange of words?","Hmmm, I can't really pinpoint her voice to anyone in particular. Perhaps we never actually spoke, and I just saw her somewhere If her face were clearer, maybe I'd recognize her, but with her bangs covering about half of her face, it's hard to tell.","[Aria-san, you mentioned not having come to the Royal Capital often, but have you come from another city?]","[Ahh, no, I live in Archlesia Empire, and it's Symphonia Kingdom itself that I haven't been to much. Well, I've certainly visited a few times, but I can't say I'm familiar enough with the area to recognize places on the map immediately.]","[I see, you're from Archlesia Empire huh.]","[Yes. Occasionally going on the streets Nhnn, ahh, no, going on small trips is a hobby of mine.]","She really gives off the vibe of a noble going around incognito. Even the way she says \"on the streets\" feels noble-like, and there's this elegance in the way she walks that doesn't quite match her attire.","It's just, hmmm Even though my name is known among the nobles, I don't really have many connections among the nobles. As I had been avoiding gatherings where nobles gather, my interactions with them were limited to casual greetings when attending parties or events, and that's especially the case with Archlesia Empire, with the number of my interactions with them even fewer I can hardly say I have any acquaintances there.","Was it just my imagination that I felt like I'd met Aria-san before then?","It's just my baseless gut feeling anyway, and if she's capable of disguises or shapeshifting, then it'd be even harder to tell. With Shiro-san's blessing, I can dispel such magic if I touch her, but if I don't touch her, I wouldn't be able to see through it.","I can't just suddenly touch a woman, and besides, if she were an acquaintance of mine, I wouldn't understand why she'd change her appearance or name. I guess I really may have seen her somewhere by chance.","I mean, if she really were an acquaintance of mine and were falsifying her appearance or name, there must be some reason for it, and it's not something I should delve into deeply.","Unnn. Alright, let's not worry about it.","[Come to think of it, I apologize for asking so late, but how should I address you? From what I feel from your name, you seem to be from another world, so should I address you by your given name or your family name?]","[Ahh, you can just call me by my name Kaito.]","[Well then, I'll address you as Kaito-sama. Still, I'm grateful that Kaito-sama called out to me. Since I had been mistaken with the district itself, I would've wandered for quite a while without your help.]","[No, no, I just happened to see you. Besides, it would be best if everyone helps each other in times of need, and all that.]","[Is that so? Kaito-sama seems to be a kind person.]","She exudes a refined aura in her words and gestures, so as I thought, she really should be a noble. Although she was lost, she seems calm enough to think she's accustomed to walking on main streets like this, and when people approach from ahead, she naturally and smoothly moves aside, so it feels like she's used to walking in crowds.","[By the way, if it's not okay to ask, I apologize. However, what kind of shop is this one marked on your map?]","[It's a restaurant. Not a high-end or particularly exotic place, just a restaurant that serves deep-fried food like fries.]","[Heehhh~~ fries huh, sounds delicious.]","[Yes, simple fried food like that is quite appealing No, really, I usually keep image in mind but they're my favorite]","[Unnn?]","[Ahh, no, it's nothing. Ah, I know! If Kaito-sama is alright with it, would you like to have a meal with me? As a token of gratitude for guiding me, please allow me to treat you Well, I'm sorry it's nothing fancy though.]","[Thank you very much. Well then, since you're offering, I'll gladly accept It's been a while since I've had fries, so I'm looking forward to it.]","Aria-san looks apologetic for what she thinks is a cheap thanks, but I actually prefer something casual and easy to accept like this rather than being offered some unnecessarily fancy cuisine.","Despite there still being a distance from the said restaurant, since I'm really just guiding her, receiving excessive thanks would only make me feel apologetic.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [ Resides in Archlesia Empire,","Kaito, with his Sympathy Magic, feels like he's seen her, but he doesn't recognize her voice (They may not have talked with each other?),","Elegance of a noble sensed in her every gesture,","The name she almost said before \"Ale\" Isn't she that Super Maid?]"]},{"number":1835,"title":"Chapter 1835: Golden Encounter 3","paragraphs":["Entering a street in the Western District of the city, Aria-san and I walked along the street while chatting. Although her gestures were elegant, it seemed like Aria-san often came to hang out in the city like this, as she was quite knowledgeable not only about the central cities, but also about towns in the countryside.","[Heehhh So such a cuisine exists huh.]","[Yes, it's an ethnic cuisine that isn't eaten anywhere other than in some towns in the western part of Symphonia Kingdom. It tastes good, but it takes time to cook, so it isn't suitable for selling in places where there are many customers.]","[I see, indeed, if someone wants to sell their product in a place where there are a lot of customers, the turnover rate is also important. It would be different for high-end stores, but when it comes to ethnic cuisines, they wouldn't have such vibes There are appropriate ways to sell fitting for each product, I guess.]","[As you say, just as how the right people for the right job, so to speak. The same goes for things like tea; it's most important to brew them in a way that suits the place and the person.]","The fact that she uses tea as an example shows her upbringing, but her cheerful and calm demeanor makes her easy to talk to.","As we came closer to the target store while I had such a thought in mind, a slightly strong wind blew. It wasn't too strong, a wind that just passed through the gaps between nearby large buildings, one that didn't affect walking but due to the wind, Aria-san's bangs were slightly lifted, revealing one of her eyes. They were beautiful ruby-like red eyes The amount of information that can be obtained differs greatly between when one's face is half-hidden and when one eye is visible.","Arehh? This person Isn't she Alexandra-san? No, the atmosphere around her changed significantly since her hairstyle is quite different, and besides, the only time I met Alexandra-san was at the Maid Olympia where I was forcibly made to be a special judge for the semi-finals, and since we've only had a brief conversation, I can't be sure.","Rather Her voice really feels different Alexandra-san's voice back then was somewhat cool and dignified, but Aria-san's voice, seemingly relieved from something, is more gentle and elegant.","Is there some kind of magic that changes just the voice? No, could she actually be just a different person with a similar face? Guess that would be most likely Like for example, they're sisters? I'm not sure, but whether she's Alexandra-san or someone else who just looks like Alexandra-san, it still seems a little uncouth to go in and ask about it now that she's hiding her identity, so I'm not going to mind it too much.","[Kaito-sama, is something the matter?]","[Ahh, no, I'm sorry. I was just thinking about something That aside, that would be it, right?]","[Yes. It's already within visible range Fortunately, it seems to be empty, probably because it's off lunchtime.]","The desired store really had the atmosphere of a casual fast-food place for the masses. The interior wasn't particularly spacious and felt somewhat cluttered, but that added to its charm of being a place that sells junk food, creating a tasty-ish atmosphere unlike that from high-end stores, which was wonderful.","In fact, I haven't had many opportunities to visit restaurants like this with a casual atmosphere because people around me, just like Lilia-san, tend to be part of high society, so I'm looking forward to it.","[The atmosphere this place has is great. While not necessarily refined, it's not without its charm. It's a good place to hang out where necessary items are placed where they need to be, and the scent floating around it builds anticipation.]","[That's right. It wafts the delicious scent of fried food. Fried chicken, perhaps.]","Just like before, her eyes were hidden, but she looked so happy that I felt like her eyes were shining. Her voice sounded a little excited, and I could tell that she liked this kind of restaurant.","Just like that, we entered the restaurant and were to place our order at the counter first. It was like a hamburger store.","[I'll order fries, nuggets, and a cola, what about you, Kaito-sama?]","[Eh? They have cola here!?]","[Yes, I heard it was passed down from a past Hero Actor. I don't really know if it's completely the same as the original in the other world but]","[I see, then I'll have the same thing as Aria-san.]","[I understand. In that case, let's just increase the size of the fries and nuggets and eat them together.]","I never thought there'd actually be colas in this world Come to think of it, handmade colas like craft colas do exist, and if someone knows the ingredients and how to make them, making one might not be as difficult as it seems.","That said, this place really is nice. Looking closely, they also have burgers here I'm not that hungry right now, so I don't feel like eating a burger, but I think I'll come back next time to have one.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Magic that changes voice Even if that exists, that seemed like something Kaito would nullify, so is it someone else then?]","? ? ? : [No, for example, if it's not magic, but a characteristic such as \"being part of a species that can change their voice\", it will not be disabled, and in the first place, compared to the beginning, the Magic Nullification effect of Shallow Vernal-sama's Blessing had been improved through repeated detailed updates. For example, someone who had cast Humanization Magic on themself would no longer have it nullified when touched by Kaito-san.]","Serious-senpai : [I see It's more like as long as there's no harm to Kaito now huh]"]},{"number":1836,"title":"Chapter 1836: Golden Encounter 4","paragraphs":["At the counter, we received our fries, nuggets and colas and sat down. Aria-san gives off an air of elegance in her demeanor and movements, but she doesn't feel out of place as she sits down with a smile on her face, suggesting she's quite accustomed to visiting fast food restaurants.","[Ah, they're delicious. I wonder if these are freshly fried?]","[Perhaps our timing was just right. These small-scale shops usually don't have things like magic boxes, so whether you get them freshly fried depends on timing.]","[I see, lucky us then.]","As I tried to pick up a long piece of fry and ate it, I found that it had just the right amount of saltiness and a delightful fluffy texture. How should I say this Eating it makes one think \"This is how fries should be\". Simple as it is, fries are the best.","Aria-san also elegantly picks up a fry and brings it to her mouth, smiling happily. If her face were visible, she would probably be beaming with joy.","The nuggets also come with two sauces, ketchup and mustard, and eating them with these is very delicious. The light taste of the chicken matches perfectly with the ketchup and mustard, making it very tasty.","Of course, cola is important for this line-up too. It has a taste similar to diet cola, but it also has a strong carbonation, making it incredibly delicious after drinking it for the first time in a long time.","By the way, how do they maintain the carbonation in this world? Do they have some kind of special magic tool for it?","[Kaito-sama.]","[Yes?]","[Do you think dipping fries in nugget sauce is improper?]","[No, if you think it's delicious, I think it's fine.]","[I see, that's a relief!]","After happily responding to my words, Aria-san dips a fry in ketchup and eats it. Somehow, even though half her face is hidden, I can tell she's enjoying her food.","[Aria-san, do you like fries?]","[Yes, there was a dish similar to this where I was born and raised. Though I say that, it wasn't as polished into these long and narrow shapes. It was just a simple dish made up of chunks of fried potatoes sprinkled with salt but it has been my favorite since then.]","[I see, it's a taste of nostalgia for you. Even so, that's a bit surprising. How should I say this Aria-san's movements have this elegance to them so I kinda thought maybe you were a noble lady in disguise]","[Fufufu, being called elegant is an honor, but I was born and raised as a commoner Yes, really What's actually odd is that I had somehow ended up at the top of a country through happenstance]","Even if she weren't Alexandra-san, I thought she might be a noble. Her clothes are quite high-quality and her movements exude grace, so I thought she must be a noble","[Unnn? Sorry, your voice was too low, so I couldn't catch the latter part of what you said]","[Ahh, no! I think the reason why my gestures seem elegant is because I work as a maid. I often interact with nobles, especially since Archlesia Empire is a country where the nobles' authority is strong, so I naturally picked up these gestures from them]","[I see]","A maid? Arehh? In that case, could she actually be Alexandra-san then?","[By the way, is Aria-san's hometown also in Archlesia Empire?]","[Ahh, no, I'm a Unique Demon, so I was both born and raised in the Demon Realm. However, I've been living in the Human Realm for a long time now, so the time I've spent in the Demon Realm and the time I've spent in the Human Realm are becoming almost equal, so it wouldn't be strange to say that Archlesia Empire is like a second home to me.]","A Unique Demon? Ahh, then she really may not be Alexandra-san after all. From what I heard from Frau-san and other maids, Alexandra-san should be a Half-Demon, and her voice is different too, so maybe she really is just someone who looks similar.","[I'm sorry for asking so many questions, but does that mean you immigrated to Archlesia Empire quite a long time ago?]","[No, I don't mind. Indeed, it has been quite a while. However, I came to the Human Realm due to an extremely rare accident called Space-Time Distortion, so I initially didn't come here of my own volition.]","[Ahh, I see. From the sound of it, it's like you're suddenly teleported from the Demon Realm to the Human Realm due to some kind of space-time anomaly?]","[Yes, you can see it that way.]","[That is, how should I say this sounds rough.]","It seems Aria-san came to the Human Realm due to an accident. That must have been really rough. I was also suddenly summoned from another world, but because the people of this world already have some know-how due to past Hero Summonings, I was able to manage without much difficulty, but still, suddenly being thrown into a different environment is rough.","[It might not have been as extreme as being summoned to another world like Kaito-sama, but it was certainly very surprising and confusing for me too. At that time, the country Archlesia Empire still hadn't existed, and the existence of the Human Realm itself was like some fairy tale in the Demon Realm, so I remember feeling bewildered.]","As Aria-san said this, with a somewhat nostalgic expression on her face, she started reminiscing.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh, I see ? ? ? added explanations in the Afterword, but the information Kaito has obtained indicates that Alexandra is a Half-Demon, so it isn't unreasonable that he would think she's a different person hearing that she's a pure Demon huh]"]},{"number":1837,"title":"Chapter 1837: Golden Encounter 5","paragraphs":["Aria-san, who came from the Demon Realm to the Human Realm due to an extremely rare accident, began speaking with a nostalgic expression on her face.","[I was a Demon who lived in a small village on the outskirts of the Demon Realm. Since I was a Unique Demon, I didn't have parents, but our village itself was small, so I felt more like the villagers were my family. When I was about 2000 years old though, I was caught up in a Space-Time Distortion and arrived in the Human Realm.]","[You said that Space-Time Distortion was quite a rare accident, but how frequently did it happen?]","[It happens about once every 1000 years. Furthermore, it's rare for anyone to be caught up in them, and I've never met anyone else who experienced the same thing, so it really must be quite the rare occurrence. Well, anyhow, I accidentally ended up in the Human Realm, and at first, I didn't know where I was or what was happening. Fortunately, the people in the rural area I found while exploring were kind to me, so I was able to understand my situation relatively quickly.]","If I'm not mistaken, the establishment of the Treaty of Friendship had made it so that the travel between the Demon Realm and the Human Realm was easier, so it would be safe to say that returning from the Human Realm to the Demon Realm was quite difficult until then.","Aria-san mentioned earlier that the time she spent living in the Demon Realm and the time since she came to the Human Realm were about the same, so she probably arrived in the Human Realm about 2000 years ago.","[At that time, there was no Archlesia Empire, and the rural area I ended up in belonged to a country called the Valhand Empire. However, this empire was quite oppressive, and the people in the rural areas were suffering greatly. It was truly coincidental, but at that time, I ended up repelling the imperial soldiers who came to collect taxes from the village. Magic was rare in the Human Realm at that time, so as a high-ranking Demon, my power was overwhelming compared to Humans, so I was able to drive them away but that led to a strange situation]","[A strange situation?]","[Yes, at that time, the discontent with the Empire had reached its limit among the people, and a revolution had happened and somehow, I ended up joining their revolutionary army or rather I kinda ended up leading them]","The last part of her words was too quiet for me to hear clearly, but it seems that the revolutionary army won and established the current Archlesia Empire.","[Well, I watched over the situation until the country stabilized, and then I planned to return to the Demon Realm. but one way or another, I grew attached to them, and ended up settling in the Human Realm. Of course, I often return to my village in the Demon Realm to talk about this and that, and I still visit occasionally.]","[I see Even so, it's amazing how your life's full of ups and downs.]","[Fufu, it's just a story of my immature days when I was just being swept along by circumstances, so I'm quite embarrassed. but even with this and that, I'm satisfied with my current life, and I think things had turned out well There was a miscalculation where I somehow ended up having a strange image attached to me but]","[A strange image?]","[Ahh, no, just like how Kaito-sama mistook me for a noble, I naturally learned many things as I studied as a maid, so just like Kaito-sama did, people who don't know me back then mistake me for someone of noble birth Yes That's why stores like this had somehow ended up not fitting my usual image, so I had to secretly visit in my private time.]","[Ahh, I do understand that feeling. I've also got lots of people misunderstanding me No, there are some that aren't misunderstandings, but there's a part of me that feels embarrassed when others see me as being more important than I actually am.]","Especially since I also ended up being teleported to a place I'm unfamiliar with, I can relate to Aria-san's situation quite a bit. I've been saved quite a bit of trouble thanks to Alice manipulating various pieces of information for me but still, the fact that I'm almost recognized by nobles, both by face and name, makes me a bit wary of places and events where such people gather.","[Ahh, Kaito-sama is a celebrity after all.]","[Ahh, so you did know about me after all?]","[Yes, as a maid, I often hear discussions related to nobility, and I've heard about Kaito-sama's countenance and the rumors about you as well. And so, I was quite surprised when you first approached me.]","[Come to think of it, you did seem surprised when I first approached you.]","[That had been quite a coincidence but you turned out to be surprisingly easy to talk to. and I've come to realize that one really can't understand someone's character without actually talking to them. With just the information about you being acquainted with the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods, one might tend to perceive you as someone authoritative like a King.]","[Ahh~~ Now that you mentioned it However, it would still be best if that misunderstanding had been cleared up though.]","Indeed, if all one knows is the information about being associated with the pinnacle of each world, one wouldn't grasp much about personality","With such thoughts in mind, we continued our lighthearted conversation, enjoying fries, nuggets, and each other's company.","<Afterword>","Alexandra (Real Name: Aria)","A Unique Demon, approximately 4500 years old. Originally lived in a village on the outskirts of the Demon Realm, but ended up in the Human Realm's Valhand Empire (later known as the Archlesia Empire) due to Space-Time Distortion.","By chance, she found refuge in a rural village with the help of kind farmers and assisted with tasks like hunting. However, when her benefactors were about to be harmed by arrogant imperial soldiers, she single-handedly defeated the soldiers who had come to the village.","At that time, Aria's power, close to that of a Peerage holder, was overwhelmingly powerful for the Human Realm of that time, so people who witnessed her power began calling her the \"Apostle of God\" or the \"Savior who Appeared to Save the People Suffering Under Tyranny\". Before she knew it, she found herself leading the revolutionary army and effortlessly crushing the Valhand Empire's forces, achieving a successful revolution.","And upon the request and under the condition of \"until the country stabilizes\", she consented to becoming the First Emperor of the new country. Due to her original name lacking majesty, she adopted the name \"Alexandra\" during her reign as Emperor.","Being diligent and detail-oriented, although not of noble birth, she quickly mastered manners and acquired the refinement and elegance akin to a natural-born noble.","After serving as Emperor for about 100 years, as they had initially arranged, she stepped down from the throne. She had intended to return to her homeland using the Teleportation Magic she had perfected during those 100 years, but she had somehow developed an attachment to Archlesia Empire. Thus, while shuttling back and forth between her hometown village and Archlesia Empire, she ultimately decided to settle in the Archlesia Empire for good.","She had no intention of involving herself in matters of the throne, but due to the manners and knowledge she acquired during her reign, she naturally became involved in educating the imperial family and eventually found herself working as a maid. Due to her meticulous nature, she mastered various maid techniques, naturally becoming the Head Maid.","During the Demon Lord's invasion of the Human Realm 1000 years ago, at the request of the Emperor at that time, she was temporarily entrusted with a military force and joined the frontline. After a fierce back-and-forth battle, she defeated the Demon Lord's No.2 Viscount-rank Demon, along with a large force of Demons, who were entrusted with the invasion of Archlesia Empire, but her battle with them took too long, so she had almost no involvement with Neun and the other members of the Hero Party.","Until around this era, documents inherited solely by the imperial family conveyed her role as the First Empress and a sort of guardian of the nation, but these documents were lost during a civil war over the succession to the throne 800 years ago. Coupled with her reluctance to discuss the matter, the notion of her being the First Emperor became somewhat of an urban legend.","She is said to possess seven vocal cords and utilizes her voice and sound in combat. Capable of altering her voice at will, she adopted a cool and dignified tone upon becoming the First Emperor to exude authority, while her natural voice when conversing as Aria is cheerful and friendly.","She's adept at toggling between her ON and OFF-work personas, striving for perfection as Alexandra while working diligently as a maid, while during her downtime, she reverts to her natural self as Aria, indulging in hobbies like leisurely strolls and such.","Although it bothers her that \"Alexandra\" is known as \"Super Maid of Technique\" and is perceived as someone extremely high class, so she can't show her true self on a regular basis, she's gotten used to it to a certain extent.","Her favorite food is fries, and her hobbies during her off-time include short trips and exploration. Even though she naturally exudes kindness and tranquility during her off-time, while working as Alexandra, she adopts the demeanor befitting that of a Super Maid."]},{"number":1838,"title":"Chapter 1838: Golden Encounter 6","paragraphs":["After finishing our meal, I walked out of the restaurant with Aria-san. I was originally supposed to be guiding Aria-san, and the meal here was a thank-you for that, so this would normally be the time for us to part ways, but at that moment, Aria-san gave me a suggestion.","[Kaito-sama, we've already concluded my gratitude for guiding me here, but I personally would like to speak a little more with you. If it's convenient for Kaito-sama, would you mind spending a little more time together with me?]","[Yes, I'd be delighted to. I also want to talk a little more with Aria-san, so I appreciate the suggestion. I don't have any particular plans myself, but Aria-san, do you have any other places you were planning to go?]","[No, but I was thinking of going to a store that sells tea items. Archlesia Empire and Symphonia Kingdom have different styles of porcelains, and each has its own advantages.]","[Heehhh You're quite knowledgeable about them huh.]","Aria-san is easy to talk to, and perhaps because there are parts of our situations that we can empathize with, the conversation during our meal flowed quite smoothly. So, while accepting Aria-san's suggestion, we began walking down the street together.","[I'm embarrassed to say this, but I'm quite detail-oriented Once I get into something, I tend to get overly passionate about it, so as a maid, I started researching tea-related cups and such in detail, thinking I should know more about them.. In the end, I went as far as I could with my own skills. Well, what I got is still layman knowledge though]","[That's impressive. However, rather than starting various things and giving up halfway, it seems like sticking to something like that would be more beneficial in the long run. As for me, I wonder? I feel like I tend to try out various things, but I don't think I could last doing them that long.]","[I don't think that's necessarily a bad thing. There's no need to force yourself to continue with something that doesn't suit you, and you only truly understand your aptitude by trying out different things. And so, trying out various things is, in a sense, diligently exploring one's own potential, and I think it's a very diligent thing to do.]","[When you put it that way, it certainly doesn't sound so bad. Thank you.]","Talking up to this point, I've realized that Aria-san is gentle and kind. In a way, the atmosphere around her might resemble that of Lilia-san. Well, it might just be because I have few acquaintances among the nobility No, Aria-san isn't a noble but this is kinda confusing.","As we walked around while I had such a thought in mind, I heard a scream that cut through that peaceful atmosphere.","[Someone! Catch them!!!]","[ [ ! ? ] ]","When I turned around with Aria-san at the loud voice we heard, we saw a robed figure running with something in their arms and what seemed to be a shopkeeper chasing after them.","At a quick glance, I could tell that that shopkeeper was chasing the robed person who seemed to have stolen items from her store, but just because I noticed it doesn't mean I could instantly react and take action. Plus, the problem area is quite a distance from where we were.","The people on the street were also not likely to help the shopkeeper out, keeping out of the way to avoid the fleeing robed person.","What should we do? Is there anything we can do here? At about the same time as these thoughts were rising in my head, I saw Aria-san clap her hands together, and with a loud bang, the fleeing robed person fell down.","[Eh? What just happened?]","[I focused the vibrations of my clap to deliver a light impact to the chin of that robed person, shaking their brain. I believe they've lost consciousness The guards should be on their way, so I think we can leave the rest to them.]","[Errr That was something Aria-san did?]","[Yes, I can manipulate sound, so in turn, I can relatively freely control vibrations in the air as well. It's an application of my ability.]","Come to think of it, Aria-san did mention earlier in our conversation that she's a high-ranking Demon, and considering her involvement with the revolutionary army, she likely has formidable combat abilities. In that case, incapacitating one or two thieves might indeed be easy for her.","However, putting that aside, manipulating sound to fight sounds pretty cool Like, incapacitating that thief in a distant location with just a light clap looked pretty stylish and smooth.","Manipulating sound seems to have various applications, and heck, I think that's an ability Amel-san would probably like Oops, let's calm down. Perhaps because I've been influenced by Amel-san, I feel like the dormant chuuni in me have been resurfacing from time to time.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Whoa, let's leave talk about the Jet-black Knees at that.]","? ? ? : [Please stop it. That's a path everyone has gone through.]","Serious-senpai : [Speaking of which, you're also quite]","? ? ? : [Do you not want your head anymore?]","Serious-senpai : [S- Sorry.]"]},{"number":1839,"title":"Chapter 1839: Golden Encounter 7","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I don't have time today, so today's chapter is a bit short.","After watching the thief being taken away by the guards, I pulled myself together and moved with Aria-san toward the tea item store.","[By the way, Kaito-sama, you had launched Nifty, right? I was lucky enough to win the lottery too, and I purchased a cup from your place. It's a very nice item.]","[Thank you. Hearing you say that makes me happy. Rather, you also know about Nifty huh.]","[Of course I do. I'm sure no one knowledgeable about tea wouldn't know about Nifty. Your ceramics and tea leaves are really wonderful. It's difficult to obtain your products now because they're so popular, but I'm sure things will calm down in a little while, and at that time, I would like to buy your other products as well.]","[Aria-san also seems to know a lot about tea.]","[Yes, as a maid, I'm very particular about tea, and I'm confident that my tea skills are at a level where I would have no problem calling it top-notch.]","[I see, Aria-san likes tea then?]","In response to my question, Aria-san lightly placed her hand on her chin before holding up her index finger above her lips, as if to make a \"shhh\" gesture.","[Let's keep this to ourselves]","[Unn?]","[But I actually prefer cocoa.]","[Eh? I- Is that so?]","I had assumed that like Ein-san or Jutia-san, Aria-san would enjoy tea, but with a slightly mischievous smile on her lips, she confessed that she actually prefers cocoa.","[No, of course, I like tea. But if I'm asked about my drinking preference, I prefer cocoa over tea, and steamed pastries over cakes and scones. In terms of the skills required for my work as a maid, I approach tea-related tasks with a high level of sensitivity and technique but I have a sweet tooth, and I prefer sweet drinks. However, if too much sugar or syrup is added to tea, it kills the flavor so]","[I see.]","She likes tea, and due to the combination of her job's requirements and her detail-oriented nature, she has a considerable amount of knowledge and confidence in her tea skills, but she personally prefers cocoa This is just my hunch, but Aria-san seems like the type who can firmly switch between being on duty and off duty.","[By steamed pastries, you mean baby castellas and the like?]","[Yes, I quite like them. Regarding baby castellas, since Underworld King-sama also enjoys them, and it's designated as \"one of the mandatory sweets for maids\" by the President of the Maid Association, Ein-sama, any individual who identifies as a maid can bake baby castellas.]","[I- Is that so?]","I don't really know if baby castellas are an essential confectionery for maids, but well, Ein-san would definitely say it's essential. Given that Kuro has a penchant for it that's borderline insanity, baby castellas would be an extremely important treat for Ein-san, who takes pride in being a maid serving Kuro.","[Do you have a favorite confectionery, Kaito-sama?]","[I like ripple pies.]","[Ripple pies are great. I like fruit-based pies very much. Since you like ripple pies, you'd probably also like shineberry pies.]","[Shineberry pies huh, that's the first time I've heard of those. It does sound delicious though.]","[Shineberries taste relatively similar to ripples, but since berries are smaller, so pies made of them have quite a different texture, giving them a different deliciousness compared to ripple pies.]","[Heehhh~~ I'd love to try them. I'll look for them next time.]","A pie made with berries with an apple-like flavor huh That sounds really delicious, and I definitely want to try it. If I search for them in Kuro's food guide, I think I'd find them listed, so let's look for it and try it out next time.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It's like having a distinction between what is necessary for work, of which you have the most knowledge and are most proficient, and what you personally prefer Well, it seems to me like she also enjoys keeping an eye on her image though]"]},{"number":1840,"title":"Chapter 1840: Golden Encounter 8","paragraphs":["The tea shop that Aria-san and I visited wasn't one that sold tea leaves, but rather a store that sold cups and other tea-related items.","It's not a store that I'm familiar with, but when we entered the store, I found a shelf lined with teaspoons, giving the place quite a unique atmosphere.","[I have never been to this store before. They sure have a lot of things here.]","[Right. The tea leaves itself is indeed important, but just like other food and drinks, the taste of tea isn't necessarily determined solely by the ingredients and brewing methods. The taste we perceive can also change depending on where we eat, the situation, the tableware, and other factors. Therefore, I personally think that there are cups and other items for tea that are tailored to the occasion and the person you are serving it to.]","[You really are quite particular about tea. I guess you pay attention to such things because you're a maid?]","[Yes, the authority of nobles is especially strong in Archlesia Empire, so there are many nobles who are particular about the style of their tea. There are multiple types and historical backgrounds in the firing methods of ceramics, cups included, such as Old Empire-style and New Empire-style. Therefore, maids are required to have a lot of knowledge.]","Aria-san calmly explains while gazing at the teaspoons and other items With half of her gaze hidden behind her bangs, her eyes aren't visible, but I feel like she was looking at them sharply.","She mentioned being detail-oriented and also expressed confidence in her tea-making skills, so Aria-san's knowledge of tea must be quite impressive.","[Though I say that, that's only relevant in necessary situations. In private settings, I believe it's fine to enjoy tea in any form as long as the tea's good. Drinking tea from a mug is perfectly acceptable I suppose you could say it just varies depending on the time and occasion? While etiquette and manners are important, as long as such things are practiced when necessary, there shouldn't be any issues doing that.]","[I see. By the way, what about you, Aria-san?]","[Me? I drink cocoa in a mug at home. I use a mug I bought from some street vendor, not a famous porcelain mug or anything like that.]","[Ahaha, I see, Aria-san is the type to clearly separate work and private life huh.]","[Right. In my case, when I'm wearing my maid uniform, I consider myself to be working, so I strive to maintain a sense of perfection befitting that appearance In private though, I tend to relax quite a bit. Yes, even now, I'm not actually looking at tea utensils needed for work, I'm just thinking about wanting some cute-designed teaspoons for home use and browsing through them.]","Seeing Aria-san with a mischievous smile on her lips, I couldn't help chuckling as well. It seems like the only reason she looked so serious was because she was wondering which design would be cute.","It seems like Aria-san has a relatively mischievous personality. Well, people with her personality are the type that I personally quite like and find easy to talk to.","[I wonder if I should buy something too.]","[I think that would be nice. Having just one item that is your favorite can make tea time something to look forward to.]","[Indeed, when you buy something new, it does make you want to use it as soon as possible.]","[Yes, that's exactly right. If it's for the use of men like Kaito-sama, I think the suitable designs around here would be good.]","[Heehhh These designs do look pretty cool. Looking at it again, it's surprising how many different designs there are for teaspoons. I haven't paid attention to them when I use them, so I'm a little surprised.]","[Learning something new and broadening your knowledge is great. Kaito-sama's world has now become a little wider, hasn't it?]","Learning something new and having your world become a little wider Those are good words. In fact, if I hadn't met Aria-san and just went to a tea shop like this, I would never have thought about the design of the teaspoons I use.","[It's certainly exciting to feel one's world expanding a little bit. I'm grateful to Aria-san for giving me the opportunity to do so.]","[Oya? Fufufu, I also gained one more insight. It seems like Kaito-sama is very good at making advances on me.]","[Huh?]","[It may not seem like it, but I'm a simple person, and what you just said made my heart skip a beat. Fufu, I'm grateful to fate that you and I met by chance.]","When she said that with a smile, Aria-san's hair swayed to the side a bit and seeing her gentle red eyes for a moment, I also felt my heart slightly skipping a beat.","Without further mentioning the topic, Aria-san started cheerfully looking at the teaspoon, recommending various spoons to me. Soon enough, I too forgot about our earlier conversation and enjoyed our time shopping.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Serious-senpai, here you go.]","Serious-senpai : [What is this? Chocolate?]","Makina : [This is from the chocolate Serious-senpai had turned into before, and I molded it and made it taste good. The shape is just as good as the ones from high-end stores, isn't it?]","Serious-senpai : [U- Unnn I'm concerned about the ingredients, but I think it looks good So why are you bringing this out?]","Makina : [It's almost April 1st, right? You should at least bring a souvenir]","Serious-senpai : [You want me to give this to Kaito!? Your ideas are lunacy!!! Oh wait, you are an insane god]"]},{"number":1841,"title":"Chapter 1841: Golden Encounter 9","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I'm a bit busy, so today's chapter is a bit short.","At a tea item shop, since we're here anyway, I bought myself a teaspoon, and seemingly having found something nice, Aria-san also purchased a teaspoon before we left the store.","After that, neither of us had a particular place we wanted to go, so we opted to enjoy some window shopping. I don't get a chance to come to the Western District that often, so the streets around here are rather new to me. I know a fair amount of food establishments from Kuro's Eating Tour in its Entirety Guide, but other than those, I know almost nothing about the area.","As I walked down the street with Aria-san, scanning the shops to see what was around, Aria-san suddenly seemed to have spotted something and a mischievous grin appeared on her face.","[Kaito-sama, while we're at it, why don't the two of us do something a little naughty?]","[Eh? Huh?]","Calm down, she probably doesn't mean anything weird. Although we have only known each other for a short time, I know that Aria-san isn't the kind of person who makes such jokes, so what she's talking about here isn't about something lewd, but definitely something more about manners. That's why, don't imagine anything strange Let's calm our minds.","Telling myself this, I looked where Aria-san's eyes were looking and found a single stall.","[Stick snacks huh.]","I have had them before, so I know what they are. As the name suggests, they're rod-shaped No, let's stop making it weird. They're what we call \"churros\" back on Earth.","Of course, they aren't exactly the same because these stick snacks have slightly different textures and shapes, but they're about 85% similar to churros.","[Yes. Walking around while eating kinda feels like we're doing something naughty but don't you think they're delicious exactly because they're fit to eat while walking around?]","[Yes, I agree. Indeed, chur stick snacks are just right for walking while eating.]","It really is as I had expected. She's from a remote village, so she probably had few opportunities to walk around while eating, and of course, working as a maid in Archlesia Empire would have instilled in her the notion that walking around while eating is improper.","Come to think of it, I remembered Olivia-san also hesitating quite a bit in regards to eating while walking, so Aria-san probably also saw it as an immoral act. Well, in Aria-san's case, I have a feeling she also enjoys how immoral it is","I move with Aria-san to the front of the stall. Actually, this stall moves around various parts of the Royal Capital depending on the day, so I've eaten in their stall before in the Southern District, and I'm somewhat familiar with them since they're also featured in Kuro's food guide.","They had four flavors of stick snacks, which I believe were plain, chocolate, caramel and strawberry.","[T- These are quite the enchanting line-up. Chocolate would be nice, but caramel also but we've just eaten earlier, so my stomach isn't free enough to eat two I'm not sure which one I should have.]","Perhaps because the people I know, like Alice or Kuro, can instantly convert what they eat into magic power and eat as much as they want, Aria-san's reaction feels quite fresh to me.","Well, that being said, since Aria-san seems to be having trouble picking between two flavors, I'll teach her a little secret here.","[Fufufu, it seems that Aria-san doesn't know the trick in times like this. Actually, there's a hidden ordering technique that solves Aria-san's problem.]","[W- What did you say.? W- Was such a dreamy technique really possible?]","When I tried saying that with a slightly mischievous tone, Aria-san joined along without hesitation. It seems like she's the type who's good at playing along.","Seeing her reaction, I couldn't help but smile wryly, but upon glancing at the shopkeeper, I saw him looking at us with an empty smile.","[Hou, you have a very sharp eye, laddie. However, at such a young age, I wonder if you really understood the existence of our hidden menu?]","It seems like this guy's also someone good at playing along. Wait, doesn't this feel like you're gonna make this topic continue!?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [How heartwarming. Lately, I've been able to tolerate the heartwarming stuff Unnn, this does feel better than sweet stuff anyway.]","? ? ? : [After this arc ends, I feel like the author's gonna write a short story involving his lovers]"]},{"number":1842,"title":"Chapter 1842: Golden Encounter 10","paragraphs":["The shopkeeper, who seemed to be riding along my and Aria-san's antics, with the same empty smile he had before, dramatically stated.","Since he's gonna be like that, I decided to go along with it and let out a bold smile.","[What would you like to order?]","[Half-and-half.]","[Hou, for you to know about our hidden menu I see you aren't an ordinary laddie.]","Yes, this is a way to solve Aria-san's problem This restaurant doesn't have it on the menu, but if you ask for it, you can ask for two different stick snacks with each being half the size.","The only thing to keep in mind is that the price is usually 3R per stick, but if you order half-and-half, it would cost 4R. Also, even though he said it was some secret menu, if Aria-san and I hadn't started talking like that, I think the shopkeeper would have suggested that instead.","In my case, I only know about it because it was explained in Kuro's eating guide.","[Half-and-half, two different tastes at the same time and the amount is the same as one. It sounds like a dream come true but not everything in this world is that sweet. Normally, one can enjoy a stick snack for 3R, but by ordering half-and-half, you can enjoy it for 4R. The risk of having that part of the menu exists after all So, what would you have?]","[We'll have two half-and-halves, one chocolate + caramel, and one plain + strawberry.]","[No hesitation Your guts, I like it. In consideration of your determination, laddie, I'll give you one suggestion.]","[Suggestion?]","The shopkeeper is surprisingly easygoing, and with us getting swept up in the atmosphere, it kinda feels like we're making some kind of deal but we're just buying snacks to eat while walking.","[Yes, ordering two sets would normally be 2R If you show the guts to pay for the lady's share, I'll let you have it for just 7R How about it, loverboy?]","[Fuuu I was planning on doing that from the start.]","[K- Kaito-sama]","It really feels like we've gotten into a strange vibe, and even Aria-san is fully embracing it, seemingly overcome with emotion I may be repeating myself here, but we're just buying snacks at the food stall.","Although I feel like I'll be embarrassed when I look back on this moment later, being swept up in the moment and atmosphere, I bought the stick snacks while giving the shopkeeper a thumbs up.","[Things turned kinda weird there, didn't it?]","[Fufu, I did have a little fun though. Besides, I learned a way to taste two flavors at the same time, which was quite enlightening Ahh, Kaito-sama, I'll give you back the money you paid.]","[Ahh, no, please don't worry about it. As I mentioned earlier, I was planning on paying for it from the start You know, you treated me with fries and other stuff earlier.]","[This would be that patterns where not accepting your kindness would be rude, right? I understand, I'll gratefully accept it.]","After hearing my words, Aria-san thanked me with a smile. It's moments like these, where she accepts things without pushing back, that make talking with Aria-san easy and comfortable.","Perhaps her conversational skills are just that good. She naturally responds in a flexible manner, and knows when to refrain and when to accept the other person's kindness, making it very easy for me to interact with her.","[Hmm~~ It tastes wonderful. I really like sweets with simple flavors like this.]","[It's simple, but tasty, isn't it? It's the kind of taste that you don't get tired of]","[Right. Being able to enjoy a variety of flavors is also great By the way, Kaito-sama I'm actually interested in the strawberry and plain-flavored ones as well How about it, why don't we exchange a bite with each other so that we can taste all four flavors?]","[Eh? Y- Yes, I'm fine with that but errr. Aria-san, are you alright with that?]","[Unn? Yes, I see no problem with it.]","It seems like she isn't the type who cares about things like indirect kissing. Anyhow, if Aria-san herself is alright with it, it's not like I'm averse to it, so we decided to exchange a bite each.","Exchanging our wrappers of half-and-half flavored stick snacks, we took our bites, and then handed them back to each other. The chocolate and caramel-flavored stick snacks were sweet and delicious.","[The plain and strawberry flavors were also delicious. It's kind of enjoyable how the same stick snack can seem totally different depending on the flavor, doesn't it?]","[Indeed. Ah, the chocolate and caramel flavors were delicious too. Thank you.]","[No, no, it's me who should feel sorry for going along with my whims]","[Aria-san?]","After receiving her chocolate and caramel stick snacks back from me, Aria-san stiffened for a moment, then shifted her gaze between the wrapper of the stick snacks and me is how her facial expression seemed to suggest. Although her eyes were hidden by her hair, I could probably infer that she was making such eye movements.","[Kaito-sama, I would like you to listen without getting angry if possible]","[Yes Is something the matter?]","[Ah, no, my mind was completely drawn to the taste of the stick snacks and hadn't even considered that what we did just now would be an indirect kiss. If you're uncomfortable with it, I apologize.]","[Ahh, about that. No, I wasn't really paying much attention to it either, so it's fine. Rather, I should be the one asking Aria-san that, are you uncomfortable with it?]","[It should depend on the other party, but I don't have a problem with it this time. I apologize for not realizing it though.]","[No, don't worry about it.]","It seems like she isn't really unconcerned about indirect kisses, but her mind had instead been focusing on the taste, and it just didn't occur to her. I can't shake off the feeling that she might be a bit lax in her guard, but at least it's a relief that things didn't get awkward between us.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [To think they'd have an indirect kiss on the first day they met What speed A terrifying character seemed to have emerged.]"]},{"number":1843,"title":"Chapter 1843: April Fool’s Day Extra - : [Title omitted]","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I got home late today and today's chapter ended up being a bit short, so I'll extend April Fool's Day and continue updating its story tomorrow.","One afternoon, I was relaxing in my room reading a magazine when suddenly, without warning, a person dropped onto the sofa in my room.","No, even though I'm the one saying this, I also don't really understand what I'm saying, but seriously, someone suddenly appeared out of thin air and fell onto the sofa. Did someone come to visit me with Teleportation Magic? That said, that's a strange way to teleport As I had such a thought in mind, I got up and approached the sofa, and saw a woman in a sailor uniform holding her waist in pain.","[Fuooohhh My back I hit my lower back. Also, I'm teleported indoors this time?]","[If it isn't Serious-senpai. Why are you suddenly in my room?]","The person who looks a lot like Shea-san, holding her waist and groaning in pain, is Serious-senpai, the self-proclaimed incarnation of seriousness, whom I have met several times in the past.","At first, I often mistook her for Shea-san, but as expected, after meeting her so many times, I've come to be able to distinguish between the two. Shea-san has a cool and sharp atmosphere around her, while Serious-senpai looks kinda stu she has this cheerful atmosphere around her, so I can easily recognize who is who once I got used to them.","But well, putting that aside Why did she suddenly appear on the sofa in my room?","[Eh? Kaito? Long time no see Is this your room?]","[Yes, did you arrive here without knowing it?]","[Every year, the moment the door to that room opens, I get automatically teleported. Until last year, I had always been teleported somewhere in the city, but I'm teleported indoors now Unn? No, could it be that I'm actually just being teleported near to where Kaito is?]","[I have nothing to do with that strange room Serious-senpai lives in though?]","[You do. You have a lot of connection with it. You're the protagonist, so Ah, no, it's nothing. In any case, it seems that when I leave that room, I will arrive somewhere near you, so I'll be in your care next time.]","[H- Huh]","I couldn't really understand any of the crucial parts she was saying, but I do understand that she apparently appears near me once a year This person really is quite the enigma, she's someone hard to understand. No, it's not that she's a bad person or anything like that though","[Well, anyway, errr Hmm Since I've got it, might as well give it to you Here, a souvenir?]","[Eh? Ahh, thank you for expressly bringing me one. What's this?]","[It's a beautifully molded chocolate from when I had chocolatized.]","[What are you talking about? Did you hit your head, Senpai?]","The heck does she mean by \"chocolatized\"? No, that just makes no sense. Well, I do understand that she had been rather weird before, but she's just becoming even more incomprehensible.","[Serious-senpai, you made these by molding chocolate?]","[No, you remember how I talked about a crazy God? One time my body turned into chocolate, that crazy God smashed my body and that would be the end product, so rather than me molding chocolate, it's more like \"I got molded\", I guess?]","[I'll be there with you, so how about we go to a hospital?]","[I didn't become crazy! I know it sounds crazy, but it's true! Even I've been troubled by it, what with turning into sugar or anko]","Wasn't her setting supposed to be like she's the embodiment of seriousness or something like that? I certainly haven't felt any sense of seriousness from Senpai, both now and back then, but why the heck would a supposed embodiment of seriousness have the ability to transform her own body into sweets?","No, maybe that crazy God had done something to her. Since they're a God, they should be able to do that much","[No, but putting aside all those circumstances, isn't it messed up for Serious-senpai to bring the chocolate, which was apparently made from the chocolate your body turned into, as a souvenir?]","[Stop with the sound arguments, please I honestly haven't thought I'm doing this either. However, since that crazy God prepared it and handed it to me, I thought I should properly give it to you]","[I've said it several times, but for Serious-senpai's sake, I'll tell you this again. That God is seriously dangerous, so you should really keep your distance from them]","[No, rather than this being about me, it's more because that God's someone related to you]","Serious-senpai's expression upon hearing my words was indescribably complicated, which left quite an impression in my mind.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [No, you completely omitted the whole subtitle!? Also, the heck do you mean you'll extend April Fool's!?]","<Translator's Notes>","The meanings have kinda gotten lost in translations, so I changed some of what was said. For example, in the line:","The heck does she mean by \"chocolatized\"? No, that just makes no sense. Well, I do understand that she had been rather weird before, but she's just becoming even more incomprehensible.","The second and third sentences are completely changed.","The first sentence is talking about Serious-senpai chocolatizing (like, the process of turning into chocolate or something) / , which is read as \"chokoretokasuru\".","The second sentence is originally:","No, maybe she had misspoken and had instead meant to say \"the chocolate I had melted\"? No, well, saying it that way's still pretty weird, but I could still somewhat understand what she meant here more than what she just said.","\"The chocolate I had melted\" /","is read as \"chokoreto tokashita\".","No April Fools' day chapter from me this year, so here's a picture of a cat I found from google instead."]},{"number":1844,"title":"Chapter 1844: April Fool’s Day Extra - : ’Extended April Fool’s Day’","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","Just realized the previous chapter was similar to last year's, so I made some changes.","(T/N: c1843 already edited.)","Serious-senpai, a self-proclaimed incarnation of seriousness, arriving from a mysterious room whose door opens only once a year, in a way that even she herself can't figure out This person really is full of mystery.","The tension brimming from her body is unique, but she's definitely not a bad person, someone who has a friendly vibe Well, there are many unusual ones among the people I know, so I feel like shes just an unusual friend who shops up from time to time.","[Serious-senpai, would you like something to drink?]","[Coffee please.]","[I understand. Do you want sugar or milk with it?]","Circumstances aside, I decided to entertain her arrival and as she had requested, I brought out coffee from my magic box. For the times when I feel like having a little drink but think it's not worth bothering Illness-san or Theta to brew it for me, I decided to have some extra brewed in a coffee pot and stored it in my magic box.","As a side note, Eta isn't good at brewing coffee or tea She isn't good at cooking-related activities, so if I ask someone other than Illness-san, it will be Theta.","Thanks to the magic box, the coffee retains its state when it was freshly brewed but I don't know if it's a mental thing or not, but I think the coffee brewed in front of me tastes better than the coffee I just brought out of my magic box to drink.","[Good grief, it's obviously gonna be black. Kaito, I'm the incarnation of seriousness, the serious of the serious, the one consecutively chosen by me as the most serious within the Greatest Seriousness Yearly Gala Black is the only way to be.]","There are so many things I'd like to throw my tsukkomis at, but for the time being, there's that one point \"chosen by me\" Wouldn't that mean you're just completely self-praising!?","[Well, putting aside the parts I wanna tsukkomi at What's the connection between Senpai being an incarnation of seriousness and coffee having to be black?]","[Oi, stop that, idiot. Don't ask such harsh questions with pure intentions. Listen here, those are questions you aren't supposed to ask here That's like trying to logically persuade the chuunis, you know After all, serious stuff = black coffee! All you just do here is agree that that is the case! Understand, don't ask me any more of those questions! I can't answer that!!!","[Haahhh I understand. Well then, here's your black coffee. I guess you'd also want something that isn't sweet for teacakes I got bitter chocos here, so here you go.]","[Well~~ You're so kind Thanks.]","[What an emotional roller coaster]","Just when I thought she was mad, she's now thanking me with a moved expression on her face. Her mood sure fluctuates wildly as usual.","[By the way, Kaito, who are you aiming for next.. Out with it.]","[Umm, please keep the topic on track Your words just lack so much reason that I can't make sense of it]","[I'm asking you who you're going to make your next lover.]","[Errr, I'm sorry. Even though I heard that, I just couldn't understand what you meant Who am I going to make my next lover? I never have such plans though]","[Guess it has to be the most likely one, Illness huh No, there's a chance that a dark horse like Lunamaria would suddenly pop up]","[And she's not listening at all Rather, you know about Illness and Luna-san huh.]","Come to think of it, she knew Alice, so she might know about the people around me. However, no matter how I think about it, I still have no idea what her intention is by asking who my next lover is.","No, even if I were to have a new lover, what does that have to do with Serious-senpai?","[Serious-senpai, may I ask something? Setting aside the details about me gaining a new lover, for argument's sake, if I were considering someone as my new lover, how would that affect Senpai?]","[If you were to gain a new lover, that would increase the frequency of my sugarization and the number of times I'd receive pure damage, so knowing about this is important. You see, even if I couldn't avoid receiving damage, I could still get myself mentally prepared It's better to be prepared than to get yourself caught off guard, right? That's what I mean.]","[I see I'm going to contact Dr. Vier, so let's check out her place together. Don't worry, I'll be there with you!]","[Stop looking at me like I'm insane!]","I mean, even though I should have listened to her words carefully, all I could think was \"The heck is this guy talking about?\", so it's only natural to conclude that she might have some sort of mental issue.","However, it doesn't feel like she's lying, and although the emotions I could feel with Sympathy Magic have their ups and downs, she doesn't seem to be lying.","[Thinking about Senpai's matters too deeply gives me a headache, so I'll stop thinking about it from now on For the time being, do you have something you'd like to eat? It's lunchtime after all.]","[Oh my, are you actually aiming for me Don't you underestimate me, youngster! Don't think you can easily bring down this Serious-senpai like that!!! That being said, chicken would be great, that spicy one. That ethnic dish]","[Tandoori chicken?]","[Right, that! I'd like to eat that!]","[I understand, I'll talk with the others.]","[Unn! Thanks, Kaito!!!]","This is just my hunch, but I think Serious-senpai is probably quite the easy person","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai (Conquered) : [No, the extended version having even a longer title than the original ones, the heck is going on!!!?]","? ? ? : [No, look at your name With enough favorability accumulated, does that mean itll be a success if he just confesses?]"]},{"number":1845,"title":"Chapter 1845: April Fool’s Day Extra - : ’Extended Extension’","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","The extensions end here.","On our way to a restaurant that I found in Kuro's eating tour guide, Serious-senpai suddenly stopped and began shouting into the void.","[No, what do you mean extended extension!!!? You finished things neatly last time, what do you even want me to do!?]","[Serious-senpai, what's with you all of a sudden?]","[Kaito, this is bad. The world still wants something from us.]","[What do you mean by something?]","At the moment, the way I see it, Serious-senpai has started saying incomprehensible things out of the blue again, but the person herself kinda seems to be serious about it.","I have no idea what Serious-senpai is seeing, but for the time being, it seems like an unexpected situation has occurred.","[This is probably that. By the flow of things It's a date, right!?]","[H- Huh, well, we are heading off to eat, so it's technically not wrong to call this a date.]","[D*mn you, world! How much do you intend to torment me!!!? Ahh, that's not it. It's not like I don't want to go on a date with Kaito, and this is a completely unrelated matter, so don't misunderstand that!]","[Ah, yes.]","It seemed like she was talking to herself about some serious stuff, but first of all, putting misunderstandings and all that aside, I don't even have any clue what the situation is Well, I do feel her inherent kindness coming through in the fact that she's providing such explanations.","[Errr, for the time being, I guess we can just go to a tandoori chicken restaurant?]","[Ah, unnn. There's no problem with that. Sorry for stopping us there.]","[No, no, let's go there.]","As usual, her emotions switched directions as fast as a roller coaster, as even though she sounded angry just now, her thoughts switched as if nothing happened.","[Come to think of it, just a question, but Serious-senpai, you said you're the incarnation of seriousness like, you're a materialized concept?]","[Yes, I'm the seriousness within seriousness, she who loves seriousness and is loved by seriousness. The King of Seriousness, Serious-senpai, but what of it?]","I feel more like she's the gestaltzerfall of seriousness, but I feel like I lose if I seriously throw a tsukkomi at that, so I thoroughly ignored it and continued with my question.","[Well, do you have any special abilities? For example, like, making a certain target become a serious person or something?]","[Fumu Well, if I have to say it I'd say complaining about the heartwarming or lovey-dovey stuff while praying for a serious development?]","[Aren't you no different from a TV watcher then? Rather, what about the special abilities?]","[I know a lot of trivia!]","[Then aren't you just a regular person!?]","Not only is it just my impression, but from the way she said it, she had zero seriousness in her With her being like that, why is she calling herself the seriousness within seriousness In a way, I suppose that unfounded confidence is Senpai's strongest point.","[Ahh, I can vomit sugar, turn into sugar and I guess I can generally change into anything sweet? If I had to point out a special ability, well, I don't really think it's a special ability, as it's more of just the way my body is, then there's that, but it's hard to judge if it really is one.]","[Rather than an incarnation of seriousness, aren't you more like an incarnation of sweetness then?]","[It's not like I can change at will, but rather, by witnessing lovey-dovey developments or the like, the serious factor within me reacts with rejection and transforms, resulting in an alteration or something like that?]","[Even you yourself don't really understand your own body!?]","That's kind of a fluffy ecology, but it's still one filled with mysteries, and even when I asked about it, instead of getting clearer, it feels like the mysteries just deepen, to the point where even the person herself doesn't seem to understand her own body much.","[Huh, well, it can't be helped if you yourself don't know much about it.]","[Ugh Sorry for being an unreliable serious guy.]","[No, no, I'm not saying you're completely unreliable Indeed, Senpai is a peculiar person and there are many mysteries surrounding you, but I can tell you're a good person so I quite like you.]","[H- Haahhh!? J- J- J- J- Just wai S- Stop screwing around D- D- D- Don't think you can make me fall that easily!!!]","[No, it's not like I'm trying to make you fall]","[But well, I suppose, in recognition of your courage, after lunch, I might not mind going out for coffee or a date!!! I'll even allow some level of skinship! However, keep it within the boundaries of what's appropriate for all ages, okay!!!?]","[Ah, yes.]","Is it just my imagination? I didn't mean it like that, but seeing her reaction now, she feels so easy that makes me think \"I might be able to push her a little further\".","Well, umm, she really is a strange person but even with all her antics, I think she's someone interesting, so as I thought, I don't dislike her after all.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : []","Serious-senpai (Conquered) : [W- What's with that look]","? ? ? : [No, I guess I understood the meaning of that word next to your name No, that's certainly something I also want to say but anyhow, you're too easy.]"]},{"number":1846,"title":"Chapter 1846: Golden Encounter 11","paragraphs":["I walk around the city with Aria-san, enjoying window shopping and chatting with her about various things. Remembering the sound-related abilities that she used a while ago, I asked her about it.","[Aria-san, can you do basically anything related to sound?]","[Yes, I suppose it wouldn't be wrong to say that.]","[For example, moving at the sound speed?]","[Yes, well, I can.]","[I see, that sounds pretty powerful. Sound attacks unleashed at sound speed]","[]","Sound Speed Movement is often considered a strong ability in battle-oriented media. Attacks with a speed of approximately 340 m/sec are quite tremendous, so I thought Aria-san might be pretty strong but she was looking at me with a complicated expression on her face.","As I tilted my head in wonder, Aria-san explained with a wry smile.","[No, sound speed certainly is tremendous at an ordinary level but for Peerage holders, that speed is so slow that there are only a few Baron-ranks who can't reach sound speed, and those who can't reach sound speed often excel in other abilities instead and for those who excel in speed, even when they're at Baron-rank, they can move dozens of times faster than sound speed.]","[Ahh, I see. Come to think of it, I did hear something about how even low Count-ranks are able to handle light speed.]","I remember hearing about it from Alice when we were talking about Lilia-san's reaction speed. If I recall correctly, at that time, Lilia-san hadn't reached the same level as Count-ranks yet, but Alice said Lilia-san's observable speed was on the level of 1/200 millionth of a second, and her reaction time was 1/100 millionth of a second. Of course, this includes enhancement by magic, but I heard that was at a level slightly lower than light speed.","Now that she has already reached the level of Count-ranks, she must be much faster than that Peak Count-ranks, Duke-ranks and the Six Kings must be on a whole different level then.","Even with the glasses that can allow me to see at speeds ten times faster than light, capturing Isis-san, who moves relatively slowly, in my view is still at a challenging level The Six Kings really are just astounding.","[Yes, so sound attacks are actually quite slow. However, although the can be sensed to some extent with magic, since sound can't be visually observed, there are many situations where it can be effectively used. One can set them up as a trap, manipulate the sound in space to eliminate blind spots, disrupt the opponent's sense of balance, the range of applications is wide But well, in direct combat, the reality is that they're slow. It may not seem like it, but I'm also a Peerage-holder, so I can move much faster than sound]","[You can reach light speed?]","[Ahh, no, I'm a little bit far from reaching light speed but I can manage about ten times sound speed, but beyond that would be a little tough.]","[I see. But from my point of view, even 10 times sound speed is more than enough.]","[Fufu, thank you. Since there are many formidable individuals around Kaito-sama, I was a bit worried you might be disappointed.]","With a mischievous glint in her eyes, Aria-san smiled, and watching her looking amused, I couldn't help but smile too.","Well, from someone like me, whose combat prowess is compared to that of a slime, both Baron-ranks and Count-ranks seem incomprehensibly impressive, and they're just beyond amazing for me.","[There's no way I'd be disappointed. I mean, just being a Peerage-holder qualifies you as being among the world's handful of geniuses, so Aria-san truly is amazing.]","[Please don't flatter me so much. I might get carried aw K- Kaito-sama!? Please excuse me!]","[Eh? Whoa!]","In the middle of our conversation, Aria-san looked as if she had noticed something, and at a tremendous speed, she ran into a nearby alleyway with me in her arms.","Without understanding what was happening all of a sudden, I was confused, but Aria-san, still holding my head, gestured for me to hide myself. Maybe I shouldn't be thinking about this at a time like this, but my face is being firmly pressed against her chest just now She smells quite elegant, strangely making my heart beat fast.","[Umm, Aria-san?]","[Shhh! Please wait a moment. I- I just spotted someone I know I apologize for making you feel cramped, but please wait a little longer.]","[Ah, yes.]","With those words, I could somewhat sense the situation. Aria-san was definitely here incognito, and she probably wanted to avoid being seen by acquaintances.","I understood that, but being held like this until that acquaintance of hers passes by, the embarrassment I'm feeling is just No, but it certainly would have been bad if I moved here and they noticed us Ahh, come to think, can that acquaintance be seen from here?","While being embraced by Aria-san, I couldn't move my face much, but I managed to shift my gaze slightly to see the direction Aria-san was looking.","No, rather, isn't that Beatrice-san? Unn? Arehh? That means Aria-san really is Alexandra-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [W- What a guy. To go for a tight hug on the first day they met Are they speed-running here or what]"]},{"number":1847,"title":"Chapter 1847: Golden Encounter 12","paragraphs":["After a few minutes of hiding in the alleyway while being hugged by Aria-san, her somewhat tense atmosphere relaxed, and a feeling of relief was conveyed from Sympathy Magic.","Beatrice-san seemed to have left without noticing us.","[That was close. As expected, if she sees me, she'll sense my Maidric Aura and figure things out Is she shopping? Since she works at the Royal Castle, it certainly wouldn't be strange for her to come out to the city to shop Ahh, Kaito-sama!? My apologies! That was on impulse Was it painful?]","[Ah, no, I'm alright.]","I didn't feel any pain or discomfort at all, and rather, it was soft, warm and comfortable. I was trying to empty my mind and not be conscious of my situation, so I didn't even have the composure to consider if it was painful or not.","It was kind of a lucky pervert situation, but fundamentally, there was no way I could break free from Aria-san's hold, who's apparently a Peerage-holder, and considering that I couldn't shout in that situation, I could technically consider this as inevitable No, Aria-san doesn't seem to mind at all though.","[That being said.]","[Yes?]","[You are Alexandra-san, right?]","[..]","I wonder why? Even though her eyes should be hidden behind her hair, I can still sense this \"He found out!? What should I do!?\" thoughts coming from her.","And next to it comes conflicting emotions She's probably having second thoughts on whether she should feign ignorance or not. No, as for me, I've already got the answer I wanted that she's the same person as Alexandra-san from her reaction just now, so if Aria-san tries to cover it up, I don't intend to pursue it any further.","That's what I thought, but after a little while, Aria-san, looking somewhat resigned, spoke.","[I apologize for not telling you.]","[Ah, no, you were traveling incognito after all Umm, I had been thinking that this might be the case for a while now, but since your voice was different, I wasn't quite sure enough to ask]","[Ahh, when I'm working as Alexandra, I change my voice. As I explained earlier, I can manipulate sound, so I can freely change my voice.]","[I see Unn? Arehh? You said \"when you're working as Alexandra\", so does that mean that your voice now is your natural voice?]","[Yes. Incidentally, my real name is Aria, and Alexandra is well, umm, a temporary name I use for various situations, but in the end, it stuck and became the name I use for work.]","Aria-san apparently didn't intend to deceive me, and after admitting that she was Alexandra-san, she explained.","[Umm, Kaito-san I- If it's possible, about this matter]","[Of course, you can rest assured. I swear I'm not going to tell anyone.]","[Phew Thank you very much. I've been working as Alexandra for a long time and developed an image of being classy and noble and there are many people who look up to me and make me their goal]","[I had a feeling that was the case, but I suppose your current personality as Aria-san is the real one?]","In fact, she was talking a little while ago about how her image got oddly fixed, and she couldn't show her true self, so I think there's no mistaking that. Aria-san lightly nodded and then smiled wryly.","[I've spent so many years as Alexandra that it's not like I'm forced to act the character If I had to describe it, it's like I switch between work-mode Alexandra and daily life-mode Aria. I'm not particularly troubled about being found out, but there's quite a contrast between me as Alexandra and me as Aria, which can strangely cause confusion If I were to meet an acquaintance from my Alexandra side in private, there's also the question of which persona I should use]","[Ahh~~ That's certainly a dilemma. As for me, you were alright as we've only spoken a few words before?]","[I suppose so. Thanks to that, I was able to naturally interact with Kaito-sama with my true personality. If I had more interactions with you as Alexandra, I think I would have made up some excuse and fled as soon as I realized you were Kaito-sama.]","When I think about it like that, thanks to not talking too much when she was working as Alexandra-san, I was able to get somewhat close to Aria-san, who is easy to talk to and has a personality I'm compatible with, so in that sense, it feels like things had worked out well.","No, during Maid Olympia, there was so much information overload that I felt a slight aversion, or rather, some discomfort about the existence of maids, so I had nothing more to say to her beyond simple greetings","[Well, let's get back on track and continue our stroll Aria-san.]","[Fufu, yes.]","Even if she's the same person as Alexandra-san, I'll still address her as Aria-san. When I called her name with that intention in mind, Aria-san seemed to realize it right away and with a somewhat pleased expression on her face, she smiled.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A special someone with whom she can be her true self D*mn it, this Flag Architect, in the blink of an eye]"]},{"number":1848,"title":"Chapter 1848: Ship Party Invitations 1","paragraphs":["While enjoying window shopping and conversing with Aria-san, the topic shifted somewhat naturally to the ship party I'm currently planning and preparing for.","Aria-san must have experienced many parties as the Head Maid of Archlesia Empire's Imperial Castle, so she would be quite knowledgeable about various aspects, and it would be helpful to receive advice from her.","[I see, it seems like that's going to be quite a large-scale party.]","[Yes, it's my first time organizing a party so are there any things I should be mindful of?]","[I think it's best if you hire reliable servers. In terms of capability, those Peerage-holders under Kaito-sama's employment might suffice but for a party of considerable scale like this, even if those on your side are capable of handling everything by themselves, having only a few servants would make your side appear hectic to outsiders.]","[Ahh~~ I see, that certainly makes sense.]","In fact, Illness-san could handle it alone if she wanted to, but it might seem chaotic and make it difficult for guests to approach her if she's overly occupied.","In that case, I suppose it would be better to hire some people to deal with that","[However, considering it's going to be quite a large party, it's difficult to determine how many to hire.]","[That's true Ahhh, in that case, how about requesting assistance from the World Maid Association? They would prioritize Kaito-sama's request, and if you inform them of the party's scale, they should be able to introduce suitable personnel. If necessary, I can also hope.]","[I appreciate the offer, but I actually wanted to invite you instead Ahh, of course, under the name of Alexandra-san, that is.]","[Fufu, I see. In that case, I'm looking forward to it.]","Aria-san's advice is valuable. Indeed, the maids in this world are exceptionally skilled, and many belong to the World Maid Association, an organization of which Ein-san is the President.","If I ask directly, she'll likely introduce trustworthy personnel. What I'm concerned about is whether Ein herself would volunteer to assist as a maid, but as long as I firmly convey that I want her to come as a guest this time, it should be fine.","[And also, let's see. Regarding souvenirs and gifts, I think it's best if you specify in the invitation beforehand. There's no rule that says you have to bring such items to parties, but if many guests decide to bring them to impress Kaito-sama, it could take up a lot of time just receiving them.]","[I see, I'd personally prefer it if they bring no souvenirs]","[In that case, if you specify in the invitations that bringing souvenirs for smooth proceedings is unnecessary, you should be fine.]","[I see]","After receiving several pieces of advice from Aria-san and jotting them down in my notes, our conversation came to a pause, and Aria-san, with a somewhat solemn expression on her face, spoke.","[Even so, a party hosted by Kaito-sama It seems like it'll have impressive guests. Have you already decided on the date and other details?]","[No, I haven't completely decided on everything, but I'm planning to finalize it soon and send out invitations. I'm thinking around the end of next month for the event.]","[I see, the end of next month huh There's the regularly held Three Nations Conference around that time but well, I suppose that isn't relevant.]","[Unn?]","[I think it's best to choose a date that suits Kaito-sama's convenience the most. Personally, I'm eagerly looking forward to the party.]","After saying so with a gentle smile, Aria-san went on to provide various detailed advice and interesting tidbits about the paper to use for invitations, and we got engrossed in that topic for a while.","<Afterword>","Flag Speedrun Top Rankings","These rankings aren't based on the speed at which they fall in love, but a ranking based on their initial actions (limited to direct action towards Kaito).","1st Place: Isis Remnant","Proposed within minutes of their encounter. The overwhelming speed that leaves no room for others, possessing both impact and heroine power, securing an overwhelmingly dominant position As expected, Isis is just the strongest","2nd Place: Fate","Attempted to have herself under Kaito's support + establish fait accompli on the first day of their encounter. While she hadn't exactly fallen for Kaito at first sight, her initial actions were driven by calculation, yet the impact of her actions is outstanding.","3rd Place: Tre","Got rejected three times on the first day of their encounter. Considering her personality, it's unclear how serious she is with her confessions, but she has mentioned feeling some sort of fate between them, so although it may seem like a joke, she might actually be quite serious.","Serious-senpai : [I thought Aria was quite fast in the Speedrun Rankings, but the Top 3 are on another level]"]},{"number":1849,"title":"Chapter 1849: Ship Party Invitations 2","paragraphs":["A few days had passed since my meeting with Aria-san, and by chance, I had come to Archlesia Empire's Royal Capital. This time, it was Chris-san who had business with me, and I came to deliver cups from my tea brand, Nifty.","I was told that Nebula and Illness-san are now able to make Empire-style porcelain, so I will ask Chris-san to check it once and if it looks alright, we will also market those.","I was guided to Chris-san's office and sitting down on the reception couch chatting, when we heard a knock on the door and Aria-san or rather, Alexandra-san entered pushing a cart of tea.","Unlike back when she was acting as Aria-san, her bangs are pinned back to show her face, and her hair is all neatly tied up in a neat and tidy bun. When she was going around with me as Aria-san, she had a relaxed atmosphere like that of an older lady next door, but she's working as Alexandra-san, she looks like a professional, an adult who is capable in her job.","Her facial expression is crisp and the atmosphere around her looks somewhat sharp. Even though I knew what kind of person she was, the change between her two states was quite surprising.","[Your Majesty, Miyama-sama. Please have some refreshments.]","[Thank you.]","The way she said that in a cool voice, brewed tea and put it in front of me and Chris-san with sophisticated movements, perhaps because of her different voice, I really feel as if she was a different person.","I was slightly confused by this, but after positioning herself at the back of the sofa where Chris-san was sitting, in a spot that wasn't within Chris-san's gaze and only I could see her Alexandra-san held up an index finger in front of her lips and mischievously winked at me.","I think she probably sensed that I was a little confused and secretly showed me her Aria-san side in a way that Chris-san couldn't see. Seeing her consideration, making me feel that she really is Aria-san, I couldn't help letting out a smile.","[Miyama-sama?]","[Ahh, no, the tea is delicious Once again, Chris-san, these are the porcelain I told you about in the letter.]","[Let me take a look at it I see, it's a wonderful piece of perfection. It's a perfect reproduction of the Empire-style, and it's simply a high-level of pottery I'm always amazed at the high level of Nifty's products.]","[The people who make them are the amazing ones That said, if Chris-san thinks they're okay, then I suppose we could add them to our line-up of items.]","[Yes, I'm sure they will be popular, especially with the nobles and maids of Archlesia Empire]","It seems that the porcelains are well-received, and adding Empire-style teacups to the lineup shouldn't be a problem. I continued chatting with Chris-san for a little while, but since we had met like this, I thought we should talk a little about the ship party, so I broached the topic with her.","[Speaking of which, I haven't decided on the exact date yet, but I'm thinking of organizing a ship party in the near future]","[Eh? A- A party hosted. by Miyama-sama?]","[Yes. I'm going to hold a party on a ship. I'll send an invitation to Chris-san too, so if it's convenient for you, please come and attend.]","[I- I see T- That's very terrifying N- No, I'm very much looking forward to it! Of course, I'll be happy to attend!]","I'm not sure if it was just my imagination or not, but Chris-san's smile, as she said that, seemed somewhat forced.","At the same time that Kaito was meeting and chatting with Chris, in a certain other space, Alice had a smile as forced as Chris's.","[No, you could just use the terminal]","[Isn't it alright!? I even did something like running errands for Shallow Vernal, renewed our contract, and made a terminal for it, so I can go in this form I'll even properly put up with the lumps of flesh around.]","[No, putting up with them is just obvious In the first place, the strength of that terminal you're planning on using is just too strong. If you relax even slightly, the weakest person in that place will be obliterated just by the pressure of your presence]","[Don't worry! My children are coming too, so I won't make the mistake in controlling that okay? See? Isn't it alright, Alice]","[Hmmmmmmm.]","Hearing Makina insisting on participating in the ship party hosted by her beloved child, Kaito, as Makina instead of Eden, Alice had an unusually troubled expression on her face.","First of all, acting as Makina in itself isn't a problem as long as its permitted by Shallow Vernal, the God of the World. However, doing that would bring about very big concerns.","There wouldn't be such a problem if she's in the form of Eden Almost everyone who knows Kaito already recognizes Eden as \"a dangerous God from another world\", so no one would dare come even close to provoking her.","However, few of them are familiar with Makina's appearance. Thinking of the possibility that someone could inadvertently make an unintentional remark or take an action that could earn Makina's ire, Alice would have to watch out for Makina for almost the entire party which to put it simply, is something she finds a hassle.","[It's my beloved child's big day, so isn't it alright I'll definitely be docile!]","[I'm troubled here because I can't trust you doing that at all Hmmm.]","And so, for a while afterward, the scene of Makina clinging to Alice, who had a troubled expression on her face, continued.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [What Alice-chan doesn't like is that if that happens, Alice-chan will end up being the one in charge of Makina I Alice-chan wants to enjoy the party too]"]},{"number":1850,"title":"Chapter 1850: Ship Party Invitations 3","paragraphs":["In the office of the Royal Palace in Hydra Kingdom, King Laguna was organizing documents. She would generally skip routing meetings and events that she deemed didn't matter much, but she wouldn't neglect anything important to the country. She handled paperwork promptly without postponing, so Laguna was indeed very capable as a King.","Setting aside her personal ideas, that is","[Haahhh Good grief, how long are they going to make the elderly sit on that throne Perhaps it's for the country to undergo some renewal, to bring in some fresh air.]","[Hahaha, please rest assured, Your Majesty. Our culture already has the culture of embracing new ideas without us needing to resort to such actions. Thus, please continue your reign without worry.]","As usual, Laguna muttered about wanting to resign as King, but this was nothing new, and it was something her aides, who were also busy organizing documents in the office, were accustomed to. Without taking their eyes off the documents, they just casually responded, and whether Laguna herself just intended it as mere small talk or not, she sighed lightly and proceeded to sign the documents.","At that moment, one of her aides approached Laguna holding a document.","[Your Majesty, regarding the venue of the Three Nations Conference]","[Ahh, this year it's going to be held here in Hydra Kingdom, isn't it Good grief, I can't help but think it's good we're having the Three Nations Conference here this year, but this event serves to demonstrate the good relations between the three countries.]","Compared to before, it seems that there's much better communication between the countries now.]","[A monster beyond national boundaries exists after all. In fact, I've had more opportunities to meet with young Ryze and young Chris due to Kaito-related matters. Well, it had its byproducts, but things have been doing great.]","Thanks to the influence of the World's Singularity, Kaito, not only were there increased interactions between countries, there was also increased interest from the Demons living in the Demon Realm towards the Human Realm, leading to more visitors from the Demon Realm to the Human Realm.","Even the Gods, since the White God Festival, have gradually started visiting the Human Realm and Demon Realm privately, and especially Gods like those who hadn't been involved much with the Human Realm before are becoming known.","And concerning the Human Realm, thanks to Kaito's influence, there's been an economic boom, and relations between the three countries have been extremely good. Of course, that wasn't something Kaito himself intended, but his influence does extend to various places.","[That said, Symphonia Kingdom has been gaining quite the momentum. The influence of the stories about Founder-sama attending a wedding and Shallow Vernal-sama herself presenting the bouquet is quite significant. At this point, our Hydra Kingdom also needs to demonstrate our prestige to some extent, so the choice of venue is important I'd like to do something that would somehow astonish young Ryze and young Chris]","[That said, we really can't overdo it either. It's the Three Nations Conference, so a certain level of formality is required]","[How difficult. Well, there's still time, so let's think about this carefully]","Just as Laguna was about to conclude her thoughts, a civil officer, looking a bit flustered, entered the office's door.","[Your Majesty! A letter has arrived from Miyama Kaito-dono!]","[What? A letter from Kaito? Hmmm?]","At the civil officer's words, Laguna tilted her head in confusion. While Laguna did have occasional interactions with Kaito, it was mainly through hummingbird, not exchanging letters with each other.","Putting aside if it were from someone like Chris, who was diligent with writing letters, Laguna usually handled simple matters with Kaito through hummingbird, and for the important ones or those that needed lengthy discussions She would directly talk with Kaito instead. After all, she could use it as an excuse to escape from boring meetings","[That is quite a high-quality paper Could this be something important?]","The letter from Kaito, which she could say was the first one she had received from him, was made of extremely high-quality paper, with a seal featuring three mountains, the design used as Nifty's brand mark, on the envelope.","Feeling tense due to the clearly unusual situation, Laguna opened the envelope and read the letter and after a moment, she tore up the document she had been holding about selecting a venue for the Three Nations Conference and threw it into the trash can.","[Y- Your Majesty!? Why have you, that's an important]","[Ahh, it's canceled now, so it's fine]","[Huh? Canceled?]","Upon seeing Laguna discarding the crucial document about the Three Nations Conference, an aide hurriedly questioned Laguna, but seemingly unconcerned, Laguna kept her gaze on the letter and calmly replied.","[It seems that on the same day as the Three Nations Conference, Kaito will be hosting a ship party Enclosed in that letter was an invitation.]","[I see, it's canceled then. As a formality, I'll have Symphonia and Archlesia informed.]","[Umu, it's canceled. No matter how you look at it, this is more important Besides, I wouldn't be surprised if young Ryze or young Chris demanded the cancellation without me even mentioning it]","Once they heard Kaito's name from Laguna, the aides immediately understood everything. They began calmly preparing the necessary documents related to the cancellation of the Three Nations Conference.","It couldn't be helped, the difference in importance between the two events was just too significant. A party hosted by Kaito, where the top figures from various circles would undoubtedly gather, versus the Three Nations Conference held annually There was just no comparison.","[Anyhow, we now need to think about various things regarding this party! Arrange an emergency meeting]","[A meeting is already being called.]","[Good, I'll head to the conference room first. The meeting shall immediately be started with those who are ready, but inform everyone that joining midway is allowed, so they can join in later as they become available.]","With a sudden change from her previously lethargic expression to that of a King, Laguna briefly conveyed her instructions before moving towards the conference room.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [An emergency meeting about Subject K Well, even though she says this and that, with Laguna in charge, Hydra Kingdom seems to be in good hands, so there shouldn't be any problems.]","? ? ? : [Yes, she hadn't inherited the stomachache from over there after all.]","Serious-senpai : [Speaking of which, that's true. Stomachache Laguna belongs to a different timeline]"]},{"number":1851,"title":"Chapter 1851: Ship Party Invitations 4","paragraphs":["The official date for the ship party was decided and the invitations were completed and sent to the people to be invited.","The food and other details have been decided on under Kaori-san's leadership, and there are no problems with procuring the ingredients, so it can be said that our preparations are almost complete.","The remaining problem now is to request people to assist as servers on the day of the event from the World Maid Association.","[Master, I think requesting personnel from the World Maid Association would be all good, but wouldn't it be difficult to persuade Ein-dono?]","[Unnn. Well, I'm worried about that but I came up with a good strategy, so I've decided to use that approach.]","[A good strategy?]","Ein-san has a past record of quietly joining the hosting side even during the previous housewarming party. Of course, her abilities are tremendously high, but this time, I intend to have her attend strictly as an invited guest.","However, it would take a lot of effort to convince Ein-san of that. Despite how she usually acts subservient, Ein-san is quite a stubborn person, so much so that Alice has given up persuading her when it comes to maid-related matters.","I think that if I ask her patiently, she will eventually break down, but there's a surer way than that, so I decided to go with that method.","Kuromueina's Castle, Demon Realm. Ein had an indescribable expression on her face as she looked at Kuromueina, who was right in front of her.","[So, it seems that Kaito-kun wants to hire staff from the World Maid Association for the party he's hosting. There will be meetings regarding wages and such, so if it's possible please introduce an appropriate number of \"maids other than Ein\" promptly.]","[Of course, if it's Kaito-sama's request, the World Maid Association will fully support him, and considering it's a party hosted by the Maid Advisor Kaito-sama, there will likely be a lot of participants. However, it's still necessary to have personnel who can take command]","[Unn, unn. You're right. He'd certainly need someone to oversee the whole thing. Pick out some good ones other than Ein. Of course, the World Maid Association has plenty of talent, and there are also those who can oversee the entire operation, right?]","[Ugh.]","Yes, Kaito's strategy for dealing with Ein was simple. It was to explain the situation to Kuromueina and have Kuromueina relay his request","Ein is quite stubborn when it comes to maid-related matters, but she generally doesn't defy Kuromueina. She's currently considering whether she can also lend a hand, but of course, Kuromueina knows that and has been thoroughly crushing such thoughts.","[Ein would only be a guest this time, so apart from introductions, there's no need for you to be involved in preparations. I've also heard from Kaito-kun that everything is already well-prepared Understand?]","[Uuu, h- however This is Kaito-sama's first time hosting a party Although there was also that housewarming party, Kaito-sama wasn't really involved in the preparations, so in a sense, this is his first time setting up one]","[Unnn. That's right. He apparently got helped out by a certain troublesome child he didn't ask help for and had almost everything done for him.]","[Fghh T- That is Ummm]","[That's why, this time, Kaito-kun wants to prepare without relying on Ein and others Of course, if it's Ein, you should be able to understand Kaito-kun's intentions and would behave obediently Right?]","Kuromueina had a smile on her lips. A harmless smile it was, but it carried an undeniable intensity behind it. Rather, since the one who scolds Ein when she goes off on a tangent about maid-related matters would naturally be Kuromueina, Ein couldn't really oppose Kuromueina when she's like that.","[U- Umm If it's just a little helping]","[No.]","[I- If it's just giving some advice]","[No If you keep persisting with your selfishness, I'll forbid wearing a maid uniform on the day of the party and make you wear a dress instead.]","[Auuuu T- That's just Yes. Understood. I'll give up on helping this time.]","Ein tried to resist a little, but her efforts were easily crushed, and in the end, she reluctantly agreed not to be involved in party preparations other than introducing staff.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, if it's related to Ein Indeed, having her hold her down is the most reliable option.]"]},{"number":1852,"title":"Chapter 1852: Ship Party Invitations 5","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I thought I had reserved a chapter for yesterday, but it seems I got the date wrong Oh well, since it can't be helped, I'll just shift all the scheduled posts by one day.","The invitations sent by Kaito naturally made waves everywhere they reached. The same goes for Ryze, the King of Symphonia Kingdom, as he muttered, looking at the invitation in his hand.","[I wonder if the location would be over Demon Realm's seas? Or perhaps, would it be in a sea somewhere among the Human Realm's three countries? If it's Miyama-kun, I believe he'd get permission even if it's on the seas near Friendship City]","[It would certainly be no problem for him, but since Friendship City is also a famous tourist spot and prominent figures gather there, having the party there could be a bit concerning. And so, perhaps it's over the Demon Realm's seas?]","As Ryze wondered if the ship party would be held at a sea in the Demon Realm, his wife and Head Maid, Beatrice, prepared tea and spoke her thoughts.","Since Beatrice also received an invitation due to being acquainted with Kaito, they were discussing the schedule of their plans together.","[I see, although the Demon Realm's seas fall under Eingana-sama's sphere of influence, Miyama-kun should have no trouble getting permission from her It's just, I'm worried since this is probably the first time Miyama-kun is hosting a party, I hope everything goes well smoothly for him Even if his social circle is impressive, he's still young and inexperienced, so I'm worried he might unnecessarily burden himself with stress.]","[He'll be fine. There are many reliable people around Miyama Kaito-sama, like Illness-sama and Master. In fact, many are willing to help rather than let him struggle alone]","[Fufu, I see Even if Miyama-kun tries to shoulder everything by himself, those around him won't allow it huh He has such good relationships with others that it almost makes me envious. Well, in that case, I suppose we don't need to worry about Miyama-kun and just focus on our own concerns.]","[Indeed so. Your Majesty, you aren't just going to enjoy a party here. That's especially since nowadays, inadvertently benefiting from Miyama Kaito-sama's influence, our Symphonia Kingdom has made significant progress. We have to be careful not to create unnecessary openings.]","As Beatrice calmly conveyed her words, Ryze smiled wryly and put the invitation in the drawer of his office desk one imbued with special magic which made it so only he could open it.","[Well, you can really feel the difference when you're in that kind of place with King Laguna and Emperor Chris. Good gracious, there are times I wish I had as much ability as them. Oops, you aren't gonna scold me for that, right?]","[If that were a statement spoken out of timidity, I would have scolded you but that doesn't seem to be the case, isn't it?]","[Yeah, it's a fact that I'm inferior to both rulers in terms of kingly abilities. However, it isn't like a nation's strength is determined by the ruler's abilities alone. If a King's abilities equated to the nation's power, then Hydra Kingdom would have long been at the top of the Human Realm. Of course, having great abilities would be desirable, but if there are areas where I lack, I can rely on those around me. Even if King Ryze himself is lacking, it's fine as long as Symphonia Kingdom itself excels. That's how I see it.]","[Being able to acknowledge one's shortcomings compared to others like that is undoubtedly one of your strong points.]","While Beatrice sometimes scolds Ryze harshly, making people perceive her as having a stern personality, she doesn't get angry without any reason. In fact, upon hearing Ryze's current words, she wore a gentle smile.","[Well, in my case, I've always had the greatest genius in human history quite close to me. I do have some pride in how I handle feelings of inferiority better than most people.]","[Even so, when you first became King, you had quite a few issues to deal with.]","[A- Ahaha There were indeed such days. Back then, you scolded me almost every day without fail.]","[I wasn't scolding you just for the sake of scolding though]","[Good gracious, I could only feel ashamed.]","Ryze smiled wryly, to which Beatrice returned the same expression. There was a gentle atmosphere between the two of them, a sense of ease from being familiar with each other.","[As a King, you're doing well enough, but you should have a bit more confidence. You're the one I've recognized as my husband, so stand tall with confidence.]","[Yeah, I'll do my best.]","Upon hearing Beatrice's words, Ryze nodded firmly with a determined expression on his face. Seeing this, Beatrice smiled, reassured that there was nothing for her to worry about.","With some spare time on their hands, they enjoyed a pleasant conversation alone as husband and wife for a short while.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Come to think of it, these two were husband and wife]","? ? ? : [Beatrice-san served as Ryze-san's assistant when he just became King, so it seems their relationship has deepened from there. Well, it seems like Ryze-san was quite rigorously taught back then, but I guess that's how much she had expected of him.]"]},{"number":1853,"title":"Chapter 1853: Ship Party Invitations 6","paragraphs":["In the President's room at the Headquarters of the Mikumo Trading Company, Akane looks at the invitation letter she received from Kaito and speaks to Frau.","[I'm looking forward to the party hosted by Kaito, but I'm worried about it. It seems like influential figures from various fields would be gathering there, and while it might be great for networking, I feel like doing that there would just make my stomach churn.]","[Well, I'll just leave that to the President and enjoy the party. I'm also an invited guest after all]","[You sure have a great personality.]","As she's acquainted with Kaito, Frau had also received an invitation, but unlike Akane, who is the President of the Mikumo Trading Company and needs to network, she doesn't need to engage in greetings and such.","Moreover, if it's an event hosted by Kaito, Alice and her people would also take it seriously, so there's no need to worry about the safety of the venue. There wouldn't be a problem even if Akane's guard, Frau, didn't accompany her. In fact, with the security measures in place, if something did happen, Frau's abilities wouldn't be sufficient to handle it in the first place.","[Come to think of it, it seems that for this ship party, there was a request sent to the World Maid Association for staff, which had been causing a bit of a stir among the maids right now.]","[Is that so? Well, it seemed like Kaito had plenty of acquaintances, so hiring staff for service would be necessary. However, serving at a party where the Six Kings, the Supreme Gods, and even God of Creation-sama herself might attend would be quite enormous.]","[Yes, it seems that there was a preliminary cut-off based on Maid Power. Despite that, it's such a prestigious opportunity that there's a rush of applicants, so in the end, it was decided they're going to conduct a very large lottery.]","[Hou~~ I hate how even though you're just casually incorporating Maid Power into an ordinary conversation, I'm not even questioning it.]","Akane mutters with a bemused expression on her face, but Frau continues the conversation unperturbed, seemingly lost in her own thoughts.","[The maids are also highly aware of the situation. It seems that several people have already been personally nominated by President Ein, and some of them are already starting their \"mountain seclusions\" in preparation for the main event.]","[No, the heck is with those mountain seclusions!? That doesn't seem connected at all! You're supposed to be serving people, what are you doing in the mountains!?]","[What are you talking about, President? When a maid speaks of mountain seclusions, it obviously refers to performing the \"Three Great Maid Asceticism\"]","[No, why the heck are you acting like that's common knowledge!!!? Just so you know, you maids aren't within the realm of common sense, okay!? Rather, the heck is this Three Great Maid Asceticism anyway!!!?]","In response to Frau, who speaks as if it's a matter of course, Akane's heartfelt screams echoed in the room. She looked fed up with how absurdly beyond the norm the Maid World is, but unfortunately, it seemed like the story wasn't over yet.","[The Three Great Maid Asceticism refers to the traditional training methods to enhance one's Maid Power: \"Rock Crushing\", \"Waterfall Splitting\", and \"Cloud Cutting\". It's said that maids who accomplish these tasks can significantly increase their Maid Power, with the greatest improvement reportedly an increase of 5000 Maid Power. I myself once undertook these tasks to train my Maid Power.]","[No, those totally looked like training for battle though!? Also, what does that have to do with serving!? How the heck does something like splitting waterfalls apply to serving!?]","[What are you talking about now, President? Splitting waterfalls and serving are two different things.]","[Then why the heck are you training like that!?]","Akane was already getting tired from throwing too many tsukkomis, but perhaps it's also just her nature that she can't help but react to everything. Even though she understands in her head that she'll probably just get some incomprehensible theory in response to her words, she just can't seem to suppress the impulse.","Seeing Akane's reaction, Frau sighed in exasperation, looking slightly astounded at her.","[I've told you already. If one completes the Three Great Maid Asceticism, it will be an increase of 5000 Maid Power Maid Power signifies how skillful a maid is. This number has a great influence on a maid's skill as a waiter. So, to sum it up]","[To sum it up?]","[If one splits waterfalls, they become a better server.]","[HOW DID THAT HAPPEN!!!?]","Of course, there was no way such a theory beyond common sense could be accepted by anyone other than the maids, so Akane was shouting at their highest volume of the day.","<Afterword>","Three Great Maid Asceticism","<Rock Crushing>","It's natural for a maid to have perfect control over her body's movements, and it's expected of a top-tier maid to crush boulders into sand using only her limbs.","<Waterfall Splitting>","With the Maidric Aura emitted by a top-tier maid, splitting a waterfall is easy. A maid shall never be obstructed by anything other than her master, and it should be a matter of course to repel waterfalls with just the emission of the Maidric Aura without moving one's body.","<Cloud Cutting>","The actions of a true maid seizes everything in existence, making one capable of splitting the sky, crushing the earth, and even parting the sea with ease. However, to wield such power for mere tyranny makes one beneath a third-rate maid. A top-tier maid should refine and control her power perfectly, naturally being capable of the act of cutting the clouds floating up in the sky without stirring a single breeze."]},{"number":1854,"title":"Chapter 1854: Ship Party Invitations 7","paragraphs":["Symphonia Kingdom Royal Capital, Albert Duchy. In her office, Lilia, who had finished her paperwork, was taking a break after drinking a cup of tea that Lunamaria had brewed for her.","A little while later, Sieglinde, who had some free time, also arrived, and the three best friends naturally began chatting.","[Speaking of which, it seems that Miyama-sama is working hard on various things for his ship party, but Milady, you seem to be quite composed?]","[I don't have any particular involvement this time after all. Since it's Kaito-san's party, it won't take the form of a noble party, and in the first place, almost everyone there were people Kaito-san knows, so there's no need for introductions at this point.]","[Indeed, we've all been acquainted with all the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods. In that sense, for Lili, it's a relaxed party full of familiar faces.]","Upon hearing Lilia's response to Lunamaria's question, Sieglinde nodded in agreement. Of course, Of course, it's not like she absolutely wouldn't have anything to do with this situation, and just the fact that the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods will all be present at the party is enough to make her nervous.","However, unlike back at the Founding Festivals, it wasn't a situation where Kaito wasn't around and Lilia had to deal with on her own, as Kaito was the host this time.","Naturally, the Six Kings, the Supreme Gods, Shallow Vernal would have their eyes on Kaito, so it's unlikely that Lilia will have a long conversation with the Six Kings or Supreme Gods.","And since there won't be any introductions or anything like that with influential figures she's meeting for the first time, Lilia feels relaxed.","[Well, that's why I'm just going to enjoy the party this time as one of the participants.]","[Hmmm. I wonder why? This feeling What do you think, Sieg?]","Observing Lilia tip her teacup with a gentle smile, Lunamaria had a somewhat complicated expression on her face and quietly asked the nearby Sieglinde.","The reason is that what Lilia said is certainly true, and Lunamaria couldn't particularly find any room for rebuttal. However, it was also true that there was this feeling in her that rose up in her heart.","The same goes for Sieglinde, who answered Lunamaria's question with an indescribable expression on her face.","[How should I say this? It makes sense, and that should be too understandable but seeing Lili acting so composed like this, I can't help but think there might be a big backlash coming.]","[That's right. I can't really point it out, but it feels like there might be something that's about to happen]","Lunamaria and Sieglinde the prediction the two made, perhaps from being close friends for a long time it was right on target.","Yes, it's true that Lilia has already interacted with both the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods, but for her to think that she wouldn't have to greet anyone new was a naive thought.","The participants currently in Lilia's mind are those who attended when Kaito held a housewarming party but Lilia had forgotten one important thing.","During the period between the housewarming party and now, Kaito \"got to know all the Six Kings Executives\" and Lilia's name is famous even in the Demon Realm, with many Six Kings Executives who are interested in Lilia.","However, Lilia has a deep relationship with Kaito, and her house is next to Kaito's Thus, there are several of them who are acting prudently, not wanting to trouble not only Lilia but Kaito.","Such people will try to use this opportunity to interact with Lilia. Since the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods would likely gather around Kaito, they would find it inappropriate to disturb them and so, the person their attention would gather to In a sense, Lilia may have been fortunate that she currently doesn't realize this.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Eh? No, Lilia should also be acquainted with most of the Six Kings Executives, so it shouldn't be that big of a deal]","? ? ? : [This would also be the first time she's meeting my camp's perverts though.]","Serious-senpai : [I see. Lilia, it's over for you then.]"]},{"number":1855,"title":"Chapter 1855: Ship Party Invitations 8","paragraphs":["Regarding the ship party, I've finished sending out invitations and also arranged the request to the World Maid Association through Kuro. Things are also going well with the dishes we'd be serving.","That said, there are still various things we have to do However, that doesn't mean I should throw myself into it too much.","[Unn, unn. Taking proper rest is important. However, Miyama-kun does have the image of someone who tends to push yourself too hard.]","[Well, I can't exactly tell Anima to not work too hard and take a break if I myself don't act on it.]","[Ahaha, I see, see other's behavior and correct yours, yes?]","With that in mind, taking a break from the party preparations, I went to visit Dr. Vier to hang out. Dr. Vier's clinic has about 3 days off per month, and today is one of those days where we can spend time leisurely without worrying about clinic hours.","Well, looking at it the other way, it would mean that the clinic is open for the rest of the month, but there are days with only morning or afternoon consultations, so Dr. Vier says she had quite a bit of free time.","In fact, she has been able to adjust her schedule even for events like the Six Kings Festival, so I suppose she isn't overly busy. With Dr. Vier's abilities, even if it was busy, she'd likely handle it with ease","[However, as a doctor, I think that's for the best. It's best to address fatigue before you start feeling tired. Especially in your case, Miyama-kun, with your youth and Shallow Vernal-sama's blessing, you can push through fatigue easily, so it's even more important to be mindful of taking breaks. You can't erase mental fatigue after all.]","[Indeed, thanks to Shiro-san's blessing, I don't get muscle soreness even after exercising, and if I want, I can also forcibly recover my stamina with the Fruits of the World Tree well, when I actually did that in the past, I got scolded by Kuro.]","[You actually did push yourself too hard before huh~~ That's very much like Miyama-kun, but you shouldn't worry those around you too much.]","[Uuuu, I don't have any words to retort with.]","Listening to the words Dr. Vier said with a smile, I can't help but smile wryly. Actually, I did get scolded by Kuro during the time I was making music boxes, so it's something I should reflect on.","Well, in a sense, having learned my lesson that time might be a good thing. Though I feel bad for worrying Kuro and making her mad, experiencing making a blunder due to overdoing things, even with Shiro-san's blessing and the Fruits of the World Tree, can serve as a brake.","As I had such a thought in mind, Dr. Vier, who was sitting across from me, set down her herb tea and stood up.","[Well then, while we're at it, I'll help out with Miyama-kun's fatigue recovery. Medically speaking, of course.]","[Ohh, that's reassuring. I do feel slightly mentally fatigued, so I appreciate that.]","Dr. Vier is a doctor, a professional in her field. Since this time it's about mental fatigue, she might use relaxing herbs or give a massage.","Thinking so, Dr. Vier moves to the sofa in the room and lightly beckons me over. While I was wondering if it really might be a massage, I finished the remaining herb tea and moved toward the sofa where Dr. Vier was waiting. As I approached, she lightly spread out her arms towards me.","[Alright, go ahead.]","[Unn? Eh? Errr What should I do?]","[I think jumping into my bosom would be appropriate.]","[Hmm?]","With a posture akin to someone awaiting a hug, Dr. Vier's words left me with a puzzled expression, unable to discern her intention. Thereupon, with an air of confidence, lightly puffing out her chest, Dr. Vier declared.","[I'm not just being noncommittal, okay? There's a solid basis behind this. Research shows that when you hug someone you like, your brain releases dopamine, inducing feelings of pleasure, and oxytocin, which has a calming effect. Furthermore, oxytocin activates serotonin neurotransmitters, so hugs not only help with mental fatigue but also boost positive feelings and motivation.]","[I- I see?]","[And so, this is a privilege reserved only for my lover Miyama-kun I'll generously soothe Miyama-kun's mental fatigue with plenty of affectionate hugs!]","Though it may be a bit late to say this, Dr. Vier has top-class assertiveness among my lovers, and she has an established reputation for her strength in situations like this.","Today being a day off with plenty of time, it seems she's eager to indulge in ample flirting as lovers Well, I don't really have a reason to refuse, and I do feel like having some flirting time with her, so I'll just take her up on her offer","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Huh? No, wait, wait!? Aren't sudden sweet developments against the rule!?]","? ? ? : [No such rule exists.]"]},{"number":1856,"title":"Chapter 1856: Ship Party Invitations 9","paragraphs":["Now, considering the scene of Dr. Vier currently waiting with her arms wide open on the sofa while I approach her, telling me it was a hug, rather than us embracing each other here, this feels more like her hugging me closely.","[How should I say this Consciously going for a hug feels a bit embarrassing.]","[Fufu, but now it's just you and me here, so you can entrust yourself to me without worries. That's why Come here.]","[W- Well then, if you'll excuse me]","Dr. Vier, with a serene smile like that of a holy mother, exuded the atmosphere of a gentle older woman, which somehow made me feel strangely nervous.","Thereupon, Dr. Vier gently placed her hand on the back of my head and pulled me gently into her embrace. Her action just now felt like I'm being held against Dr. Vier's chest.","[Surprisingly, even though we had done this many times, consciously hugging like this feels different. Miyama-kun, slowly relax your body and entrust yourself to me Even though it's through our clothes, can you feel my body temperature?]","[Ah, yes. It feels warm.]","[Unnn. Going back to our discussion about oxytocin earlier, in neuropsychology studies, it's said that when caressing someone, caressing at a rate of about 5 cm per second is the most comfortable, and oxytocin secretion becomes more active There are still various opinions about this subject, but the common main conclusion is that with gentle caresses, one can perceive the partner's body temperature and texture through touch]","As she said this, Dr. Vier gently increased the strength of her embrace around me. My face, which had only been lightly touching her chest at first, slowly nestled against Dr. Vier's body, and warmth permeated softly along with tenderness.","The pleasant scent of herbs, the feeling of her hand gently stroking the back of my head, the soft warmth enveloping my face It was a bit It was really too comfortable I don't really understand all that medical stuff like oxytocin and such, but there was this incredible sense of relief, a warmth that seemed to permeate deeply into my body","[Are you not feeling stuffed?]","[Yes. Umm, errr, I guess oxytocin is being secreted. It feels very pleasant, fluffy I do feel some embarrassment, but more than that, there's this feeling of security.]","[I see, that's because Miyama-kun is opening up to me Because you hold me as someone you can trust, it's probably even more effective. Plus, there's also my love. I love Miyama-kun so much, and I'll hug you so affectionately that you'd feel my heartfelt love without needing Sympathy Magic. That's why, just for now, leave all your thoughts behind and just let yourself be spoiled]","With a gentle voice, she tightened her embrace a little more, and my face became buried in Dr. Vier's soft breasts. However, it seemed like she was considering the angle of her embrace, as her breasts were more pressed against the area above my nose, so even when she hugged me tightly, I didn't feel breathless.","Simply put, I feel comfortable engulfed in softness The feeling of being embraced by Dr. Vier, exuding a magnanimous aura like that of an older lady, is dangerously pleasant.","This really feels like something that could be a habit. I mean, I want to stay in this state for a while longer As Dr. Vier said, even without Sympathy Magic, I could really feel her affection directly transmitted, enshrouding me with so much happiness that it makes me break into a smile.","[How should I say this Because Dr. Vier is so gentle and has this magnanimous aura, it feels so comfortable that I don't want to leave. I'm afraid this might become a habit.]","[Eh? I don't really think this becoming a habit a problem though~~ I can always do this for you. Ehehe, if Miyama-kun feels good, I'm happy too. My lovey-dovey hug is for Miyama-kun only, so there's no need for reservations, just come avail these hugs anytime.]","That line is quite unfair, one really brimming with incredible magnanimity. When I was told such things in a sweet and gentle voice, it felt so soothing to my ears that it was like being in heaven.","Hmmm, this isn't good I might not be able to distance myself for a while.","[Fufufu, Miyama-kun relying on me also makes me happy After fully relaxing, let's take it easy, kissing and cuddling like lovers. We've got a lot of time after all right?]","While listening to such sweet words, resting on Dr. Vier's chest, I gently closed my eyes and for a while, I surrendered myself to the irresistibly pleasant sensation, feeling genuinely relaxed in the comforting embrace.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Aagghh!? Kaito may be relaxed, but you're doing tremendous damage to my heart here, okay!? Rather, Vier This guy got a lot of sweetness power]","? ? ? : [Can you not give people weird stats? Well, Vier-san is basically straightforward when it comes to love, a proactive romantic who actively tries to flirt, so it's easy for things to turn out sweet.]"]},{"number":1857,"title":"Chapter 1857: Ship Party Invitations 10","paragraphs":["The invitations to Kaito's ship party were, of course, sent to a wide range of people he knows, and due to Kaito's personality, they were delivered to anyone he had exchanged introductions and talked to for some time.","Among them was someone who could be called unexpected. In the waiting room of the Adventurers' Guild in a certain town, a woman working as a receptionist holding a letter in her hand struck a guts pose.","[Alright! It has arrived a chance to get to know a rich man!]","[N- No way, Greene-san When did you make such a connection]","[I- Isn't that already a betrayal Why is it only Greene-san]","[Pupu, that's a shame. While you guys were enjoying the afterparty, Anne-san and I were deepening our connection with Miyama-san!!!]","In front of her two colleagues, who looked enviously at the invitation in her hands, Greene, the leader of Team Scarlet Blue, who had previously met Kaito at the Flying Board Competition, was smiling triumphantly.","She and the other receptionists were ordinary women who longed to live like noble ladies, and of course, they had never received an invitation to a party like this before, so they were very excited.","[A ship party A- As expected, it would be held in a luxurious cruise ship, wouldn't it?]","[Uuuu, I'm envious of you, Greene-chan. If you make friends with rich people there, introduce us to them too.]","[Yes, well, for the time being, I suppose I need to make a reservation for renting a dress for the party M- Maybe I'll splurge a bit and rent something of a higher grade than usual.]","With those words, Greene's expectations for the party swelled, but she had been slightly naive about something within her perception. Well, such could be said as unavoidable. In her perception, Kaito was a seemingly rich young man she met at the Flying Board Competition. She just regarded him as someone with some sort of connection with a noble.","And so, naturally never would she have imagined that the party would be attended by the Six Kings, the Supreme Gods, and Human Realm's three rulers That it's a party filled with individuals who are usually not only difficult to talk to, but even difficult to catch a glimpse of a party that could be considered as some sort of magical realm.","At the same time, in the underground city of the large Kruel tribe in the mountainous region of Archlesia Empire, the leader of Black Muscat, Rimegithe Lenoria Githurd Armetes Anne simply known as Anne, was looking at the invitation she had received.","[An invitation from Kaito-san This is the first time I've received an invitation like this, and I'm just confused.]","[Rather, Anne-dono interacted with him before?]","[Ahh, no, I only introduced myself and talked to him briefly at the afterparty b- but what am I to do about this? Did he just send this out of courtesy? In that case, should I politely decline?]","[No, rather than that, since you've already got an invitation, unless it's inconvenient for you, shouldn't you attend? Besides, if it's a ship party, you wouldn't need to take many precautions.]","Seeing Anne lost in thoughts while looking at the invitation in her hand, the two other members of the Black Muscat Team.","[I don't think he's the kind of person who would cheat people, and the quality of the paper on that invitation is amazing, so I think it's a legitimate invitation]","[R- Rather, that's black magic parchment, isn't it? N- No, I've never seen it before so I'm not sure Could this be an invitation to a very prestigious party then? If that's the case, you might stick out like a sore thumb]","Anne is also an ordinary commoner and has never received an invitation like this. The invitation, which came in a very expensive-looking paper, made her feel a little overwhelmed.","[He was a well-dressed young man, and if I'm not mistaken, I heard otherworlders can receive a title of nobility if they desire, so I guess it's a noble party? Come to think of it, didn't Anne-dono mention that your grandfather attended a noble's party in the past?]","[It was a small party in the countryside though It says you can wear whatever you like here but I guess it's better to be dressed properly, right?]","[Ahh~~ I think my great-grandmother had some jewelry that a noble gave her in the olden days Should I ask to borrow it?]","[I suppose so. To be honest, I'm too inexperienced to handle this on my own, so if I could borrow some of your wisdom]","The Kruel species has strong inter-species connections. Their underground city, which serves as their species' habitat, despite being referred to as a city, is in fact more like a large village, and most of the inhabitants can be said to know each other. With their custom of inheriting names from parents and grandparents, many of them are related by blood if one traces back several generations.","The story of Anne receiving an invitation to a party immediately spread throughout the underground city. This sparked interest, leading to a large gathering of curious individuals, and Anne, who had somehow become the center of attention, could only smile wryly.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [An unexpected reappearance As for Yellow Pipe Come to think of it, none of their members have been introduced.]","? ? ? : [A new entry for stomachache role, yes?]","Serious-senpai : [Let's not give them that.]"]},{"number":1858,"title":"Chapter 1858: Ship Party Invitations 11","paragraphs":["In a Japanese-style house in a provincial town in a rural area of Hydra Kingdom, one of the otherworld immigrants, Okura Shigenobu, was looking at an invitation letter that had been sent to him and his wife Hannah.","Placing a teacup of green tea in front of him, Hannah sat down across the table from him, tilting her head.","[What's the matter?]","[Ahh, no I was just thinking whether or not I should dip into the savings.]","[I'd like to first ask about that savings though]","[Oops Let's shut our eyes to that, okay? It's not that I have a source of income that I wasn't handing to you, it's just that I've been saving up some of the money I've made from Flying Board winning bets and stuff.]","[Good grief. So? Why do you need to dip into that savings?]","Seeing Shigenobu awkwardly scratching his head, though she had a wry smile, Hannah asked with a gentle voice. She had no intention of reproaching Shigenobu for having secret savings Rather, Shigenobu hands over most of his income and savings to Hannah, so although Hannah feels like Shigenobu should have a larger share, Shigenobu essentially only receives a fixed amount from Hannah as his \"pocket money\" each month and doesn't spend more than that.","[I need a formal outfit for this party and it has to be of a certain high rank or else I feel like it would be trouble.]","[Ara? Doesn't it say we can wear whatever we want?]","[But my guess is that this part will be a gathering of extraordinary people.]","[Ehhh!? I- Is that so?]","[Yeah, my first basis for that guess is this invitation letter. Black magic parchment is quite expensive. It would have been a different case if Kaito got a preference for luxury, but that isn't the case, right? In that case, the one who prepared this would naturally be a maid serving Kaito or perhaps that beastman kid Anima that Kaito had mentioned before. In that case, at least those kids are judging the people they're sending these invitations to with the thought \"It would be rude if the invitation isn't at this level\", which gives you a glimpse of the party's rank as well.]","Before being summoned as a Hero, Shigenobu attended various parties as the heir to his company. While he may not be very familiar with noble society, he does have some knowledge and experience when it comes to social circles.","[At first, I thought that Kaito's lovers among the Six Kings and Shallow Vernal-sama might also come Of course, it's definitely an outrageous party even without such consideration, and it's a place where one needs to be properly dressed. I'm not sure how close Kaito is to the Six Kings and the other influential figures who aren't his lovers My intuition tells me that Shallow Vernal-sama would bring the Supreme Gods, all the Supreme Gods coming with their Executives, and the Human Realm's Kings would bring the other members of royalty and nobility I'm thinking that this would be a gathering of people of that caliber.]","[I- Is it really gonna be that outrageous?]","[It's all just speculation, but it's better to prepare for the worst-case scenario. Even without considering that, it's certain that Kaito's lover Underworld King-sama and Shallow Vernal-sama will definitely be there, so dressing appropriately can't hurt Well, let's go to the Capital to check out some rental clothes.]","[I understand. Hmmm, I'm kinda getting nervous now.]","As Hannah nodded in agreement with Shigenobu's words, feeling that the topic had come to a close, the sound of the bell announcing a visitor rang out, and when she went to receive the guests She found Rejnhardt and Sylphia.","[Yaa, Shigenobu!]","[I did indeed tell you to come visit a bit more frequently, but you guys are taking things to the extreme]","For these two long-lived friends of his who were rough with their time intervals, Shigenobu previously told them to show up at a higher frequency. He did tell them that but Since then, they started visiting him seven to ten times a month","After chuckling somewhat amusedly at Shigenobu's astounded look, Rejnhardt and Sylphia also sat down and accepted the teacups that Hannah brought them.","[So, what were you two doing?]","[Ahh, it's for these invitations. Extraordinary people will be there, so we were talking about renting formal wear.]","[I see, Rei and I were thinking of wearing the clothes we used to wear when we served at the castle, but their designs are so old now that we've decided to get new ones.]","[Ah, that's right! In that case, we'll be paying for Shigenobu and Hannah's, so how about shopping with us? We have money plenty of them.]","Rejnhardt says this and puts a bag on the table, and seeing a lot of gold and white gold coins inside, Shigenobu and Hannah's eyes widened.","[Oi, oi, what crime have you committed? Obediently turn yourself in.]","[That isn't black money, okay!? This is part of the money sent to me by my beloved daughter, Sieg.]","[That's even worse. The heck are you two doing, buying clothes with your daughter's wages]","[No, wait, that's not it! There are many circumstances behind this]","Upon hearing Rejnhardt mention using the money sent by Sieglinde to buy formal attire, Shigenobu cast him a look of disbelief, to which Sylphia smiled wryly and explained.","[No, in the beginning, Rei and I had been saving up the money Sieg-chan had been sending us but umm We've saved up so much money that we could probably afford to throw a royal wedding and still have money left over. It also keeps on growing, so we thought it's about time we started using some of it.]","[That's right. We did tell Sieg she doesn't have to keep on sending anymore, but she's pretty stubborn]","[I mean, is Sieg that well paid?]","Sieglinde basically sends money to the two of them every month. It originally started because she felt responsible that they had to quit their positions as Court Mages, but now it feels like it's become a habit.","Rejnhardt and Sylphia initially accepted it without much thought, planning to save it for Sieglinde's wedding later on, but over the past few years, the amount of money Sieglinde had been sending has increased dramatically.","[No, Sieg's pet Rainbow Dragon apparently gives her a material that Phantasmal King-sama is very fond of and buys off from her at a high frequency.]","[There are too many points in that sentence that I'd really like to throw tsukkomis at. A Rainbow Dragon pet? Phantasmal King-sama? Hey, give me a more detailed explanation.]","Hearing Shigenobu say this with a big sigh, Rejnhardt and Sylphia looked at each other and after wryly smiling, they began talking about the details of the situation.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Come to think of it, regarding Vier's story a while ago, there were a lot of medical terms mentioned, but did she get that from a previous Hero Actor?]","? ? ? : [Ehhh!? Is there such a convenient story So it isn't because there's this transcendental beauty out there with an incredibly vast and deep knowledge spanning from future medical techniques and research to the ability to gradually elevate medical standards through associations and societies, taking into account the era and level of civilization, all while possessing the capability to execute such plans!?]","Serious-senpai : [It's you!? Speaking of which, this guy was also transferred from a world that can be called Future Earth in a sense]"]},{"number":1859,"title":"Chapter 1859: Ship Party Invitations 12","paragraphs":["While invitations were being sent to various locations, Nebula and Illness were preparing commemorative gifts to be handed out to party's participants at Kaito's house.","As it's well-known that Kaito has launched a tea brand, a commemorative blend for the ship party will be made and distributed to the participants, and Nebula and Illness are in charge of that blend.","[Howeveeeeer, it was quite regrettable, Nebulaaaaa. You can't get away from your World Treeeee, so you aren't able to join the partyyyyyy.]","[I don't mind. Even if I were to attend, I would be on Master's on the host side, so rather than enjoying the party, I would be working to ensure that the participants enjoy themselves. Also, since Master, Lilia-san, Illness-san, Anima-san, and the other key figures will be temporarily absent, it seems necessary to have someone here to guard the house in your absence.]","[I suppose sooooo. With Nebula's presence heeeeeere, I can participate in the party with peace of miiiiiind.]","[I'm Absolute after all. I will guard our place during your absence, so you can rest assured.]","Seeing Nebula puffing out her small chest with her declaration, Illness smiles. Illness used to basically avoid leaving the mansion at the same time as Lilia and Kaito before, but now, thanks to Nebula's presence, she can be more flexible in various situations.","Of course, as for tasks at Lilia's mansion While she understands that Nebula can handle them without issue, she still finds it difficult to entrust those to her, but when it comes to tasks at Kaito's house, garden, and handling visitors, Illness can rest assured she can leave them to Nebula.","[It's to commemorate the first party Milord is holding, so I'll use some special tea leaves. Let's use the tea leaves we made before.]","[Are you suuuuuure? Those tea leaves were put away because they were soooooo effective that there was concern that they might cause public confusioooooon.]","[It's fine as long as we just use less than 0.5g. It's better to avoid brewing tea with just those tea leaves, but blending them with other tea leaves should be perfectly fine. Well, the amount of magic power the consumer has may increase a bit, but if less than 1g is used for the blend, the difference shouldn't be noticed.]","[I seeeee~~]","The tea leaves Nebula had made and put away had the effect of \"increasing a person's maximum magic power\", a permanent one at that. The tea leaves having such an effect itself was a coincidence, but there's a limit to the amount of magic power that can be increased, so even though it's permanent, it doesn't mean one can infinitely increase magic power with it.","However, as a result of verifications with Illness It was found that it allows the consumer to increase magic power up to \"an amount of magic power almost double the consumer's natural magic power limit\" by repeatedly drinking it, so it was sealed off because it would cause great confusion if circulated.","It's just, the tea leaves had a uniquely wonderful flavor, unlike the taste of other tea leaves, so Nebula kept making them in small quantities for her own consumption.","[A cup of tea, verified by Illness-san. I found that a cup of tea, roughly 3g of tea leaves, increases the amount of magic power by 0.3% and at 0.5g, the increase is about 0.05%, so I don't think anyone but sharp people like Alice-san would be able to tell the difference.]","[I seeeeee, in that case, it seems to be okaaaaaay. Those tea leaves have a really great taaaaaste, so even a small amount would be a nice additiooooon.]","[Yes, I'll make some adjustments so that even Alice-san won't be able to notice it easily. Now that we've got the taste out of the way What should the fragrance be like?]","[Let's seeeee. Considering Kaito-sama's preferenceeeees, I think having a fruit-scented one would be goooooood. How about picking tea leaves based on thaaaaat?]","[That's a good idea! As expected of Illness-san, that's a good choice. I think the flavors would also blend well together.]","[I'm honored by the complimeeeeent. All that remains is to portion adjustmeeeeeents.]","[Yes!]","And so, the two of them worked together amicably, creating a commemorative blend to distribute at the party and when it had taken shape to some extent, Nebula suddenly remembered something and took out a small box from her magic box.","[Illness-san, here's a special gift from me a thank you for always taking care of me.]","[Oyaaaaa? Why, thank youuuu. I rather feel like I'm the one being taken care of more often than youuuuu, but Nebula's thoughtfulness makes me happyyyyyy.]","[I'm glad you were pleased. The box was made using the random box system, and inside it is a bottle of wine made by me After the party is over, why don't you and Milord drink it together as a form of mutual appreciation for all the hard work we've done?]","Seeing Nebula lightly winking at her, Illness couldn't help smiling as she carefully put the box away.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The heck is with that unnecessary pass, Absolute!?]"]},{"number":1860,"title":"Chapter 1860: Trial Run of the Magic Ship","paragraphs":["A huge magic ship moves through the vast seas of the Demon Realm. As I lean against the railing on the deck, the wind gently brushes my cheek, and I squint a little in comfort. Being on the deck of a ship sailing the sea like this truly feels picturesque, making me wonder if I look cool standing here like this. Well, maybe it's just my imagination","Now then, as for why I'm on the ship now It isn't because it's already the day of the ship party, that's still a while later. So why are we sailing through Demon Realm's seas in this magic ship? Simply put, it's a trial run.","This is something quite obvious, but as expected, it's difficult to have a party on a ship that we're going to learn about on the spot. Especially since we'll be hiring people this time, there's a lot to consider, including coordination and communication, so it's important to check everything in advance.","The magic ship that Kuro gave me really is a super luxury cruise ship, over 350 meters in size and capable of accommodating over 5000 passengers if needed, and the number of rooms is no joke either.","For the time being, we are planning to rent out one room for each invited guest for changing and resting, so we need to check and prepare for that.","And as for what I'm doing now in this trial run well, nothing.","Unnn. I have nothing to do. The meeting with the maids who will be dispatched and the confirmation of the venue are being handled by Illness-san, Eta and Theta are checking the rooms, Anima and Caraway are checking the expenses, necessary supplies, and the route, and although they aren't currently on board, the cooking duties are being handled by a team centered around Nebula and Kaori-san at my house.","So, having nothing in particular to do, I went out on the deck with an indescribable mood and sat idly watching the sea.","It can't be helped. There's nothing I can do here There's no way I can be involved in teaching the maids, and Anima and the others are already busy checking everything, and even if I were to participate in something I'm clueless about, I would only get in the way It's best for me to just spend my spare time like this The sea sure is beautiful.]","[Sorry for the intrusion, Miyama Kaito-sama, but may I have a moment of your time?]","[Whoa!? G- Gluttony-san?]","[Yes. I apologize for surprising you with my sudden visit without prior notice.]","Suddenly hearing a voice, I turned around to find a doll Gluttony-san's main body, which was being held by Natasha-san, appeared seemingly out of nowhere, and just like usual, Gluttony-san's words are being conveyed by Natasha-san saying it.","Well, that aside, what's going on?","[No, it's alright. That aside, is there something you want from me?]","[Hah, this may sound impolite, but I was wondering if I might be able to be of help with the transportation of participants for Miyama Kaito-sama's party, so I'm reaching out to you.]","[When you say transportation of participants Does that mean you'll help out with Teleportation Magic?]","[Yes. I heard from Shalltear-sama that you were currently planning on using a Teleportation Gate near a port where ships can dock.]","[Yes, that was the plan but]","This is obvious, but not all invited guests can use Teleportation Magic, so the assumption was to use Teleportation Gates to come to the Demon Realm.","And so, by presenting the invitation as a key at the Teleportation Gates, guests can teleport for free to the Teleportation Gate near the port, and as for who's responsible for managing the Teleportation ates well, they're under Alice's jurisdiction, but the plan was to arrange everything with them.","[However, considering the status of the participants in relation to the size of the port, which is large enough to allow a large magic ship to dock there, I think that would inevitably attract a lot of attention. However, with my abilities, it would be quite simple for me to teleport participants directly onto the ship, so I suggest setting up a temporary reception area near the Teleportation Gate, where the invitations can be verified. After confirmation, I can then use my Teleportation Magic to transport them directly onto the ship, but what do you think? That being the case, I believe there should be no issue with the large magic ship being out at sea, and there would be no need to worry about attracting attention]","[I- I see, that would certainly be a tremendous help but is that alright? Wouldn't that have quite the burden on you, Gluttony-san?]","[No, teleporting a few hundred people won't even make a dent in my capabilities. Besides, being able to assist Miyama Kaito-sama would be a supreme bliss for me Also, it's likely that the great Shalltear-sama, who has the foresight to see into the distant future, informed me of your current plans because she had anticipated such developments, so it can be inferred that assisting Miyama Kaito-sama is also Shalltear-sama's will.]","[Fumu]","Indeed, if it's Alice, she would likely anticipate this happening, and it's truly like Alice to subtly provide support in this way.","[I understand. If it's alright with Gluttony-san, please assist us. We also need to consult about this with Anima and the others, so let's go inside and talk about it.]","[Hah, I promise to work to your expectations.]","Just like that, Gluttony-san agreed to help us out. We no longer have to worry about the mobility aspect, and now we just have to really work out the details and wait for the event to start.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Well~~ As expected of the capable Transcendental Beauty Alice-chan, she's wonderful with her follow-ups! Casual assists like this is probably her secret to capturing Kaito-san's love!!!]","Serious-senpai : [She's one heck of a mess when it comes to romance, but it is true that she's super capable in everything else.]"]},{"number":1861,"title":"Chapter 1861: Before the Ship Party Starts 1","paragraphs":["On the day of Kaito's hosted ship party, Greene, with her hair neatly styled and wearing a rented dress, was heading towards the Teleportation Gate looking nervous, but somewhat enthusiastic.","[Alright, let's do our best to make acquaintances with rich people and make my social debut also, unrelated to that, I might be able to see genuine noble ladies, so I want to check them out for future reference.]","Greene is a commoner who yearns for the life of noble ladies. She yearns for the glittering world of social life and dreams that one day, she too will be part of such a glittering world.","However, as a receptionist at the Adventurers' Guild in a rural town, she has no chance to meet rich people such as nobles, and even among the Adventurers, there are few high-ranking adventurers in rural towns, so she has no contacts.","However, thanks to her hobby, she met Kaito at the Flying Board Competition she attended every year. Due to this, she was invited to the party this time, making her feel somewhat excited and hopeful.","Well, the reality was that the party was a few hundred times more tremendous than she had imagined, but she had no way of knowing that at the moment.","[Welcome, where would you like to be teleported?]","[Errr, excuse me, I was told that if I showed this invitation, I would be teleported there]","[Ahh, you're availing the special transfer then. Please allow me to check your invitation for a moment Yes, we have confirmed it and will now return your invitation to you. Please come this way so we can prepare the Teleportation Gate for you.]","[Yes, thank you.]","While thanking the courteous attendant and moving on, Greene thought in her mind.","(Eh? Can I really teleport for free? Teleportation from Human Realm to Demon Realm should be quite expensive, right I brought a considerable amount of money just in case, but for them to only conduct a simple check, not even having to line up I- I wonder if this is what the upper class calls VIP treatment I- I'm kinda getting nervous.)","Usually, when availing the services of the Teleportation Gates, one would have to wait for their turn to be teleported but it seems that special transfers are carried out at a different Teleportation Gate, where one is guided separately from the normal queue and the teleportation is carried out smoothly.","Upon arrival, she found herself inside what was likely a Teleportation Gate somewhere in the Demon Realm, but as someone who had little experience in the Demon Realm, Greene didn't know where she was.","As she looked around, a woman dressed in a maid outfit who was near the entrance of the Teleportation Gate came up to her and bowed.","[Excuse me, I sense a reaction to your invitation, but would you happen to be an invited guest?]","[Ah, y- yes!]","[Well then, I beg your pardon, but I would like to confirm your invitation.]","[H- Here you go]","Slightly overwhelmed by the presence of a maid, which she rarely encounters in her daily life, Greene handed over her invitation. The maid, after confirming it, nodded once before returning the invitation to Greene.","[Thank you very much. Well then, may I show you to the venue then?]","[I- I'm in your care.]","[Yes. The transfer will be carried out by teleportation. Besides direct teleportation to the interior of the magic ship, for those who wish to see the exterior of the magic ship, you can choose between two options: teleportation to a location where you can inspect the exterior before being teleported back to the interior later, or direct teleportation to the interior. Which option would you prefer?]","[Ahh, t- then, I'd like to inspect the exterior first]","[Understood. You will be teleported in 10 seconds. Please note that teleportation to the interior will automatically take place 1 minute after you arrive at the location Well then, I bid you a good day.]","While the maid was confirming what Greene would like, the information reached Gluttony, who was waiting in the subspace, and the teleportation took place in the way the invitee wanted.","The seas in the Demon Realm, on a floating pedestal prepared to inspect the appearance of the magic ship, Greene was stunned with her eyes and mouth wide open.","[Aehh? W- W- W- What is with this size]","In front of her was a huge luxury liner of a size she had never seen before in her life, and witnessing its overwhelming scale made her involuntarily shudder.","(A- Arehh? Could this possibly be a much bigger party than I had imagined?)","Greene realized that she had been naive in her perceptions, but that didn't mean she could do anything about it now, and while she was stunned by such a sight, a minute passed and she was teleported to the ship.","The place she was teleported to looked like a reception area, where she presented her invitation and was given a key.","[This key is?]","[It's a key to a room that has been individually allocated to the invited guests. Please feel free to use them as needed, like for waiting until the party starts, changing clothes or taking a break.]","[Ah, yes.]","Never had she expected that a room would be individually prepared for her. Overwhelmed by the extraordinary treatment, her hands trembled as she received the key. Greene then moved away from the reception area and anxiously surveyed the luxurious interior of the ship Suddenly, she spotted an acquaintance who looked just as bewildered as her, looking around.","[Anne-san!]","[Eh? Ahh, Greene-san T- Thank goodness, I finally met someone I know Having found myself in an unbelievable place like this, I was feeling bewildered and confused.]","[I feel the same way. No, I mean, I was expecting a lavish party, but I didn't expect anything like this I'm so relieved to see you here, Anne-san.]","[Geez, you could already feel how luxurious this place is from the interior a- anyhow, let's move on.]","For Greene, running into Anne, a fellow Flying Board racer and acquaintance, was a blessing in disguise. Anne was in almost the same state as Greene, so without needing to confirm with each other, they decided to stick together, moving away from the floor with the reception area.","[E- Errr, for the time being, should we head for our rooms?]","[However Where is it? This ship is so big that I have no idea where to go Shall we go back to the reception area and ask?]","In response to Anne, who anxiously asked if they should go to their allocated rooms, Greene agreed, but also said that the magic ship was too big and she wasn't sure which was their cabin.","At the moment they considered returning to the reception area to ask, an ethereal voice suddenly resounded.","[You seem to be having trouble, would you like me to help you?]","[ [ Eh? ] ]","When they turned around at the voice they heard they found a large woman with two humongous horns, dressed in a black dress that looked like a mourning dress, standing there with a smile on her face.","[Please don't hesitate to rely on me By the way, this is just my hunch, but I think we could become very good friends don't you think?]","To the bewildered Greene and Anne, the large-built woman the Humanized Tiamat wore a smile so beautiful that it sent shivers down one's spine.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [For their first encounter to be Tiamat Did these two commit some serious crime in their previous lives That is just the worst]","? ? ? : [No, well, Alice-chan is properly giving Tiamat guidance that kinda sounded wrong with that perverted snake involved. Anyhow, Alice-chan is properly instructing Tiamat, so she won't reach out to ordinary people. There's no need to worry about her. I can't exactly say anything with their mental fatigue though]"]},{"number":1862,"title":"Chapter 1862: Before the Ship Party Starts 2","paragraphs":["The Six Kings Executives, which are very well known worldwide, even to the general public vary considerably from camp to camp. No, if one were to exclude Death King's camp, which has only recently begun to gain subordinates, only the Phantasmal King's camp and the Underworld King's camp had peculiar circumstances.","For example, the Five Warlords, the Seven Princesses, and the Four Great Demon Dragons are quite well-known and are sometimes featured in magazines, so even though it's rare to see them face to face, there are opportunities to see images of them.","When it comes to the Four Great Demon Dragons, their dragon forms are widely known, so when they take on a human form, ordinary people might not recognize them, but figures like the Five Warlords and the Seven Princesses would be immediately recognizable to ordinary people Well, there's also that certain Executive who wasn't recognized by others because of how low of a presence she had","In contrast, the Underworld King and the Phantasmal King camps are different. First of all, in the Underworld King camp, the term \"Executive\" itself doesn't exist, so although there are several well-known members of the Underworld King camp, it's unclear where to draw the line on who is considered an Executive. They don't act as Executives or participate in the Hero Festival under such a title, so even though the people heard their names or aliases, the general popular doesn't know what they looked like.","The Ten Demons, Phantasmal King's Executives, are also similar in this regard. The codenames and aliases of the Ten Demons are widely known, but the Phantasmal King camp in itself is highly secretive, and so if their codenames and aliases are known, many of their members had their faces unknown to the public.","For example, even though Moloch and Lilim are known to some extent as the Head of the Satania Trading Company and the mother of the current Emperor, very few people know that they are members of the Ten Demons.","(W- Who could she be? Those very large horns Is she a Demon? Her dress is all black, but looking closely, her dress has a luxurious feel to it Is that kind of dress trending in social circles? Ahh, no, that's not it What I should know about is who this dreadfully unique woman is.)","Just like Greene, there are a significant number of commoners who didn't know what the Ten Demons looked like. However, when it comes to Tiamat, she is one of the most widely known to belong to the Ten Demons.","(W- What tremendous magic power. I was confident in my magic power, but the difference in our magic power is just overwhelming. Is she a Peerage holder? Large horns Black hair with a blue tinge Arehh? I feel like I heard about her somewhere Hmmm. Can't remember.)","Since the species to which Anne belongs to, the Kruels, is said to have ancestors who were Demons, she has also heard a little about the \"Dark Forest's Monster\" when she was a little girl, but she had only heard a little bit She didn't recognize Tiamat because she's currently Humanized and lacks the distinctive snake-like lower body.","Incidentally, as a side note, if a commoner from the Demon Realm were present here, the moment they saw Tiamat's face, they would be fleeing. She's recognized as one of the most dangerous creatures in the Demon Realm, with her huge two horns, slightly bluish black hair, and vertical slit golden eyes Just having these characteristics would be enough to make the majority recognize her as dangerous enough to flee at full speed.","[Is something the matter?]","[Ah, no, errr]","[I happened to hear your conversation, but you were looking for your room's location? If you don't mind, may I check your keys?]","[Ah, yes.]","Though she should be wearing a beautiful and gentle smile, for some reason, Greene and Anne couldn't shake the feeling of a chilling sensation running down their spine as they showed their keys to Tiamat.","[Ahh, I see, if this here is your room number, that would mean you're on the 3rd floor. It's not far from here, so I'll show you the way to your room.]","[Eh? T- Thank you very much. However, we don't want to impose too much]","[Don't worry about it, it's only natural to offer a helping hand to someone in need]","Although puzzled by the unsettling creepiness, Greene and Anne, following Tiamat who had offered to guide them, continued. While the atmosphere may seem eerie, Tiamat's actual words, actions, and goodwill suggest otherwise, making it difficult for them to refer to the eeriness except as their subjective feelings.","In the end, without much conversation, Greene and Anne followed Tiamat up the stairs to the 3rd floor. As they approached their rooms, Tiamat turned back with a smile.","[Beyond this would be your rooms. There's a room number on the door, so please check it with your key.]","[Thank you for expressly bringing us here Ahh, I'm sorry for not even being able to introduce myself. I'm Eh?]","Anne was about to thank her and introduce herself, but Tiamat quickly held out her palm in front of Anne's mouth, as if to stop her from speaking.","When Anne stopped speaking, puzzled by this action, Tiamat spoke with a soft smile.","[Do not introduce yourself to me. Knowing that would only make me more curious You shouldn't ask for my name. Knowing that would only make you want to know more You must become close to me. If you get close to me, I will surely want to part ways]","[..]","Those words seemed to carry an implicit pressure beneath them, leaving Anne and Greene speechless as they looked at Tiamat.","[Today's encounter is but a transient dream a momentary coincidence \"Forget it\".]","As both Tiamat's eyes shine dangerously, Anne and Greene's eyes lose focus. After smiling once more at them, Tiamat turned her back on them and walked back the way she had come, quietly muttering to herself as she approached the stairs to the 2nd floor.","[They who are pure, gentle, and proper They who I could easily kill if I wanted to shouldn't be involved with a monster like me.]","Dark Forest's Monster Medea Leviatash. Codename: Tiamat. She's a psycho who harbors both affection and murderous intent, a desire to kill someone close to her.","Yes, there's no doubt that she's abnormal but perhaps, because of Alice's guidance She understands that she's distorted, and she also knows that her way of thinking is abnormal in the eyes of the world.","She's definitely abnormal, but if one asks if her heart is evil, one can't exactly say she is. At the very least, when she reached out to help the two who were lost and in trouble, it wasn't out of desire, but pure goodwill","A few seconds after Tiamat's disappearance, Anne and Greene both have a surprised look at almost the same time.","[Ahh, Greene-san, I'm sorry. I was kinda in a daze there Maybe I really am quite nervous.]","[It's the same for me, Anne-san. It's embarrassing to say this, but I was probably overwhelmed by the grandeur that my mind was distracted while moving from the reception area to here.]","[Hahaha, we're both the same then. However, it's good that we managed to get to our rooms like this \"without having to ask anyone\".]","[Yes, things surprisingly worked out for us. Well then, let's check out our rooms that said, going to each of our rooms by ourselves is kinda scary, so why don't we both check our rooms together?]","[I agree.]","Smiling wryly at each other, they had completely forgotten about having met Tiamat earlier and engaging in trivial conversation along the way, they checked out the rooms assigned for them.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That's right. She's dangerous, but compared to other dangerous people, she seems better to some extent because Tiamat herself recognizes herself as someone abnormal.]","? ? ? : [As a side note, regarding her \"Dark Forest's Monster\" moniker, Tiamat herself had asked m Alice-chan to spread it widely in the Demon Realm. It's kind of a measure, like that snake's way of ensuring that the most kind-hearted people avoid getting involved with her Well, doesn't change the fact that she's a pervert though. She frequently finds the time to kill Phenex and takes pleasure in doing it]"]},{"number":1863,"title":"Chapter 1863: Before the Ship Party Starts 3","paragraphs":["Not long after Tiamat was moving down the stairs, she found the person she was looking for.","[Ah, Tiamat. Where have you been?]","[I just ran a small errand earlier Sorry to keep you waiting, Phenex.]","There stood a petite woman with long emerald hair, and her figure, adorned with many frills and a cute dress, exuded a hint of childishness.","It's the Humanized Phenex, who, like Tiamat, is one of the Ten Demons, and the two, who are good friends in their private lives, often work together on such occasions.","[There really is quite a lot of sorrow in this world. I'm especially careful when dealing with the weak. It's not good for the soul to be with someone who could kill you if they wanted to.]","[Is that so? I've never really cared about beings whose existence doesn't give me pleasure. If they can't give me pleasure, they're just worthless in my world and I'm not interested in them.]","[Fumu, I think the weak and tender-hearted and precious though]","[Isn't it fine? If Tiamat thinks so, then in Tiamat's worldview, that is right and true. People's sense of values are varied and wide-ranging, and as long as you're clear with your own standard of values, that's all that matters.]","[I see Talking with Phenex has been quite constructive.]","Phenex has a dry personality when it comes to matters she isn't interested in, but she isn't so shallow as to refuse to accept those with different values. She understands and accepts that her values and those of others are naturally different, and that what she perceives as worthless may be important to others.","However, even if that is the case, Phenex remains in her stance in regard to things she doesn't care about. And so, while she acknowledged Tiamat's sense of value, she responded in an uninterested and noncommittal manner.","After lightly smiling at Phenex, Tiamat, seemingly having remembered something, spoke.","[Come to think of it, I haven't seen you in your Humanized form in a long time.]","[Now that you mentioned it, you're right. Well, there haven't been many opportunities to humanize lately What do you think? Doesn't this suit me?]","[Yes, you look very lovely and charming. The frilly dress also seems to enhance your charm]","Tiamat's voice gradually heats up as she speaks to Phenex, and at the same time, Tiamat smiles as she reaches out and grips Phenex's petite neck so tightly that her fingernails are digging into it.","[Ahh, you are truly charming and lovely Hey, Phenex Can I kill you?]","Tiamat's lips curl up to a smile, one that was completely tinged with madness. Her eyes seemed to harbor an eerie light, so intense and filled with sinister madness so dense and ominous that it might cause the faint-hearted to faint at the sight alone.","However, Phenex, the recipient of such madness, was also a different kind of abnormal like her. Under Tiamat's gaze of madness, Phenex returned an equally insane, blissful smile with eyes filled with an equal measure of madness.","[Would you strangle me to death? Or would you pierce my throat with your fingers? Or perhaps, would you grip my neck with all your might? I love them all. Won't you kill me earnestly, painfully, agonizingly!?]","[Ahh, you really are more beautiful than anyone else]","Tiamat and Phenex are both abnormal, and their fetishes mesh well with each other. The compatibility between Tiamat, who becomes increasingly desperate to kill those she finds endearing, and Phenex, who relishes in the agony that brings her death and wants to experience it repeatedly, is unparalleled.","Of course, once again, Phenex gleefully accepts Tiamat's sudden, impulsive urge to kill. Just as Tiamat smiled with delight at Phenex's response, she immediately attempted to break Phenex's neck but both of them were suddenly bound by chains that came flying out of nowhere.","[Oya? My, oh my What a sorrowful situation this is.]","[E- Ehhh, even though my neck's about to snap there, isn't it terrible leaving me here Pandora-sama?]","When the two restrained by chains looked at each other, they saw Pandora walking towards them with veins popping out of her forehead.","[You two You aren't going to indulge your vile fetishes at a party hosted by Miyama-sama an act unbecoming of the Ten Demons, right?]","[ [ .. ] ]","Tiamat and Phenex quickly looked away at Pandora's question. In any case, they had no room to refute. The fact is that they actually did feel excited and their minds had transitioned into indulging in their fetishes.","[This time, I've been tasked by Shalltear-sama to monitor the movements of the Ten Demons, which includes you two. Listen here, if you dare to act foolishly, I will deal with you at my discretion]","[Ahh~~ It's over. If we really mess around even a little bit, we'll be sealed up and thrown into the sea.]","[As expected of Shalltear-sama, but having Pandora-sama, who is quite thorough in carrying out her duties, watch over us, she managed to contain Pandora-sama and us all together How sorrowfully brilliant.]","Yes, even though she was angry, Pandora also has a dangerously peculiar fetish, being a sadist towards others and a masochist only towards certain individuals, which often makes Kaito and Alice scratch their heads.","However, Pandora never lets her fetishes surface during missions, carrying out her orders seriously and perfectly.","Therefore, Alice gave Pandora an \"extremely important order\" beforehand, to monitor and supervise the other Ten Demons, taking steps to prevent the Ten Demons, including Pandora, from going out of control.","In fact, it was so effective that with an expression Tiamat and Phenex were dragged away with chains wrapped around them, looking as if they had realized everything and had given up.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Just when I was getting a better opinion of you last chapter, you actually went and did this!? Come to think of it, these two are 9th and 10th in the hierarchy, right? Phenex is higher than Tiamat?]","? ? ? : [No, the reason these two are lower in the hierarchy is because they take time to vent their fetishes on their missions. Phenex, after enjoying herself with her fetishes for some time, carries out her mission quickly, but Tiamat, after she has finished, comes back after a while crying (writhing in pleasure) with the grief of having lost her close partner (as she sees it), spreading ultrasonic waves and destroying the surrounding area Taking into account the damage she causes to her surroundings, Tiamat is placed in 10th.]"]},{"number":1864,"title":"Chapter 1864: Before the Ship Party Starts 4","paragraphs":["By the time Tiamat and Phenex were taken away by Pandora, Greene and Anne were together in one of the rooms allocated to them.","[Greene-san, I'm sorry for intruding in your room.]","[No, I'm rather uncomfortable being alone in such a large room myself, so I feel more at ease with you here, Anne-san.]","[That said, it's really an amazing room. T- They're providing a room like this for each invitee]","The room they had been allocated was a luxurious room that was truly befitting a room that was truly befitting a room on a luxury liner, and for the two of them, who were completely ordinary people, it was an unknown world.","As they were not at ease being alone in such a room, they decided to wait together in Greene's room until the party started.","[But then, we've come to a really great place. Kaito-san must be very rich. I heard he's an otherworlder but]","[I don't know the details either, but I've heard rumors that otherworlders who decide to migrate to our world are conferred a court rank Miyama-san must be a noble then? Even if that's not the case, he should still have quite the connections I- I definitely must get closer with him! That way, I'll also have rich acquaintances and the social life I dream of will]","[Hahaha, how should I say this You're quite resilient, Greene-san.]","[Since it's a great opportunity, I'd like to gain something before going home. I rented a really nice dress just for this occasion. For someone like me, with a monthly income (after tax) of 3420R, it's quite a painful expense, but when it comes to getting closer to the glamorous social world I've always longed for, I can't afford to cut corners.]","Despite being overwhelmed by the luxury Gree, who hasn't forgotten her goal of getting acquainted with rich people, is somewhat resilient. Well, in terms of getting to know rich people, she has already achieved that by getting to know Kaito but as expected, even she can't imagine Kaito having such an extraordinary connection with the top figures of the three realms.","[Greene-san is an Adventurer's Guild receptionist, right? I don't mean to be rude, but as it was a job that required a lot of expertise, I thought it would pay more.]","[If I'm working in the Royal Capital or a major city, yeah, but our guild is in a frontier town. The scale is completely different, so the pay is comparable to that. Speaking of which, Ive never asked about your job in detail, but since Anne-san is a Kruel, I guess you're part of the magic crystal mining industry?]","[You're quite knowledgeable. Yes, or rather, the majority of the Kruels are in the mining business.]","[Well, this may be a crude question but do you guys earn a lot from those?]","[It varies quite a lot. The Kruels basically tend to form unions with a certain number of people. Each union undertakes its own mining operations and handles the sale and purchase of the mined goods. Therefore, income varies greatly depending on the capabilities of the union to which one belongs. As for the union I belong to or rather, the union I represent, embarrassing it may be to say this, but it's more on the smaller to medium scale side, and since we don't have many connections At the lowest, we earn around 2000R per month, and at the highest, it could be 5000R, so it varies quite a lot.]","[I see, that sounds rough. However, being the representative is impressive. Even though it's small scale, aren't you among the top of your organization?]","The Kruels are a species who are vulnerable to sunlight, but who excel in mining and other technologies, living in underground cities. Mining gemstones and magic crystals are their main business.","Like others of the Kruels, Anne is also involved in the mining industry and although it's small-scale, she's the representative of her union.","[Ahh, I wish I was that great, but in fact, the leader of the union was my grandfather, so I'm just taking over the family business. How should I say this Our union has many skilled workers, but most of them are craftsmen at heart and tend to be weak in negotiations We also lack connections to trading companies, so we're in a difficult situation where we have no choice but to take on jobs at a considerably low price.]","[No matter which world you're part of, it really is important to have good contacts Ah, that's right! In that case, why don't you make some contacts at this party?]","[Hahaha, that's a tempting suggestion Is it really possible to meet someone from a trading company, especially one that has a connection with magic crystal-related things? Perhaps Kaito-san might have some connections with them, but it feels too wretched for me, with my shallow connections, to ask for an introduction]","[Hmmm, wishing for something is free, so let's keep our ideals big! Perhaps this party will even help us establish a connection with the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company!]","[If we can get a connection to such a big trading company, it would certainly make things easier for our members, but I think we're setting our sights a little too high there Let's just keep our aim for a business connection in moderation.]","[You sure don't have many desires, Anne-san.]","In contrast to Greene, who seemed to be filled with ambition, or rather, with aspirations and dreams, Anne seems to be more reserved and steady in her thinking.","In this situation, however, Greene's overblown expectations were in some ways spot on but at that time, they had no way of knowing that.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Just to confirm who's participating, there's Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company's Chairman, Magic Tool Division's Special Advisor, Magic Crystal Division's Special Advisor, and a certain someone from the the Six Kings, who is the Honorary Chairman of several large trading companies, including Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company]","? ? ? : [The reserved and steady types get beaten to a pulp by the brute force of personal connections.]"]},{"number":1865,"title":"Chapter 1865: Before the Ship Party Starts 5","paragraphs":["The massive magic ship that serves as the venue for the ship party has many rooms, and as it was originally designed as a luxury cruise ship, there are also rooms that are more like VIP rooms.","In one of the VIP rooms, one of the Six Kings, Isis and her subordinates were waiting for the party to start while having a peaceful conversation.","[Ohh~~ Amazing. So this is a ship huh Moving slowly like this on the sea, it feels refreshing!]","[I see This is the first time Eul has ridden a ship, right?]","[Yes! It's very exciting!]","[Fufu Unn I also don't get the chance to ride a ship very often so it also feels slightly refreshing for me.]","After smiling at Eulpecula, whose 10 tails were wagging as she curiously looked out the window, Isis took a sip of her tea.","Due to Isis' magic power of death, there was a concern that she might inadvertently frighten the ordinary people if she encountered them at the reception area, so she arrived at the ship quite early.","[However, I suppose it's to be expected of Kaito-sama, I could sense formidable individuals with incredible power arriving one after another. Could it be that even the Six Kings' Executives are gathering here?]","[Actually, Kaito seems to be acquainted with all of them. Well, I don't know if all the Executives would have the time to participate like us but well, when it comes to those who only had regular tasks at hand, they'd probably prioritize?]","[Fumu I wonder what the other camps are doing? Are they huddled together in the same room as we do?]","As Iris prepared a refill of tea, she responded to Polaris. The Death King's Executives or rather, the Death King's subordinates don't really have any actual \"work\"-like work, so naturally, everyone was participating in this party.","[How should I say this The dress, it doesn't suit you.]","[Yeah, I'm aware of that without you having to tell me. I mean, many of us Insectoids have wings on our backs or multiple arms, so dresses are inherently difficult for us to wear No, in terms of what I'm wearing now, it was custom-made, so I don't feel any discomfort wearing this, but as it's too different from what I usually wear, I just can't compose myself wearing it.]","[Stop talking as if you're normally a composed person. Simply put, I'm just saying the dress doesn't suit a woman who is all muscles up to her brain.]","[Yeah, I suppose so. The choice of attire is indeed crucial. Even a high-quality dress, when worn by a corpse woman, can only look like tattered drags. What a waste.]","[Hah?]","[Ahh?]","[You two~~ If you fight here, I'll get angry~~]","Seeing Sirius and Rasal getting into a quarrel like always, Spica said with a wry smile. The Death King's Executives continued to get along as usual, and even though there were some ruckus along the way, they spent time until the start of the party in a pleasant manner.","On the deck of the magic ship, Ozma is leaning against the fence smoking a cigarette. Ozma, who was enjoying the scenery as if he was relaxing, heard a loud voice.","[Ah, Elder Bro! You were here!]","[Unn? If it isn't Kong-kun, how's the Master doing?]","The one who appeared was a gorilla in a tight-fitting suit One of War King's Executives, the Five Generals, The Gallant Kong. After smiling wryly at Kong's happy smile, Ozma asked him how Megiddo was like.","[If it's the Boss, he had Bacchus bring him some sake and started drinking right away. Boss sure has been in a particularly good mood these days. I guess it must be because the lower subordinates have become more spirited since that battle in the God Realm?]","[Maybe that's part of it, but I think they've been in a particularly good mood lately because they simply like Miyama-kun more than before.]","[Ahh, I see That guy's sure is amazing.]","[Oh, do you also think highly of Miyama-kun, Kong-kun?]","Just as Kong said, Megiddo is actually in a very good mood these days. The reason for that is, with Kaito's help, Megiddo managed to overcome the destructive impulse she had been harboring for many years, allowing Megiddo herself to have even greater control over her power than before, and because she liked Kaito even more than she originally liked him because of that one incident, she was in an extremely good mood during matters involving Kaito.","[Yeah, when I first met him at the Six Kings Festival, I thought he was just a little brat, but then he showed a lot of guts and was really cool in his fight with Boss. I like guys with that kind of muddy guts. Not only that, I heard something about him beating the Boss again recently? To beat the Boss three times, that's quite something.]","[Hahaha, Miyama-kun is really great, isn't he? At this party as well, many of the Six Kings' Executives are attending not just because their respective King is close to him, but also because they genuinely like Miyama-kun as a person and wanted to participate That really is quite something.]","[Right.]","As Ozma spoke cheerfully, Kong nodded vigorously in agreement. The atmosphere was becoming relaxed when suddenly, Ozma, seemingly remembering something, asked Kong something.","[Come to think of it, how were Agni-chan and Epsilon-can doing?]","[Ah~~ They were arguing about who should enter with Elder Bro. The Boss and Elder Bro told them off, telling them fighting is forbidden here but they're all sparks over there. I think they finally came to an agreement to just let Elder Bro decide?]","[I- I see Hmmm I think I'll be staying here for a while longer]","As Ozma thought about the aggressive Agni and Epsilon, who, as usual, saw this party as an opportunity to shine, he smiled wryly with an indescribable expression, then took out another cigarette and lit it.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Among the War King's subordinates, it seems like Bacchus would always be the one whom Megiddo would dump the problems to He's the troubled guy in the group huh]"]},{"number":1866,"title":"Chapter 1866: Before the Ship Party Starts 6","paragraphs":["In the reception area of the magic ship, Kaori and Akane could be seen looking at the guests who came one after another from a distance with eyes as dead as that of a fish.","Akane was an ordinary invited guest, but Kaori was involved with the dishes served at the party this time, so she was curious to see the faces of the invited guests.","Of course, she knew that figures like the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods would all be present, but there were also individuals she hadn't expected to appear, causing her stomach to ache more than she had imagined.","[At this point, all Four Great Demon Dragons aside from Grandiereus-sama have gathered. Considering that it might be physically difficult for Grandiereus-sama to participate, it can't be helped Now, I've seen an almost complete lineup of the Five Generals, the Seven Princesses and the Four Great Demon Dragons just by watching here I already knew this was the case, but this is beyond belief.]","[U- Uuuu, my stomach hurts I was prepared for this from the start, plunging into this situation as prepared as I could but]","[You're going to be alright. Sure, Kaori came up with the original concept for the dishes, but then various people added their own touches and adapted them to fit this world, right? If that's the case, you don't have to be that worried.]","While Akane cheered her up with a wry smile, just as Kaori's expression slightly softened, a voice suddenly called out to them.","[Oh, if it isn't Kaori-chan.]","[Ahh! Shige-san, Hannah-san!!!]","[Hello, Kaori-san This place is amazing, isn't it?]","The ones who appeared were the couple, Shigenobu and Hannah, dressed smartly. Seeing familiar faces, Kaori's expression brightened.","[You said it. I didn't expect it would be this outrageous, making my stomach hurt Ahh, that's right, let me introduce you! This is Akane-san, an immigrant like us!]","[Hi, I'm Mikumo Akane. Ah, here, my business card. I'm running a small trading company, please contact us if you need anything. I'm in your care.]","[Ahh, I'm also in your care. I've heard a bit about you from Kaori, but meeting someone from the same homeworld is always nice. Okura Shigenobu, now a farmer in rural Hydra. This is my wife, Hannah. It's a pleasure to meet you.]","[Well met.]","Akane and Shigenobu had heard about each other from mutual acquaintances, but had never met in person, so they took this opportunity to introduce themselves to each other.","[Speaking of which, there's also that other migrant child, right? If I'm not mistaken, Mitsunaga Seigi-kun, was it?]","[Yeah, I have heard about him from Kaito-kun. However, didn't that kid receive a court rank? In that case, he would probably be attending as a noble, so he would naturally have escorts with him. So, it might be difficult to meet him without Kaito-kun introducing us.]","[Arehh? I heard from Kaito that Neun-san is an immigrant like us though?]","[H- Her case isa bit peculiar. It's worrying how a lot about her isn't something I can explain A- Anyhow, let's not mind her!]","Shigenobu asked about the other past Hero Actor, Seigi, but neither Kaori nor Akane had met him, so they didn't know how to describe him.","After that, they talked about Neun, but while Akane only knows that she's a former otherworlder, Kaori, who knows that Neun's identity, being the First Hero, fumbled with an indescribable expression on her face.","As Kaori's gaze moved around, looking for a way to somehow change the subject, her expression changed when she spotted an acquaintance restlessly loitering around the reception area.","[Arehh? Olivia-sama!]","[Unn? Ahh, Mizuhara Kaori huh, I met you at just the right time. I don't know about the rooms, but do I just go past this many rooms as written in this number?]","[Ahh, errr, that's not it. This number at the beginning represents the floor]","Even though it was a coincidence, Kaori spotted her regular customer Olivia and hurried over, calling out to her. For Olivia, who had little interaction with people outside, Kaori was one of her few relatively close acquaintances, so even though it was only a small one, a smile appeared on her lips as she asked about her room.","After a short explanation, Kaori looks back at Akane and the others and calls out to them.","[Sorry! I'm going to guide Olivia-sama for a bit!]","[Ohh~~ We'll be around here for a while, so don't worry about us. Just take your time and show her around.]","[Yeeeees!]","Responding cheerfully to Akane's words, Olivia slightly nodded their way before moving towards her room with Kaori. Watching them as they walked ahead, Akane muttered with a wry smile.","[Well, that's probably Kaito's influence, but it seems like Kaori also got a considerably amazing friend Oh wait, it's also the same way for us.]","Recalling how she herself had met many influential people through Kaito, Akane sighed with an indescribable expression on her face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It's the seldomly brought up Seigi-san He's so awe-inspiring that I can't bring myself to refer to him without honorifics.]","? ? ? : [Well, it's only been a few years, so he probably won't make an appearance yet.]","Serious-senpai : [No, isn't it alright!? Just let him appear Why are you trying to turn Seigi-san into some sort of seasonal character!?]"]},{"number":1867,"title":"Chapter 1867: Before the Ship Party Starts 7","paragraphs":["In one of the VIP rooms of the magic ship, Underworld King Kuromueina and her family were there, spending time in their own way until the time the party was to start.","The Underworld King camp, led by Kuromueina, had quite a few connections with Kaito since his early days in this world, so Kaito had many acquaintances in their camp. If one were to count each camp's participants, their numbers would be the largest.","[Heehhh~~ Then, Elder Sister Tre's straying habit has also been cured?]","[Hmmm, rather than cured, it's more like even if she gets lost, Cento and Cien are now able to find her immediately? Well, it's all thanks to Kaito but now that I've overcome my straying problem, I've become quite the formidable Big Sis, haven't I? If it's now, I think my Onee-chan Power has reached around 100,000.]","[What's Onee-chan Power?]","[No, you see, just like how Sis Ei has that Maid Power, I just tried to imitate it, but there's no special high value or anything like that. Well, in any case, I now feel like I've become a very competent sister with no weaknesses!!!]","At one of the tables in the room, Tre and Vier were sitting opposite each other, chatting. Upon hearing that Tre's habit of getting lost had been resolved recently, Vier, who had a long-standing relationship with her, seemed to be moved, but as Tre started talking about incomprehensible things like Onee-chan Power, Vier couldn't help but wryly smile.","[Hmmm. Then, for example, if we take Elder Sister Ein's seamlessness as 100, how seamless are you, Elder Sister Tre?]","[Let's see. I'm the type who's pretty generous with myself, so I'd give myself a generous 5!]","[You're full of gaps there]","[No, no, I think the comparison there is just unfair. After all, everyone is full of gaps when you compare them to Sis Ei.]","[Then, if we take Elder Sister Zwei as 100?]","[If it's compared with Sis Zwei, it changes quite a bit maybe 8!]","[And you're still full of gaps there]","[That's weird Well, having weaknesses is also a charming part of me, so that's all well and good!]","[H- How optimistic]","Vier cheerfully chuckled as she looked at Tre, who was as easygoing and optimistic as ever. They were chatting in a relaxed atmosphere, but Vier seemed to have suddenly noticed something and asked Tre.","[Come to think of it, you came in formal wear today huh, Elder Sister Tre? Well, Elder Sister Tre is tall and slender, so it suits you very well]","[Unn. As Vier said, I feel like this suits me better than a dress. Listen here, this outfit Kuromu-sama bought it for me the other day~~]","[You coaxed Kuromu-sama for money again?]","[Hmm, I technically did coax her, but I didn't ask her to buy me clothes. What I asked Kuromu-sama was to pick out clothes for me because I wanted to wear the ones she picked out. And so, it just so happened that Kuromu-sama's schedule was free that day, so we decided to go shopping together]","[Ahh~~ And since Kuromu-sama was shopping with you, there's no way she'd make you take out money huh.]","[Right, so she ended up being like she bought them for me. Well, you see, I'm the type who thoroughly acts spoiled around the older ones and thoroughly spoils the younger ones.]","Tre is in fact skilled at being pampered, making her much loved by Ein, Zwei and Kuromueina. She didn't have any sort of ulterior motives, her request at that time was purely out of the desire to wear the clothes chosen by Kuromueina.","As for Kuromueina, she'd naturally feel happy having her family acting spoiled and receiving their pure affection from her. As the wealthiest person in the world, she wouldn't let her family pay while shopping, so the clothes Tre was currently wearing were presented to her as a gift from Kuromueina.","Vier nodded in understanding, but seemingly having thought of something, a mischievous smile crept onto her face.","[Hohou, then, Elder Sister Tre would spoil me, your little sister, right? Does that mean you're going to buy me something?]","[I knew you would say that Tadah! I've actually already bought you something!]","[Eh? Y- You really got me something? I was just kidding]","[Fufufu, don't you underestimate how much of an Onee-chan I am. I heard about it, you know Vier got an award for your thesis a while ago, didn't you? This is a present to celebrate that, a brooch!]","[Ahh Thanks.]","Perhaps not having expected a gift to actually appear, Vier, who received the brooch Tre was giving her, momentarily looked stunned. But after a while, she gradually began to feel joy welling up, and her expression changed to one of happiness.","[I'm happy. However, that was unexpected. I didn't know that Elder Sister Tre knew about the medical society paper I presented.]","[Fufun. Of course, I'd check out what my cute little sister is up to. I've even read your papers!]","[Eh? No way, that's amazing! I think it was quite technical and difficult, but for you to understand that]","[Nope, I read it, but I didn't understand it at all!!! Heck, my mind's already going blank by page 2! H- However, I did read it all the way through, you know? You kinda wrote something about magic power being in blood and something about affinity?]","[Despite reading it all, I don't feel like you even understood 10% of it Fufu, I guess that's just like Elder Sister Tre.]","Even so, the fact that Tre managed to read through a highly technical paper despite not understanding it at all showed her genuine affection for her sister, Vier, so with a happy smile, Vier promptly wore the brooch she received from Tre.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It feels like the party guests are clearly divided into the Stomachache Group and the Heartwarming Group. The Six Kings camps are appearing in order, if you count the perverts from Phantasmal King's camp who first appeared, then I guess the Seven Princesses would appear next.]"]},{"number":1868,"title":"Chapter 1868: Before the Ship Party Starts 8","paragraphs":["Not all guests of the party are high-profile figures. For one to be invited to the party, one only has to have been in contact with Kaito. However, if one were to talk about the ratio, it's more highly likely for the guest to be a high-profile person.","Akane and Kaori, who had returned after guiding Olivia to her room, stood in the open space of the reception area and watched the participants in a daze.","Incidentally, Akane and Kaori were here because they felt uncomfortable in the overly luxurious rooms assigned to them, and also because they were curious to see what kind of participants would be there.","[Come to think of it, Akane-san. Where's Frau-san?]","[Ahh, she met an acquaintance among the maids who would be serving at this party, so she went to say hello to her. Putting aside if that acquaintance of hers was also a guest, it wouldn't be appropriate for Frau to greet her when the party starts.]","[I see, then I'll be Akane-san's guard until Frau-san returns.]","[Ou, you're running your mouth now huh? Well, I'm not very good at anything except Teleportation Magic]","[Fufufu, I'm good at Water Magic, so I can be quite impressive on the sea Ahh, even though I say I'm impressive, I'm more of a water flea compared to the participants at this party]","While they were exchanging idle chatter with each other Unlike with Shigenobu's case a little while ago, the two of them heard a voice that they didn't recognize.","[Umm, are you by chance participants of this party?]","[Eh? Ahh, yes. You are]","[Ahh, I'm sorry. I'm Elise, I run a small fortune-telling shop in Symphonia Kingdom. Well, I was feeling a little overwhelmed by all the great people everywhere, so when I saw you guys having similar vibes to me, I just had to say hello. If you're actually well-known people that I just don't know, well, I apologize.]","Hearing the words of the woman with slightly curly chestnut hair that partially obscured her eyes, Elise Kaori and Akane nod in understanding.","[Ahh, I get what you feel. Oops, my name is Mizuhara Kaori, I'm just a commoner who runs a set meal shop in Friendship City.]","[I'm Mikumo Akane. I'm the president of a small trading company called Mikumo Trading Company, but compared with all the people in this hall, I'm a complete civilian.]","[Thank you for your courtesy. From the sound of your name Could it be that you were otherworlders?]","[Yes, we were former Hero Actors.]","Seeing Elise's gentle and likable smile, Kaori and Akane, who had been seeing only high-ranking figures so far, felt a sense of relief as they spoke.","[Elise-san it's only natural since you're here at this party, but you know Kaito-kun, right?]","[Yes, I've been under Miyama Kaito-san's care ever since I first opened my shop. I was invited to the party because of that, but I didn't expect this place to be this amazing Haha, I've been completely overwhelmed by the atmosphere here.]","[I get you! Well even though I know the people attending here were basically just those Kaito-kun knows, not necessarily a gathering of famous people, seeing the Six Kings, their Executives, and the Gods appearing one after another was still intimidating. Having ordinary people like Elise-san here kinda makes me feel relieved.]","[Thanks to the two of you being here, I was also relieved to find out that I wasn't the only commoner here. If it's not too much trouble, can we continue chatting for a while longer?]","[Of course! I'd also love to hear about Elise-san's shop!]","[I'm interested in this too. If you're considering selling your original products elsewhere, there might be ways we could collaborate.]","Feeling relaxed with each other's ordinary aura, the three of them continued chatting happily for a while.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [This guy acting so brazen]","Serious-senpai : [No, in the first place, Elise is a full-on masquerader except when she's around Kaito or Alice. Her being overwhelmed may have been a complete lie, but she probably just wants to vent out the complaints she had about Kaito in her mind.]","? ? ? : [Well, in this guy's case, if she complains about someone, her favorability towards them is actually extremely high.]"]},{"number":1869,"title":"Chapter 1869: Before the Ship Party Starts 9","paragraphs":["In one of the VIP rooms of the magic ship, the room allocated to the World King's camp, the World King's Executives, Seven Princesses, had gathered. Of course, each of them was given a private room, but they had gathered to chat during the time before the party started.","[This big ship is amazing, isn't it? What kind of party will it be? Tir is really, reeeeeally looking forward to it.]","[I agree In other words, I'm also looking forward to it.]","Ariel nodded in agreement with the cheerful and excited Tirtania. Camellia, sitting on a chair at a table a few distance away, smiled warmly as she watched their interaction before calling out to the nearby Rosemary.","[As expected, it seems that there's quite a noteworthy line-up of guests. Are you alright, Eri?]","[I- I'm alright I mean, I actually feel more reassured than in usual parties because there are few people I don't know W- Well, there are still some who I just know and haven't talked much]","Rosemary is extremely shy and tends to be particularly afraid of strangers. However, this party feels much more comfortable for Rosemary compared to parties where there are only strangers, as there are many participants she knows to some extent, such as the Six Kings and their Executives.","[Rosemary is still as bad with strangers as usual.]","[Strangers scare me I wish I could see them about 100 times before we move on to the stage of talking to them for the first time. I just don't know how Tir and everyone else can talk to people they've never met so easily.]","[Tir also loves talking to people she's never met before! By making new friends, Tir's world opens up a bit wider! That's what Raz-sama taught me!]","Rosemary replies with a wry smile to the approaching Tirtania. Rosemary, who has a fear of strangers, and the sociable Tirtania, who quickly becomes friendly with anyone she meets for the first time, can be considered somewhat polar opposites. Well, that said, they get along well with each other as fellow members of the Seven Princesses but","[I agree! It's great to meet new people!!! I heard that there are even otherworlders invited to this party!!! As for me, the thought of the possibility of hearing a samurai's story uplifts my spirits!!!]","[Blossom?]","[Ah, yes. I'll lower the volume.]","Blossom was being very energetic and very loud as usual, but upon hearing Lillie's quietly spoken words, seemingly having quickly guessed her intentions, she lowered her voice.","While they were chatting amicably like that, one other member of the Seven Princesses Jutia was staring out of the window with a rather serious expression on her face.","[Aya? Jutia, what's the matter? You got that serious look on your face.]","[Eh? Ahh, sorry, sorry. I was just thinking about something.]","[You got something in mind?]","Upon noticing that Jutia, who is typically calm, now has a rarely serious expression on her face, Tirtania approached her and asked, to which Jutia turned back with a wry smile.","[This is just a rumor, but I heard that a commemorative tea blend will be distributed as a souvenir for this party. I couldn't help but be curious and you know, my thoughts just kept drifting in that direction.]","[Kaitokun-san has launched his own brand of tea, so that certainly seems possible. I see Jutia is looking forward to that blend~~]","[Right, right, Kaito's brand I mean, the tea that Nebula makes always surprises me and I've become a big fan of hers. So you see, so you see, I was wondering if they're going to distribute her new creation You know, this being a good time for them to advertise a new blend, it makes sense for them to distribute their new creation here.]","In fact, just as stated in the rumor Jutia had heard, it was planned that guests for today's party would receive items related to the tea brand Nifty and a commemorative blend would be handed out to the guests on their return.","As a tea lover, Jutia was very curious about that commemorative blend. In fact, since it was to be given out at a party attended by the Six Kings, the Supreme Gods and even the Creator God herself, she expected that it wouldn't be a half-baked product and was very much looking forward to it.","However, Jutia was thinking in an extremely sensible way and was trying to calm herself down by looking at the sea, thinking that no matter how much she was curious about it, it would be rude to devote all her attention to it.","At the very least, making sure she avoids asking Kaito about it during the party","Incidentally, at the same time A certain maid, who had obtained the same rumor and was unable to stand by, tried to rush to Kaito, but was scolded by the Underworld King and had to promise to be patient until the party was over.","<Afterword>","A Certain Maid : [No good! I have to ride it! This maid wave! To a new tea era, onward!]","Underworld King : [Stay.]","A Certain Maid : [Ah, errr I'll just have a quick word of greeting to Kaito-sama before the party]","Underworld King : [I'll ban the maid uniform, you know?]","A Certain Maid : [Auuuu I- I'll be patient until the party ends.]"]},{"number":1870,"title":"Chapter 1870: Before the Ship Party Starts 10","paragraphs":["It's naturally not only Demons who are invited to the party, but also the Gods. The criteria for someone to receive an invitation to this party was for one to have introduced themselves to Kaito. Regardless of whether they're a High-ranked God or a Low-ranked God, invitations have been sent to the Gods Kaito is acquainted with.","And now, Hina rushed up to one of the Gods who had finished logging-in in the reception lobby with a somewhat happy expression on her face.","[Sky-san! Hello!]","[Hello, Hina-san. That's a lovely dress, it suits Hina-san well.]","[Ehehe, thank you. It's my favorite dress, one that Kaito-senpai bought me before. Ah, your dress is also very nice, Sky-san! It got the feel of an elegant, mature lady, making you look cool!]","[Fufu, thank you.]","The God of Sky, who had guided Kaito and the others at the White God Festival, Sky smiled gently. Perhaps due to their compatible personalities, Hina fondly admires the gentle and kind Sky as if she were her older sister. Having received her Temporary Blessing, they continued to deepen their interactions even after the White God Festival, and having received word that she would be attending the party as well, she couldn't wait to come to the lobby to pick Sky up.","[How's your work as an adventurer going lately?]","[It's doing good. I went on an expedition with Aoi-senpai a while ago]","Sky, with a gentle smile on her lips, speaks kindly to the happily chattering Hina. While the concept of family is still not fully understood by Sky, one of the Gods where hierarchy exists but familial ties do not, it seems that she still finds her connection with Hina desirable, as if one looks at them by the side, they seem to exude an atmosphere akin to that of close sisters.","Smiling wryly at Hina's excited demeanor, Aoi, who had come to the lobby together with her, called out to the other God nearby the God who had bestowed a Temporary Blessing upon Aoi, Earth God, Gaia.","[Hello, Gaia-sama.]","[Yes, hello, Aoi-san. Nice to meet you today.]","[Nice to meet you too By the way, are Gaia-sama and Sky-sama being here alright?]","Since the White God Festival, Aoi has visited the God Realm multiple times with Hina and interacted with Gaia. Gaia is highly knowledgeable, especially regarding Earth Magic, which Aoi excels in, making Gaia someone Aoi highly respects.","Naturally, as a God, Gaia has authority over the earth and can do almost anything related to earth with her power. However, Gaia isn't one to rely solely on her Authority, and has mastered all the magic related to the earth. With her profound knowledge, Gaia provided various pieces of advice to Aoi, who was still in the midst of improvement, and the relationship between the two was good.","[Being here Ahh, you're wondering if we don't have to stay with Shallow Vernal-sama? We have been given special instructions this time, and due to the nature of this ship and the party, it's difficult for all the Gods to gather, so assisting Shallow Vernal-sama will be handled by the Supreme Gods The High-ranked God and Low-ranked Gods are instructed to attend the party as regular guests unless we receive instructions otherwise.]","[I see, it's true that no matter how big the ship is and how spacious the venue is, it's not possible for all the Gods to come. But thanks to that, it looks like I'll be able to talk with Gaia-sama leisurely, which makes me happy.]","[Now that you mentioned it, that also makes me happy. Even though I understand what event this is in knowledge, this is my first time attending a party like this, so there may be some things I could be careless about, so I hope Aoi-san can teach me about those things.]","[Ahaha, I wonder if there's anything I can teach Gaia-sama I will do my best.]","While they were having a peaceful conversation like this, Hina looked as if she suddenly realized something and asked Sky.","[Sky-san, you and Gaia-san came here together?]","[Ahh, no, we came together with the other High-ranked Gods who received an invitation as a group. As for the Low-ranked Gods. those like God of Love, who have temples in the Human Realm, it's faster to go from there, so they have come separately. Right now, they're over there at the reception de Ahh.]","[God of Sky? Is something the Oya]","Sky, mentioning that the other High-ranked Gods are also present, shifts her gaze but suddenly freezes, prompting Gaia to tilt her head in confusion and look in the same direction, to which an indescribable expression also appears on her face.","At the direction their gazes were at, near the reception desk, a High-ranked God who had come with them was facing a Demon who happened to be passing by.","[It's been a while, God of Ocean Marine-san.]","[Yes, it's been a while, Sea Dragon Eingana-san.]","They greeted each other by name. They were completely natural movements However, it was unknown if the onlookers were just seeing things or not, but it felt as if sparks flew between the two's clashing gazes.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Aaahhh, those two met huh]"]},{"number":1871,"title":"Chapter 1871: Before the Ship Party Starts 11","paragraphs":["The High-ranked God who governs the sea, God of Ocean Marine. She who rules the seas of the Demon Realm, one of the Dragon King's Executives, the Four Great Demon Dragons, Sea Dragon Eingana Those who know them know that the two of them don't get on well together.","This is mainly due to Marine's resentment towards Eingana, who is better known amongst the public, but Eingana herself is also prideful when it comes to sea-related matters and burns with a sense of rivalry.","[I see you're also here, Eingana-san.]","[Yes, Miyama Kaito-san is a person who is closely related to Magnawell-sama, and in the first place, this party will be held on the sea of the Demon Realm. Rather, I'm more surprised that you actually got acquainted with Miyama Kaito-san.]","[Hahaha, I suppose you're right. Eingana-san is the head of \"Demon Realm's\" seas after all.]","Keeping the smile pasted on her face, Marine spoke, emphasizing the \"Demon Realm\" part and clearly sensing the hostility in her words, Eingana defiantly grinned.","[Yes, I'm the one who rules the seas of the Demon Realm It's just, you see, whether it's the Demons or the Humans, when one speaks of the sea, they would tend to associate it with my name. I often get invited to events related to the Human Realm's seas, and I don't mean to brag, but apparently. I'm recognized as some kind of \"Guardian God of the Sea\".]","[.]","Eingana's clearly provocative words were indeed very effective against Marine, as upon hearing them, thick blue veins bulged on Marine's forehead, and the smile on her lips twisted.","In actuality, Eingana is far better known in the Human Realm, and in some regions, she's even recognized as the God of Sea.","As one of the Six Kings' Executives, she sometimes attends the Festival of Heroes and other events, she's already known as an Executive, and moreover, with her original form being a gigantic Sea Dragon exceeding 1000 meters, the impact of her presence is tremendous.","On the other hand, although she's the God who governs the sea, she doesn't have a temple in the Human Realm because she's a High-ranked God, and even though she's the direct subordinate of the God of Life, Life, she's third in line after Sky and Gaia, so her fame is rather low.","That's exactly the main reason why Marine has a strong rivalry with Eingana. Looking at such circumstances, one would think that Eingana would have an overwhelming advantage in their taunts but that's not actually the case.","[That really is great. I'm always amazed at how well-known Eingana-san is \"even though your sea-related abilities are far inferior to mine\"]","[]","With a snap, this time, a vein pops on Eingana's forehead. Yes, in terms of fame, Eingana certainly is overwhelmingly superior.","However, if one were to talk about abilities related to the sea, Marine, who possesses the Authority of the Sea, surpasses Eingana. The Authority is a power that can be considered the principle of the world, a higher power than magic so it's a pure fact that Eingana is almost certainly inferior to Marine when it comes to using abilities related to the sea.","And for Eingana, who has tremendous pride when it comes to sea-related matters, that is something unbearable and a look of anger was clearly evident in her eyes.","[Indeed, frustrating it may be, but I can't compete with Marine-san in terms of sea-related abilities. It is as one would expect from being part of the power of the God of the World, Shallow Vernal-sama. Yes, indeed, \"only when it comes to sea-related abilities\" Marine-san might be superior.]","[Is this just my imagination? If I were to take what you said as it is, it sounds like you're saying you're superior to me in everything other than my Authority]","[Is that what it sounded like? In that case, your ears certainly are quite normal.]","[..]","[..]","As some sort of snapping sound echoed in the area, the smiles on Marine and Eingana's faces simultaneously disappeared and their eyes were completely fixated on each other.","It was clearly a critical situation one where a fight could just break out in a few seconds but it didn't.","[The heck are you doing, you idiots? You lot trying to start a fight at my comrade's party]","[N- Nidzveld!? N- No, but this is a matter of non-negotiable pride]","[Do you intend to smear Magnawell-sama's name?]","[Ahh, no I'm sorry. I got too passionate.]","Rebuked by Nidzveld, Eingana, whose head had cooled down, realized the danger of starting a fight here and bowed her head.","Watching Eingana bowing down, Marine had a satisfied smirk creep up her lips, but at that moment, a sharp scythe was placed against her neck.","[The same goes for you, God of Ocean. If you intend to spoil this party that Shallow Vernal-sama is looking forward to, make sure you're prepared for the consequences.]","[My apologies. I was shallow Umm, I'm reflecting on this, so please down your scythe, God of Disasters.]","The God of Ocean was also reprimanded by the God of Disasters, Shea, another High-ranked God who had received an invitation from Kaito. As she regained her composure, Marine seemed to understand that she had gone too far. She quickly apologized with a remorseful expression on her face, then just like Eingana who was taken away by Nidzveld, she left with Shea, moving away from the scene.","After that, as a natural consequence of their actions, Marine and Eingana were strictly forbidden by Shea and Nidzveld respectively from coming within a certain distance of each other during the party.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Ohh, it's been quite a while since we've seen the cool Serious-senpai, Shea-san.]","Serious-senpai : [Eh? No, wait, when you say it like that, doesn't that make me the \"uncool one\"?]"]},{"number":1872,"title":"Chapter 1872: Before the Ship Party Starts 12","paragraphs":["On board the magic ship sailing across the vast ocean, in what could be called the Captain's, or rather, the Owner's Room, I was there.","There's a little more time before the party starts, and the participants are probably waiting in their rooms for the start of the party. Good gracious, I'm quite nervous, but I'm glad things are going well for now.","[So, why are you here, Shiro-san?]","Before I knew it, there was Shiro-san standing before me, who had just appeared with a flash of light. This is obvious, but Shiro-san also had a room assigned to her Of course, it's a VIP room.","I even handed her the room key the previous day, assuming that she might go to the reception area but why is she in my room?","[I've certainly been assigned my own room. However, putting that aside, I want to see Kaito-san, so I came here.]","[.]","As one would expect from someone who says \"I'm the rule\" on a daily basis, she tells me somewhat matter-of-factly the reason for her strong request too straightforwardly. She said it so naturally that for a moment, I almost found myself agreeing.","In front of the astounded me, Shiro-san continued with a somewhat proud expression.","[And so, until the party starts, we will]","[My child! Mother has come!!!]","[Makina-san!?]","Before Shiro-san can finish her words, Eden-san's main body Makina-san suddenly appears in the room again. Now that I can inherit memories from my dreams, I understand, but despite appearing bright and calm, I could still feel this madness that only Eden-san's main body possesses.","[E- Errr, Makina-san? Why are you here?]","[I thought my beloved child was nervous about your big day. At times like this, the person who can best heal the heart of my beloved child is me, your mother, so I came here to see you before your party starts! Are you happy? Ehehe, I see, you're that happy to see Mother~~ Mother also loves you, my beloved child!]","I haven't responded to her yet, and incidentally, far from being healed, it feels like my mentality is currently being whittled away. That said, are all Creator Gods this free-spirited?","[Can't say I'm impressed.]","[Eh? Arehh? Shallow Vernal?]","[For you to visit Kaito-san, who's already nervous as the party organizer, without informing them and behaving as you please, I can only say you're somewhat lacking in common sense.]","Amazing, that was really amazing, Shiro-san Completely disregarding how she herself had done the same in an instant, she began to protest to Makina-san.","[No, it's because he's nervous that I'm here trying to heal my beloved child's heart though?]","[You think trying to assert yourself here was for the best? For this party, Kaito-san did his best as the organizer without relying on the Six Kings or us. If you really care about Kaito-san, wouldn't it be best to refrain from doing unnecessary things and quietly wait for the party to begin?]","[D*mn it, i- if you put it that way I- Interfering would certainly dampen the efforts my beloved child had done Eh? Arehh? But what about you, Shallow Vernal?]","[I only came here to give my preliminary greetings. I was going to return to my room after saying a few words. After the party starts, Kaito-san will be busy attending to many guests, so I thought it would reduce Kaito-san's burden to greet him briefly beforehand.]","[Uuuu I- I see A- Alright. In that case, I'll also give my brief greetings before returning to my room.]","After hearing the words Shiro-san impassively said, Makina-san had a troubled expression on her face but perhaps feeling that Shiro-san had some truth to it, she slightly nodded, before turning to me.","[Well then, my beloved child. things might be tough for you since this is your first time, but do your best. If you run into trouble, don't hesitate to rely on Mother, okay?]","[Ah, yes. Thank you very much. I will do my best so that I can organize it well, so please enjoy your time, Makina-san.]","[Unn! Do your best! Then, I'm going back to my room~~]","After cheerfully saying so, Makina-san disappeared in a flash of light, probably heading to her own room. And so, that left Shiro-san and I in this room.","[Well then, I will also return to my room.","Although the word \"reluctant\" fits well with the atmosphere around her given what she said to Makina-san, it seems she couldn't just stay in my room by herself.","This is just my guess, but Shiro-san initially intended to stay in my room until the start of the party. However, seeing me overwhelmed by the sudden appearance of Makina-san, she changed her plans and chose to push aside her original purpose in favor of driving Makina-san away.","In other words, she prioritized my pre-party mental well-being she prioritized me before her own desires.","[Shiro-san, I'm actually quite nervous Well, there's nothing more for me to do before the party starts, but this is my first time hosting something like this, and when the party starts, I'll also need to lead things. Being alone, I find myself thinking about various things and can't relax So, if Shiro-san can spare me some time, would you mind talking with me for a while? Just long enough to have a cup of tea]","[.]","Hearing my words, seemingly not having expected it, Shiro-san blinked twice. However, she quickly seemed to understand my intention, as she smiled happily.","[I only intended to say my greetings, but if Kaito-san's asking me that, I just can't refuse you, right? In that case, I will be Kaito-san's chatting companion for a while.]","[Thank you, I appreciate it.]","Seeing Shiro-san speaking with a cheerful smile, I couldn't help feeling uplifted and found myself smiling.","And so, I spent the time until the start of the party chatting happily with Shiro-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Feels like Shiro's getting pumped up.]","? ? ? : [Yeah, maybe there's some sort of doya popping out of the sky or the sea by that time.]"]},{"number":1873,"title":"Chapter 1873: Intermission: Party Sideshows","paragraphs":["A little further back in time, when preparations for the ship party had just begun, I was in my room, making a guest list while talking to Alice.","[Kaito-san, Kaito-san.]","[Unn?]","[I was just thinking, I'm practically living here in Kaito-san's house, aren't I?]","[Well, if you put it that way, I think so.]","Alice basically accompanies me as my guard around the clock, so it wouldn't be wrong for one to say we practically live together.","Well, she tends to keep herself out of sight most of the time, apparently spending her nights relaxing on the roof, so it doesn't really feel like we're living together that much","[I do have my own resting spot, like over here]","[The heck are you doing, sliding down the wall of my room to reveal a mysterious hidden room as if it were a matter of course? Rather, I really want to ask in detail how many hidden features there are in this room that I don't know about]","[Ahaha, well, putting that aside]","[I don't really wanna put that matter aside but so?]","I really want to thoroughly investigate the hidden features of my room, but I feel like she might just casually dodge the question, so for the time being, let's focus on the main topic at hand.","[Well, in other words, what I'm saying is I'm practically part of Kaito-san's family too!]","[You mean you're going to help me with something? No, but you bringing that up at this timing should mean you're not talking about the party itself, but something else, right?]","[Oh, as expected of Kaito-san, you understand well. Well, I don't really mind helping out with the preparations, but that would kinda deviate from what Kaito-san and the others want to do.]","I also know quite well to a certain extent. If Alice intends to help with the party preparations, she would have mentioned it earlier back when we were still in the planning stage, so I could tell that if she's mentioning it now, it must be something other than the party itself.","She's considerate, so she probably doesn't intend to rain on the parade while me, Anima and the others are working hard as hosts. In fact, if Alice were to actually participate, it would likely end up being a situation where we could just leave everything to Alice, and that would be a repeat of what happened at the housewarming party.","[No, what I was talking about was regarding things like party sideshows, and I was thinking you could leave that to me. Ahh, it's not like I'll be doing anything strange, okay? It's more like performing music with instruments or showcasing some precious art pieces. I'll make sure to tell you what I plan to do in advance.]","[I see, we certainly didn't have enough hands to prepare party sideshows and the like. It would indeed be better to have such things rather than just meals and conversations all the time Hmmm, then, can I leave that to you? Of course, you'll have to consult with me and Anima about the content before making the final decision]","[Alrighty. Well, leave it to me since we're at it, I'll put out some of Alice-chan's treasured collections.]","[Are those proper ones?]","[Well, there's nothing weird among them. Look, Kaito-san probably already knows this, but I'm involved in various activities under different names, you know? I do blacksmithing, I do music, and I also do art Well, the reasons vary, whether it's for money or just to pass the time I've made quite a few things that I haven't showcased yet, so wouldn't it be interesting to unveil those as well?]","Ahh~~ In other words, she's going to introduce them as the Phantasmal King's treasured collection Most of the participants know that I'm close with Alice, or rather, that Alice is my lover, so such items being showcased here wouldn't be strange","[Is there a risk of those causing a commotion?]","[Hmmm. I have many famous creations in various fields, so people who know about them may be surprised, but I don't think it will cause an excessive amount of ruckus. They would just be treated as items owned by me, the Phantasmal King, rather than being possessions of Kaito-san.]","[I see, that would certainly be alright then.]","If they heard that those are my collection, it would cause a commotion again, but if it's just showcasing Phantasmal King Alice's collection as a sideshow, there shouldn't be any problem.","In the first place, Alice is very clever and I don't think she will cause a huge commotion. However, since she also enjoys surprising people, I think she would likely release items that would make people be amazed.","[I think the music could be in the form of playing in between, like we did for Kaito-san's birthday~~]","[It certainly feels more glamorous when there's music Unn. Then, since you're offering, I'll be counting on you. Ahh, but let me and Anima know in advance what you're going to do.]","[Yes, you don't have to worry about that.]","Just like that, I've decided to leave the party sideshows to Alice. I trust Alice, and I'm confident I can leave that to her","[That aside, why the sudden willingness to help out like that?]","[Well, there are all sorts of advanced and complicated reasons, but to put it simply I'm bored.]","[There's not a shred of depth to it]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even though he used to be very wary of her pranks, since she had become his girlfriend, she's often the one reining in the crazy people around him, so it seems like Kaito's trust in her has really increased.]","Makina : [Alice is devoted and kind, isn't she? But still, causing trouble not just for my child but also for Alice I suppose these crazy people need a talking-to from the Mother that I am.]","Serious-senpai : [No, you're on the very top of the list of those crazy people though!?]"]},{"number":1874,"title":"Chapter 1874: Ship Party 1","paragraphs":["Now then, the time for the party to start is finally approaching. Though I say that, Caraway is the one in charge of the general progress, Illness-san and Anima are in charge of overseeing the staff, and Eta and Theta are in charge of other minor situations. There are also the many excellent maids dispatched by the World Maid Association so to be honest, there's almost nothing for me to do.","I only have to say a few words at the beginning and make a toast, and then I go around and greet people I know and talk to them.","Incidentally, this time I decided to add a note to the invitations beforehand, saying that greetings to me are unnecessary or basically, for it not to be made.","The people invited to this party are mostly acquaintances of mine, and Anima thought it would be tough if they gathered around me, so I wrote in a very roundabout way that they should basically wait until I arrived at where they are, as I'll be going around. So, in essence, people shouldn't gather around me all of a sudden.","Incidentally, the reason I said \"mostly\" was because some of the guests had brought their escorts or assistants with them, so some of them had never met me before.","Also, the order in which I go around is also fixed to some extent. Anima has reminded me to definitely go to Shiro-san first.","After all, when the participants are ranked, Shiro-san and Makina-san are the highest-ranked beings here well, both are World Creators, so the most remarkable in this assembly hall.","Shiro-san and Makina-san are basically to be treated the same way, but since this is Shiro-san's world, she has slightly more priority than the other, so I go to her first.","Basically, the order of priority is Shiro-san, Makina-san, the Six Kings, the Supreme Gods, and the Three Rulers and after that, I'm free to go to anyone I see, so let's just do that.","Since they've taken the trouble to attend, I do want to have a conversation with each and every one of the guests at least once. However, considering that I don't have a lot of time to spend with each person, I'll need to be mindful of time as I move around.","[Master, the venue is ready and everything is all set. We will open the entrance in 5 minutes and make it possible for entry.]","[Unnn. I can just go in after them, right?]","[Yes, Master will enter through the backstage door after the invited guests have entered the hall. There's no problem if you go in first, but please wait until all the guests have arrived before you go onstage.]","[Alright.]","The venue where the party is held has a stage, some sort of platform, and the first greetings and Alice's sideshows will be held there.","Since it's just people I know, that should be okay to some extent but still, having to greet people on a stage is quite nerve-wracking","The participants began to gather one after another in the hall where the magic ship party would be held, and looking at the people gathering there, Lilia, who had arrived at the venue early, let out a sigh.","[How should I say this Looking at them again like this, it reaffirms how tremendous of a connection Kaito-san has.]","[God of Creation-sama and all of the Supreme Gods, the Six Kings and most of the Executives Even at Festivals of Heroes, people of such status wouldn't have gathered this much.]","[What's terrifying is that Miyama-sama got to know them in just 1-2 years and has gotten along so well that they happily attend his party. Good gracious, this unknown Lunamaria can't help but shudder.]","Sieglinde and Lunamaria, who were accompanying Lilia's muttering, also agreed. When it comes to gatherings similar to this, the first thing that comes to mind is the Festival of Heroes, but at the Festival of Heroes, the participation of the Six Kings' Executives is limited to one or two representatives per camp, accompanying each King. As for the Supreme Gods, Chronois was the only one attending to assist Shallow Vernal, and Fate and Life rarely appeared at the venue.","[Well, that still has nothing to do with me, so I could feel at ease.]","[Lili, as your good friend, I'll give you this advice. You really shouldn't be too optimistic]","[Eh? Sieg? No, in his party, as expected, people would gather towards Kaito-san With few nobles in attendance, there's not much for me to do]","[I agree with Sieg here. When Lili gets optimistic like that, something usually happens. Since we're also here, I hope we won't get dragged into it.]","[You too Luna!?]","Indeed, Lilia's argument makes sense. She's merely here as one of the invited guests, and while she's a Duchess with a relatively high status, it's low when compared to the others gathered here, so the likelihood of attention being focused on her is rather low is what the person herself had predicted.","Of course, as Sieglinde and Lunamaria feared, Lilia's relaxed expression would crumble within minutes of the party starting.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Seems like Lilia would be struck with a body blow right away.]"]},{"number":1875,"title":"Chapter 1875: Intermission: Ordinary People at the Venue","paragraphs":["In the ship party hosted by Kaito, it's fair to say that there are almost no complete commoners. For example, Mizuhara Kaori and Mikumo Akane may refer to themselves as commoners, but they are otherworlders and former Hero Actors.","Even Kaito's parents, they have received the blessings of the God of Fate and can hardly be described as commoners. Sieglinde and Lunamaria are also naturally out of the ordinary, and there are few people who are completely ordinary and could be called a commoner.","And now, Greene and Anne, who are in a sense, that scarce complete commoners were shivering with pale faces at the edge of the venue.","[U- Umm, Anne-san? I- I'm a bit dizzy, short of breath and my heart's beating fast Y- You mind if I go to the infirmary?]","[Please stop that. Please don't leave me in a horrible place like this. I mean, Greene-san Even though you were so motivated in the waiting room earlier]","[N- No, but umm Don't you think we should go through much more stages first!? I did say that I wanted to meet rich people. I did say that but I thought they'd be lower-class nobles or wealthy merchants. I assumed I could make friends with people in that area and, if possible, enter the social circles I longed for I assumed the most remarkable one would at most be a Count! The top of each realm appearing here had never even crossed my mind!]","Yes, the two didn't know any of the other participants because they had moved to the waiting room immediately after going through the reception. Although they encountered Tiamat on the way, she was in her Humanized form and the two were unaware that she was a Six King Executive.","After getting used to the luxurious atmosphere of the ship to some extent in the waiting room, they finally arrived at the venue for the main event where they found the pinnacles of each realm, the Six Kings' Executives and other famous people People far beyond who they expected.","[B- By the way, are you alright there, Anne-san?]","[I feel like crying and feel like I'm about to puke This isn't just at the level of being out of place I- I mean, t- t- t- the one over there That is the God of Creation Shallow Vernal-sama right?]","[Ahh, if Anne-san can see her too, then that isn't my hallucination I'm seeing from being extremely nervous, but the real one Does Shallow Vernal-sama ever appear at events other than the Festival of Heroes?]","[If only I hadn't seen her here with my own eyes, I could have said she doesn't R- Rather, are we even allowed to be in the same space as Shallow Vernal-sama and breathe the same air as her? Wouldn't that be disrespectful]","They both looked at Shallow Vernal, who was standing gracefully, and considering that the Supreme Gods were behind her, the two were certain that she was the real one.","However, Greene and Anne had only seen Shallow Vernal from a distance even at the Festival of Heroes, and they were trembling with fear at the mere thought of being in the same venue.","[Greene-san.]","[What is it?]","[Just who is Kaito-san? Could it be that we just didn't know it and he's actually the ruler of this world?]","[H- He himself said he's an otherworlder For all these prestigious figures to gather at a party organized by an ordinary otherworlder is very H- How should I say this? Are we perhaps involved in something incredibly absurd?]","[Yeah, we're in an absurdly frightening situation alright? I- Is it alright if we don't kneel? W- We won't just be beheaded the next moment, right]","[D- Don't say frightening things. I- It's alright. The other people here are also being usual being usual Why are they all so unconcerned with Shallow Vernal-sama being here This should have been quite a big deal but On second thought, could that actually be an illusion both me and Anne-san are seeing?]","For most of the people here, it's a well-known fact that Shallow Vernal is Kaito's lover, and there's nothing particularly surprising about her presence at the party organized by Kaito.","However, Greene and Anne, who didn't know that, could only feel restless, moving their gazes around.","[Anne-san, as I thought I'll go to the infirmary]","[If you can leave the venue in front of all these people, gathering all their attention, then feel free.]","[I'll stop.]","[For the time being, let's just stick to the wall. J- Just approaching them might be disrespectful. Let's keep as much distance as possible]","[Y- You're right.]","Thinking that they had ended up in an unbelievable realm of monsters, they huddled against the wall, trying to make themselves as inconspicuous as possible.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh, I see These guys, unlike the other Stomachache Warriors, came here without knowing much about Kaito's social circle How pitiful]"]},{"number":1876,"title":"Chapter 1876: Intermission: Ordinary People at the Venue?","paragraphs":["Greene and Anne, who had been standing in a corner of the venue while hiding their breath, had to some extent regained their composure and looked at the venue again.","[God of Creation-sama, the Supreme Gods, the Six Kings, the Six Kings' Executives, the three countries' rulers There are also High-ranked and Low-ranked Gods, Founder-sama and one of the Heroes, Fors-sama So many powerful people are here that you could say they're all here]","[Right. However, there are fewer nobles around Ahh, that one is!?]","[Unn? Do you know her?]","After nodding her head in agreement, Anne followed Greene's gaze as she seemed to have been surprised after seeing someone. At the end of her gaze were three people: Lilia, Lunamaria and Sieglinde. However, Anne, who was unfamiliar with noble society, didn't know who they were.","[Anne-san, you don't know who she is!? That's Duchess Lilia Albert, the noble with the greatest influence at the moment!]","[A- Ahh, one of Symphonia's Three Flowers This was the first time I'd seen her, so I didn't know what she looked like. By the way, is that influential noble ranking something you got from a well-known magazine?]","[No, it's a ranking made up by me and a friend.]","[Then how would I know about it!?]","Greene, who admired noble society from the start, had been creating rankings about nobles with a like-minded friend and Flying Board teammate, and Lilia was at the top of that list.","As that ranking was something Greene enjoyed only with her friends, Anne would never know about such a ranking","[A- Anyhow, that would make her an amazing noble then?]","[That's right! Albert Duchy has risen to be called the top of Symphonia Kingdom nobility in just a few years. It's a tremendous noble family.]","[Fumu, I'm not familiar with noble society, but that must mean they're pretty excellent.]","[When it comes to Dukes, their aura truly changes, doesn't it? While I do have a desire to speak with her, the difference in our status is just too much, isn't it?]","[Rather, I think there are few that people of our status can call out]","Observing Greene, who had regained her composure, wondering if she had become accustomed to the unusual atmosphere of the venue or it's just because she was originally such a fad-chaser, a wry smile appears on Anne's lips.","At the same time, Kaori and Akane, who are also in a sense considered ordinary people, had heard about this before, but now, faced with the enormity of Kaito's connections yet again, they had an indescribable expression on their faces.","[It's really amazing. I mean, isn't this more amazing than the Festival of Heroes?]","[It's certainly amazing. At the Festival of Heroes, it would basically be one or two Executives accompanying the Six Kings, so having almost every one of them gathered here like this is quite the unusual one among the unprecedented events.]","[Rather, what do we do once the party starts? None of them seem like ones we can just casually strike up a conversation with.]","[Right I just feel terrified thinking I might do something rude]","[There's no need to be anxious, my children.]","[ [ ! ? ] ]","As Kaori and Akane were feeling somewhat intimidated by the impressive gathering, they heard a familiar voice, and when they turned around, there stood a god with 20 wings floating behind her Eden.","This Eden is a being operated by Makina through Thought Division, and for Kaori and Akane, she's someone they had met once before.","[Eden-sama!? You're here.]","[If it isn't Eden-sama, it's been a while.]","Kaori and Akane also knew that Eden was the God of the otherworld the God of their original world, so they greeted her respectfully. Thereupon, Eden gently smiled and reached out to pat Kaori and Akane's heads.","[Yes, I'm also relieved to see that both of you look well. Given the atmosphere of the situation, it's natural to feel a bit overwhelmed, but I'll also be attending this party, so if you ever find yourself troubled, don't hesitate to rely on me.]","[Eden-sama Thank you very much!]","[Your words are really reassuring.]","At Eden's words, Kaori looked happy, while Akane responded with a relieved look on her face. For them. Eden was an extremely kind and gentle God, who had shown concern and offered help during their previous encounter, and because of this, they had a great deal of trust in her.","Or rather, Eden might seem like someone reliable for both of them since she doesn't go out of control unlike when she's with Kaito.","[Well then, I will go and talk to my other children. As for you girls, you don't have to get too worked up and just enjoy the party.]","[ [ Yes! ] ]","[That's a good answer. I'll talk to you later when I have the chance.]","Saying that, Eden gave both of them another pat on the head before heading towards the other otherworlders like Shigenobu and Seigi.","Watching Eden from a distance, Alice approached the nearby Makina with an indescribably astounded look on her face.","[You know, it would be great if you could be like that with Kaito-san too.]","[No, it's not like my rampages around my beloved child are intentional. It's just that my love for my beloved child is so overwhelming that it bursts like a supernova.]","[I see Haahhh Even though it's to prevent this guy from ruining Kaito's party, am I really gonna be on Makina duty all day today Prepare yourself to be punched immediately.]","[Why do you look like me being punched is already a given?]","Seeing Makina, who seemed to want to say something but couldn't, Alice let out a heavy sigh.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It's interesting how she's become a God that Kaori and the others can rely on]","? ? ? : [Ah, by the way, it looks like the party's gonna start in the next chapter.]"]},{"number":1877,"title":"Chapter 1877: Ship Party 2","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I got home late today, so today's chapter is short.","As the time to start the party draws near, I peek at the venue from the side of the stage, where almost all of the participants have gathered. Hmmm, I'm the one who invited them all to this party, but looking at all these people again like this, it's quite an amazing sight.","Especially at a gathering like this, Shiro-san's presence could be described as exceptional. Just by being present in the venue, she seems to radiate this amazing aura around her.","And of course, there were also those who looked anxious in the venue. For this party, I had really sent out invitations to those I was acquainted with, so there weren't only powerful and well-known people, but also ordinary people attending.","But even so, I think things are alright to some extent. For example, Mary-san, the President of the Flying Dragon Flight, has been in contact with Fafnir-san and Frea-san, and in the first place, she's the owner and hired president of Lilia-san, so to some extent, she knows people in this venue as well.","For example, Chapel-san, the manager of the Monster Race, is a bit of a question mark as far as friendships are concerned, but he's in charge of the Monster Race and is acquainted with Chris-san and the Dragon King camp to some extent. In fact, he's quite the capable guy, so even if he doesn't know anyone here, it seems he's able to expand his network skillfully.","As for Kaori-san and Akane-san, well, they are somewhat acquainted with the people at the venue, and seeing that the two of them are close, it's somewhat reassuring that they're together. As for Shigenobu-san and his wife, as they are friends of Rei-san and Fia-san, I had seen the four of them together.","The most worrying ones in the party though would be Greene-san and Anne-san. I had invited them because we had exchanged contact details at the Flying Board afterparty, but they hadn't interacted with most of the people in the room, and were instead looking pale at the edge of the room, seemingly overwhelmed by all the guests.","In fact, I had thought about the worries of Greene-san and Anne-san being isolated in the venue, so I asked Aoi-chan and Hina-chan in advance to talk to them when the party started. The two of them are somewhat acquainted with each other from the Flying Board afterparty, so I thought Greene-san and Anne-san would feel at ease but I may have blundered a bit. I should have asked my kouhais to speak to them before the party, rather than after it had started.","In fact, what would be most ideal for Greene-san and Anne-san would be for me to call on them and then follow up by introducing them to the others but that would be difficult to do immediately after the party starts. As expected, it would be difficult for me to just ignore Shiro-san, the Six Kings, the Supreme Gods and the rulers of the three countries and head straight to them, so for a while, I plan to rely on Aoi-chan and Hina-chan to handle things on that side somehow.","Once the greetings are done to some extent, I'll head there as soon as possible and then kindly introduce them to others someone like Camellia-san and make an effort to help them get accustomed to the party to some extent.","As I was thinking about that, it seems like all the participants have gathered in the venue. Caraway stepped onto the stage and standing in front of the Voice Amplification Magic Tool, taking on the role of emcee, the party finally began.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh, so he did think about Greene and Anne huh]","? ? ? : [Aoi-san and Hina-san Two High-ranking Gods might also come as a set!!!]","Serious-senpai : [Let's stop right there.]"]},{"number":1878,"title":"Chapter 1878: Ship Party 3","paragraphs":["Before the party starts, Caraway gives a brief explanation and introduction. That is because the food served at this party is from my homeworld, otherworld cuisine or rather, Japanese cuisine is the main focus, and to be honest, there are many dishes that aren't really suitable for standing buffet-style.","Therefore, we've also prepared tables where one can sit and eat, so there's no problem having conversations while dining there.","As for the rest, it was written in the invitation beforehand, but basically, the guests were reminded again that I was the one who would come to greet them, so they were told not to gather around me, and after informing them of the scheduled times for entertainment, it was finally time for me to give my greeting.","\"Despite the sudden impulse, thank you for attending the party I organized today.\"","And so, Caraway urged me to go up on stage and use the Loudspeaker Magic Tool to give my greetings. Since most of the guests are acquaintances, I'm somewhat relieved, but still, giving a speech in front of this many people is quite nerve-wracking.","Well, I thought up the content of my greeting and Anima and Illness-san corrected it, so as long as I don't stutter or something, I think I'll be fine.","\"And so, I hope everyone can enjoy today as much as time allows. A brief introduction it may be, but this concludes my greetings, and I would like to make a toast to signal the start of the party.\"","You don't necessarily have to make a toast at a party, but since I'm the one hosting this party The plan is based on what I imagine a standing party to be like, so we're going to start it with a toast.","\"As for the signaling toast Due to the person's request, it will be the God of this world, Shiro-san, who will be performing the toast. And so, Shiro-san, take it away.\"","Yes, actually, it wasn't me who would be giving the signal toast this time. No, at first, I was planning to do it myself, but Shiro-san wanted to do it, so I decided to leave it to her. Incidentally, as for the reason why she wanted to do it, I could guess from what she said to Kuro afterward: \"Kuro provided the venue, the ship, but I'm helping Kaito-san to give the toast signal, so this time's match is a draw\".","In addition, the straightforward response \"..No, rather than draw I don't remember us competing in any way though\" Kuro gave back to her left quite the impression in my mind.","Well, in any case, there's no one who would complain about Shiro-san giving the toast, so in a way, it can be said that there's no problem at all.","Then, Shiro-san, who came on stage at my prompting, slightly raised her glass","\"Well then, cheers.\"","\"Please wait right there, aren't you being too quick!?\"","Exhibiting the usual airheadedness, she gave the signal toast with zero preamble before the other participants had even set up their glasses. What's frightening is that if I didn't complain, Shiro-san's signal toast would not only be fine, but \"those who couldn't respond to her toast would be instead considered disrespectful\".","Well, I already expected Shiro-san to act airheadedly, so I had no choice but to follow her up.","\"Excuse my intrusion. Now then, everyone, please hold your glasses in your hands. Then, following Shiro-san's signal, I would like everyone to make a toast.\"","After conveying that to everyone and taking control of the situation, we started over, raising our glasses once again, and with Shiro-san's words, we made the toast and the party officially began.","As long as everyone enjoys themselves in their own way, everything should be fine now What concerns me now though is Shiro-san, who doesn't look like she had any intention of getting off the stage.","[Shiro-san? The signal toast is over, you know?]","[Yes. However, Kaito-san would be coming to greet me first, yes? I will be the one you're greeting at the start so I'm the first.]","[Errr, yes, that's right.]","[Well then, isn't it fine if you stay with me like this now?]","[Well it's not like we can't do that but for the time being, how about we go to where Chronois-san and the others are first?]","[I understand.]","I understand the point Shiro-san is making there. She was really emphasizing that \"first\" part, but well, let's not worry about that. However, we couldn't just stay on this stage and chat with Shiro-san, so I decided to go to where the three Supreme Gods were for the time being.","[By the way, Kaito-san.]","[Yes?]","[What number am I for the greetings?]","[Eh? No, like I said, you're the first.]","[Fumu, so in that order, I'm the first huh?]","[Yes, yes, you're the first.]","[I see, is that so, is that so.]","Hearing my words, Shiro-san nodded, kinda looking very satisfied. It's just, I'm begging you, please don't go and assert dominance over Kuro for this later I feel like you'd just end up picking a fight with her","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, it's true that the only ones who can really complain to Shiro at the venue are Kuro and Kaito maybe Makina can do it too?]","Makina : [I can, but I don't want to. I have a bit of trauma when it comes to Shallow Vernal as long as it doesn't involve my beloved child, I don't want to do anything confrontational against her, and just thinking of doing that scares me.]","Serious-senpai : [Even though you were fighting her for the silliest of reasons back at the housewarming party No, well, I guess that one has something to do with Kaito but]"]},{"number":1879,"title":"Chapter 1879: Ship Party 4","paragraphs":["Together with Shiro-san, we moved to the area where Chronois-san, Fate-san and Life-san are. There seems to be no other High-ranked or Low-ranked God present, so it seems that during the party, it will basically be just the three Supreme Gods who will be waiting by Shiro-san's side.","[Well, even though we call it a greeting, I've already met Shiro-san before the party, so you could say our greetings are over I guess it would be more like a light chat?]","[I see Well then, let's have that.]","When Shiro-san said that and lightly waved her hand, a table and chairs appeared No, well, nevermind. It's not surprising for someone like Shiro-san to say something like that.","[Chronois-san, Fate-san, Life-san, thank you for coming today.]","[Yeah, I think Miyama also has a lot of things you're unfamiliar with as a first-time organizer, but try not to stress yourself out too much.]","[Kai-chaaaaan! I can't talk to Kai-chan during the party because I'm assisting Shallow Vernal-sama now, but let's make out later!]","[You can just leave that to me and God of Time and Space and talk with him at the right moment though No, I suppose if you go with that, you may end up worrying about how things are like here and can't relax.]","While I'm at it, I also lightly greeted the three Supreme Gods. It would be unnatural to come close and not greet them, so there shouldn't be any issue with the order in this regard.","Just to clarify though, since Shiro-san is my main focus at the moment, I'll keep my greetings with them brief and then engage in small talk with Shiro-san. As for Fate-san, as she herself suggested, I'll make time later for her as she mentioned. As Life-san said, trying to force time might make Fate-san feel anxious about Shiro-san, so having it that way might be better.","[Come to think of it, it's a party with food but I don't often get the chance to see Shiro-san eating huh? When we went on a date to the beach, at the Six Kings Festival, and when we went swimming at the beach with everyone I tend to see you eating when we're near the sea.]","[Now that you mentioned it, indeed. This time too, in a broader sense, you could say we've come to the sea this time, so to maintain balance, wouldn't it be good for Kaito-san to invite me to eat somewhere other than near the sea?]","[That sounds like fun, but if Shiro-san goes to eat at a normal restaurant, it would cause quite a ruckus Ahh~~ Then, for example, eating together in my room might be okay.]","Shiro-san going to a normal restaurant for a meal would cause a different kind of problem from going there with Isis-san. After all, that would cause a commotion and the Gods would shift to a state of high alert, so I can only foresee a future where there would be a big fuss, both in the country where the restaurant is located and in the restaurant itself.","Well, that's why most of the time when I've eaten with Shiro-san in the past, it's been in situations where there weren't many other people around There was also that time when she made me a bento though.","Anyhow, in that case, it's perfectly normal to invite her to my house and have a meal together with her there. Well, Shiro-san basically doesn't eat meals, so there may be no need to force her to eat with me","[I see, then I look forward to it.]","[Unn? Arehh? Is it already decided that we're having a meal together in my room?]","[Yes. I'm looking forward to it.]","[I- I understand. I'll think about this again some other time.]","From the quiet, yet undeniable sense of certainty conveyed by Shiro-san, it was decided that next time, Shiro-san would be invited to my house for a meal together.","W- Well, I'm not averse to having dinner with Shiro-san, and I'm actually quite looking forward to it. While I'm at it, how about I serve her my homemade meals No, I can only cook simple dishes, so wouldn't that be rude? In that case, having dishes prepared by the chef would be more preferable","[Kaito-san, I believe what is needed in cooking isn't skill, but love.]","[Eh? Ah, yes.]","[A homemade meal cooked for your lover, done with all your hard work and ingenuity, that must be really wonderful. I'd like to try it once myself.]","A roundabout appeal No, rather than roundabout, this feels more like a straightforward request. Since Shiro-san can read my mind, it's only natural that she'd pick up on the momentary thought of me considering making homemade dishes. It seems like Shiro-san strongly endorses that.","[A- Alright. I'll do my best but please don't expect too much.]","[I understand. I'll look forward to it from the bottom of my heart.]","Arehh? That's strange, my words aren't getting through I told her not to expect too much, but then she said she was quite looking forward to it.","At any rate, after this party is over, let's practice cooking. Even now, I still occasionally cook with the help of someone who teaches me, but let's try learning how to cook more thoroughly.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Next would be that crazy God Arehh? But to which Makina would he go? The one recognized in that world as Earth God is her Eden self]"]},{"number":1880,"title":"Chapter 1880: Ship Party 5","paragraphs":["After chatting with Shiro-san to some extent, I'm off towards where Makina-san is next. No, that may have been a bit of a misnomer. It would be more correct to say I'm off towards where Makina-san and Eden-san are.","Well, both Makina-san and Eden-san are participating in this party. They are technically the same person, but perhaps because the people of this world are more familiar with her Eden identity, Eden-san is operating at the same time as Makina-san.","I don't really understand the logic behind it, but I suppose it would be something like how Alice is like with her clones.","[My beloved child, welcome! I'm so glad you came to see Mother!]","[Hello, Makina-san That said, we already met before the party Errr, hello to you too, Eden-san?]","[For my child to greet this me too, my child really is very kind.]","Hmmm Arehh? Dunno if it's just my imagination, but this Eden-san somehow feels calmer. No, even when Makina-san isn't on a rampage, she tends to refer to me as \"my beloved child\", making me hard to distinguish Makina-san from Eden-san, but if Eden-san doesn't refer to me as \"my beloved child\", she's likely in a considerably calm state.","While I was having doubts about this, Alice, who was next to Makina-san, called out to me with a somewhat astounded expression on her face.","[Ahh~~ I can somewhat understand what Kaito-san is thinking. You'll probably also be taken aback if you hear about the details, but I'll explain it to you. It seems like that terminal over there, Eden, had been interacting with the past Hero Actors over there, and she's aiming to keep herself calm and composed so as not to break their image of her.]","Errr, in other words, because the other otherworlders such as Kaori-san and Akane-san don't know about Eden-san's outbursts, so in order not to destroy the image she had in their mind, Eden-san is keeping herself calm If that's the case, it seems like she's trying to prevent herself from going on a rampage, but if she can do that, doesn't that mean she can usually restrain herself?","[That's right, my beloved child! As a mother, I also want to preserve the image my children had of me. But rest assured, my beloved child, my love for you will be firmly expressed from my side! If it's pampering you want, it's a pampering this me will give! While we're at it, my beloved child can come and leap into my bosom! Or rather, just leap here already. Come, be filled with Mother's overflowing lo Ouch!?]","Ahh, I see The rampages are being done on Makina-san's side huh Come to think of it, since a while ago, it's mostly been Makina-san who's been talking, so it seems like conversations with me, which might result in her going on a rampage, will mainly be conducted by Makina-san.","Just as Makina-san started saying strange things, Alice's fist was immediately slammed into her face without hesitation.","[A- Alice that hurts Alice said you'd never let me participate unless I've reduced this body's power, so the power of this terminal had been reduced, so if you hit me with a strike with that power, it'll normally hurt, you know?]","[Isn't that obvious? I'm hitting you in a way that hurts you I mean, Makina, with the way things are going, it seems like I'm almost exclusively assigned to deal with you during the party, so I'm at my wits' end here. If I see even the slightest sign of you about to cause trouble, I won't hesitate to give you a good punch.]","[Hyiiihhh Your eyes They're really serious]","Indeed, Alice's presence here is truly invaluable. Given that Makina-san and Alice are best friends, Makina-san tends to be quite indulgent towards Alice. Alice's influence in restraining Makina-san, even greater than Shiro-san's or Kuro's, is quite effective.","Up until now, to prevent Shiro-san from realizing that she was meeting up with me in my dreams, Makina-san temporarily erased her existence from my memory, including her connection with Alice, and Alice was being considerate of that as well.","However, thanks to the lifting of that restriction, Alice can now proudly go around suppressing her like this, which is really reassuring. No, I know it's quite rough for Alice but a rampaging Makina-san is seriously dangerous, so I really wish she would do her best to restrain her.","[Look here, Makina. If you go on a rampage this time, I'll hand all the photos from our previous trip together on a luxury liner to Kaito-san.]","[Can you not!? You'd totally break my calm and reliable mother image here!!! Heck, you still have those!? I told you to get rid of those before!!!]","I don't know what kind of pictures those are, but I never thought of Makina-san as a calm and reliable mother, so I don't think she has to worry about ruining her image.","[For me, those are pictures of happy memories with my dear best friend though. There's no way I can get rid of it]","[Ahh, I- I see. In that case, it can't be helped When you say it like that, I can't just forcefully demand you dispose of them. H- However, it's embarrassing, so don't show them to anyone else.]","Despite Makina-san's vehement protest, the fact that she readily forgave Alice with just a few words from her, Makina-san really is quite indulgent towards Alice or rather, Makina-san is quite gullible.","I mean, can she not see Alice's evil smile over there, looking as if everything is going according to her plan? Well, regardless, having Alice involved in this party brings relief to Makina-san-related stuff, and that's something I'm really grateful for.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [What an excellent Makina Caretaker. I mean, Makina is actually very lenient with Alice in a different way from when she's with Kaito, and in a sense, the only person who can perfectly control Makina is Alice It's decided she'd also be on Makina Duty in the future huh.]","? ? ? : [Please stop. How much more burden do you want to place on Alice-chan's shoulders]"]},{"number":1881,"title":"Chapter 1881: Ship Party 6","paragraphs":["After I finished greeting Shiro-san and Makina-san, I also finished my greetings with the Three Supreme Gods while I was at it, I also greeted Alice. Now, if I finish greeting the other Six Kings and Human Realm's Three Rulers, I can do the other greetings in a relatively free order.","And so, I next came to Kuro.","[Ah, Kaito-kun! Welcome.]","[Unn. Kuro, thanks for coming today or rather, you have quite a large group with you here.]","[Ahaha, our family is all sticking together at the beginning of the party. We'll gradually enjoy the party in our separate smaller groups later.]","Among the Six King factions, the greatest number of acquaintances I have are part of the Underworld King camp. Even excluding Kuro, there's Ein-san, Zwei-san, Tre-san, Vier-san, Funf-san, Sechs-san, Raz-san, Acht, Eva, Neun-san, Sei-san, Cento-san, Cien-san, Roze-san There are also the people I met when I went to visit Kuro's home, so it's a considerable number of people all together.","Well, the party had indeed just started, so it's understandable that they've gathered, and as Kuro said, they will probably scatter in smaller groups in a little while. Also, while we were at it, since everyone had gathered here, I greeted everyone and gave them a light bow.","[That said, Kaito-kun had planned quite an amazing party huh.]","[I kinda had the idea of making effective use of the magic ship Kuro gave me, so it's actually more of a spontaneous plan At first, I was thinking it would be more like a small-scale home party, but the magic ship turned out to be more luxurious than I expected, making it feel like a very splendid party.]","[Ahh, I see, I did give this ship to you before.]","After hearing my words, Kuro momentarily had a bewildered expression on her face, then looked as if she just remembered something. It kinda seemed like she completely forgot about giving me this magic ship, but as for the reason well, I think I have some idea what that is.","[Kuro, seriously just so you could naturally give me a magic box, you just gave me something with a size that wouldn't fit a normal magic box]","[But I wanted Kaito-kun's magic box to be something I made.]","[No, well, that makes me happy Now that I think about it, even without the magic ship, my previous magic box was insufficient in size, so it's a good thing I received a large-capacity magic box from Kuro.]","[Ehehe, I'm glad to hear that. No, actually, during our first barbecue, Sechs and the others said that if it were too large, you wouldn't really know what to do with it, which I remember agreeing Back then, none of us expected Kaito-kun to become this amazing.]","[Same here I really couldn't have predicted things to turn out this way back then.]","At the barbecue I was invited to shortly after arriving in this world, Kuro expressed a desire to make my magic box herself. However, she didn't force the issue because she agreed with what Acht and the others had said.","No, seriously, I never imagined at that time that I'd find a magic box with a house-size capacity to be insufficient Well, I mean, the capacity squeeze is almost entirely due to the stuff Magnawell-san kept on giving me","[But you know, it's interesting how with various interactions, you have grown to become more splendid Of course, that in itself is amazing, but for me, what truly makes me happy is seeing Kaito-kun, who was a bit downcast at first, now facing forward confidently and lively.]","[I had found a little too many treasures after all]","[Fufu, I see Kaito-kun has become quite the master treasure hunter huh.]","Kuro smiles kindly at me and I smile back. In fact, there were many factors that helped with my life, and there were many things I didn't know at that time but I was still able to change. The reason I was able to change had to be because of my encounter with Kuro.","When I think back on that time, I feel deeply moved feeling a little proud that I was able to change properly.","[Hmm, I'd like to have a little more leisurely chat, but I have to go round to the others]","[Ahh, you're right. I can't have you here for too long.]","[I'll come by again later if I have time. Well then]","[Kaito-kun, wait a moment.]","[Unn?]","[Can you crouch down a little bit?]","[Eh? Like this?]","There are still many people for me to go around for greetings, so I can chat with her for too long. After the necessary greetings, if there's enough time, I would like to come back to chat with her again, but for now, it's about time we cut the conversation short.","I was about to tell her so with that thought in mind, but right after, Kuro asked me to crouch down, but as I complied with doubts in mind Kuro naturally brought her face close to mine and lightly kissed me on the cheek.","[Kaito-kun, I love you much, much more than back then.]","Then, after whispering in my ear so that only I could hear, she gave me a somewhat mischievous, joyful smile.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Guaaahhh, w- what are you doing!? You're just supposed to be going around to say hello! It was supposed to be just a casual chat, with the lovey-dovey time postponed, right!!!?]","? ? ? : [Putting aside me questioning what promise you're talking about, the reason you've been acting so relaxed up until now, it's because you were confident that such a situation wouldn't come for a while huh]"]},{"number":1882,"title":"Chapter 1882: Ship Party 7","paragraphs":["This might be sudden, but among the three best friends Lilia, Sieglinde and Lunamaria, Lunamaria was usually the one acting as the brain of the group.","She isn't only smart, but also insightful. Feeling a vague sense of unease, Lunamaria's gaze shifted around, and as a result, she observed the people in the venue and their movements to some extent and arrived at an answer.","[Well then, let's have a quick hello to the people we know and have a meal]","[No, I'm afraid we're unable to do that, Milady.]","[Eh?]","In response to Lilia's somewhat relaxed suggestion, Lunamaria answered, a hint of pity held within her eyes. Upon hearing those words, Lilia momentarily looked anxious, but quickly regained her composure or rather, seemingly deceiving herself, she put on a smile.","[What are you saying, Luna? This time's party has nothing to do]","[No, I've always had this vague feeling of unease, but I now know why I see, Miyama-sama had truly been triggering stomachaches to destroy Milady's stomach on a daily basis.]","[No, it's not like Kaito-san is doing it intentionally]","Sieglinde lightly interjected, but not reacting to it, Lunamaria continued with a solemn expression on her face.","[But at the same time he gives Milady stomachaches, Miyama-sama was also a powerful bulwark that protects Milady.]","[W- What do you mean?]","[Let's put things into perspective first. Milady is arguably the most famous noble within the Symphonia Kingdom, and even without that, you're a rare genius among Humans who gained combat prowess equal to that of a Count-rank in a short period of time. Even without considering the Goddess of Time's Blessing, there should be many who have taken an interest in Milady, especially those who observed the previous battle in the God Realm. In particular, the Six Kings' Executives might want to have a conversation with Milady, given your connection with the Six Kings.]","[.]","Lilia would sometimes be optimistic, but she's still intelligent. Just as Lunamaria started explaining, Lilia turned pale, seemingly having some idea what Lunamaria was trying to say.","[Rather, many probably had the desire to meet and talk with you way before this. However, when visiting Milady's mansion in the Human Realm, the presence of Miyama-sama's mansion adjacent to your mansion inevitably weighs heavily in their minds. They can't just come near Miyama-sama's residence without giving their greetings to Miyama-sama, who has deep connections with the Six Kings, and perhaps thinking that they would be bothering Miyama-sama, they were showing restraint or perhaps, it's possible that someone like Alice-sama had directly imposed some sort of restriction on them.]","[Come to think of it, there were no actual visits to Lili's mansion by any of the Six Kings' Executives other than those brought by Kaito-san.]","Thinking about it again, they thought of that as unnatural. Lilia's name is quite well-known even in the Demon Realm, and many High-ranking Demons are paying attention to her talent, which allowed her to reach the level of a Count-rank in just under 20 years. Especially for people like Epsilon and Kong, who are part of the War King's Five Generals, given her strength, it's not surprising that they would hold a strong interest in Lilia.","However, there have been no instances of such Six Kings' Executives visiting Lilia's mansion and asking to meet her. The only exception to this was Fafnir, who visits her due to their mutual connection with the Flying Dragon Flight, so as Lunamaria had predicted, there was a high possibility that Alice or someone else had intervened in some way.","[That's not all. Indeed, Milady had met many distinguished people in the past, but Miyama-sama was generally present on such occasions, wasn't he? In that case, since Miyama-sama generally handled such matters, doesn't that mean there weren't many opportunities for them to directly interact with Milady?]","[T- That's true, I did feel pain in my stomach at those times but most of the time, they were just light greetings.]","[Yes, but Miyama-sama isn't present now. As Milady has also hosted a few parties, you should already know this, but given the scale of this party, Miyama-sama would mostly just be going around greeting the guests, and the chances of him coming here are extremely low.]","[U- Umm, Luna I understand what you're trying to say b- but Luna, couldn't it be possible t- that you're just overthinking things?]","Perhaps realizing the situation awaiting her, Lilia, sweat trickling down her pale face, cast a pleading gaze towards Lunamaria. However, reality is cruel Even if she looked at Lunamaria with such eyes, it wouldn't change the future that awaited her.","[Since a moment ago, several of the Six Kings' Executives had been exchanging glances and turning our way Perhaps, they were already deciding the order in which to meet up with Milady so that they wouldn't all visit at the same time?]","[T- That sounds rough. In such situations, Lili has to maintain her position as Duchess Albert of the Symphonia Kingdom's nobility, so she can't afford any mishandling.]","Sieglinde also understood the situation and turned a sympathetic gaze towards Lilia. Wondering if the unpleasant premonition that Lunamaria and Lilia both sensed together","[In the first place, Miyama-sama has extremely powerful people behind his back, so putting aside how he's polite with others, he's actually in a position where he would be forgiven even if he makes some sort of blunder around the Six Kings' Executives. I mean, to begin with, Miyama-sama is good at handling people, it's like he's loved by fate and the world No, I guess he really is loved by them huh. Anyhow, Miyama-sama is a communication monster who naturally gets along with others, leaving a good impression on them, whether intentionally or not. So, when Miyama-sama is around, leaving the situation to him would generally ensure a good atmosphere but since he's not here today, Milady will have to manage on your own.]","[.]","[Well then, I'm worried how Mom's doing at the moment, so if you'll excuse me]","[You must be kidding, right!? After stirring up so much anxiety in me, you're planning to leave me behind!? S- Sieg]","[Ahh~~ I'm also concerned about how my parents are doing Also, with my position, even if I were to stay here, it would be difficult for me to join in the conversation so umm Good luck with that, Lili.]","[My stomach It hurts]","Having said all she had to say, Lunamaria departed with very quick and smooth movements, and Sieglinde, even though she looked hesitant, also decided that it would be difficult to interject into the conversation between the Six Kings' Executives and a Duchess due to her position, and thus left the scene as well.","And now, left alone with a despairing expression on her face, Lilia was approached by the first person.","[Lilia Albert-dono, I would like to talk with you for a bit, but would that be alright?]","[Y- Yes. With pleasure Epsilon-sama.]","With the result of the eye contact seemingly indicating that Epsilon would be the first to visit her, though her eyes resemble those of a dead fish, Lilia desperately put on a smile and responded.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The sudden sweetness from the last chapter gave me a body blow, this time, Lilia received a body blow right to her stomach A single arc making use of two different types of body blows, how frightening.]"]},{"number":1883,"title":"Chapter 1883: Ship Party 8","paragraphs":["After greeting Kuro, I decided to go straight to the Six Kings and Human Realm's Three Rulers who were close to my location in turn.","When I moved my gaze away from the place where Kuro was, I saw Isis-san and her subordinates a few distance away, so I decided to visit them next.","When I approached the place where Isis-san and the others were after approaching a certain distance from them, I suddenly felt something. No, it's not exactly that big of a deal, but it felt like I just passed through a thin film.","[Ahh, Kaito. I can somewhat tell what you're thinking. What you have just passed through is Polaris' barrier. Normally, it would be so thin that you wouldn't notice it, but you must have noticed it with your Sympathy Magic.]","[I see, a barrier The location Ahh, so that's how it is.]","[That's right. There's no need to dampen the mood at such a nice party so we should take care of what we can on our side. Well, that's the job of us subordinates, so it's not something you should worry about. Come, let's go to Isis-sama.]","[Alright.]","The place where I felt like I passed through was a few meters away from Isis-san, and as I expected, the range of the barrier enclosed the effective range of the magic power of death.","This is just my guess, but I think those below a certain level of power those who would be deeply affected by the magic power of death aren't allowed to approach. As for me, I've got Shiro-san's blessing or perhaps, it was originally set that I'm able to pass it. Since I heard Polaris-san is an expert of Barrier Magic, it's not surprising that she could manage something like that.","[Hello, Isis-san. Thank you for coming today.]","[Kaito Hello I'm the one who should thank you for inviting me I haven't had the chance to come to parties like this. so it feels refreshing.]","When I greeted her, Isis-san returned the greeting with an easily recognizable bright smile, showing how happy she is. The fact that despite probably never having been able to attend a party before due to the influence of her magic power of death, Isis-san seemed to find the party atmosphere refreshing and somewhat enjoyable left quite the impression in my mind.","I mean, the past Isis-san might have declined party invitations out of consideration for potentially making those around her afraid, but with the increase in dependable subordinates, she seems happier than ever to attend such events, appearing more content than before.","[How should I say this It may sound strange, but Isis-san is now starting to appear in gatherings like this Hmmm, it's hard to express, but I'm kinda glad that you're feeling more positive about it.]","[Unn In fact, until I met Kaito I never went out other than for Festival of Heroes and my hobby but now thanks to Kaito and everyone I'm having a lot of fun and I'm happy Thank you Kaito.]","[In this particular instance, I just invited Isis-san, I haven't done anything else.]","[No That isn't the case Of course, I'm glad that my subordinates care about me in so many ways I'm also happy that I'm now able to think about participating in events like this but what makes me the happiest is that Kaito invited me Coming to see me like this being filled with smiles like this makes me the happiest.]","I understood that there was no lie in those words when I saw Isis-san with a smile on her face that seemed truly happy from the bottom of her heart.","Delighted by all the changes, but what makes her happiest above all is simply meeting me and sharing smiles together, Isis-san straightforwardly conveying her affection felt both tickling and heartwarming, and it brought me the same happiness.","[I can't stay long as I still have to greet the others, but since I'm here, let's have a little chat.]","[Unn I'm glad isn't organizing a party rough?","Do you have the time to have some meal?]","[Yes, I'm going to have a quick bite after I greet some people. With such a large number of people, having a leisurely meal might be difficult, but I'm planning to take breaks while Alice is performing her sideshows.]","In this way, Isis-san and I spent some time chatting happily together.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The chapter before the previous one was like that, the previous chapter was like that, then this chapter Ahh, it's like that huh. Is this gonna be a pattern where they're alternating between Kaito side and Stomachache side!?]"]},{"number":1884,"title":"Chapter 1884: Ship Party 9","paragraphs":["The party had started, but Greene and Anne remained motionless at the edge of the hall. After all, if they look around a little, they will see that all the people around them are well-known figures, and for the two of them, who could be described as commoners, many of them were people they're afraid to even get close to.","And even those they didn't know, there was also the possibility that someone they didn't recognize might be someone of incredibly high status, so they couldn't take any rash action.","Thereupon, as if meeting a friend in need, two people approached them.","[Greene-san, Anne-san, hello~~]","[We haven't seen you since the last Flying Board afterparty.]","[Ahh, y- you are Aoi-san and Hina-san, right?]","[I- I'm glad to see you. We finally got to meet someone we know.]","For Greene and Anne, who were constantly shrinking back in this environment they're unfamiliar with, Aoi and Hina, who had been asked by Kaito to visit and speak to them, were truly like saviors.","They knew them from the Flying Board afterparty, but beyond that, they were clearly aware that Aoi and Hina were otherworlders-turned-adventurers. Moreover, as they weren't people they had to shrink back from, Greene and Anne felt a deep sense of relief.","However that relief was to crumble too fragilely shortly afterwards","[Oya? These people are?]","When Anne noticed that there were two more women alongside Aoi and Hina, she asked to which Sky and Gaia smiled lightly and spoke.","[Ahh, nice to meet you, I'm the God of Sky, Sky.]","[I'm the God of Earth, Gaia. Pleased to make your acquaintance.]","[ [ Hyuuhh ] ]","Greene and Anne involuntarily gasped and straightened their backs. The blood drained from their faces at once, and only their thoughts spun at super-speed.","(God of Sky? God of Earth? A- Aren't they High-ranking Gods!? W- Why are they giving off the atmosphere that they came together like normal Aoi-san and Hina-san had such frightening connections Is it because they're otherworlders!? Is it because they're otherworlders that they're like this!?)","It's something quite obvious, but for the commoner Greene, she had never even seen a Low-ranking God properly. However, two High-ranked Gods appeared as if it were a matter of course, exceeding the tolerance limits of her mind.","Well, this may also be due to the fact that those gathered in the venue were in too high of a position, and Sky and Gaia themselves were also not acting like they were distinguished","(High-ranking Gods!? Why are High-ranked Gods R- Rather, did they just name themselves just now!? I- Is it really alright for us to know the names of Gods so easily Or perhaps, will both me and Greene-san be disposed of right after this party)","Anne was also very confused by the sudden appearance of High-ranking Gods, and cold sweat dripping down her back, she was thinking about what to do. Sky and Gaia had introduced themselves, so it would be rude for them not to respond, but not knowing how to speak to such High-ranked Gods, she was too overwhelmed and felt like she was about to faint.","However, before the confused Greene and Anne could even utter a word, two hands suddenly reached out and grabbed Sky and Gaia by the neck.","[Stop fooling around, you idiots, commoners would obviously be in awe if High-ranked Gods introduced themselves to them. Good grief, you're no different from God of Oceans, why in the heck am I becoming your guardian Hey, come here!]","[Eh? Ah, God of Disasters?]","[W- What's going on all of a sudden?]","Shea suddenly appears and grabs Sky and Gaia, forcefully pulling them away from the scene. In response to Sky and Gaia's bewildered inquiry, She responded with a heavy sigh.","[Haahhh, it's good that the Gods have been showing an inclination to interact with the Human Realm and Demon Realm since the White God Festival, but if they're going to interact with others, they should first learn common sense]","Originally being the eccentric one among the Gods, if one were to exclude the Low-ranking Gods assuming this is before Kaito came to this world, she was almost the only one who actively engaged with the Human Realm and Demon Realm, often enjoying shopping in her spare time.","Therefore, in terms of how she treats commoners, she's one of the most sensible Gods, and noticing early on that Greene and Anne were in awe because of their presence, she had come to retrieve Sky and Gaia.","In the end, after telling Aoi and Hina to come and retrieve them later, Shea left the scene, pulling Sky and Gaia with her.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Come to think of it, even during Vier or rather, during the Demon Lord arc, she was shopping in the city normally, so I suppose Shea was the only one who, regardless of Kaito's influence, was naturally friendly and actively engaged with the Humans and Demons]"]},{"number":1885,"title":"Chapter 1885: Ship Party 10","paragraphs":["After a pleasant chat with Isis-san, I left the area where the Death King camp hung out and headed to the next area. Fortunately, the party had only just started, so it was easy to greet them as each camp was still somewhat gathered.","Now then, just as I was moving my gaze, wondering where to go next my gaze stopped when I saw a certain someone. The person at the end of my gaze was Kong-san, dressed in a tight-fitting suit, and I was unintentionally stunned by the tremendous impact of his appearance.","Thereupon, Kong-sama also seemed to have noticed me, as he called out to me with a hearty smile.","[If it isn't Kaito! Thanks for the invitation today! Well~~ This is quite the amazing ship you got! You really are an amazing guy!]","[Ah, thank you. Hello, Kong-san.]","I had a few opportunities to meet Kong-san, such as at the banquet after fighting Megiddo-san during the Six Kings Festival and at the housewarming party. Initially, my impression of him was just \"that guy who got beaten up by Pandora-san\", but he's actually a really nice person.","I remember that he was quite simple-minded, someone who didn't have any hidden thoughts, as he directly praised me a lot for fighting Megiddo-san at the banquet back at the Six Kings Festival.","Well, that's fine and all but the problem here is his appearance. Kong-san looks almost like a gorilla. Rather, he would literally be just a huge gorilla if it weren't for his horns, and the sight of that gorilla wearing a tight-fitting suit was kinda amusing.","No, I mean, what he's wearing was clearly not the right size for him. It was too tight-fitting, with the burden on the buttons of his suit being too much, and on the contrary, it was so tight-fitting that it was a wonder how it could endure without popping.","Of course, no matter how funny it may be, laughing at his appearance would be rude and absolutely something I shouldn't do. It's terrible to laugh at someone's appearance, and since Kong-san went out of his way to dress appropriately for the party, I should instead be grateful rather than laugh but well couldn't you at least find a suit that has a better size!? In fact, I'm impressed that he managed to wear that obviously ill-fitting suit.","[You came to see the Boss, right? If you wanna see the Boss, come this way.]","[Ah, yes. Thank you.]","Pinching my thigh for the time being, trying not to laugh, I moved on as Kong-san guided me but the view of his back was also very destructive. His shirt that looks like it's screaming feels really miserable.","A- Anyhow, as I moved a bit, I saw Ozma-san and Bacchus-san, so it seemed like the War King camp was also gathering in this area together. However, since I didn't see Agni-san and Epsilon-san around, it looked like they had gone somewhere else.","Arehh? Those two aside, where's Megiddo-san?","[Boss! Kaito's here.]","[Ohh! Kaito huh, I'm glad you came! Come, stop acting all reserved and come closer!]","[Huh? Eh? M- Megiddo-san?]","When I heard a rather lovely voice, I moved my gaze and found Megiddo-san, with an appearance that I completely didn't expect. Red semi-short hair that's quite wavy and two large horns, those two descriptions are all good but with a physique about the same as Kuro's, wearing a dress with a cute atmosphere, Megiddo-san with the appearance of a girl beckons me close with a happy smile.","I know that it's Megiddo-san from what I sense with Sympathy Magic but what's with that look!? It's not her usual Demon Beast form, humanized muscular man form, nor that glamorous woman appearance that was her original form but a mysterious young girl form.","[Ahh? The heck's with that look of yours?]","[Master, isn't this the first time Miyama-kun has seen Master in that form?]","[Ahhh! I see, so that's how it is!!!]","Megiddo-san tilted her head in wonder, but immediately after she heard what Ozma-san said, she nodded with a look of understanding.","And then, Ozma-san went on to briefly explain Megiddo-san's current state.","[Miyama-kun, Master has about four different humanized forms. They use them according to their mood at the time.]","[Ahh, so that's how it is. I see, until now, I thought that Megiddo-san's humanized form is that muscular man-form of theirs, so I was surprised.]","[Ahh, I certainly take on that form most often. Well, it's not like me taking on this form has any significant difference, so don't worry about it.]","No, they're quite different though!? At least even after hearing that story now, if I were to think that this person with the appearance and voice of a cute girl is Megiddo-san, my thoughts would just be thrown into confusion.","[By the way, why are you using that appearance this time?]","[Ahh, it's because of this dress. I bought it at Hydra Kingdom's recent Founding Festival. It incorporates the latest designs of the Hydra Kingdom while also incorporating old techniques from Symphonia and Archlesia, so I instantly liked it at first sight. Well, the balance of combining multiple techniques seems to be a bit experimental, giving it a slightly scattered impression, but I liked that daring style! So, since I bought it with the intention of wearing it, this appearance seemed to fit this dress the best.]","[I- I see]","Indeed, the dress Megiddo-san is wearing now has a cute design with many frills, and it wouldn't quite match the atmosphere if it were worn by her original glamorous woman form.","Unn, I can understand the reason why but while she's talking with that form, it kinda feels like my brain is glitching out.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [An unexpected little girl Megiddo form It's true that her personality and way of speaking remain the same, and when a cute girl says that, that's kinda mind glitching]","T/N: Megiddo's gender is technically a secret to the public, with Ozma the only one who knows her original form in the War King camp, so they refer to her as them/they in public, but Kaito refers to her as her/she in his mind."]},{"number":1886,"title":"Chapter 1886: Ship Party 11","paragraphs":["Even after receiving the explanation, I still really had this indescribable out-of-place feeling, but I finally just settled with the thought that Megiddo-san was also one of the Six Kings and could change his appearance at will.","Then, at that moment, Megiddo-san suddenly looked as if she remembered something and turned towards Kong-san with a doubtful expression on her face.","[Come to think of it, speaking about the dress reminded me of something...... Oi, Kong! You b*stard, the heck is with that odd get-up?]","Whoa there, here comes an unexpected comment to Kong-san. This was very helpful, and I was relieved that I wasn't the only one who thought that his outfit was weird.","[Eh? Is it no good? Elder Bro said we're going to wear formal wear to the party, so I had a subordinate get one for me......]","[There's this thing called \"sizes\", you idiot...... Or rather, that subordinate of yours who bought that suit should've bought that assuming you could either humanize or shrink yourself. The heck is with that, like it would tear apart any moment but hasn't torn yet...... You must have used State Preservation Magic huh.]","Speaking of which, Ozma-san is wearing a formal suit instead of his usual trench coat, cleanly shaved, with his hair slicked back, giving off the aura of an extremely handsome adult man.","No, seriously...... Ozma-san is tall and handsome, so he looks very picturesque, and even if I dressed the same way, I wouldn't be able to create the atmosphere he had. Hmmm, I'm envious. I wish I could have that kind of cool adult atmosphere.","[......N- No, I'm not good with sensitive magic like Humanization or Body Size Alteration...... I'm good at State Preservation Magic though.]","[Good grief, just as usual, your good and weak points are both extremes. It can't be helped, here.]","Seeing Kong-san give her an apologetic smile, Megiddo-san let out a small sigh and lightly flicked her finger. Thereupon, Kong-san's body was enveloped in light, and this time, he appeared wearing a suit that fit his size. Well, although his face remains that of a gorilla, wearing a suit that fits his size, with his large physique that's muscular and sturdy, this instead gives him quite a cool vibe.","[Ohh, thank you, Boss! That suit was so tight, so this really helps!!!]","[Next time, make it custom-made and sized for you...... Oops, sorry, Kaito, made you wait there...... So, you got time?]","[No, I have to go round and say hello to other people, so I can't be here too long......]","[I see...... Then, just accompany me for one cup, I've recently found a good drink......]","While saying that, Megiddo-san took out a bottle of alcohol and a glass and handed them to me.","[Since it's a wine glass, are we having wine?]","[Yeah, it's a bit young but...... Here, cheers.]","[Ah, yes. Cheers.]","Easily removing the cork with one hand, Megiddo-san poured the alcohol into the glass I was holding. Even with the appearance of a young girl, Megiddo-san is still one of the Six Kings.","And when I lightly clinked my glass with hers and drank the wine, a refreshing taste spreads in my mouth.","[It's delicious. It's refreshing and has a nice aftertaste. Although it's red wine, it has a white wine-like feel to it.]","[Yeah, it's quite good, isn't it? It's still a bit young, and it'll be another 5 years before it mellows and is ready to drink.]","[Fumu...... Can that kind of thing be accelerated by Time Magic or something?]","[Ahh? Of course, it's possible. With Space-Time Magic, aging can be done in an instant...... Well, I don't feel like doing that though.]","Saying that with a wry smile, Megiddo-san lightly tipped her wine glass. How should I say this...... with her current appearance, there was this mysterious atmosphere mixed in with her usual boldness.","[It's not always best to rush everything. Waiting for it to mature and become ready to drink can also be a way to enjoy alcohol. If you shorten that with Space-Time Magic, wouldn't it be a loss? Well, there are times when I just want to drink quickly and use magic to speed up aging.]","[I see, that's certainly a good way to enjoy it.]","How should I say this...... Right now, I'm not sure whether her current young girl appearance affects it or not, but it feels like Megiddo-san's current appearance matches even the subtle expressions that would typically arise when discussing art, which might have seemed out of place in her usual form.","In terms of atmosphere, it feels like discussing art in her current form would indeed make a picturesque scene. Well, knowing that it's Megiddo-san on the inside, there might still be that out-of-place feeling......","As I had such thoughts in mind, Megiddo-san smiles brightly and speaks.","[Well, that's why this wine will be ready to drink in 5 years. At that time, let's go drink it again, Kaito.]","[Yes. Then, I'll also be looking forward to that time.]","[Ohh! You're immortal too, so it wouldn't hurt to learn to enjoy the passage of time.]","Seeing Megiddo-san smiling happily like that, I couldn't help but let out a smile too.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Arehh? That gorilla's actually giving out a heroine-like atmosphere...... I- Is this the power of lolicization......]"]},{"number":1887,"title":"Chapter 1887: Ship Party 12","paragraphs":["A little after the start of the party, Rosemary was standing quietly with her arms crossed in the party hall, which was starting to get bustling. She had long, loosely curled golden hair, sharp eyes, a slender, model-like figure and a beautiful dress that was at the forefront of fashion. Her standing posture was like that of a single dignified rose, one that held quite the intensity.","Of course, Rosemary herself was just nervous, or rather, her expression was frozen in nervousness, but that was something that gave her a ghastly atmosphere. At that moment, Camellia approached Rosemary and called out to her.","[......Are you alright, Eri?]","[I- I- I- I'm not alright...... T- This is scary. D- Doesn't it feel like I'm attracting attention? D- Do my outfit look weird?]","[No, it's more like you're attracting attention because your outfit looks really good at the party. Eri has an appearance that easily attracts attention.]","Rosemary's appearance indeed combined flamboyance and beauty, reminiscent of a noble lady...... Strictly in appearance, of course. Inside, as Kaito put it, she was more like a chihuahua......","[Lia, s- stay with me...... If someone talks to me while I'm alone, I don't think I'll be able to respond properly......]","[I suppose so. I've done with my brief greetings with the people I know, and since Eli probably won't be able to move around properly anyway, I'll stay here with you.]","[T- Thank you...... Uuu, unnn. I'll really just stay still here. It's scary with so many people around......]","Though this was a party with a considerable amount of acquaintances in attendance, she's resolved not to move from that spot for a while...... Just as she made this decision, Caraway stepped onto the stage and began speaking through the Loudspeaker Magic Tool.","\"Ladies and gentlemen, please enjoy the party as you listen. For this party, we have prepared various sideshows, and presumptuous it may be, I will be the one overseeing the proceedings. In simple order......\"","Listening to Caraway's explanation while directing her gaze towards the stage, Rosemary muttered softly.","[Ah, there are sideshows planned huh.]","[It seems so. Thinking of parties, would it be a musical performance?]","[Ahh, I'm looking forward to that...... I love music......]","Also listening to Caraway's explanation, Rosemary let out a relieved smile. She thought that if there were such sideshows, she could enjoy herself and alleviate some of her nervousness.","\"Now, for our first sideshow...... To commemorate the party, we have received from Phantasmal King No Face-sama to exhibit a selection from their secret collection. I'm sure everyone here is familiar with the influence Phantasmal King-sama has...... From them, we have received precious treasures to be specially showcased today. We will introduce them in order. Please note that after the introduction, everyone can also view the exhibits in the exhibition room prepared on the right side of the venue. However, please be aware that bringing food and drinks into the exhibition is prohibited.\"","As the attention of the people within the venue turned to the words \"Phantasmal King's secret collection\", Rosemary and Camellia also looked interestedly towards the stage. However, Rosemary's expression drastically changed with the emcee's next words.","\"Now then, as for our first exhibit...... Is everyone aware of the painting set \"Seven Planets\"? It's said to have been painted some 10,000 years ago, using an unknown paint that can't be reproduced using any existing material, and there are only 7 copies of this painting in the world, making it a legendary set of paintings for those who love paintings...... is how it should have been, but what if...... if there was actually another hidden copy of the painting, unknown to the world?\"","As the words were delivered in a lively manner to liven up the atmosphere, Camellia also looked intrigued. She was Rosemary's best friend, someone well-versed in the arts, so she had also been informed by Rosemary before about the Seven Planets.","[That's rather interesting...... Right? Arehh? Eri——- When did she get there!?]","Camellia turned around, only to find that Rosemary-san was nowhere to be seen. Confused, she shifted her gaze around, and to her surprise, Rosemary had silently moved to the very front of the stage and was intently watching the stage with rapt attention.","\"To begin with, according to Phantasmal King-sama, the Seven Planets are said to be the result of the painter creating a painting using unknown paints, and with leftover paints mixed with it, they created this painting which was painted before the paint was used for Seven Planets...... The name of this painting is \"Blue Earth\"...... It's a mysterious painting depicting the scenery of an island, but the island depicted in the painting doesn't exist anywhere in this world. According to Phantasmal King-sama, it's said to be a painting of an island in another world, making it a work of art with a very mysterious charm. Now then, without further ado, let's get on with the reveal!\"","With these words, Caraway removes the cloth that conceals the huge painting prepared in the back and reveals a beautiful and fascinating painting, drawn with mysterious paints, and those who are interested in art, including Rosemary, gazed at the painting with passionate eyes.","Gazing at the scenery depicted in the painting from afar, Makina spoke to the nearby Alice in a murmur.","[How nostalgic...... but isn't that one too neatly drawn?]","[Well, what was actually mixed in that paint were just pieces of iron shavings and the wreckage of a nearby wall I smashed.]","Yes, the painting was created some time after Alice arrived in this world. It depicted the artificial island where she met Makina while she was reminiscing about their memories together.","For her, it was simply a depiction of a landscape filled with memories, and she had no intention of making it public, but after meeting Kaito, reuniting with Iris and Makina, and reconciling with her past, she eventually decided to make it public.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She said that so nonchalantly, but given Alice's condition at that time, she probably drew that filled with heavy emotions......]","? ? ? : [N- No, it's not like that...... I really was just feeling a bit nostalgic for the past...... Ah, no, I don't think Alice-chan is thinking that deeply......]","T/N: That fanfic has been updated again, check it /novel/the-sugar-has-escalated-into-nocturne-in-trinia/chapter-10/"]},{"number":1888,"title":"Chapter 1888: Ship Party 13","paragraphs":["At the area right in front of the stage of the ship party, Kaori, one of the invited guests, was restlessly moving her gaze around.","(What should I do? I was avoiding the people who looked like big shots, and before I knew it, I was in front of the stage. This place stands out, doesn't it? If I don't quickly move out of here...... Uuuu, Akane-san is off to greet someone who has helped her with something related to her trading company, so we're temporarily separated and I can't help but feel anxious. I can't find Shige-san or Hannah-san either...... T- Thinking I'll be approached by someone distinguished...... Uuuu, my stomach hurts.)","Up until a little while ago, Akane had been acting together with Kaori, but being the head of her trading company, she knew some of the participants to a certain extent compared to Kaori. She had acquaintances among the participants, including those she had business dealings with, such as representatives from Kuromueina and Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company. Therefore, she decided to go around and greet them briefly, leading to her and Kaori splitting up.","Left on her own, Kaori didn't know what to do in the venue filled with people who clearly held high positions no matter where she looked, so she ended up wandering around aimlessly.","There was the option of visiting acquaintances such as Chris, but as the Emperor, Chris would surely be greeting and conversing with distinguished people, so Kaori felt hesitant to approach her in such a situation. Therefore, she was looking for the ordinary people she knew, such as Shigenobu and Hannah, but that was a difficult thing to do in the spacious venue.","At that moment, Caraway came up on stage and began to give information about the sideshows.","(Ahh, so there are sideshows. T- Then, I guess it would be just right? If I watch the sideshows until Akane-san comes back...... Fortunately, I can see the stage well from...... this...... position?)","Kaori felt a sense of relief at the thought that the start of the sideshow would soon free her from this indescribable unease, but just then, she sensed someone nearby and turned around...... and there, before she knew it, Rosemary had appeared and was gazing sharply at the stage.","(Ababababa, R- Rose Princess Rosemary-sama!? H- H- H- How!? Since when is she...... U- Uwahh, looking at her this close, she's incredibly beautiful...... As expected of the Aloof Rose, she has the atmosphere of a very dignified, cool and mature woman...... b- but...... she's scary...... S- She's glaring hard at the stage.)","As Kaori inwardly panicked at Rosemary's sudden appearance, Rosemary seemed to notice Kaori nearby and turning to look at her...... Rosemary glared at her with her sharp eyes.","Of course, Rosemary wasn't really glaring at Kaori. She was simply tense because of the presence of someone she was meeting for the first time nearby, causing her face to stiffen, but Kaori had no way of knowing this.","(Hiiihhh, s- she's glaring at me...... Ahh, a- a- am I being a hindrance!? I- I should get out of here......)","Completely intimidated by Rosemary's sharp gaze, Kaori, drenched in sweat, gave a slight nod and slowly backed away without a word.","Understanding that she couldn't afford to be disrespectful, keeping her eyes on Rosemary, Kaori continued to back away...... That is to say, she was essentially in a state where she couldn't see what was behind her.","As one would expect, after moving a few distance away from Rosemary, Kaori ended up bumping into someone behind her.","[Ahh, I- I'm sorry, are you al...... right...... Ahh, ahiii......]","[.................]","Apologizing as she turned around, Kaori found herself face to face with an ox-headed monster...... a Minotaur in formal attire, and her face drained of color at their striking appearance.","[No, I should be asking you that, young lady, are you not hurt?]","[Ah? Eh? I- I'm alright.]","To such a Kaori, the Minotaur...... the Demon who serves as an assistant to one of the Ten Demons, speaks to her in a polite tone.","(Eh? The voice...... She's female? I have my own guesses, but what species is she from? ......A- At any rate, I'm glad she doesn't seem as scary as she looks.)","Feeling a slight sense of relief, Kaori apologized to the Minotaur once again before quickly hurrying away from the scene.","(Uuuu, can someone I know...... can someone I know appear......)","Kaori's anxiety had grown significantly due to the consecutive troubles she had encountered, but at that moment, she heard a voice that brought her a sense of relief.","[Ahh, there you are, Mizuhara Kaori. My apologies, but I'm new to the cuisine over there and I don't know how to eat some of them, so I was hoping you could give me some advice......]","[O- Olivia-sama......]","[Unn? Is something the matter?]","[N- No, I'm just relieved to finally meet someone I know. Ahh, errr, the cuisine, right? Well then, I'll teach you about them, so shall we go together?]","[I'm sorry for troubling you. That would be great.]","Olivia is a regular customer of Kaori's who usually visits her restaurant at a high frequency, and putting aside their start, she's now someone she knows well.","Furthermore, Olivia held a position as the Founder and representative of Friendship City, which provided a sense of security for Kaori in terms of status...... As she's someone of incredibly high status, being with Olivia provided Kaori with a certain level of reassurance, even if they were to unexpectedly encounter powerful figures, so Kaori had a look on her face from the bottom of her heart.","[......Speaking of which, Olivia-sama. Is the plan to ask Kaito-kun out on a date making progress?]","[Progress itself is being made, but the plan has not yet been finalized. At the moment, the plan is only about \"186 pages\" long, so you could say it's still incomplete......]","[No, no!? Too much, isn't that too much!? Why would you need a 186-page plan just for a date...... or rather, how many days would that even take to carry out......]","[With my current plan, 15 days.]","[......I feel like a date isn't what you're aiming for anymore......]","Feeling relieved and regaining her composure after meeting Olivia, Kaori chatted happily with Olivia as they moved along.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [13......!?]","? ? ? : [Author-san had apparently swapped computers for writing, and it seems like he now got one that can go above 12.]"]},{"number":1889,"title":"Chapter 1889: Ship Party 14","paragraphs":["While I was greeting the Six Kings in turn, the sideshow seemed to have started, and on the stage, the secret items provided by Alice were being revealed one after another.","Glancing at such a scene, I next came to greet Magnawell-san. Magnawell-san is dressed in his special clone body, looking like an old gentleman in a chic suit-like formal wear, which is very austere and cool.","[Hello, Magnawell-san, Frea-san, Eingana-san, Fafnir-san, thank you for coming today.]","[Umu. Sorry for expressly having you come here, Miyama Kaito. I also appreciate the invitation this time. The atmosphere of the venue is really nice.]","[I'm grateful for that. However, I apologize that it wasn't an environment where Grandiereus-san could come.]","[No, it can't be helped. Just like the me back then, Grandiereus also has issues with his body. I didn't have the opportunity to do it last time, but this time, I'll negotiate with Shalltear to see if I can get a similar clone body for him like mine.]","Unfortunately, Grandiereus-san couldn't participate this time. I mean, Grandiereus-san, who is too large to use Humanization Magic, wouldn't be able to board even a magic ship as large as this, making participation virtually impossible.","[I see, then I look forward to having him join us again the next time there's an opportunity.]","[Yeah, I'll let Grandiereus know that.]","This is just my guess, but it was probably Makina-san who created Magnawell-san's clone body. At the time of the White God Festival, I only retained my memories of Makina-san in my dreams, so I didn't realize it, but now that I can carry over my dream memories, I quickly realized that the creator of that clone body is Makina-san.","And so, later on, if such a request arrives, I'll subtly ask Alice for that as well.","I don't know if I'll organize another party like this, but I'd love to have Grandiereus-san join us then.","[Him aside, aren't you tired, my comrade? You've been going all over the place, haven't you?]","[I'm alright. The party has only just started, so I haven't been around that much. Ahh, and Frea-san, your dress is lovely. The contrast between the red and orange is like a flame, and I think it fits your image.]","[I'm not very accustomed to outfits like this, but if that's what my comrade says, even if it feels ticklish, that makes me happy. You also look great in that formal wear, my comrade, it really accentuates your dignity.]","[Thank you.]","After confirming that the greetings with Magnawell-san were finished, Frea-san approached with a gentle smile.","Frea-san was wearing a red and orange dress, which gave her a charm quite different from her usual delinquent leader-like aura.","And just like that, I also briefly exchanged words with Eingana-san and Fafnir-san who were there.","[Eingana-san, thank you for all the help with the venue this time.]","[No, something like this is simple. Demon Realm's seas are my domain after all. I'm glad I was able to be of help. By the way, I was just wondering, these sideshows...... Does it also include music-related events?]","[Yes, Alice...... the Phantasmal King is going to play for us.]","[Oh my, that Shalltear-sama will...... If that's the case, I must get in the front row no matter what.]","I already knew it back in the Harmonic Symphony, but Eingana-san is quite a music enthusiast. It seems she's looking forward to Alice's performance with great anticipation.","Well, Alice's music skills are actually quite outrageous, and I'm sure she'll live up to Eingana-san's expectations.","[......Speaking of music, Fafnir-san...... Weren't you in a band before?]","[Embarrassing it may be to say this, but I was swept away by Nidzveld and Eingana and things turned out that way. Moreover, since we became so popular, it's become difficult to quit now...... It looks like we'll be acting from time to time in the future.]","[I- I see, thank you for your hard work. I listened to it a bit as well, and I think you guys were really cool. It might be rough, but do your best.]","[Yes, thank you.]","I had a hunch that was the case, but it seems like Fafnir-san really got caught up in their momentum...... Well, he's quite earnest by nature, so once he's involved with something, he tends to take responsibility, so it seems like he'll continue with the band activities in the future.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Rather, the way he compliments her dress so smoothly...... As expected, his romance experience is just on another level.]","? ? ? : [No, well, he does have multiple lovers, and compared to m...... Alice-chan, he's definitely more active in romance-related stuff.]","Serious-senpai : [Nah, when you compare that one to others, I think it would make most people seem experts in love......]"]},{"number":1890,"title":"Chapter 1890: Ship Party 15","paragraphs":["Only Lillywood-san was left to greet among the Six Kings, and I came to the area where the World King camp had gathered...... or rather, in the area where Lillywood-san was. The reason why I rephrased is because I didn't see anyone other than Lillywood-san and Lillie-san, seemingly having scattered already.","[Hello, Lillywood-san, Lillie-san. Thank you for coming today.]","\"Hello, Kaito-san. Thank you for inviting us.\"","[I may just be repeating the same words as Lillywood-sama, but thank you for inviting us.]","When I arrived in their area, Lillywood-san and Lillie-san greeted me back with a kind smile. Since I heard that Lillywood-san doesn't eat or drink much and only consumes water, I instructed the attendants to bring high-quality water to Lillywood-san. It seemed to have worked, as Lillywood-san was drinking water instead of wine or other drinks.","[As expected, it's already been quite a while since the event started, so the others are already enjoying themselves huh?]","\"Yes, indeed. Camellia and Rosemary seem to be concentrating on the artworks exhibited in front of the stage, while Tirtania, Ariel and Blossom had gone to have their meals.\"","[Blossom was quite interested upon hearing that you guys are serving otherworld cuisine, so the other two went with her.]","[Ahh, I see, Blossom-san does like otherworld culture.]","Indeed, with Kaori-san's cooperation, there are many Japanese dishes in the dining area. There's staple stuff like sushi, and quite a few other Japanese-style dishes...... Regarding the sushi, Kaori-san mentioned that there are some regions where people don't eat raw fish, so we have prepared both regular sushi and seared sushi, and have added a note to inform people about this.","As expected from someone who runs a restaurant in Friendship City, Kaori-san's advice was incredibly helpful. I would like to thank her properly next time, but I'm not sure how to go about it...... She did mention something about the glossiness of her skin, so I thought of helping out in that area, but I'm kinda having second thoughts because a guy suddenly bringing up skincare topics might seem inappropriate.","[......Arehh? What about Jutia-san?]","\"Jutia's gone to say hello to the people she knows. She's sociable and has good connections with the other Six Kings Executives...... She also mentioned heading to Ein after that and talks with her could apparently take quite a while.\"","[It seems she heard from somewhere that original tea blend would be distributed at this party, and she seemed to be quite interested in that. In fact....... Ahh, so that original tea blend really does exist. I see, so they were jointly prepared by someone named Illness and someone named Nebula...... Fumu, I see, they're also the ones who created the tea leaves that Jutia likes.]","Seeing Lillie-san nodding to herself while reading my surface thoughts, I couldn't help but smile wryly. How should I say this...... I've thought of this before, but conversing with LIllie-san is convenient because she can understand things without a detailed explanation, which makes things easier and avoids misunderstandings.","[......I don't think people would usually like having their minds read though...... but well, your sensibilities are as strange as usual.]","\"Your flowers are getting darker, Lillie.\"","[......This is embarrassing. That just inevitably happens when my mood is getting uplifted.]","Apparently, for Lillie-san, my attitude of not being averse to having my mind read seemed to be favorable, and although she was feeling a bit embarrassed, she smiled happily.","Well, it really is a fact that I don't mind having my mind read. I mean, it feels like it's being constantly read by Shiro-san, so it's too late to be worrying about that now.","\"Where do you plan to go afterward, Kaito-san?\"","[After this, well, after greeting Human Realm's rulers, I'm going to greet anyone who catches my eye. It's not like the greeting ends immediately after saying hello, there's usually some small talk involved, so it feels like I would really just end up greeting people.]","[When you organize a party of this size, that can't be helped. I know it's a lot of work, but please take your time and take some small breaks in between.]","[Thank you.]","Just like that, I chatted with Lillywood-san and Lillie-san for a bit, and the gentle and calm conversation with them felt soothing. Somehow, even though greeting people would apparently be a lot of work, I felt like chatting with them makes me quite relaxed.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected of the man who lost his privacy early on in the story. You could tell from his face that he'd already been through hell.]","? ? ? : [Well, in fact, Kaito-san is seriously mentally strong in this aspect too.]"]},{"number":1891,"title":"Chapter 1891: Ship Party 16","paragraphs":["Finished greeting Lillywood-san, I next looked for Human Realm's rulers...... Ryze-san, Chris-san and Laguna-san, thinking of greeting them, but by coincidence, I saw them together.","This was just right. The rulers were probably talking to each other, and it was the perfect time to say my greetings. As I approached, I eventually heard their voices.","[Good gracious, I suppose it's to be expected of Miyama-kun. It's truly impressive seeing all these distinguished figures naturally gathering like this.]","[Indeed. Even at the Festival of Heroes, you wouldn't see such a scene, really making you realize how incredible Miyama-sama's connections are.]","[No, seriously though, I don't know what's going on with him...... It's not like they intentionally went to meet them or had them introduced by someone; the fact that they just naturally encountered each other is just absurd.]","Right after I thought they seemed to be talking about me and was feeling slightly awkward about it, the atmosphere in the area suddenly changed with Ryze-san's words.","[It's truly remarkable, but to think that our Symphonia Kingdom maintains a good relationship with such a Miyama-kun, as a King, I couldn't help feeling proud. Even among those invited this time, the majority of those from the Human Realm are affiliated with our Symphonia Kingdom, and even among the invited nobles, ours are the most numerous.]","[......Oya oya, what are you saying? Symphonia Kingdom is just adjacent to the land where Miyama-sama's mansion is located, so he would naturally have many acquaintances there. It's rather presumptuous to attribute a stroke of luck as some sort of achievement of your nation. What matters here is how closely one is personally acquainted with Miyama-sama.]","[Indeed. Furthermore, if one were to boast about the environment, wouldn't it be thanks to the efforts of young Lilia, who graciously accepted and hosted Kaito when he arrived in this world, and treated him warmly at the mansion? If young Ryze is also a King, rather than relying on your sister's achievements, you should instead take pride in your own achievements...... Well, if we're talking about which King has the closest personal relationship with Kaito, it would probably be me......]","Somehow, it felt like sparks flew between the three of them just now. Ahh, on a side note, although the land where my house is located exists within Symphonia Kingdom's Royal Capital, it seems to be treated as separate from the Kingdom itself, almost like a kind of independent state. So, I'm technically not considered a citizen of Symphonia Kingdom, but more like a neighbor...... Well, as Alice says, \"That's more of a foreign relations affair, so Kaito-san doesn't need to worry about it.\", so I just don't mind the technicalities and think of myself as living in Symphonia Kingdom's Royal Capital......","Well, that aside, I think their current state of affairs is that the rulers are probably checking each other out, or perhaps, a battle to assert dominance over the other countries has begun.","I suppose things like honor and appearance are important in cases like these, and all three of them probably want to gain a mental advantage in such situations. It's just...... I'd prefer if they don't bring me up in their conversation. It makes it even harder for me to approach them.","[Well, you see, I basically visit Kaito's house once a month and have tea with him, so we're pretty close.]","[Isn't your original purpose to have a mock battle with Duchess Lilia? It feels a bit presumptuous to barge in without being invited by Miyama-sama.]","[She's right. Miyama-kun is kind, so he wouldn't be unkind if you suddenly visited. In fact, one could even say you're taking advantage of his kindness by doing that.]","[Hmm, what's this, what's this? Both of you look as if you're the closest to Kaito.]","[Oh my, I wonder what you could be saying? At the very least, I'm proud to say that I've exchanged more letters with Miyama-sama than anyone else here.]","[Even if you act all proud about your letter exchanges with him, we'll just feel troubled. If you're going to say that, Miyama-kun is essentially going to marry Lilianne in the future, so one could say we're practically family, right?]","......What should I do? All three of them started appealing that they were the one closest to me, making it really hard for me to talk to them! I mean, if I talked to them like that and they asked me \"Then, who do you think you're closest with?\", I'd be really embarrassed to answer.","To be honest, I'd really like to put off talking to them for later, but I can't really talk to others without talking to them first...... As I was thinking about that though...... a situation that changed the air appeared once again.","[No, I'm......]","[I'm the one who......]","[As expected, it's me who is......]","[................]","[ [ [ Ah...... ] ] ]","Yes, that person was standing there nearby before we knew it. A genuine God with a divine smile on her lips and a ring with twenty wings attached to it...... I could see the faces of the three instantly pale, their blood seemingly draining away in an instant.","[......We shouldn't have conversations that presume to decide Miyama-kun's will, yes!]","[T- That's right! Who he's close with is something Kaito should decide, not something for us to impose! Making such assumptions is disrespectful to Kaito!!!]","[Yes, exactly! We can't cause any trouble for Miyama-sama, and while we are grateful for the fact that we are allowed to interact with him in some small way, let's not say anything unnecessary!]","Seeing the three of them completely change their tune and speak in desperate voices, Eden-san remained silent for a moment before nodding once and then disappearing...... It seems like they've judged that they're safe, as the three of them were patting the chests with expressions of deep relief.","Unnn. No, I do feel sorry for the three of them as they seemed like they had just met with an accident, but still, I'm somewhat grateful to Eden-san for diverting them away from that strange flow of conversation.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Good grief, it's completely inevitable to be blinded by the majesty of my beloved child, but moderation is important. It would be great if they could maintain moderation.]","Serious-senpai : [Eh? You are talking about moderation......?]"]},{"number":1892,"title":"Chapter 1892: Ship Party 17","paragraphs":["After Eden-san left, I briefly greeted Ryze-san, Chris-san and Laguna-san. Or rather, my greetings with them went so smoothly, with me really just giving them a simple greeting. So much so that I'm wondering if perhaps, they were wary of that incident with Eden-san a while ago happening again.","Since Laguna-san and the others were also like that, Eden-san must have been that terrifying...... Well, I understand that feeling, as that earlier situation also felt like it could have been a life-threatening crisis if something had gone wrong.","Anyhow, with that, it seems like I've finished greeting the people who needs priority greeting. Fortunately, I was able to greet the Six Kings Executives together quite efficiently, so it seems like the time needed for the rest of the rounds will be shorter than planned.","Well, putting that aside, first and foremost, I would be heading to the place...... the people where I'm needed. Yes, I'm heading towards Greene-san and Anne-san. I've asked Aoi-chan and Hina-chan to check on them, but I want them to enjoy the party too, so I'm going to meet up with them early and take over accompanying Greene-san and Anne-san.","[Anne-san, Greene-san!]","[K- Kaito-san...... We finally met you.]","[M- Miyama-san...... I'm so relieved to see your face.]","Using Sympathy Magic to locate their whereabouts, I quickly headed to their spot, and upon arriving, Anne-san and Greene-san looked visibly relieved.","[I'm sorry. I actually wanted to come earlier, but there were other people who I had to prioritize greeting, so I was late...... Aoi-chan, Hina-chan, thanks.]","[No, I mean, we kinda made a mistake too.]","[......We carelessly came here with Sky-san and Gaia-san...... and we kinda startled them. I guess we have been influenced by Kaito-senpai as well.]","[I- I see, it was a sudden request, so it can't be helped. Anyhow, thank you very much. You can leave the rest to me, so both of you go ahead and enjoy the party.]","The reason why the two of them had to rush to Anne-san and Greene-san in the first place was that my planning was inadequate, making it difficult to reach them immediately after the event started, so it's my responsibility that they were startled by the approach of the High-ranking Gods.","After thanking Aoi-chan and Hina-chan again and telling them that I would take over, they both nodded and after a small goodbye to Anne-san and Greene-san, they headed towards Sky-san and Gaia-san.","[......Well then, once again, thank you for coming today. I apologize for startling you with my lack of explanation.]","[Ah, no, to be honest, even if you had explained what this party is like first, I feel like I would have just thought you were joking.]","[I agree. I mean, Kaito-san...... Umm...... Are you like, actually the shadow ruler of the world that we just didn't know about?]","[No, it's not like that at all, I'm just a normal...... normal? I'm a bit unsure of that myself, but I should be a normal person.]","No, I myself am just an ordinary human, but considering my social connections, I guess it would be hard to claim that I'm just an ordinary guy from the perspective of the two ordinary people.","Although it's too late to say this now, it might have been better to introduce some acquaintances to the two of them beforehand. Well, when I sent out the invitations, I didn't know that I would have a lot of free time later, and even if I had thought I would have some free time, I thought it would be difficult to coordinate time......","[Errr, since the two of you probably don't know many people in the venue, I'll introduce you around. Let's go together. If there's anyone in particular you'd like to be introduced to, please don't hesitate to let me know.]","[......Anne-san, I have made up my mind!]","[Greene-san?]","Even though I said I would accompany them, I couldn't exactly stay with them throughout the party, so I suggested that I would introduce the two of them to someone first, and after feeling conflicted about it, Greene-san powerfully opened her eyes.","[Miyama-san, I'd be happy if you could introduce me to someone rich with social connections...... Ahh, but someone that isn't too great...... like a Baron or someone like that......]","[Ahh, sorry. I don't know any Barons among the nobility. If it's Viscount, I only know two...... but they're also a bit special...... For the time being, how about I introduce you to someone who seems to know a lot about social life?]","[I- I understand, I'd be happy to have that.]","To begin with, I don't know many nobles. When it comes to Viscounts, there's only Seigi-kun and Viscount Dunel. Seigi-kun is an otherworlder, so I'm not sure how well-versed he is with social circles. Meanwhile, Viscount Dunel apparently attends social events as Count Ducas, so his situation is also tricky.","I think it would just be better if I just introduced her to Lilia-san. Lilia-san is kind and I think she would be an easy person for Greene-san to talk to.","Anne-san still seems to be hesitating, so I'll go ahead and introduce Greene-san to Lilia-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [What do I say to this? No, well, Kaito actually doesn't really know many nobles, so out of the nobles she knows, Lilia might certainly be the best.]"]},{"number":1893,"title":"Chapter 1893: Ship Party 18","paragraphs":["Having decided to introduce Greene-san to Lilia-san first, I talked to Greene-san as we moved along.","[Greene-san, would you mind if I formally introduce you to Lilia-san...... to Duchess Lilia Albert? When it comes to nobles I'm acquainted with who are knowledgeable about social circles and are kind and easy to talk to, I feel that Lilia-san is the most applicable......]","The runner-ups would be Amalie-san, Orchid, and Chris-san, but all of them are royalty, so I thought Lilia-san would be a better choice...... No, Lilia-san is also royalty but......","Thereupon, upon hearing my words, Greene-san's eyes lit up.","[H- Her Excellency Duchess Lilia Albert!? T- The one that's currently Top 1 in the noble ranking in terms of momentum...... I- Isn't she the great noble everyone looks up to......]","[Noble ranking? Is there such a thing?]","[Ah, Kaito-san, please don't mind her. That's apparently some kind of ranking that's only in Greene-san's head......]","I don't really understand what's going on, but for the time being, it seems like she's receiving it favorably...... It seems like Greene-san sees her as someone to look up to, and that isn't exactly something I would have any objections to.","[To be introduced to Her Excellency Duchess Lilia Albert, I'm so moved! I had given up the thought of talking to her because of the difference in our status, feeling it would be too presumptuous but......]","[You don't have to be too nervous. Lilia-san is truly a very kind person......]","As we were chatting like that while I was using my Sympathy Magic to search for Lilia-san, I began to see a slightly strange sight. I did find Lilia-san, but I found Luna-san standing at a distance, observing Lilia-san from afar.","[......Luna-san, what are you doing?]","[Ahh, well, my mother seemed to be doing well at the party, so I went back to MIlady's side and am now observing Milady as she draws hardship to herself.]","[......I don't really get it, but what about helping her?]","[In the first place, my status basically doesn't allow me to be part of their conversation, and I don't really want any part of those stomachaches......]","I feel like the latter part might be the truth there. After exchanging a few words with Lilia-san, I headed towards Lilia-san...... who is currently talking to someone who I presumed is Astaroth-san.","The reason I say \"presumed\" is because the person Lilia-san was talking to was wearing a stuffed cow costume that clearly looked like something Alice had made. I had heard from Pandora-san that Astaroth-san usually wears the stuffed animal costumes that Alice gave her, so that should be the case here.","As for the reason why that cow is currently wearing formal wear, I'm not sure if it was originally designed that way or something added to match the party......","\"If it isn't Miyama-sama.\"","[Hello, Astaroth-san. Excuse me, are you busy chatting?]","\"No, I have already completed my brief greeting to Duchess Lilia. If you wish to speak with Duchess Lilia, please go ahead, as I'm about to head off elsewhere......\"","[I'm sorry to have bothered you guys. I hope you enjoy the party, Astaroth-san.]","\"I'm unworthy of your kind words. Well then, if you'll excuse me.\"","From what I heard from Luna-san earlier, it seems that Lilia-san was quite overwhelmed and was quite exhausted, so I approached somewhat forcefully to intervene in the conversation.","Before I could call out to them though, Astaroth-san noticed me, politely excused herself and then kindly stepped aside. After giving her a slight bow, I turned towards Lilia-san, who was kinda looking at me as if she had seen her savior.","[Kaito-san...... You came at a really good time......]","[Luna-san told me something about Lilia-san having trouble, but is something the matter?]","[No, it's just that the Six King Executives who I hadn't interacted with before came one after another, and to deal with that...... Luna and Sieg fled as soon as possible.]","[T- Thank you for the hard work...... Ahh, errr, I actually have someone I'd like to introduce to Lilia-san......]","[......................]","That's strange, why is she suddenly looking at me with dead fish eyes? It's like she's silently saying \"You made me think I was saved, only for you to unexpectedly come attacking here? Don't you have any compassion in your heart?\", but I can't really complain considering my past behavior.","[Who is it this time? A God of some world? An authority from the otherworld?]","[No, I don't blame you for thinking so, but they're ordinary people...... I've met them when we participated in the Flying Board competition before. This is Greene-san......]","[N- Nice to meet you! I- I hope Your Excellency is in excellent spirits today, ah, errr...... My name is Greene.]","[And this is Anne-san.]","[I- I- I- It's a pleasure meeting you for the first time. My name is Rimegithe Lenoria Githurd Armetes Anne of the Kruels. P- Please call me Anne......]","Both of them seemed extremely nervous, and for some reason, Lilia-san also looked bewildered, as if she was seeing something unusual.","[......Kaito-san, come to think of it, I'm actually quite the distinguished person, aren't I?]","[You are a Duke after all.]","[Right, I am...... No, well, it's just refreshing seeing the people Kaito-san brought along being so clearly nervous about meeting me......]","Indeed, people having this kind of reaction around her might be a first. Although Acht and Eva weren't used to formal speech, they interacted with Kuro and other distinguished people on the Demon Realm side regularly and weren't nervous around Lilia-san. Akane-san is also someone with nerves of steel, so while she might have been respectful of Lilia-san's social standing, she wasn't overly nervous, so people having such a reaction around her really is rather refreshing.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That's right, she's a Duke. If you think about it normally, she should have had a higher position than most people...... but because Kaito usually brings along people who don't fit the norm, even the person herself has also become somewhat desensitized......]"]},{"number":1894,"title":"Chapter 1894: Ship Party 19","paragraphs":["Lilia-san was a little bewildered by the slightly different situation from usual, but she soon regained her composure and greeted Greene-san and Anne-san in a familiar manner.","Lilia-san herself is a gentle person who is, in a good way, doesn't feel like a noble at all, but I think she's used to parties like this because she has been to many aristocratic social gatherings such as evening parties and tea ceremonies.","The fact that I mostly see Lilia-san being flustered is probably because she ends up dealing with particularly difficult situations, so this Lilia-san, who can respond with such composure like this, might actually be her true self.","[......And so, LIlia-san. It seems like Greene-san has been yearning for the life of high society, but I don't really know those kinds of things, so I was hoping Lilia-san could teach her about it...... No, of course, Lilia-san has your own circumstances, so it's just if you have the spare time......]","[....................]","[Umm? Lilia-san?]","When I cut straight to the topic related to Greene-san after the introductions were over, Lilia-san was momentarily taken aback, but then her eyes gradually began to sparkle.","She wasn't angry or troubled, but instead seemed absurdly happy...... Eh? Why?","[I see, so that's how it is...... Yes, of course, please leave it to me! I can't exactly ignore Kaito-san's request after all. I heard that Greene-san is new to parties like this, so I'm sure she has a lot of concerns...... So how about it? Throughout this party, how about going around with me? I can teach you the basics, and if you're considering entering high society in the future, wouldn't it be beneficial?]","[T- That would be more than I could hope for, but would you be alright with it, Your Excellency Duchess Lilia?]","[Yes, of course. It's a request from none other than Kaito-san, so you can leave everything to me.]","I wonder why? She looks really cheerful, like she's readily consenting to doing this. No, I'm rather thankful for that, as I have to go to other places to say my greetings, and I could also be relieved to have Lilia-san by Greene-san's side.","However, why is she so eager to the point of being almost overly enthusiastic about it?","As I was wondering about this, Luna-san, who had been nearby before I knew it, spoke with a wry smile on her lips.","[I can already somewhat guess Miyama-sama is questioning what's going on, so let me explain. Milady had just obtained the strongest means of protection in this party.]","[Hmm?]","[Just a moment ago, she was overwhelmed by the continuous visits from the Six King Executives, and considering the possibility that more of the people on the Six Kings' side that Milady is acquainted with might come, Milady would be quite preoccupied handling all them, so she had probably already given up on enjoying the party earlier...... but here, Milady has obtained the ultimate card that would allow her to quickly wrap up conversation even if it's with the Six Kings themselves: \"She's guiding a civilian at the request of Miyama-sama\".]","[A- Ahhh, so that's why she's so happy.]","[In fact, being directly requested by Miyama-sama at this party is one of the strongest cards she could hold. Ignoring that and still trying to have a long conversation with Milady would be recognized as going against Miyama-sama's wishes after all......]","In other words, by asking her to guide Greene-san, I was able to help Lilia-san as a result? That's something I should be happy about, but considering that a significant portion of the reason that Lilia-san is having troubles at this party can ultimately be traced back to me, I feel like I just stirred up trouble in order to get credit for solving it.","W- Well, if Lilia-san is happy as a result, let's call it all good.","[Well then, I'll leave Greene-san to Lilia-san...... What about you, Anne-san? If you have someone you'd like me to introduce to, I can do that.]","[......I- In that case, umm, this might be a bold request, but could you introduce me to someone who has connections in the mining industry? .......Jewelers would be fine as well, and if possible, I would be truly grateful if you could introduce me to someone who is knowledgeable about magic crystals......]","[Ahh, I do know someone who can help you with that.]","If we're talking about magic crystals, it has to be Tre-san. After all, she's the Special Advisor for the Magic Crystal Division at the Seditch Magic Tools Trading Company, and with her personality, she's someone I can easily introduce Anne-san to.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This is that, isn't it? Anne's assumption would be that she'll just be introduced to the Head of a small to medium-sized company like Akane, right? Is she gonna be alright? The Head of the Magic Crystal Division of the world's largest trading company is gonna appear......]"]},{"number":1895,"title":"Chapter 1895: Ship Party 20","paragraphs":["I asked Lilia-san to take care of Greene-san and moved on with Anne-san. The Kruels were apparently mainly miners of gemstones and magic crystals, and they were hoping that they could be of some help in the business.","[......Umm, even though we're good friends, I do feel apologetic for taking advantage of Kaito-san, but I got greedy because it's such a valuable opportunity.]","[No, no, please don't worry about it. I mean, in the first place, since this was my first time hosting a party, I decided to invite just about everyone I knew with who I had contact information, and the one who invited Anne-san and Greene-san, who barely knew anyone here, was me, so I should have thought about things more in advance.]","[Is that right? I thought you usually host parties like this......]","[No, this is completely my first time. Heck, I have almost no experience of going to parties like this. This time, I happened to receive this magic ship, so I was wondering if I could put it to good use.]","[Ahh, I see...... Unn? You received...... this magic ship...... Unnnn??? ......I must have misheard you.]","This isn't something I thought of when I first encountered Anne-san as a member of the Black Muscats, but she's actually a really good person, and even now, she still seems quite apologetic.","I really made her cower this time due to my lack of thought, and I hope things would turn out well for her if possible.","[Come to think of it, would it be better if they're related to magic crystals than to be related to gemstones?]","[Ah, yes. Both involve mining, but magic crystals require more skill to mine than gemstones...... and umm, if one is good at it, they can easily get paid a lot of money. My union has really skilled workers, but we aren't blessed with a lot of work, so I'm hoping we could get a job opportunity where we can utilize our technical expertise......]","[I see. I don't know much about this, but are all of the Kruels basically involved in the mining business?]","[Indeed so. There are some who take on other jobs, but most of them would still be involved in the mining industry. As you may know, us Kruels are weak to sunlight, but on the other hand, we excel in dark places, being able to see clearly even in dark caves. In the first place, because we live underground and have abilities suited for mining, we're naturally inclined towards such tasks.]","When I asked a little more about the Kruels, I learned that the Kruels are characterized by their small stature, their strength in dark places such as underground, and they're dexterous people with strong physical strength for their stature, making them suitable for mining.","In addition, because they have difficulty with sunlight even though they aren't nocturnal, preferring to be active during the day, it seems they find it challenging to pursue other occupations.","As we were moving around the venue, I happened to see Tre-san, who we were heading to, approaching our way.","[Ohh, it's Kaito. Well, don't you look happy there, were you looking for me?]","[Yes, I was just going to visit Tre-san......]","[Eh? You were really looking for me? I was just saying that completely at random......]","I really was looking for Tre-san, so when I answered that that was indeed the case, just like before, it seemed like Tre-san hadn't actually predicted my actions, just saying things offhandedly, so she was genuinely surprised. How should I say this...... That's just like Tre-san.","[Come to think of it, where's Cento-san and Cien-san?]","[Both of them are in front of the stage, looking at artworks. I didn't know what the deal was with those stuff, so I was just wandering around. If it's a party Kuromu-sama is participating in, it's generally safe, so there are often occasions where I go off on my own.]","[Ahh, I see, they did say they like ceramics and woodcraft.]","Alice showed me a list of the collections she's exhibiting in advance, and there were pottery and woodworking items, so it's understandable that Cento-san and Cien-san would be interested.","Well, in any case, it's good to see Tre-san here. Let's introduce her to Anne-san right away.","[Anne-san, this is Tre-san, the one I'm going to introduce Anne-san to. Tre-san, this is an acquaintance of mine......]","[......Arehh? Isn't this one a Kruel? So you also knew someone among the Kruels huh, Kaito. I suppose this would be good timing......]","[Unn? Good timing, for what?]","I would certainly like to introduce Anne-san, but I got curious about that \"good timing\" Tre-san muttered, so I asked.","[Hmmm. Kaito, are you close with this Kruel girl?]","[We've only met a few times, but I think I can get along with her to some extent.]","[Fumu fumu, so Kaito, from your point of view, is this girl someone who can be trusted? You can just tell me what your hunch tells you.]","[Eh? Yes, I think she's someone that can be trusted.]","[I see, thanks!]","After confirming all that with me, Tre-san's expression changes to a crisp one and pulling out a business card from her pocket, she offers it to Anne-san with a smile.","[Nice to meet you, I'm Tre, serving as the Special Consultant of the Magic Crystal Division at the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company.]","[Ah, yes. I'm one of the Kruels...... Huh? Eh? Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company's...... Special Advisor?]","[Yes.]","[ ! ? ! ? ! ? ! ? ]","It might just be my imagination, but it seemed like Anne-san's consciousness momentarily drifted away just now. And then, while glancing back and forth between the business card she was handed and Tre-san's face at an incredible speed, she started sweating profusely.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She said \"good timing\", and then introduced herself in work mode...... It seems like they're gonna start talking about work.]","? ? ? : [As expected, Kaito-san has a knack for finding just the right opportunity, the way his fate turns is quite excellent. Anne-san could also expect significant profits here...... but well, ignoring the body blows that come with them.]","Serious-senpai : [He's the type that brings good luck in exchange for stomachaches huh......]"]},{"number":1896,"title":"Chapter 1896: Ship Party 21","paragraphs":["Anne-san's gaze flusteredly moved about, but after a few moments, she looked aghast and bowed her head to Tre-san.","[P- Please excuse my rudeness. My name is Rimegithe Lenoria Githurd Armetes Anne. M- My apologies, I don't have a business card with me.]","[No, please don't worry about it. Would you mind if I call you Anne-san?]","[T- That would be fine.]","[Well then, I feel apologetic bringing this up with you at this party in which we just met, but would you mind talking about work for a little bit?]","[Y- Yes!]","How should I say this...... Tre-san in her work mode just feels different. No, she's a tall, model-like beauty, so she looks good being crisp...... but with her usual personality being like that, seeing her like this feels quite disconcerting.","That aside, they're going to talk about work...... Anne-san is a Kruel, and upon seeing her, Tre-san said it was right timing, so is what she's going to talk about some kind of job she needs to ask a Kruel to do?","[I'll confirm just in case, but can I assume that Anne-san is involved in the mining business?]","[Yes. Umm, I'm technically the representative of our union.]","[I see, how big of a union is it?]","[We are technically a medium-sized union of more than 50 members, but we just have 54 members, so we're just barely medium-sized.]","[Do you have technical qualifications?]","[Ah, yes. Including myself, 7 people have a 1st-Class Qualification, 15 have Semi 1st-Class Qualification, and the rest all have at least a Semi 2nd-Class Qualification.]","[That is quite excellent. Do you have an exclusive contract with any group or company?]","I don't really know much, but from their conversation, it seems that there's some kind of qualification needed for mining, and the union led by Anne-san seems to have very good qualifications. From what I've heard, 1st-Class sounds like it's the highest, and for those with lower qualifications, they'd at least be 3rd-Class or so.","[Ah, no, we had basically been accepting short-term work. Umm, I'm ashamed to say this, but the members of our union may have been skillful, but we aren't very good with connections, so we don't have a lot of experience with big jobs.]","[......I see.]","After hearing Anne-san's words, Tre-san seemed to be pondering for a moment, then smiled lightly and spoke again.","[......I suppose saying \"That's just perfect\" here would be rude, but that indeed is the ideal union. Anne-san, first of all, thank you for answering my questions.]","[Ah, no.]","[With that said, I'd like us to get to the main point of the topic, so to make a long story short...... Would you like to sign an exclusive contract with us?]","[............Huh? Eh? U- Umm...... With the Seditch Tool Trading Company?]","[Yes. Recently, our trading company has been expanding in scale in the Human Realm with the concept of increasing the number of Magic Tool Creators. The same goes for the magic crystal department, where we have secured several magic crystal veins to expand our operations in the Human Realm, and we were just looking for someone to handle the mining. When it comes to mining in the Human Realm, the Kruels are the best, so I was planning to visit the Kruels' city later to find a union with which we could make a contract.]","It makes sense now that she mentioned it, and I guess the program for training magic tool creators that Mom and Dad are participating in is just one part of that project.","[Even though we are expanding our scale in the Human Realm, we aren't going to expand drastically all at once, so we were looking for a small to medium-sized union, and Anne-san's union fits the conditions perfectly. Of course, there are likely considerations on Anne-san's side as well, and discussing the detailed contract here would take a lot of time, so I would like to arrange a separate meeting for negotiations at a later date, but would that be alright?]","[Ah, y- yes. That's already more than we could have hoped for on our end......]","[Well then, let's exchange contact information and I'll inform you of the date and time of our meeting later. I'll have you visit one of our company branches, but please rest assured that we'll cover all transportation-related expenses.]","[Y- Yes. Thank you very much.]","Anne-san, with a humble demeanor, bowed repeatedly as she exchanged contact information with Tre-san. And then, after a brief silence, the atmosphere around Tre-san changed...... how should I say this...... It's like some switch had been turned off.","[......Alright, that's enough talk about work! Heck, why do you always have that complicated look on your face, Kaito?]","[No, you should already know why. I know that Tre-san is someone who can handle work properly, and I understand that you're the type to do things properly when necessary...... but seeing Tre-san looking like a capable woman really just feels out of place......]","[That's strange? The way you said it, it sounds like when I'm not in work mode, I'm a no good woman...... Rather, can I ask something? What do they mean by no good? It's apparently something used a lot by otherworlders, and I kinda get what it's implying because of the situations in which it's used but......]","[Ah~~ Errr, I think it was originally used for broken cars....... mechanical products......]","(T/N: The word originally used here was ponkotsu, which kinda mean something like clunky, but the word eventually got used to no good people.)","Hearing Tre-san, transitioning from work mode to a completely relaxed atmosphere, suddenly asking about something trivial with genuine interest, I answered with a wry smile. As I thought, I really feel more comfortable when Tre-san is laid back like this.","It's just, Anne-san was looking at the sudden difference in atmosphere in a daze now......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected, the benefits that come in exchange for stomachaches are huge...... I should also get some sort of benefit......]","? ? ? : [For Serious-senpai, he's providing sweet development, which could be considered a stomachache issue, and in return for that, isn't Serious-senpai bringing about that sugarization phenomenon?]","Serious-senpai : [Aren't those just demerits!? Where are the benefits?]","Makina : [Isn't knowing me thanks to my beloved child the greatest benefit of all?]","Serious-senpai : [That's just too big of a demerit!!! WHERE ARE THE MERIIIIIIIITS!?]","Makina : [......Arehh?]"]},{"number":1897,"title":"Chapter 1897: Ship Party 22","paragraphs":["Having returned to her normal state from work mode, Tre-san calls out to the bewildered Anne-san.","[Ah, Anne-san, you also make yourself comfortable. Let's just forget about work and talk about it another time! We got a party to enjoy!]","[Ah, errr Y- Yes.]","[Anne-san, you might be confused, but Tre-san is someone you can trust, so you'll be alright. If there's anything negotiations-related that you want help with, as it's my responsibility for introducing you to her, I'll help you.]","[N- No, things like responsibility Rather, I already feel so indebted to you, Kaito, that I don't think I could repay you even in a lifetime, so I don't know how to express my gratitude]","[N- No, it's not that big of a deal.]","Anne-san bowed her head to me with genuine gratitude, and from the tone of her voice and her expression, I could tell that she truly thinks of this as a lifelong debt of gratitude.","[No, I'm not exaggerating. I never thought we would get an exclusive contract with the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company I'm truly grateful. My union members have been diligently working to acquire high-level skills, but I haven't been able to provide them with jobs or pay that match their efforts, and as their representative, I felt a great deal of responsibility for that. The skilled members of my union could have had a better life if they moved to other unions, yet they have stayed with us without switching I've always wanted to recompense them in some way.]","[I see, there are indeed times when technical skills alone aren't enough in a business matters.]","[Yes, that's why I'm really happy to have this connection with the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company.]","It seems that the issue of being weak with connections was a more serious problem for Anne-san's union than I had initially thought. Their union seemed like a small to medium-sized business? Since they have to secure work on their own, connections and negotiation are inevitably necessary.","[Hmm~~ This question might sound blunt, but roughly speaking, how much is the monthly salary for members of Anne-san's union?]","[Errr, for example, my salary is about 2000R/when it's low, and about 5000R/month when it's high.]","[Eh? As a representative of a medium-sized union with 7 1st-Class members, if that's your approximate salary. Well, it sounds like you're being seriously underpaid. If someone holds a 1st-Class Mining Qualification, they could easily deserve around 5 times that amount.]","[I'm embarrassed to say this, but not only are we weak in negotiations We also have frail connections, and there are many situations in which I can't come on strong because we don't even have many jobs to begin with]","Indeed, if Anne-san's side is desperate to secure work while the other side, which could be another union, holds the advantage, then even if they're disadvantageous, Anne-san's side might have no choice but to accept them. If not, she might be thinking that she couldn't even pay her union members' salaries.","[Fumu fumu, I see. Then, Anne-san, I think it will happen after we officially sign the contract If you're okay with it, we'll dispatch personnel from our company who are capable of negotiating with external parties. If we enter into an exclusive contract, you must prioritize the tasks we assign to your union, but it doesn't mean you can't take on other jobs as well.]","[Eh? W- Would that be alright?]","[Unn. Well, let's talk about the detailed conditions during the negotiation.]","[T- Thank you very much!}","At Tre-san's suggestion, Anne-san was extremely moved as she bowed her head. From the look on her face, I could tell that she was having a hard time with negotiations, so Tre-san's suggestion must have been a godsend.","[By the way, Tre-san, I don't really know much about it, but is that 1st-Class Mining Skill Qualification awesome?]","[Unn, it's pretty amazing. There are 10 levels of Mining Qualifications, starting with 7th-Class, 6th-Class, 5th-Class, 4th-Class, Semi 3rd-Class, 3rd-Class, Semi 2nd-Class, 2nd-Class, Semi 1st-Class and then 1st-Class. Well, 7th-Class and 6th-Class are designations for trainees and apprentices, so proper skilled miners start from 5th-Class. Basically, they advance through annual promotion exams, but you can only advance up to 2nd-Class through exams alone. To reach Semi 1st-Class and 1st-Class, one needs to fulfill various conditions such as achievements and recommendations before they can take the promotion exam, so it really is just a handful who had such qualifications.]","[I see, so those with 1st-Class Qualifications really are just the chosen few.]","[Unn. Of course, if we're talking about the Kruels as a whole, there are quite a few who got 1st-Class Qualifications, but having seven of them in a medium-sized union is impressive. Especially for high-purity magic crystals is challenging, so you really need someone with at least Semi 1st-Class Qualifications to handle them with confidence.]","There are quite a few levels of qualifications, but in this world, magic crystals are incredibly important, so the mining industry may be strictly controlling the qualifications for those who could handle them.","[Then, Anne-san must be pretty amazing.]","[N- No, it's not like that. It just so happens that my parents have 1st-Class Qualifications, so I've learned a lot of things from them since long ago.]","At my words, Anne-san flusteredly shook her head with a blush, and with her petite figure, how should I say this She kinda feels like a cute small animal.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Nuhh No, calm down, it's okay. She hasn't triggered my heroine sensor yet. She's still currently on the safe side.]","? ? ? : [She's a female character with a precious, pale skin tone.]","Serious-senpai : [Stop it! Don't try to attack with your uniqueness!!! There are people who like that kind of thing after all!!!]"]},{"number":1898,"title":"Chapter 1898: Ship Party 23","paragraphs":["Having already accomplished my main objective of introducing Tre-san to Anne-san, I was thinking about what to do now, when Tre-san drew closer with a bright smile, seemingly having guessed my thoughts.","[Kaito is still going around to say your greetings, right? Then, how about I take care of Anne-san, or rather, why don't I stay with her?]","[Eh? Is that alright?]","[Unn. We can also talk about the details of the contract schedule while we're at it, so if Anne-san is also alright with it...... What do you think?]","[Y- Yes. I'm alright with it. Umm, I do feel a bit anxious about it but......]","As expected of Tre-san, she's very perceptive with these kinds of things. Perhaps considering Anne-san's situation and realizing that I might need to greet others as well, she kindly suggested taking care of Anne-san herself.","I really appreciate that, but I kinda feel like this would be a blunder. Of course, Anne-san should be fine with Tre-san herself now that she had talked to her to some extent, but if she were to act together with Tre-san after this, she would end up meeting many other people, a worry I just couldn't wipe out.","[Well, I understand it's impossible to completely dispel your anxiety, but if we can find someone else we get along with and she can talk to, she'll feel a bit more at ease, right? Just a moment, I'll call for a professional......]","[ [ A professional? ] ]","After understanding Anne-san's anxiety, with a bright smile on her lips, Tre-san said something about calling a professional and looked around, seemingly looking for someone.","After a few moments, she seemed to have found the person she was looking for and loudly called out.","[Oiiiii, Raz-chaaaaan~~ Can you come here for a sec!?]","[Yeeeees! What's the matter, Sister Tre? Ahh, Kaitokun-san! Hello! Seeing Kaitokun-san makes Raz very happy~~]","[Hello, Raz-san. Thank you for coming today.]","Oops, I see now. I understand what she meant. The one she called was Raz-san, a communipower monster. Indeed, if it's Raz, I feel like she will quickly become friends with Anne-san.","After Raz-san and I finished greeting each other, Tre-san introduced Anne-san to Raz-san.","[Raz, this is Anne-san, from the Kruel tribe.]","[Aya!? Nice to meet ya~~ Raz is named Razelia! Please call me Raz.]","[Ah, my name is Rimegithe Lenoria Githurd Armetes Anne. You can just call me Anne.]","[Best regards~~ I've heard some stuff from Sister Tre! The Kruels are good at mining, aren't they? Then, then, do you also mine magic crystals?]","Raz-san asked with a curious look, and though looking puzzled, Anne-san nodded her head.","[Ah, yes. We also mine magic crystals.]","[Oh~~ That's amazing! Raz isn't very knowledgeable, but wasn't it difficult to mine magic crystals? Like, I've heard it somewhere...... Errr, if it gets damaged during mining, it will be, errr, it will be a disaster!]","[That's right. When magic crystals are damaged during mining, it becomes difficult to engrave magic formulas on them, and their value decreases. Once engraved, however, they can withstand damage without issue......]","[Haeehhh~~ That sounds difficult. Anne-san must be amazing then!!!]","[N- No, I'm not very......]","[That's not the case, Raz can't do mining...... but, but, I'm glad to hear your story! I would like to know more about it~~ Is there a difference in mining methods between magic crystals and gemstones?]","[Yes, for example......]","As Raz-san asked her questions in a cute manner, Anne-san's nervousness disappeared and she began to smile. The great thing about Raz-san is that you can tell that she really enjoys conversation from the bottom of her heart, which makes it fun to talk with her.","With a cheerful smile and a cute reaction to everything, Raz-san listens so attentively and happily that Anne-san also finds herself naturally talking to her.","She quickly became friends with Kaori-san as well, so it's safe to say Raz-san's exceptional social skills are truly impressive.","As their conversation progressed, Anne-san's nervousness seemed to melt away, and their conversation became more and more lively.","[And so, Kaito. We'll look after Anne-san here, so you go and greet the others.]","[Thank you. Well then, I'll leave her in your care...... Anne-san, Raz-san, I'm going to make the rounds to greet others, so I'll see you later.]","[Ah, yes. Thank you very much.]","[Yes! Come chat with Raz again later~~!]","Feeling warmed by Raz-san vigorously waving her small body to see me off, I head off to the next location.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Yeah, if a 30cm tall fairy listens to you happily with glittering eyes, the conversation would be quite lively......]","? ? ? : [Raz-san really has good communication skills, and she makes friends easily even with people she has never met before. What's impressive is that Raz-san isn't being consciously calculating or trying too hard to make friends with others, it all comes naturally for her, effortlessly fitting into one's heart without any sense of unnaturalness to it.]"]},{"number":1899,"title":"Chapter 1899: Ship Party 24","paragraphs":["After leaving Anne-san under Tre-san and Raz-san's care, I move on, thinking about who I should greet next. Since I have finished visiting the places that should be my priority for now, I feel that from here on, I should really just talk to anyone who catches my eye.","However, I would really like to greet everyone at least once, so let's keep in mind who I have already finished greeting.","As I was walking along thinking about this, I suddenly noticed someone I didn't recognize. No, what I could see here was just her back, but I couldn't quite remember who she was.","Thereupon, almost as soon as I stopped, the person turned around, and I involuntarily held my breath. Is this that so-called asymmetry? She had a distinctive hairstyle, her slightly bluish-white hair had different lengths on each side, the right side cut short and the left side had a semi-long cut, drawing my attention, but what surprised me even more were her eyes.","I don't know how to describe it, but it's like there is no light behind her red eyes...... With eyes completely devoid of light, coupled with her Noh mask-like expression, there was this peculiar creepiness to her.","It was unlike Illness-san's unfocused eyes, her eyes truly had no gloss to her, like they were just dry, hardened, blood-colored hue...... It makes me think of the word emptiness in my mind.","(T/N: Noh mask)","[Ohh! Isn't this the host!?]","[ ! ? ]","And then I was even more surprised. The mysterious figure looked at me and greeted me with a bright, bouncy voice...... but her expression didn't move at all. her mouth was indeed moving a bit, but other than that, not even her eyebrows moved a twitch. And yet, for her voice to be incredibly cheerful, the dissonance was just incredibly intense.","[Well, it's quite the honor to meet you.]","[Ah, errr......]","[Ohh, please don't get me wrong. I'm not a suspicious person...... Well, if someone who's not suspicious at all starts saying they're not suspicious, they might just have a tsukkomi slapped back at them, so it's better to just ignore that! Ahh, but I digress. I am here accompanying Her Majesty Laguna.]","[A- Ahh, I see, no wonder you don't look familiar......]","[Well~~ I'm sorry for surprising you. Her Majesty Laguna said there was no need for me to accompany her and I should just enjoy the party as well, so I couldn't help but indulge myself...... Ahh~~ just to confirm, but are there any rules against non-invited guests consuming food or drinks? If so, I apologize.]","The tone of her voice is bright and lively, and I can really feel the excitement in her voice...... but her expression still hasn't moved a millimeter. Even Shiro-san's expression changes a little bit, but the expression really doesn't move at all, as if her face from the mouth up had been petrified.","I mean, even her mouth doesn't move very much, so where is her loud voice coming from......","[No, you've gone out of your way to attend, so I'd be happier if you enjoyed the party without worrying about it. Please have a good time.]","Incidentally, I knew in advance that Laguna-san would bring two companions with her. I mean, it was also the same case with Ryze-san and Chris-san, as if they had arranged it beforehand...... Or rather, they probably did coordinate with each other, as each of them applied for two companions to accompany them.","There's also nothing wrong with those accompanying them to enjoy the party, and I sincerely hope they do.","[What a big-hearted remark. Would you mind me feeling charmed?]","[That's kinda over exaggerating there......]","[No, no, it's not like I'm thinking \"This could be my chance to marry into money guhehe\" or anything like that, okay? Only about 34% of my thoughts are like that!]","[Isn't that percentage already quite high!?]","But well, how should I say this...... Laguna-san sure has brought someone with quite the personality...... She has quite the groove with her, with a voice that clearly expresses her emotions...... but with her face not moving a bit, as if her facial muscles are completely dead, she is quite the striking character.","[......Ahh, I'm sorry. We haven't introduced each other yet. You may already know this, but I'm Miyama Kaito.]","[Tahaa~~ Sorry about that, slipped out of my mind too. We've been chatting for quite a while, but I haven't even told you my name. I'm Jane Doe, it would be great if you would remember my name...... Kaito-sama.]","[I'm in your care. Errr, may I call you Jane-san?]","[Of course, you can call me Jane or My Honey, whatever you like!]","[T- Then, Jane-san...... Are you a noble?]","[Oh my, what discerning eyes...... Tahaa~~ It must be overflowing, isn't it!? That so-called high-class aura!]","[Ah, no, I just thought that because you have a surname......]","[Ah~~ I see, it's because of that...... Uwahh, I really said things like high class...... How embarrassing...... Um, I'm sorry. That just now was out, so please erase it from your memory!]","Jane-san, with her hands on her cheeks, shook her head and spoke in a strained voice as if she was embarrassed...... but as usual, her eyebrows hadn't even made a single twitch at all.","And although her emotions are easy to tell by the tone of her voice, I couldn't sense any emotion from her with my Sympathy Magic...... Perhaps just like Zwei-san, she's not letting any of her magic power leak out at all.","Looking at it that way, it's also possible that she's quite a formidable person...... What a mysterious person.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Jane Doe is the temporary name given to unidentified female corpses...... Sympathy Magic doesn't work on her, she refers Kaito not as \" カイト \" like the others but \" 快人 \", and she has the name of an unidentified corpse \"Jane Doe\"...... She's too suspicious.]"]},{"number":1900,"title":"Chapter 1900: Ship Party 25","paragraphs":["Jane-san, a woman with a very unique and mysterious atmosphere, speaks to me in a voice so bright unimaginable from her face that still looked frozen with her eyebrows not even moving a twitch.","[Yes, yes! Kaito-sama, can I make my appeal here?]","[Unn? Make your appeal here?]","[Whoa there, I don't have any hint of emotions I should be guilty about, okay!? Things like \"I'll skillfully integrate myself in and aim to marry to riches\" or that \"While I'm all dressed up for the party, I'll exaggerate my selling points by about 20% and earn myself some evaluation points\"...... Well, I may be thinking about it quite a bit! But putting that aside, it's a chance to have Kaito-sama know about it, so please give me some time to present myself!]","[H- How should I say this...... You're quite honest.]","[Tahaa~~ My oh my, you've found one of my charms before I gave my presentation! It seems like Kaito-sama is a genius at finding the best in people huh?]","She was a very easy-going person, and lighthearted conversation with her was quite enjoyable. Well, the expression on her face is still the same as before, and her eyes are still vacant and devoid of light, but her voice is very energetic.","[Well, anyhow, I'm going to make my pitch, but don't you think I'm pretty good? I'm not so conceited as to say I'm a peerless beauty, but I'm reasonably good-looking, and I might be a bit biased in my self-assessment, but my overall abilities are pretty decent. I've also got a pretty decent pair of breasts, not too big or too small...... Whoops, well this is quite tough. I'm aiming to give myself a favorable evaluation, but I'm kinda concluding that all my selling points are just pretty decent...... I feel like crying a bit at my lack of outstanding merits.]","She really started to appeal to herself, but with her concluding her evaluation as \"pretty decent\", how should I say this...... I can't say I've disliked or liked her more.","[Ahh, I'm quite confident in the texture of my skin. It's soft and squishy to the touch. I'm sure my breasts also feel good to the touch too, don't you think? What do you think, how about trying it out? Just kidding~~ Tahaa~~ My overflowing sexiness just slipped out huh, sorry for being too sexy.]","[I- I see, Jane-san is a woman full of charm huh.]","[What a keen eye, I'm currently a good buy, don't you think? As for my shortcomings, it's probably that I bombed the labor negotiation or that my facial muscles are dead all the time, to the point where I hardly seem to be working at all. Well, with that said, I'll give myself a good rating as a boyish, energetic girl...... Hmm, I'm boyish? Is boyish good? I feel like it stands in the fine line, but it's clear that I'm not the silent, cool type or the serene older sister type, so let's lean more towards that! Please overlook the finer details!]","[Ah, yes...... Errr, I mean, what's the appeal about?]","[That's a good question. About that...... Since I started on a whim, I feel like I've lost sight of the landing point a bit...... To be honest, I'm a bit lost on how to continue from here. It would make me feel all warm and fuzzy inside if you could throw me a lifeline here.]","She seemed to be trying to say \"I've gone and done it~~\", but her expression didn't change at all, so I felt like my brain was bugging out. However, I feel like the person herself is aware of the lack of change in her expression.","Besides, even with all her antics, she does seem to be a nice guy, and I also enjoy our conversations.","In a corner of the party hall, where the Human Realm's rulers were gathered, Ryze, Chris and Laguna were talking to each other. The content of their conversation was about the people accompanying them......","[Listen here, putting aside young Lilia, who is a noble, all of your royalty's family members, your Knight Captain and even your Head Maid are acquainted with Kaito have received invitations, so in reality, it's as if young Ryze had brought along a considerable number of people with you.]","[Hahaha, well, I also think it was kinda unfair, but we didn't particularly ask to be invited. Instead, the ones I brought along this time as companions don't hold very high noble titles.]","As a result of discussions among the countries, it was decided that each country would bring two companions this time. This is largely to show that Kaito and the country are on good terms.","Since the companions they brought aren't people Kaito knows, they plan not to burden Kaito with introductions. However, everyone still wants to go to places where they might have the chance to interact with Kaito, so as their King, invitations to events like this are an easy way to gain favor with the nobles.","[I have brought two nobles on the Innovation Side with me, but what about you, Your Majesty Laguna?]","[I wasn't sure who to bring. I could have brought nobles with me, but you see, the nobility don't have much authority in Hydra Kingdom...... so I chose two members of the Parliament to bring with me. Look, \"the two of them are over there\".]","Laguna answered Chris' question and pointed to a spot a few distance from their location. There were two people there dressed in beautiful formal wear, and they seemed to be hanging out together.","[Both of them are merchants and have quite promising futures. I'll introduce them to young Ryze and young Chris later. Well, as he already had so many people to greet, I would just be troubling Kaito if I were to introduce them to him, so I didn't introduce them earlier...... but I think it would be good for Hydra in the future if they could expand their connections with other people.]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Whoa there, saying that she's accompanying Laguna was just casually mentioned to mislead Kaito huh...... She had really become someone whose identity is unknown.]"]}]);
